window.FWN_HERO_SUMMONING_PEACE_CHAPTERS=(window.FWN_HERO_SUMMONING_PEACE_CHAPTERS||[]).concat([{"number":1901,"title":"Chapter 1901: Ship Party 26","paragraphs":["<Author's Notes>","I never thought that there would actually be someone who could get it right with such little information...... reading the comment section surprised me.","(T/N: This comment section is over there in syosetu.)","Aside from the fact that Jane-san's facial muscles weren't working at all, her personality was cheerful and pleasant, and our conversation somehow naturally became lively, creating a comfortable atmosphere that it was hard to believe we met each other for the first time.","[Well~~ Kaito-sama's conversational skills are good too. I can't help but get excited. You're good-looking, have a good personality, are rich, and have a wide social circle...... Hahaan, Kaito-sama, aren't you a high-spec male with strong communipower!?]","[I think you're exaggerating a bit...... Rather, I think the reason is that talking with Jane-san is lively and fun. That being the case, I feel that Jane-san is the one with strong communication skills...... Well, your face really doesn't make a twitch at all though......]","[Tahaa~~ Sorry about that! This is what you might call a quirk, so while we're at it, wanna talk about it? Even this Jane Doe has a sad past...... is what I was thinking, but it would be a long story, so maybe another time. Good grief, although my expression looks completely dead like this, my heart is full of love and peace, so please don't think of me as a boring woman, okay? I'm heading for the interesting woman route here!]","No, I actually do think she's a very interesting woman. The fact that she's so filled with emotions despite having a blank expression is already interesting once you get used to it.","It really is a mystery how she can produce such voices without changing her expression or moving her mouth much, but well, that's also part of what makes Jane-san fascinating. If possible, I'd like to have a more leisurely conversation with you sometime.","That said, I still have to make the rounds for greetings, so I can't keep talking to her forever. I'll need to wrap things up here at some point.","[No, I really do find you fascinating, Jane-san. Talking with you is so enjoyable that I wish we could chat longer.]","[Ohh, I've certainly got myself a good impression, yes? Tahaa~~ The gates have been opened, onwards to the marry-to-riches route! Of course, I'll let myself in!]","[Ahaha, well, putting aside the marry-to-riches route, I do really want to talk with you more...... but I still have to continue going around greeting everyone......]","[Ahh, indeed. Well~~ I'm sorry for keeping you long. Kaito-sama is busy too, so please don't mind me and head to your next destination.]","[Thank you. Well then, I'll take my leave now. Let's have a leisurely chat again if we have the chance.]","[No, no, it should be me thanking you!]","After thanking Jane-san as she pleasantly sent me off, I started walking to the next location.","Thereupon, after walking for a short while, I heard Jane-san's voice.","[Ah, right, right, Kaito-sama!]","[Yes?]","Turning to the voice I heard, with both her index fingers pointed at me, Jane-san spoke.","[......May happiness be with you.]","Her voice sounded strangely warm and filled with power, and for a brief moment...... I may have been seeing things, but I feel like I saw Jane-san's eyes slightly shine.","[Or something like that, just kidding lol~~ Tahaa~~ It has appeared huh, this mysterious me filled with mysteries...... Well then, let's meet again~~]","After bidding goodbye again to Jane-san, who was waving her hand with her usual expressionless face, I returned my gaze forward and began walking again.","As she stared at the back of the departing Kaito with an expression that didn't move a twitch and vacant eyes, the woman who identified herself as John Doe muttered softly.","[......Thank you...... Little young Hero.]","After murmuring this in a voice that no one could hear, Jane turned on her heel and walked towards the entryway of the venue. She had passed several Six King Executives along the way, but none of them noticed Jane's presence, simply opening the entryway of the venue and walking out.","As Jane was about to leave just like that, she heard a somewhat sharp voice lurking behind her.","[......I didn't feel any hint of harmful intent towards Kaito-san, so I didn't interrupt your conversation...... but I'm curious about you. That bizarre Presence Isolation technique is something that would divert away my attention if I wasn't paying careful attention.]","[......Tahaa~~ The scary guard had shown up huh. I'm a timid one, so I'd like you to excuse me from the investigations.]","[Calling it investigations is an exaggeration, I'm just asking some simple questions. If you answer honestly, you can go home...... So \"you who likely possess at least omnipotent power\", who are you?]","Upon hearing Alice's sharp inquiry, not lowering her guard at all, Jane, her expression still unchanging, turned her eyes devoid of light towards Alice.","[......I'm no one special. The one before you was someone who couldn't even become a nobody, the remnant of someone who once was a God, akin to a ghost traversing countless words. Tahaa~~ Sorry for being mysterious!]","[As expected, there's so little information that it's hard to guess who you are with just that...... In that case, let me ask you the important thing. Do you have any hostility towards Kaito-san?]","[There's no way I would. If it's gratitude and debt of gratitude, I have so much that I can't express it in words...... Well then, let's call it a wrap like that, so I'll excuse myself! If fate allows, let's meet again!]","After saying this, Jane disappeared like a mist. Alice, who could only watch that happen, put her hand on her chin with a dubious expression on her face.","(Pursuit seems impossible. While there may not be a big difference, the other side seems to have a higher status...... Rather than pursuing this matter myself, it seems quicker to ask someone like Shallow Vernal-sama. No matter how I think about this though, I can't imagine a being of that level could slip in without Shallow Vernal-sama's permission......)","Alice gave up chasing Jane and decided to ask Shallow Vernal, who most likely knew what was going on, she disappeared with a light sigh.","<Afterword>","『?????』","A being who was once a God, a being who is no longer a God, a being who, in exchange for the one they revere, \"escaped the end\". From that moment on, their expression stopped moving, and the being who became unable to become anything entrusted the recreation of the world to others and became a wandering ghost, traversing different worlds.","One who can't stand still, one who can't disappear...... To cease to be oneself is a blasphemy against the one they revere......","They held no resentment for the being who brought the end...... because such is an act of dishonor to the pride of the one they revere who proudly stood against the end......","Yet they held no purpose, held no meaning to live, only a reason not to disappear...... until they heard the story of the Little Hero who defeated the End and learned about the story that once ended had been reopened......"]},{"number":1902,"title":"Chapter 1902: Intermission: ●●●●● Part 1","paragraphs":["At a time long foregone, when the woman who referred to herself as an unidentified corpse to Kaito still went by the true name she had already discarded now.","How many years would it be in numbers? At least over a billion, maybe even over a trillion, they were memories of a day too far away...... but they still linger without fading in the slightest.","———-No, you can't! For me, for someone the likes of me...... Nebula-sama mustn't come to an end!!! Please, return me to my original world!!!","The Destruction God of the Apocalypse...... The phenomenon of the \"End\" itself, manifested into some sort of monster, an unstoppable despair against which countless Gods and numerous worlds could do nothing but vanish.","When it appeared in the world she created, she had already prepared to meet her end. And so, she went to bid farewell to the one she revered the most...... the Ultimate God in both name and reality, standing at the pinnacle of countless World Creators.","But, however, the Ultimate God...... Nebula didn't let it happen. With her power to encompassing everything, Nebula took over the role of Creator God to the world created by ●●●●● to herself, transferred all the creatures of that world to other worlds under her control, altered history so that they were \"originally born and raised\" in those worlds, and she declared that she would fight the Destruction God of the Apocalypse...... Shallow Vernal.","Nebula is the Ultimate God, known as the pinnacle among the World Creators, both in name and reality. ●●●●● herself also believes wholeheartedly that Nebula is the most powerful being.","Ahh, then why is she...... ●●●●● screaming as she clings to her with tears in her eyes? Even though she could have waited and believed in the triumph of the being that she sincerely reveres with a confident smile on her face......","......No...... She knows. The truth, that is......","Why did Nebula replace her, the original World Creator? If all she wanted to do was to overthrow Shallow Vernal, she shouldn't have bothered to do that.","Why did Nebula even alter the history of the creatures of that world and transfer them to other worlds? If they were in the way of the battle, there were plenty of ways for her to go around this without going through all that trouble......","......Yes, she knows. No, she's sure of it. That the mistress whom ●●●●● respects from the bottom of her heart and places all her trust in...... in this battle against Shallow Vernal...... She herself is sure that she can't prevent the end of her story...... that she can't resist Epilogue. And yet, knowing all that, she declared she was going to face the end alone on behalf of ●●●●●......","That is why ●●●●● was appealing so desperately. She told her she was the one who had to disappear, that she and Nebula were beings of different value...... but Nebula circled such an appeal with a strained smile.","———–Fool, I am Absolute. You are under my protection, so never in eternity shall you ever get ahead of me. Even if what stands before us is only our end...... Even if it's only for a few seconds, know that your end will come only after my end.","After saying these usual Nebula-like words, she gently stroked ●●●●●'s head with a smile.","———–However, there was one statement I could not overlook, so I must correct it.","———–A statement...... you can't overlook?","———–You are my subordinate, my servant, part of what constitutes the Absolute that I am. Saying things like \"for the likes of ○○\", there's no being whose value is lower than the others. You will always be my pride. For this reason, such words that undermine my pride...... Even if you are part of my pride, you are to refrain from making such words.","To Nebula, who speaks of her, who is nothing more than a servant and someone under Nebula's patronage, as someone she's proud of as if it's a matter of course, considering her a part of herself, ●●●●● continues to nod while endlessly shedding tears.","To such a ●●●●●, Nebula took off the faintly glowing necklace she was wearing around her neck and handed it over.","———–I leave this with you.","———–This is...... the necklace Nebula-sama always wears......","———–It's not that big of a deal, okay? It was just the first thing I made when I became self-aware. I was just wearing it without much thought, and it seems a fragment of my power got mixed in it, so it always glows faintly, but it has no other effects. However, since I have worn it for so many years, I do feel somewhat troubled by the thought of it breaking, so I will leave it to you. Keep that and wait for my return.","———–......Yes, I will definitely...... take care of it.","———–Yeah, I'm counting on you. Well then......","Entrusted with the task of \"holding onto something that must not be broken\", ●●●●● was no longer able to follow Nebula. Since she had received what was likely the final order of the one she reveres..... Since she was told to wait, she could only wait.","After seeing off Nebula as she disappeared, ●●●●● held the necklace in both hands, as if she was wrapping it around, and continued to pray desperately. Extremely hoping for a miracle to happen...... Ahh...... but alas...... at the very least, at that moment, her wish didn't reach her.","How much time had passed? After a short while, the pale light emitted by the necklace Nebula entrusted to her...... quietly dissipated.","[......Ahh...... Ahhhhh....... Uaaaaaahhhhh....... AAAAAAAAAAHHHHHHHHHHHHH!?!?]","The meaning of the extinguished light of the necklace, in which a fragment of Nebula's power resides...... Yes, the great Ultimate God whom ●●●●● revered from the bottom of her heart and pledged absolute loyalty to has now met her end. Taking ●●●●●'s place, that is......","<Afterword>","? ? ? : [A- A sudden seriousness!? ......Arehh? Where's Senpai?]","Makina : [She said \"Seems like it's going to be a leisurely meet-and-greet for a while, so I'm going to go sleep for a while\".]","? ? ? : [......I see......]","T/N: Sorry I'm late, I was kinda getting addicted exploring in that new gacha. Playing as the keqing-like sephiroth kinda drew my attention."]},{"number":1903,"title":"Chapter 1903: Intermission: ●●●●● Part 2","paragraphs":["In the space that exists between time and space, ●●●●● was talking with a World Creator she is relatively close with. The reason was that she wanted to entrust the world recreated by ●●●●● to that World Creator.","[......It's not like it would increase any sort of workload on me, so I don't really mind, but you're doing that even though you've gone to the trouble of recreating it?]","[Hmm, recreating it is also a kind of resolution for me, but I don't really have the capacity to think about anything else right now...... Well, I'm not really the type of World Creator who interferes with my world in the first place, so leaving them alone would be fine! That also kinda gives me an uneasy conscience though......]","[I see...... That aside, what's with your face?]","[Good gracious, my face just kinda abandoned its job, tahaa~~ Look at me, I'm the cool type now!]","Looking at ●●●●●, who was speaking brightly but had a face that didn’t even twitch like a Noh mask, the World Creator had an indescribable expression on their face.","Some time has passed since Ultimate God Nebula has been brought to her end, she who was an absolute existence for both them and ●●●●●, and the World Creators who once gathered under Nebula's wing have gone their separate ways.","No one holds a grudge against Shallow Vernal. Nebula challenged the apocalypse with her own pride. As absolute as she always is, she held no regrets for her actions, and they knew that she was great until her very last moments. For this reason, for outsiders to hold a grudge against Shallow Vernal is an act of insulting the battle Nebula is proud of...... Having understood this, although all those who were under her command were filled with sorrow, no one was driven by hatred.","That said, since the loss of the Absolute, the Ultimate God Nebula, there's no one suitable among them to lead the multitude of World Creators, so the World Creators have each gone their separate ways, and many haven't been in contact with each other for a long time.","[So, you're going around different worlds?]","[I don't have any purpose or goals after all. If I go around different worlds...... I may find something...... Tahaa~~ It's that \"self-searching\" I hear about~~!]","In a sense, ●●●●●'s bright voice has been broken by Nebula's end. It isn't that her personality has changed. Except for the fact that her expression no longer changes, she's the same person she used to be.","However, the wounds left in her heart are impossibly deep. She lost the one she reveres, and if she could, she would like to disappear immediately...... but she can't.","Nebula had made it so ●●●●● survived. Having escaped the apocalypse...... ●●●●●'s current existence is Nebula's final gift to her. Therefore, she could only keep moving forward. To stand still or to disappear...... would be a blasphemy to her precious master......","Bidding farewell to the World Creator, ●●●●● starts walking. She who was supposed to be brought to her end, now that her world has been recreated, she has become someone with nothing left...... With an empty heart, just like a corpse that only walks forward, she embarked on an aimless journey through countless worlds.","With no purpose and a life that held no meaning, only a reason not to stop, ●●●●● has traveled through many worlds like a ghost. In the process, she had the opportunity to reunite with other World Creators who had also served Nebula in the past and reminisced with them.","Just hearing that, it may sound like her journey wasn't a bad one, but ●●●●●'s heart remains as still as the expression on her face, and even though she tries to be cheerful...... acting how she used to be, she's as empty as if a large hole has opened up in the center of her heart.","[......Ahh...... I see...... Here too...... In this world too...... Anywhere...... Nebula...... isn't here either.]","Occasionally, when words of weakness slipped from her mouth, tears would fall from her eyes that no longer reflected light, but that was all she could do. Nothing about her situation improved.","Not knowing how many years had passed, she wandered through countless worlds for hundreds of millions, even trillions, of years...... but the turning point came after so many years had passed.","[......Eh? Shallow Vernal...... That monster lost?]","[So I heard. That said, it apparently wasn't with a direct battle, but...... what's his name again...... Ah, right, right, a child named Miyama Kaito, a species called human from a world different from the one created by Shallow Vernal, brought about a significant change in Shallow Vernal...... Heck, I even heard that he had become lovers with Shallow Vernal.]","[Haaaahhh!? Eh? Wait, lovers? Eeehhh...... That apocalypse monster actually has emotions!?]","[Not sure if she had emotions or if she developed emotions, but that aside, that's what I heard.]","The story that she heard from a World Creator she's acquainted with in a world she visited during her aimless journey brought astonishment to ●●●●●'s heart for the first time in a long time.","Even as she listened to the story in detail, everything she heard brought her surprise, and although her expression remained unchanged, ●●●●● was captivated by the tale for a while.","[......That's surprising. I did hear Shallow Vernal creating a world of her own from a World Creator I visited 2 worlds ago, but I didn't expect things would turn out like that. Tahaa~~ That said, that's one heck of a child.]","[Unn. I was truly surprised when I heard it too. However, regardless of the outcome, if it managed to thwart that Destruction God of Apocalypse...... Ahh~~ Sorry, it's nothing.]","[Unn?]","[No, I was about to say that this might alleviate some of Nebula-sama's regrets, but even thinking about regrets would be disrespectful to her, isn't it? I'm sure Nebula-sama wouldn't have minded though......]","[Indeed. Rather, I feel like she'd be quite fond of this Miyama Kaito. If Nebula-sama were still around, I might have invited him to join our ranks. After all, just hearing about him has already captivated me quite a bit!]","[Even if you say that, with that face of yours......]","[Tahaa~~ That's too harsh! Well, that aside, I've heard quite an interesting story. Thank you very much.]","[Unn. Then, if fate allows, let's meet again in a few hundred million years~~]","After thanking the World Creator for telling her the news, ●●●●● moved from that world to the next one.","The next world she arrived at was quite a lush green world, and she gazed at the world blankly from a scenic spot. As she thought of visiting this world's World Creator later, ●●●●● recalled the story she had heard in the previous world.","[Good gracious, that was quite an amazing thing. To win that Shallow Vernal over...... Hmmm, I've been deliberately avoiding that place, but maybe I should visit Shallow Vernal's world and check out that child. He does seem like someone Nebula-sama would be inte...... res...... ted————— Eh?]","It was truly just a casual act. Feeling a sense of emotion stirring within her for the first time in a long while, she took out the necklace entrusted to her by Nebula, feeling a sense of nostalgia, when her eyes, which had not moved since then, trembled greatly.","After all, the necklace that she took out...... faint it may be...... but it was still shining......","[......The necklace...... is shining? No way...... I- I mean, this is...... something that held a fragment of Nebula-sama's power...... E- Even though...... it has always been dim...... Ahh...... Ahhhh......]","Her body shook. Her mind was desperately trying to organize the information, but her heart was so shaken that she couldn't think straight.","However, the most important words...... as if desperately informing herself, were squeezed out of her mouth.","[......Nebula-sama...... has resurrected?]","<Afterword>","Makina : [In a way, the one who accomplished all this was me, right?]","? ? ? : [Well, I guess so. After all, you had......]","Makina : [After all, it was my world where the miracle that is my beloved child was born!!!]","? ? ? : [Ah, that...... I thought for sure you were referring to the proposal you made to Shallow Vernal-sama about creating a world...... No, but considering Kaito-san's existence as the Singularity, you aren't exactly wrong...... Hmmm.]"]},{"number":1904,"title":"Chapter 1904: Intermission: ●●●●● Part 3","paragraphs":["Sanctuary, God Realm...... There, Shallow Vernal and ●●●●●, both of whom in a sense, had a fate connected with each other, were facing each other. That said, Shallow Vernal had almost no memory of the time when she was still the phenomenon known as The End until she got acquainted with Makina and acquired a certain degree of ego, and she had forgotten everything except those that left a strong impression on her, like Nebula.","However, as for the ●●●●● in front of her, although she didn't understand why at that time, this person was the only one among those who fled to another world that she \"let escape\", so she did somewhat have an impression of her.","[......First of all, let me say this: I have no grudge against you, and I have no intention of harming this world.]","[Fumu, I understand.]","[The reason I came here...... No, I won't beat around the bush and ask you straight to the point. Did you...... resurrect Nebula?]","[Yes.]","[................]","The shock that these words, spoken so nonchalantly, had on ●●●●● was great. She doesn't know what intentions Shallow Vernal has, but Nebula has been resurrected...... That fact alone seeped into her heart as unspeakable happiness, bringing tears to her eyes that had lost their light.","[......I see...... Nebula-sama...... she's here, isn't she? Living in this world......]","[Yes. I'm having her be the guard dog of Kaito-san's home.]","[I see, a guard dog...... guard———————– Yes?]","However, the words Shallow Vernal spoke next filled ●●●●●'s head with confusion. Because she had just heard it a while ago, she knew of the name \"Kaito\" that Shallow Vernal mentioned, but she didn't understand what she meant by Nebula being a guard dog.","[Thinking it was necessary to have someone protect Kaito-san's house in his absence, I downgraded her power by a portion and turned her into a Spirit. Currently, as the Spirit of the World Tree at Kaito-san's home, she's serving as his guard dog.]","[......? ? ? ? ? ? ?]","She couldn't understand what she was saying at all. Rather, she can't keep up with the fact that Nebula had apparently been resurrected for such a reason.","To such ●●●●●, Shallow Vernal explained everything step by step. Of course, coupled with Shallow Vernal's airheadedness, there were some parts that still made no sense to her even after asking for details, but she was able to understand how Nebula is doing at the moment.","[......I- I see...... Ah, no, how should I say this...... Although I have incredibly mixed feelings about this, if Nebula-sama is satisfied, it's not my place to say anything......]","[So, what are you going to do? If you want to meet her, I will tell you the location...... but of course, I will have you sign a contract that you will not harm Kaito-san or anyone around him.]","Shallow Vernal's words made ●●●●● ponder. Of course, she did have the desire to go see Nebula right now. However, she also wondered how in the world she would behave when meeting with Nebula.","Rather, it's obvious that meeting Nebula, whom she'd longed to see, would make it difficult for her to control her emotions, so she wanted a little more time to prepare herself.","[......I will go see her. However, I would need some time for that...... I promise not to harm anyone in this world. So, could I please have permission to stay in this world for a while?]","[I don't mind, but on one condition.]","[A condition...... Yes, if it's anything I can do......]","[I would like to know about the lovey-dovey events that couples from different worlds do together. You have crossed many worlds, haven't you?]","[I see, lovey-dovey ev...... Hoehh? Hmm? Ahh, umm, I'd like to think I misheard you...... but did you say lovey-dovey event......?]","[I'd like to know about various lovey-dovey events from different worlds as references for when I go on dates with Kaito-san.]","[......A- Alright.]","Feeling as if she had recovered from a bit of confusion, only to be drowned again in a deep swamp of confusion, ●●●●● nodded.","With permission from Shallow Vernal, ●●●●● had obtained permission to stay in Trinia. Using her abilities, she had acquired some knowledge of this world and was now pondering in a town in the Human Realm where she had temporarily retired.","(I want to see her, I want to see Nebula-sama immediately...... but I really don't know what kind of attitude I should take...... I- If I just check how she looks now...... No, she'll definitely find out.)","Feeling in a state where she wanted to meet her but couldn't muster the courage, ●●●●● hesitated...... when her ears caught snippets of conversation from a group a little distance away.","[Anyhow, once the party starts, you're free to move around. Kaito will also be busy, so introducing you guys to him wouldn't be possible. It's fine if Kaito himself approaches you, but keep in mind that going to him is forbidden. If that's allowed, I don't know what young Ryze and young Chris would say......]","Hearing their conversation...... and that name, Kaito, ●●●●● raises her gaze and approaches that group...... a group made up of Laguna and the two merchants she's bringing with her. As an omnipotent being, if she were to use an ability akin to Recognition Inhibition Magic, Laguna and the others wouldn't notice her approach.","(Apologies, people I'm seeing for the first time...... I'm gonna have a small peek at your memories. So this is...... Miyama Kaito-sama...... A party hosted by him, who could be said to have triggered Nebula-sama's resurrection...... According to Shallow Vernal-sama, Nebula-sama can't move beyond a certain range from her World Tree, so it's unlikely that Nebula-sama will be at that party...... but Kaito-sama will be there.)","She wanted to catch a glimpse of him. That person who brought about change in Shallow Vernal, and in a roundabout way, became the catalyst for Nebula's resurrection...... It was just the right timing, as while ●●●●● was struggling to gather the courage to meet Nebula, she decided to meet with Kaito first. That being the case, she invoked her Recognition Inhibition authority...... and \"followed behind Laguna\".","<Afterword>","? ? ? : [Ahh, I see, she technically wasn't lying huh. Laguna herself may not know of it, but she really was accompanying Laguna......]","Makina : [Hmm. If this intermission stops here, does that mean she'll be reunited with Nebula after the party?]"]},{"number":1905,"title":"Chapter 1905: Intermission: At the End of a Long Journey","paragraphs":["<Author's Notes>","I didn't have much time, so today's chapter is a bit short.","At the foot of the World Tree, which is located in the open space of a large garden in Symphonia Kingdom's Royal Capital...... Nebula was making something with her processed branches.","Because she has a restriction that prevents her from being a certain distance away from her World Tree, she could not participate in the ship party, so instead, she can only stay at Kaito's home, where she is making woodwork to pass the time. But soon after, Nebula stopped her work and let out a sigh with a somewhat dismayed expression on her face.","[......Good grief, what a roundabout way to go about things.]","The air seemed to shake just slightly right after Nebula murmured that. Under normal circumstances, it wouldn't just be something that makes one feel discomfort about, but for the Absolute Nebula, it was easy for her to guess what had happened.","[Instead of visiting directly, you went out of your way to create a phase-shifted other space just to meet......]","[Ahh~~ No, umm...... I know your situation over here, so let's just say I was being a little cautious...... Umm...... You see...... errr......]","[It's been a while, \"Canaris\". For you to come all the way here to see me, you're still as conscientious as always.]","[ ! ? Nebu...... Nebula...... -sama......]","Hearing her name called in a calm voice, ●●●●●...... Canaris' voice trembled and her expression distorted. As if time had stopped since that moment, her face, which had not yet moved for hundreds of millions or trillions of years, moved, and tears came to her eyes, which had not held light.","She has wanted to see her for a long, long time. Even though she understood at that time that she would never see her again, she looked for her every time she visited a new world. She thought that the day would never come when she would hear her gentle voice calling her name again......","The one standing before her is a little shorter than what she used to be, about a meter shorter, and her magic power has changed a bit since being reincarnated as a Spirit. But even so, she was easily convinced. That the one before her is Nebula, whom she has wanted to meet for a long time......","[......I believe you already understand this, but I'll say this first. Apologies and gratitude are just disrespectful to me. What happened at that time had occurred under my judgment and the Absolute me had acted at my own discretion. Everything had already concluded in my mind...... There's no sin, no gratitude, nothing for you to burden. Having such a thought existing in your mind is disrespectful to me.]","[......Yes...... I had thought...... Nebula-sama...... would say...... something like that......]","Canaris approached Nebula with tears streaming down her face and clung to her petite body.","[......I won't say it...... If that's what Nebula-sama says...... Whether it's apologies...... or gratitude...... I won't say them. B- But...... Please at least...... let me say this...... I missed you...... Nebula-sama...... Even if you had such an appearance...... the fact that you're still here...... makes me...... helplessly happy.]","[You're exaggerating...... but well, I'm glad that you came to show yourself like this. It must have taken you a long time to get here...... but you did a good job, Canaris.]","[ ! ? ! ? NEBULA-SAMAAAA!]","As Nebula lightly patted her head with a gentle smile, Canaris, unable to hold back any longer, clung to Nebula and started crying loudly.","Seeing this, Nebula smiled lightly while continuing to gently stroke her head.","[Good grief, I thought of serving you some tea since you came all the way here, but it seems that will have to wait a while longer...... But well, accepting such things is also the duty of this Absolute, so cry until you have let everything out.]","Her voice was gentle and warm...... that just hearing those words made Canaris feel as if all the long and painful days had paid off, and Canaris continued to cry like a little child in Nebula's chest.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [Hmm, I slept well. I'm sure the party isn't over yet, but it should have progressed quite a bit.]","? ? ? : [That's right. It just finished...... the serious development we've had after a long time, that is.]","Serious-senpai : [........................Eh?]"]},{"number":1906,"title":"Chapter 1906: Intermission: At the End of a Long Journey - Part 2","paragraphs":["After a certain amount of time had passed, and at the time when Canaris, who was sobbing like a child, finally calmed down, Nebula prepared a table and chairs, told her to take a seat, and began preparing tea.","The time flow of this phase-shifted other space, so it was decided it wouldn't be a problem for them to spend a leisurely time.","[Even so, what's with that face?]","[Tahaa~~ Well, it worked for the first time in a really long time earlier, but it instantly returned to its not working state. It might be that my facial muscles have developed a habit of slacking off.]","[Fumu, well, if you yourself don't mind it, then there's no problem. Here's a cup of tea made from the tea leaves I made.]","[My oh my, this is quite awe-inspiring. The very fact that I'm having Nebula-sama make tea for me is at the pinnacle of awe-inspiringness......]","[Since this Absolute me is better at brewing tea than you are, it's only natural that I should brew it for us, and there's no such thing as disrespect in that. What would be disrespectful is you being too awe-inspired that you couldn't taste my tea.]","[Tahaa~~ How should I say this...... That's just like Nebula-sama...... Ahh, it's so delicious...... I feel like I'm going to cry again.]","Canaris had also served for a long time until Nebula's end, so she has a good understanding of Nebula's personality. Because she believes it's natural for a superior to take care of subordinates, considering her personality, it's understandable that Nebula herself would brew tea in such a setting.","Well, she does feel ashamed sitting there and letting her revered master, whom she hasn'e seen in a while, make her tea......","[Are the others in good health?]","[Yes! We weren't convinced that anyone other than Nebula-sama could be at the top of our group, so in the end, each of us just went wherever we pleased, but we still keep in touch from time to time. I think everyone will be overjoyed to hear that Nebula-sama is back!]","[It's alright for them to be happy, but if they come to this world in droves, they will just cause trouble for Milord and the others. I'm aware that my life had already been brought to an end and this would be my second one, and I do like my current life to a certain extent, so I have no desire to reign as I did before.]","[I see, if that's what Nebula-sama has decided, I don't think anyone will complain...... Ah~~ but I'm sure everyone will want to see you.]","[Fumu......]","Nebula is truly adored by many. Otherwise, she wouldn't have reigned as the Ultimate God who rules over countless worlds.","And since there are many omniscient and omnipotent among those who have pledged their eternal allegiance to her, it won't be long before Nebula's resurrection becomes known.","[......Well then, Canaris, I have one favor to ask of you.]","[Y- Yes! I am by your command!]","Hearing Nebula's words, Canaris nodded in a bouncy voice. Her expression was the same as ever, but the joy in her voice made her emotions very clear.","[Explain my situation to anyone you can contact with, and tell them to pass it on to others. Tell them that basically it's forbidden for them to come see me in person, but that they may contact by letter or other means. If they wish to visit this world, they must first show courtesy to Shallow Vernal and obtain her permission...... and that they should leave enough space between visits so as not to cause any inconvenience.]","[Hah!]","[As for the letters, it would cause a fuss if those were forwarded directly to us. I would prefer to leave handling such letters with Canaris and have you deliver them to me. I know it will be a hassle for you, but what do you think?]","[Of course, I don't mind! If I can be of service to Nebula-sama, I will happily do so!]","In the end, Canaris was asked to act as a liaison with Nebula's former subordinates, and Canaris, who was eager to work for the master after being reunited with her after a long time, nodded many times, looking really happy.","Just like that, they continued to discuss the details over tea, and when they had reached a certain degree of agreement, Canaris got up from her seat and bowed deeply before Nebula.","[......I have a favor to ask Nebula-sama!]","[Unn? Speak.]","[I will not interfere with Nebula-sama's present life! I will be courteous to Shallow Vernal and ask for permission! I will definitely adapt to the common sense of this world! So please...... Allow me to serve by Nebula-sama's side again!]","[......Fumu.]","It's a truly heartfelt wish, and upon hearing it, Nebula seemed to be pondering about it a bit.","[......I don't mind, but there are conditions...... or rather, there are some things you will have to adapt to. As I said before, I recognize that my current situation is a new life, and with it a change in status and other aspects. If you are to serve by my side, you will need to become accustomed to these changes.]","[Yes! I will show you that I can accomplish anything, no matter the difficulty!!!]","[I see, well then...... In this world, you are to address me as \"Nebula\" without the honorifics, or you either opt for \"-chan\" or \"-san\". You are also not to humble yourself like that, treating me frankly. And as I will also call you with \"-san\" and \"speak to you in a polite tone\", you must adapt to it without feeling uncomfortable at all.]","[..................Ahh~~ Umm...... Please wait. I was too awe-inspired that I feel like throwing up...... The extreme loyalty to Nebula-sama within me just......]","Seeing Canaris' enthusiasm from a moment ago and her face, still as expressionless as ever, turning pale, Nebula thought \"Seems like this is going to take some time\" to herself.","<Afterword>","? ? ? : [It seems like the story will be returning to the party next chapter huh.]","Serious-senpai : [Eh? Umm, seriousness...... happened? While I was gone...... again?]"]},{"number":1907,"title":"Chapter 1907: Ship Party 27","paragraphs":["<Author's Notes>","I was busy celebrating my birthday so I didn't have the time to write, so today's chapter is a short one.","As I was moving around the party venue greeting people I saw, I suddenly spotted a group with an unusual combination. The people I was looking at were a group made up of Shigenobu-san, Hannah-san, Rei-san and Fia-san...... those people making a group is not unusual. I had heard from Shigenobu-san and Sieg-san that Rei-san and Fia-san used to be Shigenobu-san's old traveling companions, so there was no question why they were together.","What was unexpected was Chapel-san, the manager of the Monster Racetrack, being there with them. And since they seemed to be quite friendly with each other, I wonder if they might be acquaintances.","[Hello, everyone. Thank you for coming today.]","[Ahh, Miyama-kun. Thank you for the invitation.]","[Ou, making rounds must be rough, isn't it?]","When I approached them, Rei-san and Shigenobbu-san were the first to respond, and the others greeted me in turn. Of course, Chapel-san was among them.","[Good gracious, even though we have only been acquainted through the purchase of the Behemoth, it's an honor to have been invited to this event.]","[Since this is my first time hosting a party, I sent invitations to everyone I know who I could contact...... but this was a combination I hadn't expected. I mean, is Chapel-san acquainted with Shigenobu-san and the others?]","[Hahaha, how should I say this...... We've got a bit of a rotten relationship.]","In response to my question, Chapel-san gave a wry smile and nodded. From this feeling, I think that Chapel-san might also have been a travel companion of Shigenobu-san.","At first glance, it seems that there might be a considerable age difference between Shigenobu-san and Chapel-san, but in this world, there are many people whose appearance and age don't match, so it's hard to judge based on age.","[Well, Miyama-kun, as you probably figured out from our conversation just now, Chapel-kun is also one of our traveling companions.]","[If we were to exclude our children and grandchildren, he might be the youngest among us traveling companions.]","Hearing Fia-san and Hannah-san's words, Chapel-san smiled with some embarrassment.","[Well, even so, for that vase maniac to now be the manager of the Monster Race, I never thought I'd see you again in a place like this!]","[Wait, Shigenobu-dono...... Please stop with that weird way of speaking. It might make Miyama-dono misunderstand some things...... To briefly explain to Miyama-dono, who is unaware of the circumstances, I was born into a family of traveling merchants. When I was young, I saw a beautiful vase at one of the trading destinations and couldn't forget it, so I joined Shigenobu-dono and the others on their journey to find it.]","[Ahh, I see......]","[It took a considerable amount of time, but I eventually obtained the vase I was looking for. After that, I left the journey and returned to my homeland, the Archlesia Empire. Through various connections there, I was eventually appointed as the manager of the Monster Racetrack.]","This is a very unexpected turn of events. From the way he spoke earlier, I got the feeling that they had not met since he left their journey.","As was the case with Kaori-san, there are a certain number of people who don't have a hummingbird, so contacting each other must have been difficult.","Well, whatever the case may be, I am very happy that they were able to meet again because of this party.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [Isn't the period until reappearance longer than that of Seigi-san?]"]},{"number":1908,"title":"Chapter 1908: Ship Party 28","paragraphs":["As I moved from the area where Shigenobu-san's group is hanging out to the next one...... I found another unusual combination. One of them was someone I know very well...... Noir-san, but the one with her was Rachel-san.","Rachel-san, the head of the Knight Order of Symphonia Kingdom, and Noir-san...... Ahh~~ Perhaps they knew each other back when Noir-san was active as an Adventurer?","[Hello, Noir-san, Rachel-san. Thank you for coming today.]","[Hello, Miyama-san. Thank you for the pleasant party.]","[If it isn't Miyama-sama, it's been a long time. Even though we've only had limited interaction, I'm honored to have received an invitation.]","Seeing Noir-san, who greets me with a gentle smile, and Rachel-san, who greets me with a neat bow, I couldn't help smiling.","[You two are acquainted with each other? I suppose it was when you were adventurers?]","[Yes, that's indeed the case. There are times when Knight Order and the Adventurers would jointly take down enemy units, so the Highest-ranking Adventurer at that time, Noir-san, and I often shared the front lines together.]","[How nostalgic. I'm very grateful to you for your help back then.]","As I thought, the two of them really had worked together in subjugating monsters...... I suppose they're so-called comrade-in-arms.","[Noir-dono was an exceptional talent, and I felt it was regrettable when I heard about her retirement. Given that it was due to health issues though, it can't be helped.]","[It had already been getting tough for me to fight at that time. It might also be that I relaxed a bit because Lu-chan has become skilled enough to be called a full-fledged adventurer...... but it has become difficult for me to continue my activities as an adventurer.]","[Come to think of it, even back when we first met, you seemed to be suffering from anemia.]","[Yes, it was gradually getting worse, and I'm ashamed to say that there were days when it was difficult for me to even go out.]","Nowadays, Noir-san seems to be healthy, and according to Luna-san, she hasn't had any episodes of anemia recently and seems to be doing well. However, when I first met her, she was suffering quite a bit on the roadside, so it's clear that continuing her activities as an adventurer was indeed difficult for her.","[But now, Noir-dono's full of vitality. Have you completely recovered from anemia?]","[Yes. I have become completely healthy since I started taking in Miyama-san's warm essence into my body.]","[......Huh? Eh?]","[Thanks to this, my complexion has improved, and I seem to have gotten healthy enough to even consider resuming my adventuring career. But well, I've become quite addicted to Miyama-san's essence that I'm feeling a bit immodest for always desiring it. Personally, I would like to have more, but Dr. Vier is very strict......]","[......A- Ahh, so that's how it is...... So you two had such......]","[No, phrasing!? It's a misunderstanding! You're getting it wrong!]","It's not like Noir-san was lying. However, the way she said it was so badly worded that Rachel-san didn't understand that she was talking about blood.","I mean, when she said it with flushed cheeks and an ecstatic expression on her face, one full of allure, even I, who knew the situation, couldn't help but be taken aback and my reaction was delayed.","[Come to think of it, Noir-dono lost her husband long ago, didn't you? I'm a Demon who was an Undead, and my husband is also an Undead, so there are some aspects that are difficult for me to sympathize with, but I'm genuinely delighted to see you finding a new love and becoming more positive.]","[Yes. Miyama-san already has a firm hold of my heart after all.]","[Wait, Noir-san!?]","The scenario has been completed with Rachel-san misunderstanding, and while Noir-san probably realizes the mistake, she doesn't seem particularly inclined to deny it, and instead seems to be going along with it.","Casting a fleeting glance my way, Noir-san had a mischievous smile on her face. It made me think that, despite their differences, being mother and daughter, there are similarities between her and Luna-san...... That aside though, how am I going to clear up Rachel-san's misunderstandings......","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [Rather than kidding, I feel like Noir's nonchalantly being serious there.]"]},{"number":1909,"title":"Chapter 1909: Ship Party 29","paragraphs":["At any rate, after frantic explanations, I managed to clear up Rachel-san's misunderstanding.","[I see, so that's what she meant...... Since I don't have any blood, I didn't consider that she might be talking about blood.]","[Ahh, come to think of it, Rache-san is a Living Doll, right? Is it like a deceased person's soul residing in a doll?]","[Indeed, there are such examples. Or rather, Living Dolls are typically born through such a process. In my case, you could say I was artificially created...... In my case, my husband created me.]","[I've heard of that. Necromancers can alter their own magic power to artificially create Dead Souls and produced Undead soldiers...... ]","Nodding at Rachel-san's words, Noir-san joins the conversation. In the first place though, I don't really know much about Undead-related Demons. Among those I know, it seems that Sechs and Isis-san fall into that category, but even though they're both considered Undead, I feel that Isis-san and Sechs-san are quite different in nature.","[That's right. In the first place, although we're generally categorized as Undead Demons, our natures vary widely. This might be a redundant explanation for someone like Miyama-sama who uses Sympathy Magic, but emotions dwell within magic power. Negative emotions, in particular, manifest strongly in magic power, and sometimes the emotions of the deceased, which could be called grudges, can bind their souls...... Of course, souls that can't even self-resurrect can't possibly transform into something else. However, interestingly, such negative souls tend to attract similar souls, and it's said that when many souls filled with negative magic power merge, Undead Demons are born. During that process, it's common for them to inhabit some kind of medium, especially something resembling their form back when they were alive, which is why dolls are a popular choice.]","[By \"common for them to inhabit\", does that mean it's not always the case that they'd dwell in something humanoid?]","[That is correct. There are some who inhabit plants and become a tree known as a Living Tree, or simply staying as a cluster of magic power without taking a physical form...... settling into a ghost-like form. However, while it's often heard that she belongs to the Undead, Death King-sama's case is quite unique. In her case, rather than being an Undead, she's more of an embodiment of the concept of death itself...... ecologically speaking, she's more like a Spirit, so it may be more appropriate to describe her as a Spirit of Death.]","Now that she mentioned it, I can see her point. I've felt this before, but Isis-san seems to have a different vibe compared to Sechs-san or Rachel-san. When described as a Spirit embodying the concept of death, it certainly seems to fit.","Well, in fact, since the soul of the Great Evil God of Despair is the core of her existence, she's probably more like a God rather than a Spirit, but since Rachel-san has no way of knowing that, it's only natural she'd think of her as more of a Spirit.","[Returning the topic about me, Necromancers, including my husband, fundamentally utilize the souls of the dead and negative magic power. However, it's not like there are conveniently available Dead Souls or negative magic power whenever they needed to use them. Thus, they basically pseudo-generate Dead Souls by altering their own magic power and use them to create Undead soldiers. In my case, I was created through such a process, so you could say that I'm more like a Magic Doll or a Golem.]","[I see. That said, that's kinda amazing. Pseudo-generating Dead Souls......]","[I'm not acquainted with any necromancers, so I'm not very familiar with them. However, they apparently use quite complex and difficult rituals, which consume a significant amount of magic power. Moreover, it seems that there are few Necromancers to begin with.]","Nodding as I listen to Noir-san's supplementary information, it's true that the Necromancers I know of are just Sechs-san and Rasal-san, both of whom are Peak Count-ranks.","If even Noir-san, who presumably meets various powerful people as an Adventurer, doesn't know any Necromancers, then Necromancy must be that challenging of a magic.","[......This is something I've only heard about from my husband, but Rasal Marfik-sama, who joined Death King-sama's camp, conducted research on negative magic power, using a special circulation method to generate tenfold negative magic power from just one unit of it. After many years of research, Rasal-sama had completed it, which gained praise from my husband, saying that \"the pinnacle of Necromancy is undoubtedly Rasal\".]","Now that she mentioned it, as was the case at the afterparty of the Harmonic Symphony, Sechs-san consistently said that Rasal-san is the best Necromancer in the Demon Realm, and for even Sechs-san, who is known as the Great Sage of the Dead, to honestly admit his defeat, I guess Rasal-san's Necromancy skills is so top-notch.","Even so, it's interesting to hear about things like this that I had never heard of before. In a sense, this may be the best part of the conversations at a party with a variety of people.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [Her kneeling down in a dogeza right from the start had left quite the impression on me, making me think of her as just a cocky necromancer, but as the story progresses, her competence becomes more and more apparent. She's so competent of a subordinate, doing this and that, that I kinda think of her as the most subordinate-like among the Death King's subordinates.]"]},{"number":1910,"title":"Chapter 1910: Ship Party 30","paragraphs":["After speaking with Noir-san and Rachel-san, I was thinking about whose place I should head to next when Caraway on stage began to explain the next sideshow using the Loudspeaker Magic Tool.","\"Everyone, while we are enjoying the party, we have once again prepared a wonderful performance courtesy of Phantasmal King-sama. Many of you may already know this, but Phantasmal King-sama, known for their exceptional talent in various fields, is also a top-notch musician. However, as they seldom appear on stage, it's rare to hear Phantasmal King-sama's performance...... But this time, Phantasmal King-sama will be giving a special performance at this party. Please take a moment to enjoy the wonderful melodies played by Phantasmal King-sama.\"","It seems that more time has passed than I thought. This musical performance was supposed to take place around the halfway point of the party, so about half of the time had already passed.","Taking out my watch, I saw that a fair amount of time had indeed passed. But well, having it at this timing may be a blessing in disguise.","With this in mind, I stopped my round of greetings and headed for the staff door on the side of the stage.","Alice's performance was scheduled to last about 45 minutes, during which time I was to wait in a separate room so as not to disturb the audience.","Well, how should I say this...... That's how it was explained, but it was actually more like my break time. I'm quite grateful to be able to take a break here, because I'm getting tired from going around greeting people.","Or rather, since it's Alice we're talking about here, she must have originally prepared the entertainment for this performance so that I could take a break without worrying about it.","Whatever the case may be, it's a break for me. Let's move to the break room and relax for a while.","With this in mind, I went out through the staff entrance and tried to move towards the break room...... but immediately after, I heard the door I had just passed through open, so I turned around.","Thereupon, for some reason, I saw Dr. Vier emerging from the door.","[Ya, Miyama-kun. You mind if I come here?]","[Y- Yes, that's alright...... but is something the matter?]","[Ahh, no, it's not like I have anything special in mind, but Miyama-kun, you're taking a break, right?]","[Ah, yes. It's decided that the time Alice is performing is considered a break time.]","Upon hearing my response, Dr. Vier nodded with a somewhat satisfied expression on her face. It was as if she had received a response she had anticipated.","[Greeting everyone and attending to various tasks can be tiring after all. As the host, there are aspects that require consideration and attention, so taking breaks is important. And so, I thought I'd help Miyama-kun relax and take a break. You know, I'm pretty good at giving massages and stuff after all.]","[I see, that would be great...... but aren't you going to listen to the performance, Dr. Vier?]","[Unnn. I've already heard Shalltear-sama perform several times, so I'm fine. Besides, you know, I have a hard time staying still watching anyway.]","I smiled back at the chuckling Dr. Vier. In reality, even if I go to the break room, it's not like I can have a nap, so having someone to talk to is appreciated.","It's nice being able to have a leisurely chat with my lover, Dr. Vier, and to be honest, I feel really grateful that she came along with me.","[In that case, I'll take you up on that offer.]","[Unn, unn, you can count on me! Then, let's go to...... Is there an available room around here, Miyama-kun?]","[Yes, it's a waiting room, just a few steps from here.]","[Fumu fumu, then, even if it's just for a short distance, let's hold hands!]","Seeing Dr. Vier cheerfully talking with a bright smile, I naturally found myself in a good mood. Holding the hand she held out to me, we walked towards the break room, our fingers firmly intertwined with each other.","[Ahh, sorry for saying it late, but the dress suits you really well and you look beautiful in it.]","[Yay, thanks! Since I usually make my clothes with magic, I tend to wear the same ones all the time, so I was a bit worried. But it's reassuring to hear you say that, Miyama-kun.]","[Ah~~ I see, I used to think it was convenient making clothes with magic, but I realize now that one drawback is that if you're not mindful about it, you'd end up looking the same everyday.]","[Unn. Of course, I can change into different outfits, but it requires a bit of tweaking with the spell, which can be a hassle, so it's often easier to stick with the same outfit. If I erase and recreate my outfit, I can clean the stains right away, which definitely makes it convenient.]","Maintaining the clothes also requires a fair amount of magic power, so it's challenging to create clothes with magic unless someone's reasonably powerful. Well, it seems that there are some people like Kong-san who aren't good at it even if they're powerful......","Chatting calmly just like that, we walked down the corridor.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [W- Wait a second there...... Isn't this party supposed to be just filled with heartwarming exchange of greetings? S- Somehow, it kinda shifted to one where he's taking a break together with just his lover......]"]},{"number":1911,"title":"Chapter 1911: Ship Party 31","paragraphs":["The room used as a lounge is quite spacious and has a large sofa, as to be expected of a luxury cruise ship. There was also a table and chairs nearby, the same spot where I had tea with Shiro-san earlier...... but this time, since I'm going to take a break, I wanted to relax on the sofa.","[Dr. Vier, would doing it on the sofa be alright?]","[Unn.]","[Then, let me get us something to drink from my magic box......]","[Whoa there, that won't do, Miyama-kun.]","[Eh?]","Sitting down on the sofa, I was about to bring out some tea or the like from my magic box, when Dr. Vier asked me to stop.","[It's currently Miyama-kun's break time, so you shouldn't try to entertain me here. Miyama-kun is an earnest, kind and really good boy...... but you really aren't good at taking proper rests, so I'd like you to just leave matters like that to me.]","[I see, if that's what the doctor recommends, I have no choice but to obey. Well then, I'll take you up on your offer and leave matters to you, Dr. Vier.]","[Unn. That said, Miyama-kun, is your throat parched?]","[No, I had some drinks back at the party, so not at all.]","When she said I'm bad at resting, I can't help but agree. In fact, there has also been that time in the past when Kuro got mad at me for not taking enough breaks, and how should I say this...... Even though I had been telling off Anima for this matter before, one way or another, us master and retainer ended up resembling each other, both of us not being very good at resting.","I guess it's just part of my personality. Somehow, I just keep thinking I need to do this or I have to do that. And so, it really might be better to leave matters to Dr. Vier and make sure I take a proper rest.","[I see, I'm not thirsty either...... so I think we can do without the drinks. Well then, given the opportunity, I'll give you a massage on your shoulders and back. Being in such a party would make people conscious of the fatigue their legs would have, but if you've been standing with good posture for a long time, the muscles on your back can get stiff, which can later lead to shoulder and back pain.]","[I see...... Indeed, now that you mentioned it, I do feel a bit tense around my shoulder blades.]","[Unn. That area tends to take on a lot of stress. It's important to loosen it up before you start feeling pain. We can do it while sitting, but since the sofa is wide enough, why don't you lie down on your stomach a bit? I'll cast State Preservation Magic on your clothes, so you don't have to worry about wrinkles...... but for ease of massage, I'd appreciate it if you'd take off your jacket.]","[I understand.]","Following Dr. Vier's words, I take off my suit jacket and hang it on the hanger rack in my room. Then, I lay down on the sofa in a prone position.","The sofa itself is quite large, so there's plenty of room to lie on my face.","[Then, I'm going to massage your neck, shoulders and back. Let me know if it hurts.]","[Yes. I'm in your care.]","When I told her so, Dr. Vier's hands touched my neck, giving me a gentle massage that seemed to loosen up my entire body. It wasn't too strong, but it felt like she was relaxing my muscles...... and it felt very good.","Dr. Vier's skillful massage was probably the main factor, but I felt like the tension around my neck was gradually easing away.","[Miyama-kun, how is it? Is the strength alright?]","[Yes...... Or rather, it felt extremely good. I've had my shoulders massaged a bit before, but Dr. Vier is really good at massaging huh. As a doctor, do you often give massages?]","[No, not at all. I am knowledgeable about the structure of a human's body, so I do know which spots could help you feel relaxed, but I don't have the opportunity to give massages in my daily work as a doctor. When people come to see a doctor, they’re often there when they have severe muscle pain or sore muscles, and massaging them in such a condition can damage the muscles, so I don't massage them, but apply medicine. If their symptoms are severe, I'd instead opt for Healing Magic.]","Well, Healing Magic would certainly be a quicker treatment. Massages have the advantage of being pleasant and relaxing, but medicine or Healing Magic would be more appropriate for treatments.","The purpose of massages was only to help me relax and recover from fatigue, not for her to treat me as a doctor, so that's why she's giving me a massage.","While I had such thoughts in mind, Dr. Vier suddenly brought her mouth close to my ear and whispered in a sweet, bewitching voice.","[......That's why, my massage...... is a special service only for my beloved Miyama-kun...... or something like that, fufu.]","As her warm breath tickled my ear, my heart couldn't help skipping a beat. This slight warmth in my cheeks, whether it's from the improved blood circulation due to the massage or perhaps from embarrassment...... isn't something I'm quite sure about, but it's something that doesn't make me feel bad.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [G- Guhaak...... I knew it would turn out this way, d*mn it!]"]},{"number":1912,"title":"Chapter 1912: Ship Party 32","paragraphs":["It wasn't a long massage, maybe lasting for about 10 or 15 minutes, but it was very effective, as when I got up afterward, my shoulders and other parts of my body felt noticeably lighter.","[Ohh, amazing. My shoulders feel so light and it feels so much better.]","[I think the massage has improved your blood circulation, so you'd probably feel like you can move better than usual. Well, even if that's so, you shouldn't push yourself too hard, okay?]","[Yes.]","[Unn, unn, that's a good answer. Well then, that's the end of the \"physical\" care!]","[Thank you ve...... Unn? Physical?]","I wonder why, there was just something odd about the way Dr. Vier spoke. She expressly emphasized \"physical\" in a peculiar way, as if suggesting there's another type of care.","And as if to confirm my thoughts, Dr. Vier leisurely spread her hands in front of me.","[Unn, the next step is mental care...... a relaxation for the mind. As for this one, I've explained it before, so there's no need to explain it in detail again, right?]","[Ahh~~ Errr, this....... would be that, right?]","[Unn, it's hugs. Of course, Miyama-kun's wishes are the top priority, so if you're not in the mood, it's perfectly fine to just chat casually.]","I think putting it that way is very unfair. It's not that I dislike it or anything, rather, that proposal is just too attractive. To be honest, when she hugged me before, it felt so good that it almost became addictive, and even now, when she made such a suggestion, I recalled how it felt back then and my heart started to anticipate it.","If I could simply ignore the embarrassment, it couldn't be more appealing, and in fact, it is incredibly relaxing...... N- No, but well, it's just the two of us anyway, and we've already done it once before......","[......T- Then, may I take you up on your offer?]","[Unn! Of course. Errr, considering the time you'd be back at the party...... We should be fine for another 15 minutes, so you can lean on me as much as you want during that time. Ahh, of course, extensions are okay too. I'll use Barrier Magic to shift our time a bit, so if you let me know about 5 minutes in advance, I think I can extend it quite a bit. Well, we can go with the flow, and decide on stuff based on how you feel at the moment......And so, come on, Miyama-kun.]","Dr. Vier's magnanimity, or rather, her motherly nature at times like this is so overwhelming that when she softly calls my name, I find myself drawn to her.","Then, Dr. Vier gently holds my head in her arms and slowly strokes my head. It really feels incredibly comforting, like something that could really become a habit...... No, I think this may have already become a slight habit.","No words were spoken, but a pleasant fragrance and a soft, comforting warmth seems to slowly melt away my thoughts. It's like a slight numbness in the back of my head, not ticklish or unpleasant...... It feels reassuring, and I can feel my mind relaxing.","......I do feel embarrassed...... but more than that, I feel comfortable and happy, making me feel it's regrettable that we'd have to finish this up in 15 minutes. No, I mean, I'm sure I will ask for an extension.","Perhaps sensing my feelings, Dr. Vier stopped her hand that was stroking my head for a moment, and when I glanced sideways towards her, I saw her lightly waving her finger to manifest a magic circle.","At the same time, at the venue of a ship party. By the wall away from the stage where the performance was taking place, Otherworld God Makina had an indescribably frustrated expression on her face.","[I- I was late......]","[......Huh?]","[Not only taking care of my beloved child's physical body, but also mental care with a loving embrace...... T- That's the kind of thing I, his mother, should be doing...... D*mn it, I hadn't noticed her at all, but Vier huh...... She's got quite the motherliness in her. I'll remember her name———-]","[Don't peek at them.]","[———Ouch!?]","As Makina suddenly started speaking with a serious expression on her face, Alice dropped down her knuckle on Makina's head and sighed in exasperation. Alice is naturally aware that Kaito and Vier have slipped out of the venue, but to ensure she's not interrupting their lover time together, she has stationed her guard clones a fair distance away from the break room.","[Uuu, no, I'm not going to peek in any further...... Even still, that was a shame. If I had been there, I could have been the one providing my beloved child mental care......]","[And why do you think you can fit in the same framework as Vier-san? You're not someone who relaxes Kaito-san's mind, you're the one giving the burden, okay?]","[It's alright, I'm his mother after all. Engulfed by Mother's love, my beloved child will be relaxed a lot! There's no mistaking it!!!]","[Yeah, leave the dreaming to when you're sleeping.]","[———Ouuuuuuch!? Wait, Alice!? You've been hitting me too hard since a while ago. Alice said you would never let me participate unless I dropped this terminal's durability, so you do know that this terminal's durability had been lowered and what you're doing normally hurts, right!?]","Yes, in order to participate in this party, Alice has presented Makina with various conditions, among which include the reduction of durability of the current terminal she's operating and pain being transmitted without blocking it. Of course, this is a measure to stop Makina by hitting her when she gets out of control.","[Of course, I know that. If you still had that durability that was at a ridiculous level where attacks with firepower capable of obliterating regular multidimensional beings wouldn't even leave a scratch, the world would be in serious trouble before I could even inflict any sort of damage......]","[Fufun, well, I'm very strong aft———– Ouch!?]","Perhaps bothered by Makina looking smug, Alice's fist struck down Makina's head for the third time, leaving her clutching her head and momentarily incapacitated.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [G- Ghaak, d- d*mn it, that's some pretty destructive power..... Also, Makina's caretaker is doing her job properly huh......]"]},{"number":1913,"title":"Chapter 1913: Ship Party 33","paragraphs":["The break with Eden-san eventually ended up being extended for a while, but it allowed me to take a good rest and relax.","After thanking Vier-san and dropping her off at the venue, it was time to resume the meet and greet. I was feeling energetic and full of energy both physically and mentally, so I was ready to go out with a bang...... is what I would like to say, but well, as expected, even I wouldn't be that enthusiastic.","[Oya? If it isn't my beloved child, back from your break?]","[Ah, hello, Eden-san.]","Ah, but this is a bit...... Having to face Eden-san right after I got out of the break is rather tough, like couldn't she have given my heart some time to prepare...... No, I've already greeted Eden-san when she was with Makina-san earlier, but since we have encountered each other by chance like this, it would be strange not to talk with her at all.","However, this might be quite dangerous. I mean, Eden-san called me \"my beloved child\" just now...... Unn? Oya?","[......Arehh?]","[Is something the matter, my beloved child?]","[Ahh, no, Eden-san's atmosphere is...... arehh?]","Eden-san now started calling me \"my beloved child\", so based on past experiences, she should have been in a rather advanced phase, but there's absolutely no trace of the madness that I would normally sense at this stage.","Rather, she was smiling at me very calmly, and the atmosphere around her was that of Eden-san who wasn't going on a rampage.","[Ahh, I see...... I understand my beloved child's doubts. To put it simply, the one who holds affection for my beloved child beyond the set standard is the me over there....... Makina, so the one who goes out of control is her. And since Alice had been keeping a tight hold on that me, you can assume that there's no worry about me as Eden going out of control......]","[......Ah, errr, I feel like I get it but at the same time don't...... I don't really feel like you can allot a certain part of your emotions separately...... No, well, I guess it wouldn't be strange if Eden-san could do that.]","I'm bewildered by this mysterious safety system where another version of herself handles any affection beyond a certain level, but the one in front of me is an omniscient and omnipotent God, so it's likely she can manage something like that without any trouble.","And so, the Eden-san in front of me right now is an Eden-san in a state of no fear of running out of control...... An Eden-san who is kind and calm, but is relentless with everyone but her own children.","......That's quite relieving, isn't it? No, Eden-san is originally kind and gentle if she isn't going out of control, and she'd just be a good person...... no, a good God.","In fact, the other otherworlders like Kaori-san adore Eden-san. In my case, I can't let my guard down around her because I have to pay attention to Eden-san, as if I'm not careful, she might suddenly go on a rampage...... but if I didn't have to worry about Eden-san's outburst, I feel like her shortcomings have been completely overcome.","No, it's not like she had overcome it since she just moved the outbursts somewhere elsewhere, and Alice must be having a hard time coping with her......","[How are you doing, my beloved child? I know it must be confusing for you to host a party for the first time, but are you having any trouble?]","[No, I'm having a great time. I've had a good break, so I think I'll be able to resume greeting people again without any problem. Ahh, but with the number of guests and the fact that everyone is moving from place to place as we approach the midpoint of the event, it may be a little difficult to locate those I haven't greeted yet.]","[I see...... Well then, I'll help you with that. I'll touch your head a bit.]","[Eh? You'll help me?]","When I curiously tilted my head, Eden-san lightly touched my head, and her hand glowed with a faint light...... but nothing in particular changed.","Thereupon, Eden-san slightly smiled and spoke.","[I've given my beloved child the ability to \"know the whereabouts of people you haven't greeted yet\" for a limited time until the end of the party. If you think in your mind to find someone you haven't greeted yet, you will naturally know where they are.]","[Eh? That's a huge help. Let me try......]","As Eden-san explained, when I thought about searching for the people I had not yet greeted, I could indeed get a sense of where the people I had not yet greeted were in the venue.","This is very convenient. Without needing to search specifically, I can roughly tell who is where, which would significantly improve the efficiency of making rounds to greet everyone.","[With this, it seems like I can make the rounds to greet everyone quite smoothly. Thank you very much, Eden-san!]","[If I was able to help my beloved child, then I'm happy too. However, my beloved child tends to overwork yourself, so please make sure to take breaks occasionally and do your best at a manageable pace.]","[Ah, yes!]","After gently patting my head with a smile, Eden-san gave me a slight bow before moving away. As I thought, when she's not going out of control, she feels completely different...... If only she were always in that state, I would truly feel at ease......","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [Eh? That's a pretty good system...... If she could just keep using it from now on......]","? ? ? : [Can you not? Do you know how many times I smacked Makina during that conversation between Kaito-san and Eden-san just now......? All the burden is just falling on me......]"]},{"number":1914,"title":"Chapter 1914: Intermission: First Contact","paragraphs":["After being reunited with Nebula, Canaris immediately flew to another world to carry out the orders she had been given. With her pendant as a decisive factor, thinking that someone would soon notice and act upon Nebula's resurrection, it was considered necessary to quickly convey Nebula's instructions.","The first place she visited was the God to whom she had entrusted the world that Canaris had re-created.","[Hello~~ It's been a long———- Uwaaahhh!?]","As Canaris was about to greet them, the God she had approached earlier placed their hands on both of her shoulders and spoke with a serious expression on their face.","(T/N: Not sure what the gender of this God is, probably female coz they refer to themself with \"watashi\", but not 100% sure.)","[Canaris!? We're good friends, aren't we? That's right, you did entrust me with the world Canaris re-created, so we must be good friends, right!? That's also why you came to me first, right? Right?]","[Ahh~~ Yes. Rather, your eyes are bloodshot......]","[Of course, they're gonna be bloodshot!!! I've been waiting here for a long time...... Nebula-sama had been resurrected, right? By the time I noticed, Canaris seemed to have already gone to Shallow Vernal's world, and I thought Nebula-sama would be angry if any trouble was caused in Shallow Vernal's world. Well, there's also the fact that Shallow Vernal is scary, but anyhow, I held back and waited! It's probably not just me who's like this, I think everyone is waiting for Canaris with the same bloodshot eyes.]","[U- Ughh...... I'm supposed to be going around to everyone's places now, but hearing that makes me anxious.]","[That aside, explanations!!!]","[Y- Yeah......]","Though overwhelmed by tremendous enthusiasm, Canaris told them about Nebula's current situation, her will, and the orders she had given through Canaris.","After listening to all of this, the God released their hands from Canaris' shoulders and nodded in understanding.","[......I see, if that's what Nebula-sama says, then I will follow her will. Unn...... but just for a moment, sorry about this, okay?]","[Unn?]","[That's not faaaaaair! Why is it just Canaris who can meet Nebula-sama!? I also want to meet Nebula-samaaaaa......]","[O- Ohh...... W- Well, I understand how you feel. If I were in the opposite position, I would feel envious as well...... Well, meeting her will have to wait until after negotiating with Shallow Vernal.]","[Unn. Since Canaris came to talk to me first, I think I will be the first in order for that negotiation...... That said, negotiating with Shallow Vernal huh...... That's scary.]","[Here's a piece of advice: If you bring along something specific to this world that allows lovers to be lovey-dovey, like certain cultural items or tools, the negotiations will go more smoothly.]","[......Hmm?]","Canaris' advice was extremely accurate, but the God who heard it had no idea what she was talking about, their face like Canaris did when she first negotiated with Shallow Vernal.","After a short conversation, seemingly having remembered something, the God spoke.","[......Come to think of it, I was too concerned about Nebula-sama's current situation earlier to ask, but Canaris, were you able to stay calm when finally reuniting with Nebula-sama? That's absolutely impossible, right?]","[A- Ahh~~ You really are gonna ask that...... I'm a little afraid to talk about it...... Well, as you guessed, I cried a lot in front of Nebula-sama......]","[Unn. I knew that would happen. Even I feel like I'd cry when I finally get to meet her, and Canaris was especially......]","[And, ehehe, Nebula-sama gently hugged the crying me and stroked my head.]","[———-Huh?]","[Tahaa~~ It was truly a moment of bliss. Feeling Nebula-sama's benevolence, my happiness was at its maximum.]","[.......................]","Listening to Canaris happily telling her story, the God put a hand on Canaris' shoulder again with a gentle smile.","[......I see, I'm happy for you. Canaris has been suffering for a long time, and I'm glad you were relieved some of that pain by seeing Nebula-sama again.]","[......I- Is that so...... U- Umm~~? Your hand got crazy strength here though...... my shoulder feels like it's gonna shatter......]","[Unn. I really think it must have been tough for Canaris, and knowing how benevolent Nebula-sama is, her doing such a thing isn't surprising...... Unn. But don't you think that reward is a bit too much? I mean, I'm so jealous I could go crazy here, so you mind if I punch you once? It's okay, right? Sorry, thanks! Then, \"Galaxy Annihilation Punch!\"]","[I didn't consent to it all though!?]","As a side note, this God, who is good friends with Canaris, is also stubbornly loyal to Nebula. While shedding tears of envy at Canaris who was embraced and patted by Nebula, they brandished their fist at her.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [Their loyalty is real, but the way they restrained themself and didn't force their way to Trinia shows that the Absolute had properly educated them.]"]},{"number":1915,"title":"Chapter 1915: Ship Party 34","paragraphs":["With Eden-san's help in making the greeting process very smooth, I resumed the greeting process with great enthusiasm.","Concentrating my attention, I found an area where several people who I hadn't greeted yet were gathered together, so I thought of going there first. The ability I got only tells me the location of the people I haven't greeted yet, not who was where, so I wouldn't know who they were until I got closer to their area.","It seems like three people have grouped together, but I should be able to see them from a distance by now...... Ah, I see, it's Tir-san, Ariel-san and Blossom-san......","[Ahh, it's Kaitokun-san!]","[Hello, Tir-san, Ariel-san, Blossom-san.]","They were the members who weren't present when I went to visit Lillywood-san's area. Lillywood-san told me at that time that they went to eat, so they must have just finished eating and were moving around.","I returned the greeting while smiling back at Tir-san who approached me with a happy smile on her face.","[Greetings...... In other words, hello, Kaito. My gratitude...... In other words, thank you for the invitation.]","[Ohh, if it isn't Master! I'm thrilled to have been invited to this wonderful event! That's the sushi, tempura, and sukiyaki I've heard about, right!?]","[......No, there was sushi, but as for tempura and sukiyaki......]","There certainly was sushi, but we didn't serve tempura or sukiyaki...... Ahh~~ but there was kushiage, which should be close enough...... No, let's stop with that thought. I feel like Akane-san might get mad at me if I say those are similar. There was no tempura and sukiyaki, let's leave it at that.","[Master? Kaitokun-san is the Master?]","[Yes, that's right! Master...... is the Samurai Master!]","Whoa there, Blossom-san started to say weird things...... No, it really is just a misunderstanding, but Blossom-san has already made up her mind that I'm the Samurai Master, and she's so enthusiastic about anything Samurai-related that she doesn't listen to me at all.","[S- S- S- Samurai Master!? Tir didn't know that......]","And now, look there, the pure-hearted Tir-san believed it and looked at me with a shocked look on her face, as if she found out a shocking revelation......","[Speaking of Samurai, Blossom often says that, right? If Kaitokun-san is a Samurai Master, does that mean he's a better samurai than Blossom?]","[That's right. I definitely can't hold a candle against the Master.]","[Hawawawa, t- that's amazing! Tir doesn't know much about samurais, but to be called Master, they must be really amazing! Kaitokun-san must be very, veeeeeery amazing!]","Seeing Tir-san looking at me with a twinkle in her eyes, as if I'm some sort of superhero, I can't help but return a drawn-out smile.","When she looks at me with such pure eyes, it's hard for me to say I'm not...... It kinda felt like I'm destroying a child's dream. No, Tir-san is much older than me but......","As I was thinking about that, Ariel-san patted me on my shoulder.","[I don't misunderstand...... In other words, I think maybe Blossom is just saying that on her own. Having misunderstood must be rough...... In other words, having misunderstood in such a weird way, Kaito must also have it rough. Dealing with matters afterward...... In other words, dealing with Blossom isn't something I can do, but as for Tir, I'll clear up the misunderstanding when she calms down.]","[Ariel-san, thank you very much. I would really appreciate that.]","I was very thankful that Ariel-san didn't seem to misunderstand at all while Blossom-san and Tir-san were excitedly talking about samurai-related topics.","How should I say this...... In this situation where I feel like my side of things was left behind, having someone in a similar situation is incredibly reassuring......","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [In Tirtania's mind, it seems more like \"I don't get what's going on, but that sounds amazing\". Meanwhile, Blossom is still like a rushing locomotive, but I guess she's still much better than the perverts over there among the Ten Demons......]"]},{"number":1916,"title":"Chapter 1916: Ship Party 35","paragraphs":["In a corner of the bustling party venue, two people were facing each other with contrasting expressions on their faces. On one side was Ristia Asmodeus, a.k.a. Lilim, one of the Ten Demons, looking as if she had just bitten a bitter bug, and on the other side was Satania Darklord, a.k.a. Moloch, another member of the Ten Demons, with a somewhat daring smile on her face, seemingly finding the situation enjoyable.","They each participate from a public standpoint, with Ristia as Emperor Chris's mother and Satania as the president of the Lord Trading Company. And it is this public standpoint that is the reason why Ristia's expression is so distorted.","[......My oh my, Satania-san. It's quite an honor to meet you in this way. I heard that my daughter...... Her Majesty Chris had been in your care......]","[Oh my, if it isn't Ristia-sama. Yes, indeed. I believe we have a good relationship with Her Majesty Chris.]","After exchanging smiles and greetings on the surface, Ristia snaps her fingers, casting a barrier around them that muffles any sound from leaking out.","\"With this, there's no worry about the conversation being overheard outside,\" Satania says, her tone relaxing.","[That's quite the repulsed look on your face, Lilim. You seem to be very displeased with your daughter's friendship with me. Fuhaha, this is quite a pleasant thing.]","[Moloch...... I'll ask just in case, but you're not deliberately helping Chris-chan just to agitate me, are you?]","[And what if I said that's right?]","[I'll kill you.]","[Fufu, well, don't worry. It's not like I was trying to harass you. We judged that it would be beneficial for our Lord Trading Company to establish a cooperative relationship with Emperor Chris, who is currently making great strides, as part of the progressive faction, purely based on foreseeing future prospects. Well, even without me explicitly saying it, you probably understand it since you didn't make any moves.]","[Yes, having you and Lord Trading Company's backing is very beneficial to Chris-chan...... though I personally don't find this amusing.]","That's right, Lord Trading Company, led by Satania, has recently been supporting Chris with various forms of assistance. For the progressive Chris, having the backing of a major company has made it easier to take action in various situations, and as a result, the reforms in the Archlesia Empire have advanced significantly.","However, Ristia, who doesn't want Chris to get involved with the Ten Demons, has complicated thoughts regarding this matter. She understands that having such a connection is extremely beneficial to Chris, so she doesn't complain about it...... but still, she's not amused.","[Listen here, okay? Putting aside if it's just a cooperative relationship, if you were to show Chris-chan your creepy hobbies, I won't let you get away with it.]","[Good grief, not appreciating the beauty of skewers, this is why those who are consumed by lust are...... Even without you telling me, I wouldn't talk about my hobbies that might expose my true identity. I do feel it's a pity I can't spread the beauty of skewers though.]","[It's just disgusting, and there's not a shred of beauty in it......]","[Huh? Not understanding how wonderful skewers are, a fool you may be, that's still quite unforgivable...... Given the opportunity, I'd like to talk about the beauty of skewering———– Wait, I'm stopping this conversation with you for a moment.]","[Unn? What are you suddenly———- Ahh, I see.]","Satania, who had been in a wild mood, suddenly seemed to have noticed something and broke off their conversation, took out a hand mirror and started checking her hair.","Ristia tilted her head for a moment, but immediately afterward, sensing the presence of the person heading their way, she nodded her head as if she understood everything.","[Hello, Ristia-san, Nia-san, thank you for coming today.]","[Thank you for inviting us. I love parties, so I'll be enjoying myself.]","[I greet Miyama Kaito-sama with my heartfelt gratitude...... Going out of your way to visit us, I feel myself trembling at your benevolence. As to be expected of Miyama Kaito-sama, a party of this caliber isn't something I see very often......]","[......That's quite the change of attitude you have there from when you're talking to me huh, skewer maniac......]","When Kaito came to greet them, Ristia responded naturally, while Moloch returned the greeting with a graceful bow. Seeing that blatantly obvious change in her attitude, Ristia only let out a deep sigh.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [But in reality, in this situation, Kaito actually thinks more highly of Ristia, who acts naturally and is easygoing, right?]","? ? ? : [Well, Kaito-san would probably be happier if someone treated him that way. Well, Moloch is one of those with bugged loyalty, so it's probably impossible for her to frankly interact with him......]"]},{"number":1917,"title":"Chapter 1917: Ship Party 36","paragraphs":["<Author's Notes>","I didn't have much time, so today's chapter is short.","After talking with Ristia-san and Nia-san for a bit, I resumed my greeting rounds and was moving on, when I suddenly spotted a certain person standing by the wall.","She was dressed in a jet-black dress with a wide back opening due to the wings on her back, standing there with a glass of wine in her hand...... Yes, it was Amel-san.","As usual, she's dressed entirely in black, but since she looks good in them, she actually comes across as quite stylish.","At a quick glance, it looks like she's quietly enjoying a glass of wine in solitude....... but that's probably not the case...... This is just my hunch, but I think she's probably thinking something along the lines of \"That's strange, I'm talking to them quite a bit, but the conversation doesn't last long.\"","How should I say this...... It's like her outward appearance and the person she is inside is different. No, I suppose it's more like how people around have different impressions of Rosemary-san, but she's actually different inside. Well, there's a considerably large difference between Amel-san and Rosemary-san.","Rosemary-san has a fear of strangers and is timid, and when she meets someone for the first time or with whom she's not very familiar, her facial expression stiffens and she becomes nervous and unable to speak, which often makes her misunderstood and avoided by others.","On the other hand, Amel-san is quite sociable, and she often makes a proactive effort to approach people. In fact, she had approached me at the Harmonic Symphony's afterparty, and when we ran a stall together, she often talked to customers.","However, Amel's chuunibyou-like way of speaking can be unintelligible, which makes it difficult for others to understand her intentions, resulting in her being perceived as someone difficult to communicate with.","In fact, just like Lilia-san, even Chris-san, the Emperor of Archlesia Empire where the Wingeds live, also thinks Amel-san is difficult to communicate with, and although she tries to talk with Amel-san, she finds it difficult to continue the conversation.","And so, even at this party, she probably actively engaged in conversations with others, but despite that, the conversation didn't last long, leaving her sipping on her drink alone.","I headed towards Amel-san with such a thought in mind, and a little while later, she noticed me approaching....... and a radiant smile quickly appeared on her face...... a smile that showed her genuine delight to see me.","I might just be seeing things, but I kinda felt like I'm seeing some sort of phantom Pomeranian behind Amel-san.","[My sworn friend!]","[Hello, Amel-san. Thank you for coming today.]","[Hmph, I would fly to the ends of the earth if it's the invitation of my sworn friend. A dazzling banquet it is, shining like a starry sky, and the gathered stars are fierce, somehow also evoking an atmosphere reminiscent of the Sabbath.]","[Ahh~~ I suppose there are many people here that even Amel-san would feel afraid of?]","[Unn, meeting the Six Kings does make me nervous. Of course, I've already met them a few times, but I'm not that close with them, so I'm kinda anx...... Hrnn!? Well, I too am one who bears the burden of my tribe, so I can't approach them with a half-hearted attitude.]","It's just like Amel-san for her true self to occasionally show up, and just like usual, she's got the charming cuteness that never fails to bring a smile to my lips.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [Rosemary = Chihuahua, Amel = Pomeranian huh...... What about Anima?]","? ? ? : [Maybe a Golden Retriever that wags its tail and runs up to its master?]"]},{"number":1918,"title":"Chapter 1918: Ship Party 37","paragraphs":["After talking to the enthusiastic Amel-san, I would normally have gone on to greet the next one, but I kinda wanted to do something about the fact that she was feeling a bit lonely here...... but thinking of someone I could introduce Amel-san to was rather difficult.","For example, if this were Rosemary-san, it would be resolved by having Camellia-san stay nearby for the time being, and there are probably people who can do the same with the method of conversation that Nebula devised.","But in Amel-san's case, the problem lies not in her communication skills. For example, even if I were to introduce someone to Amel-san and explain to them the reason behind her way of speaking, would that mean they could have a friendly conversation with Amel-san without any misunderstandings......? Unfortunately, that doesn't seem possible.","I mean, Aoi-chan and Hina-chan, who are from the same world, should be able to understand the situation if I just say she's a chuuni...... but that doesn't mean they'd be able to understand Amel-san's phrases.","[Amel-san, do you have acquaintances among the participants of the party?]","[I am also a being with a mission. Some of us met at events such as the Festival of Heroes guided by the cycle of fate, while others I only met for a brief time.]","[There are people you meet regularly at events like the Festival of Heroes, while there are others with whom you only have a greeting-level relationship huh......]","Yes, if someone can't understand her way of speaking, they can't have a conversation with Amel-san. Moreover, the tricky part is that there's no specific rule or pattern to this way of speaking. It's not that a specific phrase always has a set meaning; she just chooses phrases that seem cool at the moment, so there's no consistency.","Sometimes, there are phrases that even unknowing people can somewhat understand the meaning of, while there are also times when I, someone familiar with chuunis, have to take a few seconds to process because of its complexity.","Also, I have my Sympathy Magic, so I can somewhat sense what Amel-san wants to convey. I can't read minds like Lillie-san, but I can pick up the gist of her words to some extent...... Ahh, if it's Lillie-san, wouldn't she be able to converse with Amel-san without being confused by her words?","[Incidentally, who do you meet relatively often?]","[I suppose I often meet they who traverse the flames' path. They tend to come following the King of Fierce Battles. However, our bonds haven't strengthened as much as the frequency of our gatherings may suggest. Also, there are occasions where I meet the Spirit of the Red Flower...... but ummm...... that one reads people's minds, so being around her feels uncomfortable...... Hrnn, no, I just don't think we're on the same wavelength.]","......Seems like she's no good. It's evident she isn't comfortable, or rather, she's clearly reluctant to meet her. As I'm always in a state akin to having my mind read by Shiro-san anyway, I personally don't mind her that much, but as Lillie-san had mentioned before, there are people who don't like having their mind read.","I feel more like Amel-san probably just dislikes the idea of having her attempts to act cool rendered useless though.......","[Ahh, that's right. Has Amel-san spoken to those in Isis-san's camp?]","[The King of Frozen Death? No, I don't remember talking to the King of Frozen Death at the festivals, and she used to be quite sca———– Hrnn, she used to emit an intimidating aura, so even I couldn't approach her casually.]","Amel-san is probably thinking of the time when Isis-san was in a rough state. Alice mentioned it as well, but at that time, Isis-san seemed to be in a state where she was almost constantly intimidating those around her...... In fact, when I first encountered her, despite the considerable distance between us, I had visions of death due to her magic power of death.","At that time, there was a high possibility that even if someone has power on the level of a Peerage holder, they would still be intimidated, but if it's the current Isis-san, Amel-san, who has a power on the level of a Peerage holder, should be fine facing her.","[The shopkeeper of the basement bar whom you met before back in my home...... Iris-san is Isis-san's Head Subordinate, and I was thinking that Iris-san and Amel-san seem to get along well.]","[That time's shopkeeper! Unn, indeed, if it's that shopkeeper, she'd understand what I'm saying, and we could be frie...... Hrnn! Indeed, I do sense a familiar power from her. Perhaps she, too, harbors the essence of darkness within her......]","[......Probably so.]","Umm, I'm not included in those that harbor something inside them, right? When you mention harboring darkness, it makes me feel like I'm about to recall some deeply buried embarrassing memories, so I'd rather not go there.","Or rather, it's terrifying how those embarrassing memories from my dark past seem to resurface at the most inconvenient times since I arrived in this world.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [......I was just thinking, that \"Black Violent Star\" nickname Iris had in the Extra Chapters...... Is the one who attached that to her Amel......]"]},{"number":1919,"title":"Chapter 1919: Ship Party 38","paragraphs":["I was thinking of bringing Amel-san to see Iris-san, but by coincidence, we encountered Iris-san along the way.","[Arehh? Iris-san?]","[Unn? Ahh, what a coincidence. I was just coming to get some drinks and food...... We can't have ordinary maids serving Isis-sama after all.]","[Ahh, I see......]","Now that she mentioned it, ordinary maids can't approach Isis-san, so someone among her subordinates has to go get her food and drinks. Although there's a dining area, there's no rule against eating elsewhere, so it's fine to take food and bring it to their preferred area.","[However, meeting you here is just right. I was just on my way to see Iris-san......]","[To see me?]","[The Master of the Secret Realm, the Brightest Star of the Snowy Plains. I'm grateful for this miracle of reuniting with you once more. My sworn friend visiting you is due to the karmic fates I have weaved into motion. My melody reached only chosen ones, and amidst the chaos, it was being consumed by silence, a dilemma my sworn friend worries about.]","[Ahh, I see. Indeed, your unique way of speaking might be hard to understand for those not accustomed to it. If that's the case, I don't mind. I suppose Isis-sama would also be pleased.]","As expected, Iris-san seemed to fully understand Amel-san's way of speaking, nodding without a change in her expression.","Isis-san too, due to her personality, would surely be happy to talk with Amel-san, and with Iris-san there, it would be easy to convey the meaning of Amel-san's words.","While I was thinking about this, Iris-san turned to me, smiled faintly, and spoke.","[You were in the middle of greeting people, weren't you? Leave her to me and return to your rounds.]","[Ah, is that alright?]","[Umu. I was planning to return to Isis-sama's side anyway, and having one more companion with us wasn't a problem. As I said before, having more people around would make Isis-sama pleased. And so, Amel, right? Are you okay with that?]","[I'm not dissatisfied with the path the star guides me.]","[Thanks. Well then, let's go.]","Understanding my situation, Iris-san offered to take care of Amel-san and I thanked her for it. Although I still had some time, since the party was now in the mid-stage, many people I hadn't greeted yet were scattered around, making her suggestion very helpful.","[You also have it rough, my sworn friend.]","[Ahh, no, don't worry about it. I'll be happy if Amel-san enjoys the party. Let's talk again if we have the time.]","[Unn! My sworn friend too, you do your be———- Hrnn! May fortune be by your side.]","Leaving Amel-san in Iris-san's care, I started walking towards the next location.","As I moved around the venue using the ability Eden-san gave me...... I realized there were two people outside the venue I hadn't greeted yet.","Their location was...... the exhibition room. Oh, right, Alice's collection was partially introduced on stage, and then the rest was displayed in the adjacent exhibition room.","And so, these two went to the exhibition room...... Alright, let's head there next.","When I reached the exhibition room, I immediately knew who the two people I had just sensed were. It was Rosemary-san, whose eyes were shining in front of the artworks, and Camellia-san, who was accompanying her.","Rosemary-san loves art after all, so I had a feeling that she's been in this exhibition room ever since the art pieces were introduced on stage.","[Hello, Rosemary-san, Camellia-san. Are you admiring the exhibits?]","[Ahh, Kaito-san, hello. Yes, Eri has been here the whole time, fascinated by everything......]","[Ahh, Kaito-kun. Hello, they're amazing! As expected of Shalltear-sama, her collection is truly amazing. There are so many art pieces here that I had never seen before or had only heard about in rumors.]","[Ahaha, I see you're having fun. Are you looking at a painting right now?]","[Unn! T- This painting is amazing! Ah, w- when you look at it from this angle, the color of the painting......]","[Eh? Ah, wai———-!?]","With excitement I'm seeing from her for the first time, Rosemary-san, looking extremely happy, pulled my hand...... or rather, she hugged my arm and enthusiastically explained the highlights of the paintings to me.","However, suddenly having my arm embraced, I was overwhelmed by the soft sensation and the pleasant scent of roses...... How should I say this...... This is just a sad saga of a man, but no matter how much romantic experience you accumulate, being unexpectedly pressed against a beauty's chest can leave you feeling shaken and unable to calm down.","Of course, I didn't hear much of the explanation that Rosemary-san happily gave me.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [After the Pomeranian, the Chihuahua appeared!?]"]},{"number":1920,"title":"Chapter 1920: Ship Party 39","paragraphs":["Feeling my heart racing as Rosemary-san embraced my arm, to cover it up, I called out to the nearby Camellia-san.","[Rosemary-san is in quite high spirits, isn't she?]","[It seems she's excited to see rare works of art. It's really unusual for Eri to be this aggressive. Well, I think she's just doing it unconsciously and is unaware of her current behavior, and it's about time she noticed it......]","[Eh? What did I not no...... ticed...... Ahh......]","Rosemary-san, who tilted her head at the words Camellia-san said with a wry smile, looked puzzled for a moment, but then, her expression suddenly changing as if she realized something, she glanced alternately between my arm which she was holding onto and my face.","And then, her face turned red and she flusteredly pulled her hands away.","[Ah, I- I- I- I'm sorry, Kaito-kun. I- I really didn't mean to...... Ahh, errr, did your arm hurt?]","[Ahh, no, I'm alright. That did surprise me a bit, but I wasn't hurt.]","[I- I see, I'm glad to hear that.]","[Fufu, unconsciously it may be, but for Eri to hug his arm, that's just proof how much you trust Kaito-san, isn't it?]","I reassured Rosemary-san as she apologized with a flushed face. In actuality, my arm wasn't hurting at all, I just felt my heart racing from feeling the touch of her chest, but that wasn't really something I can tell her about.","The dress that Rosemary-san is currently wearing is designed to be open at the bust, so the feeling of her bare skin against mine was incredibly powerful.","[Even so, there are so many amazing exhibits here huh. I was briefed in advance about the artworks to be introduced on stage at the party...... but I'm not very familiar with the items that are only exhibited here. Are there any unusual ones around?]","I switched the subject so that I don't get my eyes don't awkwardly turn towards her chest. This exhibition room is much larger than I imagined, and it feels like there are all sorts of things displayed here, so I thought it would be a good opportunity to see something unusual.","[Ahh, errr, that one over there is new to me too. I've heard a little about it from Blossom, and she said that iron giants exist in the otherworld, so I was wondering if it was a replica of that......]","[Iron giants? Errr, let's see...... A- Ahh, I see...... It's a robot.]","When I looked at the exhibit that Rosemary-san told me was unusual, what I found was...... unn. Errr...... Isn't that the Great Alice-chan Robo!? I don't know whether that was an action figure or a plastic model, but a miniature-sized version of that robot is being displayed.","......Now then, it seems like this exhibition room has some items that were added as a joke, items created by Alice on a whim, blending in with the rest......","[A robot huh. Neither I nor Lia have seen it before, so we found it quite curious.]","[I guess so. Are they creatures related to Iron Golems? Are they common in Kaito-san's world?]","[Ahh, no, these robots are...... How should I say this...... creations depicted in literary works don't really exist. It's just, there are a lot of people who like them, so there are quite a few different versions of them......]","As I was briefly explaining what a robot is to them, I suddenly realized something. Things had naturally turned out this way with the previous situation where Rosemary-san was holding onto my arm, but currently, I'm sandwiched between Rosemary-san on my right and Camellia-san on my left, both beautiful women.","Being aware of this now kinda makes me a bit embarrassed.","[Unn? Kaito-san, is something the matter?]","[Ahh, no, looking at the positioning we have now, I was just thinking it's kinda like I have a flower in both hands.]","[Flower...... Fumu, is it really alright to consider a Spirit of Grass like me as a flower?]","[H- Hmmm, how should I say this? If it's more like the metaphor back home, meaning that I'm flanked by two glamorous and lovely women, then I definitely have a flower in both hands.]","Not knowing how I should respond to that, I simply conveyed what I was thinking. Thereupon, Camellia-san looked at me blankly, seemingly having heard something completely unexpected.","[Ah, I think she probably didn't think you think that way and is surprised. Lia, even though she's beautiful, has low self-esteem, and there's also her strangely low presence...... It was a shame.]","[Indeed. I also think Camellia-san is a very beautiful woman.]","[Eh? Ah, I- I see...... Thank you.]","[Ahh, of course, Rosemary-san is very beautiful too.]","[Fufu, you were being considerate of me huh. Thank you...... Kaito-kun really is kind.]","Camellia-san, not being used to receiving compliments on her appearance, looked a bit embarrassed, while Rosemary-san seemed slightly more composed. Rosemary-san is just shy around strangers, but she likes glamorous outfits and can be quite proactive with those she has opened her heart to, so she might be more comfortable with this kind of topic than Camellia-san.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [This is just my hunch, but I think Rosemary is the same type as Isis, where feeling happy about being complimented by Kaito comes before any feelings of embarrassment or the like.]"]},{"number":1921,"title":"Chapter 1921: Ship Party 40","paragraphs":["After talking with Rosemary-san and Camellia-san, I returned to the venue and headed back to visit the people I hadn't greeted yet. This time again, I used the ability given to me by Eden-san to go to someone in the vicinity...... but what I found there was a rather unexpected combination.","One of them is Akane-san, and the other is Elise-san...... Do they know each other?","[Hello, Akane-san, Elise-san.]","[Unn? Ahh, Kaito huh, you're making your greeting rounds?]","In response to my words, AKane-san smiled brightly and lightly raised her hand to welcome me, and Elise-sa also spoke with a smile comparable to that of a blooming flower.","[Hello, Kaito-san! Thank you for inviting me to this wonderful party today.]","[......Ah, yes. I'm glad you're enjoying yourself.]","Although there was a beaming smile on her face, the emotions she conveyed through my Sympathy Magic were something along the lines of \"Just quickly get your greetings over with and leave\".","I mean, Alice can also do that, but how in the heck are they doing that!? I can't read people's minds, Sympathy Magic only allows me to somewhat sense emotions carried by their magic power, but somehow, with some unnecessary amazing technique, they're conveying their emotions so precisely that words come to my mind.","[......Errr, have you two known each other before?]","[No, we met at the reception of the venue, and since it was easier for us ordinary folks to talk to each other, we ended up spending time together. I also heard that Elise-san's store makes a variety of accessories, so we were talking about how it would be nice if we could include her products in our line-up as well.]","[Both Akane-san and I feel somewhat overwhelmed by the other guests...... but when the two of us are talking, there's also the advantage of not being approached much.]","To be honest, putting aside Akane-san, I don't really feel like Elise-san is type to be intimidated by such things...... Ahh, but she did seem overawed back in the Six Kings Festival...... Well, she had quite an intense character when in front of me, so I didn't have that image of her in my mind......","As I had such a thought in mind, Elise-san smiled gently and lightly beckoned me over.","[Kaito-san, I think that's a lint I'm seeing there. Please squat down a bit so I can take it off.]","[Eh? Like this?]","At Elise-san's urging, I crouched down, to which she reached out toward my shoulder and whispered into my ear in a voice audible only to me.","[......You got any complaints there or what?]","[N- None.]","[Then, stop with all these stupidities and quickly get going to the next person...... Properly keep an eye out for rests though. Like, it might be a good idea to grab something light to eat at the food corner just as you're heading there to say hello to someone.]","Although she whispered her demands in a somewhat intimidating tone, the fact that she added words of concern at the end suggests that she doesn't dislike me after all.","It seems like while she's in that outsider-oriented facade, she doesn't want to talk much with me.","[Yes. I got it.]","[Thank you. Well, it may have been just a quick greeting, but I'll be on my way to the next area.]","[What, you're quite the restless guy. Ahh, speaking of which, Kaito, have you already gone to say hello to Kaori?]","[No, I haven't said hello to Kaori-san yet.]","[I see...... I think Kaori-san is with the Founder. Even though she had been acting like that, she's a strong girl, but she does tend to feel easily intimidated, so if you see her, you go talk to her and help her relax.]","[I understand. I haven't said hello to Olivia-san either, so I will look for the two of them.]","Smiling at Akane-san's typical caring words, I briefly said goodbye to the two of them before heading toward the next location. While I'd like to go see Kaori-san and Olivia-san next, the ability I have doesn't specifically help me search for someone...... Unn? Arehh?","Until now, I could only vaguely sense where someone I hadn't greeted yet might be, but when I thought \"Where's Kaori-san?\", I suddenly knew where she was.","I see, so if I'm trying to vaguely find someone I haven't greeted yet, I can determine where they are, but if I try to find a specific person, I can determine their location...... This is truly a valuable ability, and I'm sincerely grateful to Eden-san for it.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [At this rate, it looks like this arc will end around 50?]","? ? ? : [He did finish greeting the main characters, so that would likely be the case...... Or rather, those special characters only go up to 50.]"]},{"number":1922,"title":"Chapter 1922: Ship Party 41","paragraphs":["Relying on my ability, I went to Kaori-san and Olivia-san. They seemed to be together, sitting down to eat at a food and beverage corner.","They had their backs to me and didn't seem to notice my approach. As I got closer, I thought it was time to talk to them, but at that moment, I overheard their conversation.","[Like I said, Kaito-kun has plenty of romantic experience, so I think it's better to be straightforward rather than thinking too much about this and that.]","[Indeed, with Miyama Kaito-sama's wisdom, he would be able to see through my shallow plans, and in terms of experience, there's no need to doubt that Miyama Kaito-sama is by far superior to me.]","Arehh? They're talking about me? The same thing happened with Ryze-san and the others, but it felt awkward entering into a conversation where they were talking about me.","That said, I can't just stand here eavesdropping on them, so I'm sorry to interrupt, but I'm going to ask them about it.","[This is quite troubling. How do you suppose I han———]","[Kaori-san, Olivia-san, hello.]","[———-! ? ! ? ! ? ? ! ? ! ]","When I spoke up, Olivia-san seemed startled enough for the chair she was sitting on to make a loud clatter, and after straightening her back, she turned her pale face towards me.","......Eh? I- I didn't think she would be so surprised. I'm sure I didn't speak that loudly......... somehow, it makes me feel apologetic.","[M- M- M- Miyama Kaito-sama!?]","[Ah, yes. I'm sorry for startling you.]","[N- No, it's no problem at all. A- As expected of Miyama Kaito-sama, your presence concealment ability is akin to that of the Phantasmal King. Despite usually radiating a brilliance and presence like the sun that illuminates the three realms just by your mere presence, to completely erase one's presence without any hint of conceit in such a situation...... It's proof of your complete mastery, no, of your complete control of your power, and I'm honored to have learned another wonderful thing about Miyama Kaito-sama!]","It's no good, she's clearly about to blow her fuse. She's on a full-on praising spree...... Also, the reason she didn't notice my approach isn't because I'm hiding my presence, but because she was so engrossed in their conversation, and since we aren't in Friendship City, Olivia-san's abilities are diminished.....","[Olivia-sama, please calm down. You're acting even more unnatural...... Ahaha, Kaito-kun, hello. I'm also focused on my conversation with Olivia-sama, so you suddenly popping out of nowhere surprised me.]","[Ah~~ I'm sorry for interrupting your conversation.]","[No. That's all well and good...... but errr, Kaito-kun...... How much have you heard?]","[Errr, from when you said I have a lot of romantic experience.]","[I see......]","It might have been a conversation best left unheard. I don't think anything particularly important was said from what I heard...... As I thought about this, Kaori-san leaned in close to Olivia-san's ear and whispered something to her.","[It's alright, Olivia-sama. From there, we haven't said anything specific, and I'm sure Kaito-kun hadn't found out about it.]","[Y- You think so? If it's Miyama Kaito-sama, who possesses wisdom that is as close to omniscient as possible, wouldn't he be able to see through everything from the slightest conversation he heard?]","[No, he's not like that. It's going to be alright.......]","I couldn't hear the content of their conversation, but from their atmosphere, it seemed like Olivia-san was feeling flustered while Kaori-san was trying to calm her down. In that case, was Olivia-san feeling uneasy about being overheard?","Hmmm, I'm curious...... but if I thoughtlessly ask here, because it's my question, Olivia-san will tell me honestly even if she doesn't want to, and I want to avoid that...... I suppose it's best if I don't ask?","Waiting for things to calm down between the two of them for the time being, let's then proceed as if we didn't hear the conversation earlier.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [Ah, I see, since she had only talked about this with Shiro during the Founding Festival, Kaito wouldn't know that Olivia was going to ask out on a date......]"]},{"number":1923,"title":"Chapter 1923: Ship Party 42","paragraphs":["For the time being, Olivia-san seemed to have regained her composure, and looking relieved, Kaori-san stepped away.","[I'm sorry to have kept you waiting. It was a great disrespect to keep Miyama Kaito-sama waiting, and I sincerely apologize from the bottom of my heart.]","[No, that's an exaggeration. Please don't worry about it at all. So, did you two have your meal?]","At first glance, Olivia-san still seemed a bit flustered, but it was nothing out of the ordinary for her, so there was no issue. For the time being, as I had decided while waiting, I steered clear from the earlier topic and didn't touch it.","[Yes. Mizuhara Kaori taught me various things and we were having a meal. We've finished eating now, but we were engaged in a lengthy conversation. There were many dishes here that I haven't tried even at Mizuhara Kaori's restaurant, so it felt quite refreshing. I feel like I've gained various insights again this time.]","[I've actually finished with the meal quite early, but I wanted to see the others' reactions, so I stayed behind here. Since I'm involved in the planning stage, I'm naturally curious about their thoughts......]","[Ahh, I see, I understand how you feel. So, how was everyone's reaction?]","[Many regard the dishes as unusual, but overall, it seemed quite well-received. Even Raz-sama came by midway and said they were delicious, which was a relief.]","Upon reflection, it was a perfectly understandable reason. Kaori-san had been quite helpful with the party's lineup of cuisines this time, working with Illness-san and the others to brainstorm the menu, adjust it to suit the palate of the people in this world, and so on...... and so, naturally, their reactions were of interest.","[I'm glad if it was well-received. Actually, I'm thinking of having a little something myself...... Olivia-san, among those you have tried, do you have any recommendations? If you found something you like, I'd like to try it......]","[Eh? F- For me to give my suggestion to Miyama Kaito-sama and influence Miyama Kaito-sama's meal...... What a significant role this is. It feels like the time when I once received the original text of the Treaty of Friendship from Shallow Vernal-sama.]","[No, like I said, that's an exaggeration...... Please just tell me what you think was good without worrying that much.]","If I equate my \"What should I eat~~\" thoughts with the Treaty of Friendship, I might get scolded. Well, I guess that's just Olivia-san's way of feeling awed.","Having learned from past interactions with Olivia-san, it's just right to go a little pushy, so let's push forward with this.","[I suppose so...... Personally, I found the galette delicious.]","[Galette huh, if I'm not mistaken, it was made with potatoes and shirasu...... errr, small fishes, right?]","[Yes. It doesn't have a very assertive flavor, but I liked its simple yet warm taste. The slight saltiness combined with the mild flavor of the small fish felt pleasant on the palate.]","[Olivia-sama prefers dishes with a light taste that emphasizes the flavors of the ingredients rather than strong-flavored sauces.]","[Indeed so. Although it's only a slight difference if I were to compare them to other dishes, I think I prefer delicately flavored dishes...... Ahh, errr, was that a helpful reference?]","Galette is a type of crepe made with buckwheat flour. It isn't exactly Japanese cuisine, but since the theme is dishes from another world, it also counts.","According to Kaori-san, it's simple and easy to arrange, making it easy to adjust and suitable for parties......","[Yes, thank you. Since Olivia-sama told me about it, I'll try the galette you recommended.]","[Ah..... Yes! I'd be very happy if it suits Miyama Kaito-sama's palate. Ahh, no, it's not like I was involved in the production......]","With a smile in response, Olivia-san's expression, which hadn't changed much before, looked rather pleased. Olivia-san's expressions may not change much, but when compared to Shiro-san or Jane-san whom I met a little while ago, whether she's being usual or when she's feeling happy or anxious, her expressions are generally understandable.","She remains as earnest as ever, but conversing like this makes me feel that, despite everything, she's become considerably more flexible and emotionally expressive compared to when we first met.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [Incidentally, galette is a traditional French dish, with the most famous being buckwheat galette from Brittany. Kaito may have slightly misunderstood what kind of dish it is, as galette doesn't necessarily refer exclusively to those made with buckwheat flour. The term \"galette\" generally describes a \"round, flat dish\", so there are galettes made with ingredients other than buckwheat flour as well. One famous example of this is the Galette des Rois, also known as the King's Cake, a type of almond cream pie traditionally eaten in France during New Year celebrations. It's baked with a small ceramic figurine inside, and when the pie is sliced and shared among family members, whoever finds that figurine is said to have good luck for the year.]"]},{"number":1924,"title":"Chapter 1924: Ship Party 43","paragraphs":["After talking with Olivia-san and Kaori-san to some extent and eating a few light dishes, I resumed my greeting rounds. Thanks to the ability Eden-san gave me, I was able to smoothly greet the Six Kings executives whom I hadn't greeted yet and Mitsunaga-kun, proceeding with my greetings at a good tempo.","Originally, I had planned that by the time the greetings were finished, the party would be nearing its end, and I had assumed my own participation in the party would mostly conclude after the greetings. But at this rate, it seems I'll be able to finish the greetings with some margin.","In that case, I would check with Anima and Caraway, and if there was nothing in particular I needed to help with, I might be able to join the party a little more leisurely.","I had a short time to talk to each person because I was moving so fast, and although the number of people I could talk to would be limited, it would be good to have some leisurely chat with my lovers or those close to me.","But well, before that, I should finish greeting everyone first...... Errr, there's one more person near here that I haven't greeted yet...... Ahh, there she is. I see, it's Jutia-san huh. Indeed, when I visited Lillywood-san's area, I heard she had gone to see a friend or something along those lines and I hadn't been able to greet her.","[Hello, Jutia-san. Thank you for coming today.]","[Oya oya, if it isn't Kaito, what a coincidence, what a coincidence, being able to meet Kaito here makes me happy. I'm enjoying this very, very nice party. Thank you for inviting me.]","[Hearing you say that also makes me happy.]","When I spoke to Jutia-san, she responded with a bright smile. That was just as usual, but I wonder why? From what I sensed with my Sympathy Magic, despite her something about it felt different, like she seemed slightly restless.","From what I see, she seemed to be hesitating about something?","[Jutia-san, is something bothering you? No, it might just be my imagination, but you seemed to be feeling restless......]","[Ahh, sorry, sorry. Ah~~ Well, hmmm...... I wonder if it was showing in my face? Now that you asked about it, I suppose saying \"it's nothing\" would be rude. Errr, actually, I heard you're serving a special tea blend commemorating this party, and while it's common to have seasonal specials or blends when commemorating something...... I was wondering if there might be some new tea leaves, and I can't help but get restless about it. I was trying not to ask Kaito because it would trouble you......]","Ahh, I see, word really travels fast huh...... Hearing about it now, I can certainly understand what's going on. Or rather, seeing how upright she is as usual, looking incredibly apologetic while telling me that, I get the feeling she wouldn't have said anything unless I had asked.","I mean, that reminds me...... Ein-san hadn't rushed in first huh. If Jutia-san had caught wind of that information, then Ein-san would definitely have gotten the same information. And yet, she hadn't rushed our way at all.","No, it might be that she's just being considerate because I told her to stop greeting me before the party started, but even if she didn't approach me on her own, she only gave me a brief greeting when I went to greet Kuro...... Maybe she had been strictly ordered by Kuro beforehand.","[It's not a completely new creation, but from what I heard from Nebula, they added a small amount of tea leaves that tasted great, but weren't allowed to be released to the public due to various reasons.]","[Oh my, was it perhaps a treasured tea? Uuu, I'm curious, I'm curious, but under those circumstances, it would be rude to ask for those tea leaves, so I guess I'll just have to settle for what I can get as a souvenir.]","[That would be much appreciated. Ahh, but this is unrelated to this tea today, but we're planning to release our new tea leaves soon.]","[Really!?]","[Whoa!? J- Jutia-san, you're being too close.]","[Ahh, sorry, sorry.]","I was surprised when Jutia-san came very close to my face after hearing the words \"new tea leaves\". When Julietta leaned in close enough for her breath to brush against me, combined with her beauty, I couldn't help but feel my heart race. Also, as usual, she emitted a pleasant scent reminiscent of a forest.","[Yes, as a new product from our tea brand, we're planning to introduce several chocolates with a concept of pairing well with tea...... something like the ones we previously brought to the Harmonic Symphony. Additionally, we'll also be selling tea leaves for warmer climates that are easy to brew with water and suitable for drinking as iced tea.]","[I see, I see! You're now selling tea leaves suitable for iced tea huh...... My oh my, I'm looking forward to it.]","[Just like before, if you'd like some tea leaves, you'll have to ask me or Anima for them. They aren't ready yet, but when the tea leaves are ready, I'll come visit your place again.]","[Thanks! I'll be ready to welcome Kaito when the time comes. I've really, really been under Kaito's care after all.]","[Ahaha, I'll be looking forward to that time then.]","Seeing Jutia-san happily talking, I couldn't help but smile too, and just like that, we continued to enjoy chatting for a while.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [S- SEIGI-SAAAAAAAN!? W- What the heck, even though there was dialogue with characters like Chapel and Rachel, who are almost at the level of extras that most readers would have forgotten, Seigi-san is getting the summary treatment!? Is this kind of absurdity really allowed!?]","? ? ? : [......It's not yet time for him to speak yet after all......]","Serious-senpai : [You'd really going to wait 5 years for that to happen!? Let him speak!!!]"]},{"number":1925,"title":"Chapter 1925: Ship Party 44","paragraphs":["After finishing my conversation with Jutia-san, realizing I had only a few more people left to greet, I headed to the next spot.","In the distance, I saw a tall woman with large, distinctive horns, and a petite woman with jade-colored hair———- It's Tiamat-san and Phenex-san.","Ahh~~ Right, I haven't greeted them yet. They're not the type of people you'd easily forget, but I might have been unconsciously avoiding them.","[Hello, Tiamat-san, Phenex-san.]","[Oya? My oh my, Miyama Kaito-san. Hello, wonderful party, isn't it? Hearing the joyful voices of people makes me feel that the world isn't only full of sorrow.]","[Why, if it isn't my God! You have my greatest gratitude for inviting me. It's an honor to attend a festival hosted by my God.]","When I greeted them, Tiamat-san and Phenex-san responded quite normally. Well, it's not like these two are always going out of control...... but the image of them when they go off the rails is so strong that them being calm feels a bit odd.","[......Arehh? You both have matching accessories? Those seem a bit too rugged to be necklaces though......]","[Ahh, these aren't necklaces...... How do you call it? A type of collar, I suppose?]","[Pandora-san put them on us. If we tried anything funny, she would apparently seal us from a distance and throw us into the sea...... I like pain, but I hate being sealed because it's not painful and it's boring.]","[According to Shalltear-sama's sorrowfully brilliant strategic move, Pandora-sama was given the task of overseeing us Ten Demons this time......]","Ahh, I see. The reason these two, and the Ten Demons in general, are so quiet is because Pandora-san is keeping an eye on them...... Usually, Pandora-san herself has a tendency to go off the rails in private, but she's someone who takes her job seriously. So, by giving her this task, it also prevents her from going out of control......","Alice sure is amazing, keeping in check about half of the problem children just by herself......","[Even though there are so many people I feel like I could get along with, how sorrowful.]","[Tiamat's idea of getting along with someone is synonymous with wanting to kill them after all. As for me, it looks like I won't have any opportunities to feel pleasure this time, so I'll just enjoy the party normally.]","[The food from the other world was quite interesting though. I usually don't leave the Dark Forest, so having the chance to experience the other world's culture felt refreshing.]","[I prefer stronger, more stimulating flavors, but simple food like this is nice once in a while.]","With their fetishes sealed, both seem to be enjoying the party normally, which is a bit of a relief.","Well, when I think about it, both Tiamat-san and Phenex-san have extremely abnormal inclinations, and that's the main issue. With those sealed, they might actually be relatively normal.","[Phenex-san, do you like dishes with strong bitterness or spiciness?]","[Yes. Or rather, I like those that cause pain. It feels good after all.]","[I- I see...... What about you, Tiamat-san?]","[I don't have any particular preference for seasoning, but I do like meat. You know, like striped frogs and such.]","......Striped frogs, I feel like I heard that before...... I think Kuro used them as an ingredient for one of her baby castellas. Anyhow, I guess liking frog meat makes sense since she's a snake?","[Come to think of it, aren't you making your rounds to greet everyone, my God? It must be quite the task with so many people here, isn't it?]","[Yes, it's pretty tiring, but I'm almost done. Only a few more people left to greet.]","[I see. Well then, since we've run into each other, allow us to offer you a moment of respite to our revered God...... Tiamat, would you mind?]","[Ahh, you mean that. I don't mind at all.]","[Unn?]","As I tilted my head, wondering what they were planning, Phenex-san lit a green flame on her fingertip and tossed it toward Tiamat-san, who caught it in her hands.","Thereupon, a pale green light began to emanate from Tiamat-san's hands, transforming into sparkling particles that enveloped my body. It only lasted a few seconds, but it felt like the warmth of a bath spreading throughout my body, and I suddenly felt a bit lighter.","[What was that just now?]","[I used my regenerative flames, which Tiamat diffused with her vibrations to envelop you. It’s a small gesture, but it should help relieve some fatigue.]","[I hadn’t mentioned it before, Miyama Kaito-san, but I can manipulate vibrations, so I used subtle vibrations to lightly massage your body.]","[I see, I certainly do feel a bit lighter. Thank you.]","No, seriously, how should I say this...... As long as their weird fetishes were sealed away, both of them were genuinely good people. No, seriously, the problem brought by their fetishes is just too intense that it overshadows everything else.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [The pervert stopper is working properly. Also, Tiamat had already been mentioned using ultrasonic waves and stuff, but it seems like her ability isn't the manipulation of sound, but vibration huh...... She seems normally strong.]","? ? ? : [Well, she's one of our Executives after all, so she'd be strong. If she wanted to, she could make her targets vibrate like they're in a microwave.]"]},{"number":1926,"title":"Chapter 1926: Ship Party 45","paragraphs":["When I used the ability that Eden-san gave me again, I found that the number of people I had not already greeted was already down to a few, and I had plenty of time to greet them even if I went around quite slowly.","At any rate, there seemed to be one person nearby, so I moved on to the next one...... is what I was thinking, but as I was doing so, I happened to see the person I was aiming for approaching me.","Soon after, I saw Sieg-san with a glass in one hand.","[Sieg-san, hello.]","[Kaito-san, what a coincidence.]","[Yes, come to think of it, when I went to see Lilia-san, and also when I went to see Rei-san and Fia-san, we missed each other and haven't met yet.]","The moment I saw Sieg-san, I thought \"Eh? Hadn't I greeted her already?\", but come to think of it, when I visited Lilia-san, she was with Rei-san and Fia-san, and when I went to the area where Shigenobu-san and the others were, she had almost immediately gone back to Lilia’s place, practically missing each other.","[Our timing certainly didn't mesh well.]","[Have you gone somewhere just now?]","[Yes, I was with Lili for a while and then I went to greet Funf-san and was just about to return.]","Sieg regularly receives teachings from Funf-san, and among the other participants of the party, she has a close relationship with Funf-san. After returning to Lilia-san's place once, now that the entertainment and such have ended and there's a lull, it feels like the right moment to greet them on the way back.","[Kaito-san, is everything going well with greeting everyone?]","[Yes. There are only a few people left, so I have a lot of time to spare.]","[I see...... Fumu, then in a way, it may be fortunate that we didn't see each other until this time. The fact that you've got plenty of time means that I get to talk to Kaito-san at leisure.]","[Indeed, now that you put it that way...... Since we've already met like this, let's talk a little bit more leisurely.]","[Yes. Let's move a little closer to the wall while chatting.]","As Sieg-san said, in terms of timing, meeting at this point is rather fortunate, and there's plenty of time to talk leisurely without any rush.","Thinking about it, it's actually somewhat miraculous that we've been passing each other until now, but I'm starting to feel it's been for the best.","Moving to the wall with Sieg-san to avoid getting in the way of others moving around, I asked a nearby maid for a drink too, lightly toasting with Sieg-san.","[Sieg-san, how do you like the party?]","[It's quite fresh. I sometimes accompany Lili as her escort, but I basically wait outside with Luna instead of entering the party venue, so I don't have much experience actually attending these parties. If we're talking about a similar atmosphere, I guess it's like the party on the final day of the Six Kings Festival?]","[Ahh, now that you mentioned it...... that party was quite lively, and the lineup of the participants may be somewhat similar. Speaking of the Six Kings Festival...... the outfit Sieg-san is wearing......]","[Yes, it's the one you bought for me when we attended the Six Kings Festival. As you might already know, I'm not very comfortable with dresses...... When it comes to events that require formal wear, I rarely have the opportunity to wear them, so this outfit is the most expensive one I have...... Since it was a gift from Kaito-san, I want to take the opportunity to wear it on occasions like this.]","Seeing Sieg-san smile shyly as he said that, I couldn't help but feel a sense of affection welling up inside me, and it naturally brought a smile to my face as well.","[Hearing you say that makes me happy, making me want to give Sieg-san clothes again. No, it's mostly because I want to see Sieg-san dressed in various outfits but...... would you like to go shopping with me again sometime?]","[Yes. I'd love to...... Ahh, but in that case, I would prefer something that I can wear out and about, not something expensive like formal wear. Umm, how should I say this...... Wearing the outfit you bought, I thought it would be nice if we could have a picnic together......]","[That's great. Sounds like a lot of fun. When we went to Rigforeshia together, we did explore the forest, but going somewhere with a beautiful view for a picnic also seemed like a great idea.]","[Yes. At that time, I'll put all my effort into making us a delicious bento.]","[While we're at it, how about we make the bento together? I'm not really as good at cooking as Sieg-san, but doing it together seems like it would be fun......]","[That sounds wonderful. Fufu, how should I say this...... I can't help but feel really excited about it already.]","It came up naturally in the conversation, but having a picnic with Sieg-san really does sound fun. Choosing a wide, secluded spot and bringing along Bell, Lynn, and Sela might also be a good idea.","I thought to myself that next time, I should discuss this in earnest with Sieg-san.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [That's a really unpleasant flag...... but well, his dates with Sieg do tend to be relatively lighthearted......]","? ? ? : [Maybe his relationship with Sieg-san will progress as well~~]","Serious-senpai : [Don't say such horrible things......]"]},{"number":1927,"title":"Chapter 1927: Ship Party 46","paragraphs":["After speaking with Sieg-san, I continued to rely on the ability Eden-san gave me to make the rounds and was able to complete all the greetings in not too much time.","Although the party was reaching its end, there was still quite a bit of time left. Just as I was thinking about what I was going to do, I saw Caraway go up on stage.","\"Everyone, please excuse my interruption again while we're having fun. We will soon move on to the last sideshow of the party. The sideshow will be led by Phantasmal King-sama, and so, without further ado, the stage is theirs.\"","Come to think of it, I think there was a mention of a \"bingo game\" at the end of the sideshow schedule that Alice had given me. I wondered what a bingo game would be like at a party like this, but Alice told me it would be fresh and fun since it's a culture that isn't common in this world.","While I was thinking about this, Alice, in her Phantasmal King form, came up on the stage and spoke. She didn't seem to possess a Loudspeaker Magic Tool, but since it's Alice, she should be able to use Loudspeaker Magic even without it.","\"Yes, yes. Well then, I will now be taking charge of the stage, and we will be playing a little game. It would be a bingo game, one of the entertainments often held at parties in the otherworld where Kaito-san is from. I think there are many people who don't know about it, so I will explain it including the rules. Please enjoy it as an opportunity to experience the culture of another world.\"","After prefacing her explanation with this, Alice explains the rules of the bingo game. Well, the rules aren't that complicated, so after a brief explanation, the introduction of the prizes begins.","The maids seem to be going around handing out bingo cards as they go along, and I'm given one too...... If they expressly handed me one too, does that mean I can join in?","Or rather, the prizes...... Were they prepared by Alice? I did tell her to send an invoice for the sideshow expenses to Anima, but I will check again later to make sure Alice didn't pay out of her own pocket.","\"......Ahh~~ Before we introduce the prizes, I'd like to say a word or two...... We have prohibited the use of Law of Causality Manipulation, Luck Manipulation, Phenomenon Establishment or any such things in this bingo game. We have set up a barrier to prevent such things here in this venue, but everyone, please be prudent. Ahh, and for those Gods who might still try something, we also have some basic countermeasures.\"","That's an unusual warning for a normal bingo game, but since more than half of the people in this venue are capable of Law of Causality Manipulation, Space-Time Magic, Phenomenon Establishment, and other such cheating magic, in a sense, giving out that warning may be important.","And as for Shiro-san and Eden-san, who seem to be able to slip through those countermeasure wards, it seems she also prepared some other countermeasure.","\"The one who prepared the prizes this time is me. Kaito-san has nothing to do with them, and there are no items related to Kaito-san...... Oi, you b*stards! I figured you guys would be aiming for those, but don't blatantly show your lack of interest, you Gods!\"","Upon hearing Alice's words, Shiro-san handed the bingo card she had in her hand to the nearby Chronois-san, while Makina-san placed her bingo card on the table and started drinking her beverage.","Unn, well, those two certainly don't need prizes, able to create whatever they want if they really want it...... Well, if the two of them have lost interest, things would be kinda peaceful in a way.","\"I got a little annoyed with how blatant some people are, but it seems we can go on without a problem, so it's all good. As for the prizes, there will be no \"first prize\" or \"second prize\", but rather, the winners will get to choose what they want with the time they won as the basis for the ordering. I've prepared a wide range of items like magic tools, artworks, and decorations. Most of the prizes are commercially available, but we have asked Nebula, who lives in Kaito-san's house, to help us make some of the prizes. Well, as for the prizes itself, they will be displayed at the back of the stage, so please take a look. There's no time limit for choosing, so feel free to decide after winning. However, since bingo continues while you choose, items with limited quantities are first-come, first-served. Well, that's how it's going to be.\"","After a brief explanation, Caraway, Eta and Theta placed the prizes on the stage. There are quite a variety of things, even some huge ones that look like Teleportation Magic Tools. It looks like there are a lot of gorgeous prizes, but since the participants are all top-class people from various fields, that much might be necessary.","Also, there's some sort of signage...... Errr, \"In cooperation for some of the prizes, Underworld King Kuromueina\"...... Ahh~~ so Kuro is also involved, then the magic tools are from her company? Alice and Kuro are pretty close...... I feel like some sort of light-hearted exchange like \"Kuro-san, please offer the prizes~~\" \"Okay~~\" went for the prizes to be provided.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [Indeed, that's the best possible measure to deter Shiro and Makina. That's why she didn't let Kaito get involved in the preparations for the sideshows huh......]"]},{"number":1928,"title":"Chapter 1928: Ship Party 47","paragraphs":["And so, the bingo game started, but there was nothing special about it, just an ordinary bingo game.","Alice takes a large spherical lottery machine out of nowhere, spins it, takes out a ball with a number written on it, and reads it out. If the number matches, the player makes a hole on that spot in their bingo card.","\"Now then, for our third number, 17...... Let's raise a hand for any of you who are one step away from a bingo~~\"","[......Ah, me.]","\"That's strange. I should have adjusted things so that Blessing effects wouldn't apply, but why are you straight out only one step away from a bingo? No, there are also others who are one step away from bingo but......\"","The bingo card in my hand was indeed one step away from a bingo, as along with the free hole in the middle, I just needed one more...... a 7 and it would be a bingo.","Alice said she had taken precautions, so she had probably negotiated with Shiro-san in advance to make sure my Blessing didn't take effect.","(Yes. As requested, the Luck Correction by my Blessing has been removed for this bingo game.)","Then, this situation really is just a coincidence. Well, it's common in bingo games for someone to be one step away from a bingo early, only to not win for a long time, and in the end, if you don't get a bingo, it's meaningless......","\"Yes. Our next number...... is 7.\"","[......Bingo.]","\"Kaito-san? Did you pick up a Luck Correction buff from a strange place again? Hmmm, but I don't sense any indication of that, so it was just a coincidence...... The probability of getting a bingo straight from the start of the game is about 1 in 500,000, so it's technically not impossible. Anyhow, there seem to be no other bingo players, so congratulations! Now, please go up on the stage and choose your prize. Meanwhile, as Kaito-san chooses his prize, our bingo game continues.\"","It was an unexpected straight-out bingo, earning me the first pick. I'm kinda iffy having the organizer be the first one to pick, but looking around at the participants, I saw no signs of dissatisfaction, and some, such as Isis-san, were clapping happily.","For the time being, I went up on the stage and looked at the prizes, and there were quite a few. However, taking something too big feels kinda awkward here, and there's nothing in particular that I want...... Ah, there's a new book I was thinking of buying later. I'll take this one.","[I'll take this one then.]","\"Yes, yes, alrighty. Then, our next number is......\"","When I picked my prize and got off the stage, the drawing had gone on twice since I won, and there was a second bingo.","[......Eh? Ah..... Eehhh......]","\"Whoa, our second bingo goes to Mizuhara Kaori-san, who runs an Otherworld Restaurant in Friendship City. Congratulations. Now, please go up on the stage and choose your prize.\"","[Ahyii, y- yes......]","To my surprise, the second bingo winner was Kaori-san. Kaori-san was obviously very embarrassed as she walked up to the podium and stood in front of the prize section.","There, she immediately glanced at a large magic tool...... a Teleportation Magic Tool, but I saw her shaking her head frantically and looking towards the items with a lower value.","Seeing Kaori-san, who was clearly being reserved with the others, I went up on the platform again, moved next to her, and whispered.","[......Kaori-san, don't you want the Teleportation Magic Tool?]","[Ueehhh!? K- Kaito-kun...... Uuuu, i- indeed, if not for this opportunity, I would haven't had the chance to get a Teleportation Magic Tool, and it would certainly be really convenient to have one, but it's too expensive for me to choose......]","[No, it should be alright. I mean, to be honest, most of the participants here probably either have Teleportation Magic Tools or can use Teleportation Magic themselves, so there aren't many people who would want it......]","[......Eh? Ahh, i- is that so? Wouldn't doing that be frowned upon?]","[You'll be alright. First, that happening is unlikely, but if anyone complains, I'll protect you, so don't worry.]","[Uuu, saying such a cool thing......]","Since she had won the bingo, I'd really like her to choose what she wants without hesitation. After telling her that if anything happens, I'll take care of it, showing a slightly worried expression for a moment, Kaori-san nodded and called out to Alice.","[U- Umm, Phantasmal King-sama. May I have this Teleportation Magic Tool......]","\"Yes, yes, alrighty. You want to have it placed in a random box for you to take home?\"","[Ahh, I have a magic box, so it's fine. Thank you very much.]","\"Now, there are still a lot of great prizes to be won! It's about time for more bingos to pop out. Our next number......\"","Kaori-san put the Teleportation Magic Tool into her magic box and got off the stage with me.","[I- I was so nervous...... Kaito-kun, thank you for coming. Umm, I was very anxious, so having you there makes me happy.]","[No, I'm glad if I could help you even a little bit.]","[Ugh, y- you're as much of a playboy as always......]","When I responded to Kaori-san's words with a smile, she blushed a little and scratched her cheek with a wry smile.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [It's certainly one of the most expensive magic tools, but it seems like there aren't many people in that party who would want it.]"]},{"number":1929,"title":"Chapter 1929: Ship Party 48","paragraphs":["As the bingo game progressed and the number of bingos increased, Greene and Anne were standing side by side at the edge of the party hall, staring at their bingo cards.","In the middle of the party, Greene was with Lilia and Lunamaria, while Anne was with Tre and Razelia. However, as the party approached its final stages, they regrouped for the last sideshow.","[......Anne-san, hypothetically speaking......]","[What is it?]","[For example, if I got a bingo here and I picked out that extremely expensive-looking necklace with the midnight crystal on display over there, do you think I would gain animosity from the people around?]","[Hmmm. I think it should be fine...... Or rather, up to this point, almost no one has paid any attention to it. Basically, high-ranking Demons often create their clothing with magic, so wouldn't jewelry not be that popular to them?]","Needless to say, being commoners, Greene and Anne are overwhelmed by the prizes lined up on the stage. However, as they had seen the second person to get bingo, Kaori, having a relatively commoner-like demeanor similar to them, they were now just enjoying the bingo game, hoping for a good prize to get if luck happened to be on their side.","Greene's eyes were glued to a necklace that was lavishly adorned with a midnight crystal, a rare and extremely expensive item even by world standards. It was an ornament that would be impossible for her to obtain on her salary, and Greene's eyes sparkled with admiration for such a thing.","[......Even so, despite all the expensive magic tools and ornaments on display, looking at the winners so far, they've chosen almost exclusively artwork and knick-knacks, haven't they?]","[This is just my guess...... but those magic tools on the stage may certainly be of such rank that it's difficult for us to even see them, but as Phantasmal King-sama said at the beginning, aren't they all commercially available? For the top-ranked people from various fields here, they may have custom-made magic tools or be able to use the magic itself on their own, so such things wouldn't be very attractive to them, right?]","[Ahh, I see...... The participants' levels are so high that they either already possess similar items, or if they do need something like it, it wouldn't cost them much to buy it themselves. And so, they're choosing things that they found unusual, such as works of art and knick-knacks......]","[That's what I think. Even Death King-sama, who just got a bingo, also chose a small container......]","Yes, while the magic tools on the stage were indeed luxurious, they wouldn't particularly pique the interest of Human Realm's Rulers and the high-ranking nobles, the Demon Realm's Six Kings and their Executives, or the Divine Realm's Supreme Gods and High-ranking Gods.","Of course, Alice, who prepared the event, had already taken such things into consideration, and right from the start, she had prepared prizes such as magic tools for ordinary people like Greene and Anne, and rare crafts and miscellaneous items for the wealthy participants.","[......By the way, Anne-san, you've also got two slots there that would net you a bingo, but is there something you're looking forward to getting?]","[If it's possible...... I would like to have that magic box. That one on the platform is made with black magic crystal, which is something out of reach for me personally......]","[Oya, you don't have a magic box?]","[No, I do have one, but it's not a very good magic box. When operating as a group, there's a need to bring along a lot of essential items like mining tools, food, and drinks. Even for a medium-sized group, this amounts to quite a quantity. Currently, I'm managing this by preparing several magic boxes made from low-purity magic crystals to handle these needs. However, if I could get my hands on a black magic crystal magic box, I could store everything in a single magic box, which would be incredibly helpful......]","\"Our next number is 22.\"","[———-Eh? Ahh, b- bingo.]","[You did it, Anne-san! Congratulations!]","[T- Thank you. I'll be off for a moment then.]","As they were talking, Anne happened to get bingo on the next number. Smiling happily at Greene's congratulatory words, she made her way to the stage and successfully obtained the magic box she had been aiming for.","Furthermore, two numbers later, Greene also got a bingo, and she was able to acquire the Midnight Crystal necklace that had remained without any issues. All things considered, both of them seemed very happy.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [Ah, I see, if they're all commercially available, then those things are definitely for the general public......]","? ? ? : [Of course, they were prepared after researching in advance who wants what. Alice-chan wants Kaito-san's party to end on a positive note for everyone. However, if those were given away as memorabilia, the guests would instead feel apologetic, so that sideshow was prepared thinking that it would make them feel like they were lucky enough to get it. Kaa~~ Alice-chan is just so talented, as a fan, I couldn't help feeling really happy!!!]","Serious-senpai : [......Well, she actually is quite competent, and as usual, her dedication to acting in the shadows is too great.]"]},{"number":1930,"title":"Chapter 1930: Ship Party 49","paragraphs":["With the bingo game, which was the last sideshow, over, the party was now in its final stages. I had already done my round of greetings, so all I had to do was to say a few last words to close the party.","Well, I just wanted to say \"Thank you very much for your time today and I look forward to having this opportunity again\", not having to talk too long, so it's not a problem.","Looking around the venue, the atmosphere of the place was that everyone was leisurely chatting, as if they knew that the end of the event was near.","However, even so, it seems that things have grown quite large since we started thinking about how to make use of the magic ship I had been given.","It was quite hectic, but moving around busily here and there somehow ended up being fun. No, it would be tough to organize events like this regularly, but doing it occasionally in a festive mood was enjoyable, enough that I might consider hosting a party again after some time has passed and if I feel like it.","There were no major unexpected events, and the party went on quite peacefully......","(Kaito-san, there's something I'd like to consult with you. I've consulted with Earth God and I'd like to give you a little gift as a thank you for the party, how about it?)","......Eh? At this time? What's more, it's something you're jointly doing with Eden-san...... or rather, Makina-san? Is that going to be alright? I feel like it could cause a big fuss......","(I don't think there will be a problem. The suggestion to set off some fireworks had just been brought up earlier, so there wasn't really a need for us to prepare anything. According to Earth God, they intend to prepare traditional Japanese fireworks, so the atmosphere will be a bit different from those in this world.)","I see, well, I'm not sure about its origins at all, but fireworks do have a strong image within Japanese culture, and there are fireworks in this world as well, perhaps introduced by past Hero Actors, but I felt that there weren't many types around.","This party served Japanese food, along with some other stuff that fit the \"otherworld culture\" theme, so it might not be a bad idea to have fireworks at the end of the party.","(Since Kaito-san also seems to be feeling favorable to the idea, let's set off around \"100,000 fireworks\"......)","Please stop right there! T- That number is just wrong! Since we have no idea how long it would take to set off 100,000 fireworks, considering the duration of the party, please limit it to an amount that will last about 20 to 30 minutes.","(I see, I understand.)","Also, please talk about this to Caraway, who's facilitating the event...... Ahh, no, Caraway or Anima would panic if Shiro-san suddenly brought that up to them......","Errr, I'm going to be the facilitator then? However, can I really move the event along in a timely manner......","[......Alice, are you aware of the situation?]","[I wasn't really listening to whatever it was, but I was paying attention to what Shallow Vernal-sama and Makina were talking about...... I'll take a peek at your memory. Ahh, I see...... I'll handle the proceedings then.]","[That would be great, thank you.]","[Well, considering those Gods, this is still them being relatively calm, so let's think of this kind of unexpected plan as manageable.]","Alice is really reliable; she quickly understands the situation by glancing at my memories and immediately takes action, which is incredibly reassuring. I've relied on her quite a bit for this party, so I feel bad adding more to her plate, but I’m relieved that she’s taken on the role of emcee.","Shortly thereafter, it seemed like Alice had informed Caraway and Anima, as I saw Caraway, who was likely checking on the timing backstage, retreat further back.","A little later, Caraway climbed onto the stage with a Loudspeaker Magic Tool...... but that Caraway’s probably Alice in disguise using transformation magic.","\"Everyone, the party is nearing its end, but before that, we have an unscheduled surprise event to add. To commemorate this party, by the graciousness of the God of this world, Shallow Vernal-sama, and the otherworld God Eden-sama, there will be fireworks in about 30 minutes. You can view them from these windows, but for those who want a clearer view, we will temporarily open the deck. If you wish to watch from there, please follow the maids near the door.\"","Looking toward the mentioned doors, I saw several maids waiting...... but I didn’t recognize any of them, so they were probably Alice’s clones. How should I say this...... She’s really too capable.","I was truly saved by her, so let's thank her next time by treating her to a delicious meal.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [W- Well, considering those two Gods, at least they didn't do it on their own. That's something.]","? ? ? : [It would have been nice if they had told us earlier, but I guess that was just a spontaneous idea. Well, if it's just something like this, that's manageable......]","T/N: Managed to skid in some time, but I won't be around for the next couple of days or so. IRL stuff happening."]},{"number":1931,"title":"Chapter 1931: Ship Party 50","paragraphs":["Well, in the end, no one stayed inside the hall to watch the fireworks through the windows; everyone moved to the deck to watch the fireworks.","The party started while it was still bright, but now the sun had completely set, providing a perfect setting for the fireworks.","[Master, thank you for the hard work.]","[I'm the one who should be telling you that, Anima. You've been directing things the whole time, haven't you? Thank you...... Now it's just greeting and seeing people off, then cleaning up, so we can be a bit more relaxed.]","[Yes.]","While waiting for the fireworks to start, Anima came close, and we exchanged words of appreciation. Anima had mostly been working behind the scenes, directing everything. Unlike Caraway, who I occasionally saw hosting the event, or Eta and Theta, who were moving art pieces, I barely saw Anima during the party.","As we talked, the fireworks began. With a loud sound, colorful fireworks appeared in the night sky, captivating us with their beauty.","Since we were on the open sea with no obstructions, the view was incredibly clear and felt quite luxurious. Actually, given how far out at sea we were, it wasn't a place where fireworks would normally be set off, so these fireworks created using Gods' power were indeed quite extravagant.","[It's a magnificent sight. I've seen fireworks before, but these seem much more vivid and intricately designed than what I'm familiar with.]","[In my world, events called fireworks festivals exist...... They're events where watching the fireworks was the main attraction, and they were quite popular.]","This time, with Makina-san's involvement, the fireworks were quite elaborate, reminding me of the fireworks festivals I attended in the past. Glancing to my side, I saw Anima enjoying the display, her eyes shining as she looked up at the sky.","Well, since she was right beside me, I gently held Anima's hand...... She looked surprised for a moment, but then she smiled and intertwined her fingers with mine.","Without saying anything more, we just stood side by side, watching the beautiful fireworks.","After watching the fireworks, we returned to the party venue for the closing remarks. Since we were wrapping things up, it was the perfect time to give the final speech, so I took the Loudspeaker Magic Tool and stepped onto the stage.","\"Once again, thank you all for coming to the onboard party today. Since this was my first time hosting a party, there may have been some shortcomings, but I’m glad if you enjoyed it. Despite everything, I had fun planning and organizing the party, so I might host another one like this in the future. If your schedule allows, I hope you can join us again then.\"","The speech was really simple and only took a few minutes. After that, I handed out souvenirs to people as they left the venue, serving as a way to see them off.","The souvenirs consisted of sample tea leaves from Nifty and a special blend prepared by Nebula and Illness-san for today's event, essentially a tea leaves set.","We had considered items like cups, but given the risk of ceramic breaking and the inconvenience of carrying larger items, we settled on the tea leaves set.","[Thank you for today.]","[Likewise...... S- So in here is the blend using Nebula-sama's treasured tea leaves......]","[Ein, you shouldn’t open it here. Wait until we get home.]","[Uuuu...... Yes.]","Ein-san, who momentarily looked like a bloodthirsty carnivore, nodded meekly after being scolded by Kuro.","As I thought, Ein had probably been so well-behaved during the party because Kuro told her to.","[Kuro too, thank you.]","[No, it was a fun party. With Kaito-kun hosting the event, it’s nice because we can enjoy ourselves without worrying too much about our status. I’m looking forward to the next one.]","I see, since I’m not affiliated with any major faction in a public sense, it seems like people were able to enjoy the party without worrying about their respective statuses.","Indeed, in a normal party, someone like Kuro, one of the Six Kings, would be a significant VIP and would likely receive a lot of special attention, which she probably doesn’t enjoy.","In that sense, there’s a demand for parties hosted by me...... It might be a good idea to consider a second one after some time.","With these thoughts in mind, I handed out souvenirs and exchanged a few words with each person...... and just like that, the first party I ever hosted ended.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [Alright, that's the end of the party. There was a bit of flirting at the end, but that much is fine. Now then, on to the next arc.]","? ? ? : [There's still the event where Pandemonium visits with the wine she got from Nebula-san, remember?]","Serious-senpai : [Ah...... Ahhh...... R- Right......]"]},{"number":1932,"title":"Chapter 1932: The Party is Over 1","paragraphs":["The ship party has ended...... but that doesn’t mean everything is over and we can just go home and rest. Even after seeing off the participants, there’s still cleanup and other tasks for us organizers.","The cleanup of the venue will primarily be handled by the maids, so what will I be doing...... Well, I’ll be preparing for the afterparty.","Since the maids helped us out this time, we’re holding an afterparty for the organizers in part of the venue to show our appreciation.","We have some of the food from the party as well as dishes bought from shops...... Well, there’s no real preparation needed since we just take them out of the magic box and arrange them...... Also, each maid has a room prepared for them, so they can either stay on the ship tonight or return home via Teleportation Magic.","As for me, I plan to stay on the magic ship for the night and return tomorrow.","[Miyama-sama, thank you for the hard work. It looks like we have enough hands for the cleanup, so I’ll help with the preparations.]","[Ah, Emily-san. Thank you. Could you arrange the drinks? I thought of making the drinks self-service.]","[Understood.]","The one offering to help was Emily-san, who managed the maids dispatched for this event... The Super Maid of Physique.","Actually, I met Emily-san during the Maid Olympia judging, but unlike Alexandra-san (Aria-san) who I coincidentally met later and exchanged contact information with, I hadn’t exchanged contact information with Emily-san. So, I wasn’t sure where to send the invitation.","And so, I planned to send an invitation through Laguna-san, but before I could do that, she was introduced to me as a recommendation from the World Maid Association. No, seriously, that was a really fast recommendation...... I heard that she personally requested to participate, so her application came in immediately.","During the interview, I did suggest inviting her as a guest, but she preferred to work as a maid, and having a leader who could manage the maids does give everyone peace of mind.","[Are you okay, Emily-san? You don’t look tired but......]","[Yes, I’m perfectly fine. After the afterparty, I plan to return to the royal palace and resume my duties there.]","[Ehhh...... S- So you still have your duties as the Head Maid of Hydra Kingdom today?]","[Yes, I love my work after all.]","[I- I see......]","I've heard that Emily-san is a maid with inexhaustible stamina, but seeing it firsthand is impressive. The maids dispatched from the World Maid Association for this event took a break from their regular duties to participate, but Emily-san would apparently be resuming her duties as the Head Maid of Hydra Kingdom's royal palace while helping here.","Even though Laguna-san gave her permission to prioritize our party preparations, Emily-san would return to the royal palace via Teleportation Magic to work as usual once she finished here.","Perhaps a workaholic, but unlike Illness-san who I've rarely seen take a break, Emily-san seems to never rest at all. Despite this, she doesn't show any signs of fatigue; in fact, she looks even more energetic now than at the start of the party. I suppose that's to be expected of the Super Maid of Physique.","When I asked Laguna-san about it, she just tiredly replied, \"Ah, it's fine. If you let her do as she likes, she really won't take a break at all. She does it because she enjoys it, so just leave her be.\"","Emily-san is a woman with tanned skin and chestnut-colored hair in a side ponytail, giving off a very healthy vibe. She’s around 190 cm tall and has an athletic build that suggests she’s well-trained.","Incidentally, her tanned skin is apparently not from sunburn but her natural skin color. She gives off the impression of a tall, athletic beauty.","[Well, if you ever feel tired, please don’t hesitate to say so. Please, don’t overdo it.]","[Thank you for your concern. However, that's exactly what feels goo..... Ahh, no, I mean, of course, there are times when I feel a bit tired, but right now, I feel completely refreshed in both body and mind, so I’m fine.]","Emily-san's bright smile conveys a sense of kindness and friendliness. However, being Laguna-san's former rival, she seems to be extremely skilled......","<Afterword>","<Emily>","The Head Maid of Hydra Kingdom's Royal Palace and one of the only four Super Maids in the world, known as the Super Maid of Physique. She is a tall woman with a bright and kind personality, and she loves her work so much that she is always working. Her inexhaustible stamina is so legendary that no one has ever seen her look tired.","......However, her true nature...... is \"a self-sufficient masochist who finds pleasure in fatigue\". She experiences pleasure from feeling tired, which activates her body and cells to recover from fatigue, making her more energetic the more she works.","She was once Laguna’s rival, and Laguna, who has fought her many times, states \"If you don't settle it in a short battle, the longer it drags on, the more exhausted you'll get while she keeps getting more energetic, making a long battle hell.\"......","She is always working, and when Laguna forcibly gives her a day off, she just finds temporary work elsewhere."]},{"number":1933,"title":"Chapter 1933: The Party is Over 2","paragraphs":["With Emily-san helping out, we proceeded with the preparations. But, well, since all we were doing was taking things out of the Magic Box and arranging them, it wasn't much of a hassle, and it turned into more of a chat.","[By the way, I've heard that you were once considered Laguna-san's rival......]","[Ahh, there was indeed a time when I was called that for a short period. In the past, the Human Realm had very few immigrants, and not many people had seen a Peerage Holder, so I was called that. But in reality, Laguna-sama was always a level above me. Even when we first met, she would win 9 out of 10 times. I was only called a rival because I could somewhat hold my own against her. But that was only for about 500 years after the Treaty of Friendship was signed, so it was a short period......]","From what Frau-san told me during the Maid Olympia, Emily-san is a Viscount-rank Demon. Laguna-san is currently on the level of a Count-rank, but she had mentioned that back when she was traveling with the Hero Party, her strength was at the upper level of Viscount-ranks, almost reaching Count-rank. And so, Emily-san is probably quite strong among Viscount-rank Demons.","[......Emily-san, you're a Demon, right? In that case, you came to the Human Realm quite early, right after the friendship treaty was signed?]","[Yes, I was originally interested in the Human Realm. My family are fishermen in the Demon Realm, but my grandmother was a Mermaid who got lost and settled in the Demon Realm long ago. She told me many stories about the Human Realm. So, right after the Treaty of Friendship was signed, I volunteered for the reconstruction support and worked in the Human Realm. That's when Laguna-sama noticed me and approached me.]","[You were scouted because of your work ethic and abilities then?]","[Ah, no. It was more like I was scolded because I worked for about 48 days straight without a break, and everyone around me was getting freaked out. After that, various things happened, and Laguna-sama hired me. She told me to take breaks many times, but eventually, she gav...... she understood what I wanted.]","That isn't just workaholic level...... Moreover, it's not like she's being forced by anyone; she just loves working so much that Laguna-san must have been quite troubled.","Even though she was suggesting breaks and vacations out of consideration for Emily-san, they were unwanted or even disliked. She feels somewhat similar to Ein-san, who even Kuro gets exasperated with. Although Kuro insists Ein-san takes some breaks, it’s on the level of a few minutes every few months.","[Come to think of it, one of the reasons Laguna-sama had me start training with her might have been to make me stop working for a while, no matter the method. That said, I don't really like fighting, so I wasn't very enthusiastic about it.]","[Really?]","[Yes, it's only when certain conditions align that battles feel goo...... Errr, excuse me. My fighting style shines in long-term battles, but mock battles rarely last that long, and in a real battle between Peerage Holders, it could last days or even months...... so I don't often get the chance to utilize my forte.]","(T/N: Mochiaji means forte, but well...... see that \"......\" before the sentence? mochiaji was placed there, so there could be an unsaid \"ki\" before the sentence, turning mochiaji to \"kimochi aji\", which turns the sentence to \"I don't often get the chance to experience the tasteful stuff.)","[I see. In mock battles, it usually ends at some point, so it doesn't turn into a long-term battle.]","What's this? What she's saying is very reasonable. It makes sense that in mock battles, it would be hard to use her forte. But somehow, I kinda felt a bit of a murky emotion there for a moment.","It felt like the kind of vibe Pandora-san, Phenex-san, or Tiamat-san give off when they talk about their fetishes...... N- No, comparing her to them is too rude...... Must be my imagination, unn. It's probably just my imagination. I mean, look, Emily-san has such a refreshing atmosphere...... Unnn. Let's not think about it.","[B- But, hearing you talk like this, it really sounds like you love your work, Emily-san.]","[Yes, I absolutely love it. Especially during busy periods when there's an abundance of tasks. The pleasu...... The feeling of getting into the zone while processing work endlessly and the euphoria that comes with a job well done is quite delightful.]","[A- Ahh~~ It's like how you feel your best when you warm up a bit during exercise, right?]","[Yes. fufufu.]","[A- Ahaha......]","I thought I was diverting the conversation to avoid stepping into strange territory, but it seems I accidentally hit the nail on the head.","For a brief moment, her face showed sheer ecstasy when she talked about busy periods...... I don't think she's just one of those that gets motivated. She clearly looks like she had a particular kink for it.","Well, at least she's trying to hide it and put on a façade, so I guess she's much better than those three perverts.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [......And so, the Four Heavenly Masochists have finally been revealed...... In an Extra Story way before, Shea was included as a filler, but she's more of a hardworking person than a masochist. Now, with Pandora, Phoenix, Tiamat, and Emily, the Four Heavenly Masochists are complete...... Three-fourths of them are Phantasmal King's subordinates though!?]","? ? ? : [Please don't bring that up. I'm already having a hard time dealing with it myself......]"]},{"number":1934,"title":"Chapter 1934: The Party is Over 3","paragraphs":["Returning to her homeland after the ship party hosted by Kaito, Laguna bid farewell to her companions before heading back to her house, which was a few distance away from the Royal Palace.","Although the Royal Palace had rooms for Laguna...... their King, she found more comfort in the house when she could do as she pleased, not caring about being King.","As Laguna approached the small house by the seaside, she stopped short with a serious expression.","[......No, let's do some training before hitting the sack......]","Muttering this, Laguna moved towards the sea, but the scenery around her suddenly changed.","[Wha!? W- What in the world...... The sea? No...... an enormous river?]","Laguna found herself standing on water. She wasn't using magic to create a foothold or anything; she was simply floating above the flowing water.","Initially thinking she was on the sea, she quickly realized it was a huge river. Just then, an unfamiliar voice reached her ears.","[Oh dear, I must have startled you. Good gracious, given the somewhat complicated circumstances, I created this special space to have a little chat, but it must be quite the surprise. Tahaa~~ Sorry for not notifying you beforehand!]","[......Y- You are......?]","Turning towards the voice, Laguna saw a woman with bluish white hair, a face as expressionless as a mask, speaking in an apologetic tone.","However, as a seasoned warrior, Laguna immediately understood. The being before her was overwhelmingly more powerful than her...... almost as if she was a God......","[It's understandable to be confused. You can call me...... Errr, let's just go with my name here...... Just call me Jane Doe. Well, just think of me as a trivial wandering God or something along those lines.]","[Ah, y- yes. I'm Laguna Dia Hydra. So, Jane-sama, what business do you have with me?]","[Ahh, rather than business, it's more like I'm here to apologize...... Considering how some people watch videos at double speed these days, I'll keep the explanation concise. I'll transmit the information directly to your mind. It might be a bit startling, but don't worry, it's not dangerous~~ There we go.]","[ ! ? ]","In an instant, information flowed into Laguna's mind, and she understood why the god named Jane had appeared before her.","[......I- I see, Jane-sama followed me to attend Kaito's party..... and mentioned to Kaito that you were accompanying the Hydra King......]","[That's right. Since I used your position without permission, I came to apologize and offer something in return. Oh, don't mind the honorifics with me. I'm not a God of this world, just a wandering Stray God, so no need to be formal.]","[T- Thank you for your consideration...... However, a reward?]","[Yes, since this world belongs to Shallow Vernal and I have limitations on what I can do freely, I can't claim I can do anything, but I can grant most requests...... Tahaa~~ I'm an Omnipotent God after all.]","Despite Jane's unchanged expression and cheerful voice, Laguna had a bewildered expression on her face.","After all, while she spoke of it as if it were no big deal, the being before her was a God on the same level as World Creators, comparable with Shallow Vernal and Eden...... Just the idea of being in the presence of such a being was overwhelming for Laguna, and being offered a gift by someone so powerful left her at a loss for what to ask.","[Can't think of anything right away? Then, if you don't mind, could I take a look into your memories? That way, I can come up with an appropriate gift......]","[Eh? Ah, yes. I don't mind at all but...... w- well, errr, I'm sorry. I didn't expect such a question, so I'm a little flustered. I thought you'd just look at my memories without asking......]","[Unn? No, well, I could look at your memories without you noticing, but you wouldn't like that, right? W- Well, I did already take a peek at your memories when I first started following you to learn about anything related to Kaito-sama, so I guess it's too late to do this now. Tahaa~~ I really am sorry.]","[P- Please raise your head! I'm far inferior, so I have no right to oppose anything Jane-sama does!]","[No, no, that isn't true, okay? Just because someone is superior doesn't mean they can be disrespectful to those inferior to them. It's something I learned from the one I respect: those in higher positions naturally have more room to be considerate, so it's the superior who should be more thoughtful. Tahaa~~ Sorry for the lecture!]","[..................Ahh, errr...... It's the first time I've spoken with a sensible World Creator before, so I'm kinda bewildered......]","Laguna murmured with an indescribable expression as Jane, who naturally bowed her head to someone inferior and considered her feelings, spoke.","After all, the World Creators Laguna knew were Shallow Vernal and Eden, and neither were beings who would show consideration to someone like Laguna.","(W- What a reasonable God...... Ah, no, this won't do. Thinking that way is disrespectful to Shalovanar-sama and Eden-sama. For the time being, let's calm ourselves......)","As Laguna's thoughts swirled in confusion, Jane quietly waited for Laguna to calm down without rushing her.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [Coming all the way to apologize for having used you, creating a space to meet to avoid any commotion, bowing her head in apology for peeking into your memories without permission, asking for consent before looking into your memories again, and being considerate even to someone inferior...... This must be the result of the Absolute's teachings. Seeing how she's so different from Shiro and Makina, it's no wonder she's bewildered.]"]},{"number":1935,"title":"Chapter 1935: The Party is Over 4","paragraphs":["<Author's Notes>","~ ~ Useless Trivia ~ ~","The reason why the subspace Laguna arrived at was like an enormous river is because Jane Doe's true name comes from the Latin word \"canalis\" which means \"canal\", so the situation is reminiscent of that.","(T/N: Canaris is hereby renamed to Canalis. I won't be editing the previous chapters though.)","After waiting for Laguna to calm down, Jane, also known as Canalis, looks into Laguna's memories.","[......Fumu, it seems like you've been particularly worried about being left behind by someone named Lilia-san, doesn't it?]","[......You really can't hide anything from a God huh. Yes, it was indeed as you said. Young Lilia and I had been having mock battles once a month now, and we've been growing together through mutual effort...... No, I suppose there's no point in pretending here.]","Since the other party was an Omniscient God and could see Laguna's memories, there was no point in hiding anything. With that thought, she felt she could honestly express the feelings she had been suppressing deep in his heart.","When Lilia grew significantly through her battles in the God Realm and reached a level where she could compete on equal footing with Laguna, she was truly happy.","Just as she was called the Strongest Human, there was no one among Humans who could match Laguna's strength. Of course, if you included Demons and Gods, there were some who were equal or superior to him...... But if it's just within Humans, Lilia was the first to reach the same level as Laguna.","That made him genuinely happy, and she threw herself into training even more, enjoying the rivalry.","[......Young Lilia and I have completely different conditions. Young Lilia has not yet reached her prime and is still developing, with a lot of room to grow, improving at an astonishing rate every day. But for me, that isn't the case...... I'm already about 1800 years old. It may not be much time for Demons and Gods, seeing me as someone young, but I've been training for a long time. Us Humans are generally known for our rapid growth, and I was able to increase my strength on the same level as Count-ranks.]","[.....................]","Jane listened quietly to Laguna's words, not interrupting her.","[......For quite a while now, I've felt the limit to my growth. I'm not saying I can't grow at all, nor that there are no factors for me to grow further. But soon, my growth will stop, and I won't be able to keep up with young Lilia's growth speed...... No, I already can't keep up with her at the moment. I'm just masking it with experience and technique, but that's nearing its limit too.]","[Is that what's causing you uneasiness?]","[Yes. I know it's a rather luxurious worry. Even within Human history, I must be exceptionally gifted...... but still, I can't help feeling frustrated. To be left behind by a good rival I finally found......]","She didn't know exactly when it started, but Laguna vaguely felt her own limits. The wall she reached after continuous training...... She doesn't want to accept it. That she would soon stop growing...... Thus, she threw herself into training even more.","And the more she trained, the more clearly she felt her growth limit approaching. If she stopped training, Lilia would leave her behind in no time. She had no choice but to keep pushing towards the visible wall, and that was her biggest worry recently.","[I see, I see. It would indeed be sad to be left behind by a rival. Well then, let's go with that!]","[......Eh?]","[Your thank you gift, I mean. Let's see...... To reach the level of talent and growth speed of someone like Lilia-san, it would require reconstructing your very existence...... Let's see. It should be fine to extend your growth limit a little and increase your growth speed slightly. Just a moment, I'll go ask permission from Shallow Vernal...... Yes...... Yes, something like that...... Eh? Something for lovers to eat together that doesn't exist in this world? Well, I can make that...... Yes, if that's what you want, I've got no problem with it. Yes, in that case......]","After announcing so casually that she would solve Laguna's problem, Jane asked for permission from the creator of this world, Shallow Vernal.","After that, still expressionless as before, Jane spoke in a gentle voice.","[Alright then, I got the permission without any problems, so let's get it done quickly...... There, all done.]","[Eh? Ah, errr......]","[The adjustment to your growth limit and growth speed is complete. Tahaa~~ I'm sorry it's a reward that's hard to feel immediately! As a bonus, I'll also give you a spear I made myself. Ah, it doesn't have any special effects; it's just very durable and conducts magic well. Tahaa~~ I'm sorry it's not some amazing Sacred Treasure~~ For something like that, I'd need more permission from Shallow Vernal, so please bear with this!]","Unable to keep up with Jane's cheerful but expressionless declaration, Laguna was left with a bewildered expression on her face.","<Afterword>","【Laguna's Growth Limit has Slightly Increased (by an Omnipotent God's Standards)】","【Laguna's Growth Rate has Slightly Increased (by an Omnipotent God's Standards)】","【Laguna has Obtained a Durable (capable of withstanding Cosmic Destruction-level Attacks) and Highly Conductive to Magic Power (100% transmission rate) Spear】","Serious-senpai : [The standards of an Omnipotent God are scary, but what is even more scary is the fact that Lilia is apparently still more talented and has a higher growth rate...... As expected of the World's Bug.]"]},{"number":1936,"title":"Chapter 1936: The Party is Over 5","paragraphs":["Hearing Jane's really casual tone, like it was just a continuation of small talk, about raising the growth limit and growth speed left Laguna dumbfounded, a spear suddenly appeared in front of her.","It was a translucent blue spear, and when Laguna glanced at Jane, Jane gave her a slight nod. Confirming this, Laguna grasped the spear.","(It's light, and it fits in my hand incredibly well...... It's also so easy to infuse it with magic that I can tell just by looking. This truly is a spear made by a God...... Something that could never be forged by ordinary means......)","The extraordinary spear aside, Laguna could instinctively understand that Jane had solved her worries. The growth limit she had always felt was no longer perceptible.","Realizing this, Laguna gripped the spear tighter.","[Well, with that, my business here is done. I apologize for calling you out so suddenly.]","[N- No, rather, I don't know how to thank you......]","[Hahaha, I'm the one who should be thanking you. We might have another chance to meet in the future, and when that time comes...... I’d appreciate it if you could just have a nice conversation with me. Tahaa~~ I'm sorry for being so haphazard!]","Jane, still as expressionless as before, announced that the matter was settled and started to dissolve the space, but before she could, Laguna hurriedly spoke up.","[P- Please wait!]","[Yes? What is it?]","[This may be a very rude request but...... When you first introduced yourself, you said \"with your name here\", so if possible, I'd like to know your real name. Of course, I swear never to tell anyone.]","[Ahh, it's alright. I just introduced myself that because that's how I introduced myself to Kaito-sama...... It's not like I'm particularly hiding my name. Well then, let me reintroduce myself. I'm Canalis.]","[Canalis-sama...... I'm truly grateful for this matter. If there’s ever anything I can do to help, please don’t hesitate to ask......]","[Those are kind words. If such an opportunity arises, I’ll be counting on you. Now then, I’ll send you back.]","With those words, the scenery wavered, and when Laguna realized it, she was standing by the seaside. It felt like a dream, but the blue spear in her hand proved that what had happened was real.","[......Fuuu......]","With a small smile, Laguna kicked off the sand and leaped into the sea. Activating a countermeasure spell to avoid disturbing the waves, she rapidly accelerated underwater, moving far offshore in an instant.","And then, upon reaching a place where there were no signs of people or ships, she leaped out of the water and swung the spear towards the sky.","The spear wielded by the one regarded as Human Realm's Strongest produced a shockwave that split the cloudy night sky, allowing moonlight to shine upon the sea.","Bathed in the moonlight, Laguna wore an innocent smile, like that of a child.","(......Ah, the wall of limits I had always felt is gone. Feeling that I can still grow, what happiness...... Canalis-sama said she had extended it just a bit, but at least, for now, I can’t even tell how far my limits have been extended.)","The wall of growth limit that had vaguely been felt before was now completely unnoticeable. Laguna didn't know to what extent the growth limit had been extended, but it was certain that it had been significantly extended to the point where she could no longer sense it at all.","Of course, she would need to train diligently to continue growing, but for someone who had been troubled by the feeling of her limits, it was a liberating sensation.","(......This won't do, I can't help but feel exhilarated. My body is itching to train as soon as possible. Fufu, I thought myself pretty old, but now I feel like a child......)","The sun had already set, so it wasn't possible to begin serious training at that moment. However, the joy of being able to train and grow from now on filled Laguna's heart with exhilaration.","(As expected, given my position, openly showing my faith to her...... might be inappropriate. However, I suppose offering personal prayers should be acceptable.)","Creating a foothold on the sea with magic, Laguna knelt down in a knightly salute, lowering her head and holding the blue spear above her head, she prayed.","(Canalis-sama, I offer my heartfelt gratitude and prayers......)","Having sworn not to speak her name, Laguna didn't utter it even in this solitary place, instead offering deep gratitude and prayers to the God in her heart.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [I don't know exactly to what extent, but it feels like she'd be somewhere between Count-rank and below Lilia level...... so perhaps she can reach the level of Duke-ranks? No, considering how Lilia was like under the effect of Critical Point of Fate during the God Realm Battle, she might go even further......]","~~ Additional Info~~","*changed for English viewers* The Author originally named Nebula as Nepula ( pronounced as Nepyura ), but the Translator thought it was just a typo, but apparently, the change from \"b\" to \"p\" was actually intentional. According to Translator-san though, he's too lazy to change it to Nepula."]},{"number":1937,"title":"Chapter 1937: The Party is Over 6","paragraphs":["Thanks to everyone who finished their assigned cleanup joining in to help, preparations for the party wrapped up quickly. And so, the staff party began...... a party filled with maids.","Well, the maids hired to serve were the most numerous, and with Eta, Theta, and even Illness-san wearing maid uniforms, everyone except Anima, Caraway, and me was in maid uniform.","It might be a dream come true for maid enthusiasts, but in this world, maids are more considered as formidable beings than people overflowing with moe, and they're, in fact, strong people.","[......But looking at it this way, Eta and Theta look quite good in maid uniforms.]","[Is that so? Hearing Master say that makes me happy.]","[The Maid World...... is deep. There are many powerful individuals here...... that we didn't know about.]","When they first arrived at the mansion, they were making slime-like tea and rock-hard cookies, but now they've become quite skilled as maids.","The lively Eta is good at cleaning and laundry, often seen doing those tasks, while the dexterous Theta excels at cooking and frequently helps in the kitchen. I mean, we often eat together at night at Lilia-san's mansion, but breakfast is often made by Theta and eaten in my room or in the dining room, so she's quite good at it.","[I guess the Maid World really is that special?]","[Maids possess considerable combat skills, but unlike knights or adventurers, they don't often fight on the front lines, so even though they're strong, they're not widely known.]","[As expected...... those known as the Super Maids are famous for their strength. However, even those who aren't well-known...... can have combat skills on par with Peerage Holders. Even I was surprised...... when I learned about Illness-sama's strength.]","Now that you mention it, I've heard that maids are stronger than average knights, but I rarely hear about maids taking on monsters instead of knight orders. They cooperate in missions, but it's usually when the knights request support.","Combat skills are a necessary part of being a maid, but they don't flaunt or use them recklessly.","[As for Illness-san, from what I heard from Frea-san and other people, she's apparently quite famous in the old Demon Realm.]","[I see, it would certainly not be surprising for someone as strong as Illness-sama to be well-known. Theta and I are still quite young as Demons though, so we didn't really know much about the old Demon Realm.]","[We're just...... 763.]","[That's still quite older than me though...... but well, I guess that's young for a Demon?]","[As long as you remember your exact age...... you're still considered young. Many of the older Demons only roughly remember their age...... remembering it as around how many thousands of years old they are or something like that.]","Now that they mentioned it, there certainly are few Demons who mentioned their exact age. Come to think of it, Neun-san also mentioned how she kept track for a few hundred years, but she eventually got rougher with her tracking.","[Ah, Master, your glass is almost empty. Let me prepare another.......]","[Here...... you go.]","[Ahhh, thank you, Theta.]","[......Oi, Theta. I was just about to do that, you know?]","[It's your fault for being slow. If you have time to chatter, you should instead be moving.]","[Now, now, no fighting. I'll ask Eta to help next time.]","Eta and Theta are twins and usually get along well, but they often quarrel over trivial matters. Their arguments never get too serious, and they quickly make up...... but well, it's that case of being close enough to fight often.","However, it's a bit troublesome if they start fighting here, so I decided to lightly mediate and calm them down.","[Ah, Master! Let me get some food for you!]","[......If Eta gets to decide that, it'll be too much, so you better consider how much Master eats.]","......When I was first told they'd be serving as maids, I was honestly a bit troubled, but now they've become like family. Watching them chat and laugh together is heartwarming...... and most of all, being together with them is fun.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [Eta and Theta have unique personalities, but they don't make many appearances...... Guess they have something in common with the kouhais huh......]"]},{"number":1938,"title":"Chapter 1938: The Party is Over 7","paragraphs":["After talking with Eta and Theta, I decided to take the opportunity to thank others as well. I had spoken briefly with Anima during the fireworks, but I hadn't talked to Caraway yet, so I decided to start with her.","[Caraway, great job today. It seemed like we left most of the hosting to you, but was it tough?]","[Thank you for the hard work too, Miyama-sama. No, no, that isn't the case. I actually had a lot of fun.]","When I called out to her, Caraway responded with a cheerful smile. Her tail was shaped like a heart, indicating she was in a good mood or happy, which was reassuring.","Me, Anima, Caraway, Eta, Theta, Illness-san...... that would be my household that were the main members on the host side...... Well, Illness-san is technically a maid at Lilia's mansion, but she's usually at my place, so I often forget that.","Of course, she still handles several times the workload of other maids at Lilia's mansion while also managing most of the tasks at my house...... On top of that, she frequently enjoys her hobbies with Nebula. She's truly impressive.","Well, that aside, among the members of my household, Caraway was the best suited for the hosting role, so I left most of it to her.","Nebula would likely excel at it too, but she couldn't participate since she can't stray far from her World Tree, so Caraway handled most of the hosting alone. Well, Alice did step in at the end part of the party, but other than that time, she's mostly around the stage.","[You really seemed to fit the role. Your hosting was excellent.]","[Hmmm, I wasn't consciously trying, but I suppose it might suit my personality. If there's a similar opportunity in the future, please count on me.]","[Ahaha, alright. I haven't thought about it yet, but if we have a second event, I'll ask you again.]","[Yes! It could also be not just a party, we could plan some sort of event.]","[......Fumu, an event huh......]","Indeed, now that she mentioned it, I did think it would be great to host another party like this someday, but as Caraway said, it doesn't necessarily have to be a party.","[Now that you mentioned it, we could certainly organize something other than a party.]","[Yes. How should I say this...... We have sufficient budget...... Nifty's sales are incredible after all...... Besides events that we had to directly participate in, we could even run a promotional campaign or something similar.]","[Ahh~~ A campaign does sound good. But if we're doing that, wouldn't it be better if we had our own store?]","[Yes, as Miyama-sama said, a store would offer more possibilities. However, opening one is quite challenging. Balancing between countries would require simultaneous openings in all three, and finding reliable people to manage the stores would be difficult.]","[Ahh~~ That's certainly true...... If we have to hire someone, it becomes quite a large-scale effort, and finding trustworthy people would be difficult......]","Now that she mentioned it, finding trustworthy people to manage the stores is indeed quite difficult. If we had someone reliable for Nifty's operations, like how Lilia-san has Mary-san, it would be great...... But giving the responsibility to Anima or Caraway would add too much to their workload, making it really challenging.","Currently, we have Anima, Caraway, Illness-san, and Nebula taking on most of the tasks, with Eta and Theta helping out as well...... It would also be ideal if we could find someone to oversee everything, but well, that won't be easy......","[Well, let's just think about that later. For now, let's enjoy the afterparty.]","[Yes! Ah, Miyama-sama, let me pour you a drink.]","[Thank you.]","For the time being, I'll set the thoughts about the store, campaigns, and other events aside. Now, I'll just relax and enjoy the afterparty, engaging in a pleasant chat with Caraway.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [A trustworthy person to handle the tea-related operations...... A producer...... with the skills...... Speaking of which, there was also that Omnipotent fellow who wanted to serve the Absolute...... Ahh......]"]},{"number":1939,"title":"Chapter 1939: The Party is Over 8","paragraphs":["Leaving the venue where the afterparty was being held, I moved to the deck of the magic ship. Well, the afterparty was still ongoing, but I took a break to feel the night breeze.","......It's totally not because the maids started getting excited about their maid discussions and I wanted to escape. Unn, it was just that there were too many maids and I couldn't keep up with the conversation, which made me feel quite out of place......","Well, putting that aside, when I stepped out onto the deck, a pleasant sea breeze greeted me. It wasn't until we looked into it during the party planning stage that I found out this magic ship was equipped with various magic tools and was highly functional.","For instance, the deck has a magic tool that blocks winds above a certain strength, so strong winds won't blow through. However, it still allows a moderate sea breeze, which is nice.","Including these features, the ship truly feels like a super luxurious cruise liner, but to Kuro, it was just an excuse to give away a magic box...... I guess that's to be expected from the richest person in the world.","With such thoughts in mind, I absentmindedly watched the night sea. The view was obscured by darkness, but the deck was adequately lit, and the night sky was filled with stars, making it far from boring.","[......Taking a breeeeeak?]","[Eh? Illness-san?]","When I turned around upon hearing a voice suddenly calling out to me, there was Illness-san, with a gentle smile on her lips.","[I alsooooo came for a breeeeeeak.]","[Ah, I see. Once again, thank you for your hard work at the party.]","[Thank you for your hard work toooooo, Kaito-samaaaaa.]","After responding to my words with a smile, Illness-san came to stand beside me. She was so close our shoulders almost touched, making my heart skip a beat.","We ended up standing side by side, gazing at the sea. The mood feels peculiar...... It's not like it feels uncomfortable, but I couldn't find the right moment to start a conversation, so we remained silent for a while.","[......Kaito-samaaaaa, you can use Sympathy Magic, riiiiiight?]","[Eh? Ah, yes.]","[What is it liiiiiiiike, reading emotioooons?]","[Hmmm, it feels like vague...... It feels like emotions carried by magic power are being conveyed. It's like I'm reading the mood——— whether it's awkwardness or joy———- but in a more clear way.]","In response to Illness-san's softly muttered question, I hesitantly answered. It's quite an intuitive thing, so explaining it in words was difficult.","Someone like Lillie-san might be able to explain it better, but for me, it's really just somehow being able to tell someone's emotions.","[I'm sorry for asking such a strange question so suddenlyyyyyy. Latelyyy, I’ve been feeling that it’s difficult to put feelings into woooords, so I wanted to hear how Kaito-sama senses emotiooooons.]","[Putting feelings into words? That certainly is tough. Even I might struggle if I were asked to clearly express my feelings.]","[Yeeeees. Until nowww, I hadn’t felt this way muuuuuch. But nooooow, I can no longer ignore iiiiiit, so I’ve been rethinking thiiiiings. It's difficult, isn't iiiiiit....... Even though I should vaguely understand my feeliiiiiings, it’s hard to put them into wooooords.]","[......Are you troubled by something?]","[Yeees, you could say thaaaat...... I'm thinking about what I want to doooooo and how I want the future to beeeee, but it feels like my thoughts are just going in circlesssss.]","If Illness-san is troubled by something, I definitely want to help, but her wording feels somewhat roundabout, as if she's hiding the main issue.","In that case, forcing the issue might not be the best approach...... Hmm, what should I do?","While I was pondering this, Illness-san turned towards me, her face showing what seemed to be a wry smile.","[If Kaito-sama is alright with iiiiiiit, could you spare some tiiiiime for a little consultation after the afterpartyyyyy?]","[Yes, of course. If I can be of any help, I'm more than willing.]","[Thank youuuu. Well theeeen, after the afterparty eeeeends, I'll come visit your rooooom.]","[Alright.]","It's rather unusual for Illness-san to consult me about something, but given how much she's helped me on numerous occasions, I want to be of assistance as much as possible.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [This is bad, the flow of things doesn't seem good at all...... I mean, the trouble Illness had here, it's clearly about her romantic feelings for Kaito...... D- D*mn it, where the heck can I run to......]"]},{"number":1940,"title":"Chapter 1940: Illness’ Consultation 1","paragraphs":["After the afterparty ended, I returned to my room...... the room assigned to me on the magic ship, and first changed my clothes. I had been wearing formal attire for the party, so I wanted to change into something a bit more casual.","That said, since Illness-san was planning to visit later, it won't be something too casual...... a regular shirt and pants should be fine. I shouldn't need to wear a hoodie either.","I also feel like taking a quick shower if possible, but since I'm not sure when Illness-san would come, I can't exactly do that...... but as I was thinking that, a hummingbird arrived from Illness-san.","She wrote that it would be better if we both had some time to freshen up and change clothes, so she'd visit in about an hour, which meant I could take a shower without any issues.","The owner's suite is equipped with a shower room, so I used it to quickly rinse myself off. Well, this owner's suite is quite spacious and luxurious, giving off a high-class suite room vibe, making it feel like I'm on a fun vacation.","I don't know when I'll get to use this magical ship again, so I should thoroughly enjoy it while I can.","After showering and dressing, I glanced around the room. If I were to talk with Illness-san, I suppose the sofa would be a good spot? It's set up for face-to-face seating, with a table in between.","As I made my preparations, having such thoughts in mind, an hour flew by, and I heard a soft knock on the door, signaling Illness-san's arrival.","[Yeeees...... Come in.]","[Excuse my intrusioooon.]","Illness-san, who entered the room, was wearing casual yet composed casual clothes...... a black dress with rose embroidery here and there. Compared to her maid uniform and the clothes I saw her in when we went out together, it was a somewhat more casual outfit.","Perhaps because she had also showered, there was a faint scent of shampoo, and combined with her demeanor and atmosphere, she really exuded a mature woman vibe, making my heart race.","[Should we talk on the sofa?]","[Yes, that's fiiiiiine...... Well then, if you'll excuse meeeee.]","[Would you like something to drink?]","[About thaaaaat, actually~~ Nebula gave me a bottle of wine to shaaaaare, so I brought thaaaaat.]","As she said this, Illness-san took out a stylish wooden bottle. A wooden wine container, that's unusual. It's probably made using the World Tree as a material.","It's an elegant bottle made possible by the existence of Preservation Magic. No, in the first place, shaping the World Tree wood into a wine bottle must be quite challenging...... Well, I guess that's just to be expected of Nebula.","[I mean, with the container like that...... Did Nebula make the wine as well?]","[Yeeees. Nebula and IIIIIIIII have been experimenting with making wiiiiine, so I believe this is one of thoooooose.]","[I see...... So you've been making wine too.]","[We're still amateurs at iiiiiit, so we planned to share once we improved the quality a bit moooooore. We've actually also been trying various other thiiiiings. Nebula is very curious after aaaaaall.]","[Ahaha, well, as long as you and Nebula are having fun, that's what matters. Let me know if you need any equipment or anything.]","[Thank you very muuuuuuch.]","I see, so they're next pastime is winemaking huh...... come to think of it, they mentioned wanting to try making coffee beans too, so maybe they're working on that as well.","[......Arehh? I don't recall seeing our place having any grapevines......]","[Space-Time Magiiiiiic was used to create a subspace where we're growing theeeeeem. I'm not veeeeeery skilled with Space-Time Magic, but Nebula is quite adeeeeeept and we're experimenting growing various things in the subspaaaaaace.]","[I see. Nebula really is amazing.]","Being able to use Space-Time Magic, as expected of Nebula. Though I'm a bit surprised, since it's Nebula we're talking about here, her being able to use it isn't unusual.","Since they're still experimenting growing various things, they'll eventually introduce them to me, so let's look forward to when that happens.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [The idiot parent is as doting as ever, his judgment when it comes to Nebula-related matters is too loose.]"]},{"number":1941,"title":"Chapter 1941: Illness’ Consultation 2","paragraphs":["When I prepared wine glasses for us, Illness-san poured in some of the wine made by Nebula. Drinking wine while facing a beautiful woman in a spacious room on a luxury liner... it's quite an amazing situation.","Unfortunately, such a mature or adult atmosphere still feels like a high hurdle for me, and I don't feel like I'm able to handle it gracefully.","Hmmm, I really want to become a man who suits an atmosphere like this.","[Thank you. Then, while we're at it, shall we toast?]","[Yeeees.]","We lightly clinked our wine glasses together for a toast and slowly brought the wine to our lips. Before coming to this world, I hardly ever drank wine, but since arriving here, I've been drinking it quite often and have become somewhat accustomed to it.","Well, it's not so much that I can say I can discuss the differences in taste...... but this wine is delicious. I think it's probably a rosé wine. It's a lightly colored wine with a slightly sweet taste and a refreshingly light finish.","[It's refreshing and delicious. This is rosé wine, right?]","[Yeeees. I suppose it's because I like roseeeees, so she chose to brew rosé wine for meeeee.]","[Ahh, I see......]","Speaking of which, even though the rosé there actually means pink, the word \"rosé\" is pretty close to \"rose\", doesn't it? Considering that Illness-san likes roses, she chose to give her rosé wine instead of red or white wine huh.","Not only is it filled with Nebula's consideration, but the taste is also good. When I went to a restaurant with Alice, she told me that rosé wine has the best of both red wine's tannins and white wine's fruitiness, making it a wine that goes well with dishes that are hard to pair with red or white wine.","[......Errr, so, you said you had something you wanted to consult?]","However, we can't just enjoy the wine forever. The main reason we're here is because Illness-san asked for my advice, so I need to take it seriously.","Hearing my words, Illness-san tilted her wine glass and took a sip. Despite her height making her look too young to drink wine, her gestures and demeanor were so mature that drinking wine didn't feel out of place at all.","[......I wondeeeeer where I should start? Maybe it's better to begin from the beginniiiiing...... Looking baaaaack, my world has always been a simple oneeeee. I never really thought about what I wanted to beeeeee or what I wanted to dooooo. I just lived according to my own standaaaaaards without any real basis for my actiooooons.]","[....................]","Illness-san spoke calmly while gazing at her wine glass, but as I thought before, she unusually felt at a loss, as if she was feeling troubled.","She mentioned before that she didn't really understand her own feelings, so this trouble likely relates to that.","From what I've heard so far, it seems like she used to act based on her own internal standards without wavering, but now those standards are being shaken...... Well, I won't know for sure until I hear the whole story.","[In that seeeeense, even though I've lived a long tiiiiiime, maybe I was still emotionally underdevelooooooped. Being tossed around by feelings I never knew befoooooore, I ended up feeling lost like thiiiiiiis.]","[......Fumu. I still don't fully understand the whole situation, but it sounds like there was a significant turning point that wasn't there before, and that's what had been troubling you?]","[That's riiiiight. The turning pooooooint was when Kaito-sama came to this wooooorld.]","[......Eh? Me?]","[Yeeees. The first time I saw Kaito-samaaaa was when Milady gathered the servaaaaants.]","Illness-san is referring to the time when I was just summoned to this world, and Lilia-san gathered the servants at the mansion to inform them that I was an important guest and that any mistreatment of me would not be tolerated.","However, arehh? Why is she bringing that up now?","[At that tiiiiiime, Kaito-sama had an understandably anxious expression on your faaaaace.]","[That's right. I had just been suddenly summoned to another world, so I was feeling quite uneasy about a lot of things.]","[When I saw your faaaace, I thought I wanted to be smiliiiiiiing, for you to be happyyyyy. At that tiiiiime, I didn't realize it immediatelyyyyy...... but I suppose it was love at first siiiiiight.]","[........................Huh?]","With a somewhat nostalgic look on her face, she spoke unexpected words, leaving me dumbfounded, my thoughts unable to keep up.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [W- Whaaat!? Y- You're making your attack immediately!?]"]},{"number":1942,"title":"Chapter 1942: Illness’ Consultation 3","paragraphs":["The words Illness-san told me, as if it were the most obvious thing in the world, were completely unexpected and shocking to me. Love at first sight? A- Arehh? That's strange...... This consultation, could it be about a romantic issue......? N- No, but consulting directly with the person you fell in love with at first sight feels like a very bold move......","Ah, no, wait, I shouldn't jump to conclusions. Maybe she fell in love with me at first sight, but after getting to know me, she realized it was a misunderstanding or something...... No, that would be really depressing, and I don't think Illness-san would say something like that.","[After falling in love with Kaito-sama at first siiiiiight, I asked Milady to make me your exclusive attendaaaaant. I thought it would be greeeeeat if I could support Kaito-sama closely when you were anxious just after arriving in this wooooorld.]","[I- I- I- I see. W- Well, having Illness-san my exclusive attendant has really been helpful.]","[Kuhihi, hearing you say that makes me happyyyyy.]","P- Please wait a moment there. I haven't fully processed the information yet, and my head is too confused to keep up with the conversation.","Illness-san is mature, kind, and has a calm, composed demeanor, and despite her petite build, she has the aura of a wonderful adult woman. If you asked whether I like her or not, of course, I like her; she's like the woman anyone would call their ideal...... so much so that because of the atmosphere around her, I unconsciously thought she would never consider someone like me, who she might see as a child, in a romantic sense.","[I love you, Kaito-samaaa.]","[ ! ? ]","[My feelings have not changed since I first laid eyes on youuuu...... No, I can confidently say that I love you even more deeply noooooow...... I feel that something has changed within me compared to the beginniiiiiing.]","I- Illness-san is being incredibly bold, almost confessing her feelings, and I'm quite flustered inside my head, but Illness-san remains calm.","If I had to describe it in words, not only does she hold no falsehoods in her feelings of love for me, she doesn't even find it embarrassing to express those feelings. Though her saying she loves me so naturally makes me feel unsettled, it seems that, at least for Illness-san, this is not the main point of the conversation.","For the time being, pushing my agitation deep down, I focus on listening to Illness-san's story until the end.","[At that tiiiiiime, my world was still simpleeeee. Meeting Kaito-sama and knowing love made the world appear beautifuuuuuul, but my thoughts remained simpleeeee. I just wanted Kaito-sama to be happyyyyy, to see you with a smiiiiiiile, and I tried to do whatever I could to make that happeeeeeen.]","Indeed, Illness-san has always been supportive and naturally helped me when I was in trouble. I’m aware that I've been greatly indebted to Illness-san, and hearing that it was out of love makes me feel both embarrassed and happy.","[I was supposed to be just a spectatooooor. I was content watching Kaito-sama on the stage from the audience seaaaats, or perhaps, being a minor character painted in the corners of your storyyyyy. Such a thing isn't something I had questioooooned, as just seeing you happy already filled my heaaaaart. Ah, that might be a bit misleadiiiiiiing. Even nooooooow, seeing you happy fills my heaaaaaaart and makes me incredibly happyyyyyy. But recentlyyyyyy, I feel that my personal feelings have started mixing in with my thouuuuughts.]","[......Personal feelings? Errr, isn't that just natural?]","[Yeeees. That would normally be the caaaaase, but such a feeliiiiing...... Desire, perhaaaaps? I've never had such a feeling befoooore, and it just made me quite confuuuuuused. I used to be content just watchiiiiiing, but now I feel like I want to be on the stage with youuuuu. It feels like I've become more selfish than I realiiiiized, and I don't know what to do about iiiiiit.]","......I think I can somewhat understand Illness-san's dilemma here. It seems like the order of things happened in reverse for her.","Normally, one first holds romantic feelings for someone, becomes close, and then love blooms...... But in Illness-san's case, she felt love first and then developed romantic feelings later. No, I myself thinking about this feels embarrassing...... but I don't think I'm mistaken with the idea.","Love is something you give, romantic feelings are something you seek. That's something I heard before, but for Illness-san, who holds deep love on the level of devotion, she's likely feeling bewildered by the emergence of an emotion akin to desire.","Unn, I think I understand what's going on to some extent...... but still, this isn't something you should be consulting with the target of those feelings, me, right!? How am I supposed to respond to this!?","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [Gahaak!? That's a full-throttle confession!! Isn't that a confession disguised as a consultation!? Bold confessions really are a girl's privilege huh...... Kuh, the damage is already overwhelming......]","Doctor M : [Are you okay? Want to talk about my child?]","Serious-senpai : [Please stop adding insult to injury.]"]},{"number":1943,"title":"Chapter 1943: Illness’ Consultation 4","paragraphs":["<Author's Notes>","I don't have much time, so today's chapter is a bit short.","I can somewhat understand Illness-san's worries, but I don't think we've quite gotten to the main point yet. This consultation was originally supposed to be about not being able to articulate her feelings, right? From what I've heard so far, it seems like she can articulate her feelings just fine, and they come across clearly to me.","[......Illness-san, are you worried about not being able to articulate your feelings?]","[Yeees. In my miiiiiind, I understand what I'm feeling and what outcome I want it to haaaaave...... but it's difficult to express that in woooooords. No, perhaaaaps, I'm feeling hesitaaaaant. I might be afraid of saying words that coooooould significantly change the environment that I've been certain about until noooooow.]","[I understand that feeling. It's scary to think that the comfortable relationship we have now might change......]","This feels nearly like a confession. Well, if someone said the flow of this conversation so far is already like a confession, they'd be right...... but from Illness-san's perspective, loving me, or rather, being devoted to me is a given without any hesitation, but when it comes to seeking something for herself, she seems very hesitant.","[That's riiiiight. Even thoooough the goal is clear to me, I can't seem to clearly envision the path to get theeeeere. But at the same tiiiiiime, I do want to come up with my own answeeeeer. Although I'm feeling really hesitaaaaant, this is definitely what I wanteeeeed...... What I want for myseeeelf, how I want the future to be liiiiike, I want to thoroughly think about this and come up with an answeeeeer.]","[I see...... So, consulting with me this time was to get some reference for your thoughts?]","[That's definitely part of iiiiiit...... but how should I put iiiiiit? This is also difficult to explaaaaain...... but I suppose I wanted Kaito-sama to know what I'm thinkiiiiing.]","With an unusually puzzled expression on her face, Illness-san tilted her head. She usually gives the impression of being confident and composed, not having any doubts in her mind, but it was clear that she was genuinely unsure about her current romantic feelings, and there was evident hesitation in her words.","Since she said she wants to think things through and come up with her own answer, I, the one she's consulting with, should give her hints that might help her reach her conclusion...... but that's easier said than done.","[Honestly, I might not have much advice to give...... Ah, but there's one thing I can say. If what I'm thinking here isn't just my ego...... If the answer Illness-san is trying to reach is what I think it is...... Errr...... I don't think the result would be one that would make Illness-san sad.]","[Kaito-samaaaa......]","[And so, I think it's okay to take your time. It's fine to slowly think about what you want to do from now on and what kind of future you want.]","[......Kuhihi...... Kaito-sama really is......]","Hearing my words, Illness-san looked surprised for a moment, but then she quickly smiled and her narrowed eyes looked at me affectionately.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [......So basically, it's that, isn't it? She wants to properly confess to Kaito, but she's worried because she can't put her feelings into words...... Isn't that practically a confession already!? Also, with Kaito's response there, doesn't that make you a couple with mutual feelings for each other!?]"]},{"number":1944,"title":"Chapter 1944: Illness’ Consultation 5","paragraphs":["After listening to my words with a smile, Illness-san quietly closed her eyes. Somehow, it felt like she was gathering her thoughts.","If that's the case, talking to her now would just be a hindrance. Thinking that, I quietly sipped my wine and waited for Illness-san to finish organizing her thoughts.","Just like that, after a while...... perhaps about 5 minutes, Illness-san slowly opened her eyes and looked at me.","Her gaze wasn't the usual unfocused one, but a serious one with her beautiful eyes fixed on me, to which I couldn't help feeling captivated.","[......I may have been overthinking thiiiings.]","[Overthinking?]","[Yeeees. To meeeee, my feelings for Kaito-sama were speciaaaaal, something I hadn't experienced in the past tens of thousands of years of liiiiiife, so I believed that if I were to put those feelings into wooooords, they had to be just as speciaaaaal.]","From what I've heard from Frea-san, Illness-san had apparently been well-known in the Demon Realm even before the Six Kings system was established, so she must have lived for at least 20,000 years.","For Illness-san, who had lived that long, these newfound feelings must have indeed been very special.","[That's whyyyy, I had been having second thouuuughts. What word could I call iiiiiit, how can I convey such a feeliiiiing...... but after confiding with Kaito-samaaa, I realized I had been mistakeeeen.]","[You mean, there's no need for special words?]","[Yeeees. I beliiiiieve it's better to keep it simple rather than overcomplicate thiiiiings. Without unnecessary embellishmeeeeents, I decided to just express my feelings honestly.]","Thereupon, pausing for a moment, looking straight into my eyes with a gentle smile, Illness-san spoke.","[......Kaito-samaaa, I love you. I love you from the bottom of my heaaaart. That's why, wanting to see you happyyyyy, I devoted myself to youuuu...... and more than anythiiiing, standing by your side, I want to share such happineeeeess.]","[......Illness-san.]","[Because I like youuuu, I want to be by your siiiiide. Because I love youuuuu, I want to devote myself to youuuuu...... Such simple words are enough to express my feeliiiiiings.]","As Illness-san said earlier, there were no embellishments in her words, just straightforward feelings. Because of this, her feelings were conveyed to be very strongly...... How should I say this...... It made me really happy.","[Illness-san, I'm really glad that you were assigned to me when I came to this world. I could tell now that it was because of my Sympathy Magic...... but back then, there were times when I could sense that the people at Lilia-san's mansion were unsure how to interact with me, treating me with fear and trepidation, and while I knew it couldn't be helped, it still left me with an indescribable feeling. But from Illness-san, I never felt that atmosphere at all...... being with you really put me at ease.]","Now, I'm acquainted with almost everyone at Lilia-san's mansion, and I even go shopping with some of them, but in the beginning, I truly felt a bit uncomfortable around them.","Yes, I understand that they didn't know how to interact with me, an otherworlder man in what had been essentially a men-prohibited environment, and I was also being strangely reserved...... making it so that we're both being overly considerate of each other.","However, thanks to Luna-san, Sieg-san, and most importantly, Illness-san, it never became a major source of stress.","[In that sense, I'm really grateful to Illness-san, and I've always had favorable feelings for you. But well, how should I say this...... Illness-san has been a woman I've admired, a kind and mature lady, so I always thought somewhere in my heart that you wouldn't see me in a romantic way, so today's conversation surprised me...... but I'm honestly happy...... Ahh, sorry, I started rambling about.]","[Kuhihi, in my case thouuuugh, hearing Kaito-sama earnestly telling me how you feel makes me happyyyyyy.]","[Ahaha, thank you. But yeah, let's keep it simple here...... I also love Illness-san as a woman. So, errr...... Once again, I will be in your care.]","[Kuhihi, yeeees. Same heeeeere, please allow me to stay by your siiiiide.]","Yes, I certainly was surprised by the content of the consultation, and I was also surprised at how quickly she managed to gather her thoughts and convey them in words....... but seeing Illness-san smile so happily...... I'm really glad we got to convey our feelings like this.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [......!?]","Makina : [Ah, her eyes rolled back...... Could it be that because of the previous chapter, thinking it would be a while before they became lovers, she let her guard down and was caught off guard?]"]},{"number":1945,"title":"Chapter 1945: Illness’ Consultation 6","paragraphs":["Despite becoming official lovers after expressing our feelings for each other, that doesn't mean things between Illness-san and I haven't changed immediately.","Since we were originally drinking wine together and the consultation was resolved, would it be okay to continue enjoying wine while chatting hereafter?","[Kaito-samaaa, while we're at it, would you mind if I sit next to youuuu?]","[Ah, yes. Of course.]","[Kuhihi, well then~~ If you'll excuse meeee.]","With that thought in mind, Illness-san proposed sitting next to me. We were currently sitting opposite each other across the table, and it's a long couch so there's no problem.","When I agreed, Illness-san stood up with her wine glass, circled around the table, and smoothly sat down to my right...... our distance was incredibly close. Our shoulders were almost touching...... but well, it's not strange to have this kind of distance as lovers.","[Kaito-sama, here you goooo.]","[T- Thank you.]","I thanked Illness-san for pouring wine into my glass, but how should I say this...... I'm feeling strangely nervous. Maybe it's the atmosphere after all? Quietly drinking wine with my lover at such close proximity, especially in this luxurious cabin on a cruise ship...... Well, it's certainly not a situation that happens everyday.","Illness-san's dress-like outfit had a somewhat formal feel to it, and with Illness-san herself exuding a mature aura, it created an atmosphere that I'm not used to experiencing much.","Thinking like that, Illness-san leaned softly against me without saying a word. It was a faint weight and warmth that didn't feel burdensome, with a subtle shampoo scent drifting around, making me incredibly nervous.","[......Strange, isn't iiiiit? Just a slight change in our relationship seems to greatly change our perceptiooooon. Being like this makes me happyyyyy, but it's also making me feel a bit nervouuuuus.]","[I get what you mean. Rather, we've only just become lovers, so we're feeling quite conscious. However, Illness-san seems really calm, I don't see any signs of nervousness from you.]","[That isn't the case thouuuugh. I'm really nervous insiiiiiide. Feeling my heart racing like thiiiiiis, it's truly a first experience for meeee...... Would you like to confirm it?]","[Eh? Ah, errr......]","[Kuhihi, I'm just kiddiiiiing...... For now, that is.]","A- Arehh? Why does she feel like a love veteran...... In terms of romantic experience, I should definitely be more experienced than Illness-san, but the atmosphere around her, brimming with composure...... She's strong.","Indeed, with Sympathy Magic, I could sense nervousness from Illness-san, but it didn't show in her behavior or expression at all, so it was hard to notice. At first glance, she seemed very composed.","Her approach is quite proactive, seemingly quite natural for her, so I feel like I'm being toyed with. No, perhaps it's simply that since Illness-san is usually calm and mature, I might have unconsciously ended up being the one led or waiting for a reaction.","If that's the case, maybe I should....... in this situation, hugging her shoulder seems like the most natural thing to do, but she's wearing a dress that exposes her shoulders...... Would it be too much to suddenly touch her bare skin even though we've just become lovers? No, then again......","I hesitated a little but then moved my right hand to gently embrace Illness-san's shoulder. Illness-san reacted with a slight twitch for a moment, but that was all. She didn't seem particularly bothered and leaned into me, letting herself be held.","[......Errr, does this bother you?]","[Nooo. In fact, I feel happyyyy. It's juuuust, since it was sudden, I was a bit surprised and felt a bit embarraaaaaaassed. I also feel my heart beating faster than it was befooooore.]","......I see, she was surprised and felt embarrassed huh...... I can't read that from her expression at all though, as her gentle smile gives off an air of composure.","She's not like Shiro-san, whose expression doesn't change, but perhaps Illness-san is the type who doesn't easily show nervousness or embarrassment on her face...... When I used my Sympathy Magic to sense her feelings, I could indeed sense more nervousness from her than before.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [......A- Adult-like..... lovey-dovey......]","Makina : [Seems like the damage is considerable enough. I wonder if it's gonna come out soon...... Maple syrup would be nice, I'm in the mood for pancakes right now......]","Serious-senpai : [The heck are you here with your strange requests!? It's not like I'm doing that on purpose, so telling me to turn into maple syrup is out of the question!!!]","Makina : [Don't worry, maple syrup will come out...... \"I had settled it so\".]","Serious-senpai : [......You're a freaking devil...... I mean, if you want it that badly, go prepare it yourself!!!]"]},{"number":1946,"title":"Chapter 1946: Illness’ Consultation 7","paragraphs":["Illness, leaning against Kaito while elegantly drinking wine, seemed quite composed from Kaito's perspective.","However, as Illness herself had confessed, her heart wasn't as calm as it appeared, and she was instead feeling quite agitated.","(Oh myyyy, my heart is more shaken than I expecteeeeed. Just the chaaaaange in our relationship to being lovers makes me feel this consciouuuuus.)","Illness was currently most unsettled by these unknown feelings. She had consulted with Kaito and realized that no special words were needed to express her feelings towards him, honestly conveyed her affection, and in return, Kaito reciprocated those feelings, making them lovers.","It was supposed to be a simple change, but Illness felt emotions she had never experienced before. A mix of happiness, bliss, confusion, nervousness, and embarrassment swirled within her, making her feel like her mind was floating in the clouds, unable to calm himself down.","(......I don't think it's because I'm drunk from the wiiiiine. I can't get drunk from this few of an amouuuuunt, and unless I intentionally try tooooo, I don't get druuuuunk. However, this fluttering feeling in my heaaaart...... It's rather ticklish and makes me uneasyyyyy...... yet it's not unpleasaaaaant.)","Though she was puzzled by her inability to control her emotions well, if asked whether she disliked it, she would shake her head. The dominant emotion within Illness was undoubtedly happiness, and she felt an indescribable sense of security from leaning against Kaito.","Soon after, when Kaito's hand moved around her shoulder, embracing her, she felt as if her body temperature had risen.","(Is this what being in a relationship is liiiiike? Perhaps due to my lack of intereeeeest, I'm lacking in informatioooon. It seems I'll inevitably have to rely on Kaito-sama to leeeeead. I suppose Kaito-sama would be accustomed to stuff like thiiiiiis? He casually put his arm around me without startling meeeeee, one's experience really shows through such thiiiings.)","Kaito was also nervous, but due to his romantic experience, he appeared composed to Illness. He was actually nervous when he first put his arm around her, but once he did, Kaito calmed down, smiling as he drank his wine normally.","[Now that I think about it, Illness-san, we often drink wine together huh.]","[That certainly seems to be the caaaaase. It's not that I particularly like wine, but I do find myself often drinking it with Kaito-samaaaaa. It may be because I frequently buy wine to share with youuuuu.]","Previously, Illness had bought wine with her salary from Kaito and enjoyed it together with him, and since then, there have often been similar opportunities where she visits Kaito's room to drink wine with him.","Up until now, as both a subordinate of the Illusory King and a maid, Illness had only used the bare minimum of her salary, hardly spending any of it otherwise. However, using the salary she received from Kaito to buy wine to drink together with him was becoming a secret pleasure for her.","[The wine we sometimes drink together, Illness-san picks and buys it, right?]","[Yeeees. I go to wine specialty shooooops to choose them so that we don't have the same one twiiiiiice.]","[Heehhh, I've never been to a wine specialty shop before...... If you don't mind, can we buy the next wine for our evening drink together?]","[That sounds very fuuuuun. I would certainly love thaaaat.]","Hearing Kaito's suggestion, Illness smiled happily. Just thinking about doing it together with Kaito made an already enjoyable time seem even more exciting.","Understanding that this was the joy of doing something together with someone she liked, with a happy expression, she leaned against Kaito a little more firmly than before.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [....................]","Makina : [I'm sorry for my children who prefer honey, but Mama actually prefers butter and maple syrup on my pancakes. Of course, the pancakes you eat at the store are delicious, but buying pancake mix and making pancakes at home just gives them their own deliciousness!]"]},{"number":1947,"title":"Chapter 1947: Illness’ Consultation 8","paragraphs":["The time I spent with Illness-san had a mysterious comfort to it. We occasionally chatted while drinking wine with my arm around her shoulders. That's all there was to it, with not much conversation and many moments of silence.","However, there was never any discomfort or awkwardness. The atmosphere felt like time was flowing slowly, difficult to describe, but with a relaxed comfort.","I enjoyed the warmth and feel of Illness-san's shoulder under my fingers, the softness and scent of her leaning against me, her gentle voice in our occasional conversations, and the deliciousness of the wine...... It felt like I was enjoying the time spent with Illness-san with all my senses.","[How should I say this...... It feels strange. We're just leisurely letting time flow gently, but it feels very comfortable......]","[Indeeeeed. It kinda feels like being in a daaaaaze. However, I really like this atmospheeeeere. I'm a bit at a loss on how to express iiiiit...... but I'm really feeling the time I'm spending alone with Kaito-samaaaaaa, and it makes me feel all fluffyyyyy.]","[Ahh~~ I understand that feeling very well. How should I say this...... It's like sharing a time of happiness, which feels very comforting.]","[Yeeees. It's soooooo comfortable that I'm a bit worried I might get addicted to iiiiiit.]","I really get what Illness-san was trying to say. We were in a room on a magic ship traveling over the sea, and since there weren't many people on this large ship, it felt especially like we were alone together.","It felt like the kind of adult atmosphere where lovers quietly spend time together in a bar at night. The atmosphere was different from when I drank with Anima and Iris-san in the underground bar, perhaps because Illness-san is a more mature woman.","As I was thinking about this, Illness-san, still leaning against me, lightly rubbed her cheek against mine. It might have been unconscious, but the way she was behaving so affectionately, in contrast to her usual calm demeanor, felt extremely cute.","[......Wouldn't it be fine if you did get addicted? The mood between us might not always turn out the same, but I'll always be with you...... Besides, more than anything, I myself find this atmosphere very comforting and fills me with happiness.]","[I seeeee~~ Kuhihi, I didn't know. Sharing happiness with someone you love can be so warm and comfortable huuuuuh...... Kaito-sama, if you would allow iiiiiit, may I be a bit selfiiiiish?]","[Yes, of course. Go ahead and tell me.]","This was entirely my assumption, but I had a feeling that Illness-san's selfish request wouldn't be that selfish at all, but rather a cute one.","To some extent, Illness-san seemed to feel embarrassed about making demands, so from my experience, I figured it would be something I could easily comply with.","[......I wouldn't mind even if it's just for a short whiiiile, but I would be happy if you could hug me clooooose.]","However, wasn't this request just too cute? Seeing Illness-san shyly asking not just to have her shoulder held but to be hugged tightly, there was no way I would respond with anything other than \"yes\".","[Of course, I'd be happy to...... Let me put down the wine glass first.]","[Yeeees. I'm in your caaaare.]","[Well then, if you'll excuse me......]","[Ah......]","After setting down the wine glass, Illness-san turned towards me and lightly spread her arms. I embraced her from the front, enveloping her small frame. Holding Illness-san's petite body, it felt soft and warm.","Her delicate frame, the breath I could feel near my chest, the pleasant scent I'm smelling stronger than before...... Unn. This feels incredibly good, enveloping me with a strong sense of happiness.","Illness-san remained silent, but she wrapped her arms around my back and hugged me tightly in return. Though she had said it would be just for a little while, it felt like she didn't want to let go anytime soon.","Of course, I also wanted to savor this happy moment for a while, so I slightly tightened my embrace compared to before.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [................]","Makina : [Unn, unnn, it's a love story with a mature atmosphere. This is nice too...... Ah, I want a bit more maple syrup here. Alice, could you squeeze it out of Serious-san's hand?]","? ? ? : [......So you squeeze the stuff out this time huh...... Does that mean Senpai's insides are maple syrup? No, being the gag character with an amusing bodily function, it probably changes depending on the situation......]"]},{"number":1948,"title":"Chapter 1948: Illness’ Consultation 9","paragraphs":["After enjoying some wine with Illness-san and spending time together, we eventually went out onto the balcony of our room.","The owner's room had a spacious balcony where you could see the deck of the ship and the sea. It was more like a small garden in terms of size, but stepping outside, the night breeze felt pleasant against our cheeks.","[There are a lot of stars, but it's dark at night so you can't see the sea.]","[......Ahh, that's riiiiight. Normallyyyyy, with this darkness, you can't see the seeeeea.]","[Ah, right, Illness-san mentioned having really good eyesight before, didn't you?]","[Yeeees. With just the light of the staaaars, I can see quite far even at niiiiight.]","Illness-san had exceptionally good eyesight and could apparently see magic power in the air if she focused. However, she usually adjusted her focus to avoid seeing too much and getting tired, so there were downsides as well......","[Since we're at iiiiiit, would you like to see too, Kaito-samaaaa?]","[Eh? What do you mean by see?]","[I can temporarily share my vision with Kaito-samaaaaa, so you can see the view through my eyesssss. Howeveeeeer, due to Shallow Vernal-sama's Blessing on Kaito-samaaaaaa, I need your consent to use this kind of magiiiiiic. Well, I wouldn't share my vision without consent anywaaaaaaay, so that doesn't matter to me muuuuuch.]","[That's certainly true. In that case, would you mind sharing it with me?]","[Yeeees. But fiiiiiirst, please sit in the chair prepared over theeeeere. Since I'll be sharing my visiooooon, there's a possibility you'd feel disorientated due to changes in perspectiiiiive, so it's important to sit still for safetyyyy.]","I see, now that you mention it, it wouldn't be surprising if things got weird if I moved my body according to the scenery that Illness-san sees. It's certainly important to sit still for safety's sake.","When I sat in the chair Illness-san prepared and closed my eyes as instructed, her palm touched my eyelids.","[Now then, I'll start sharing it with youuuu. Please try not to move too much to avoid straiiiin.]","[Yes——– Whoa, seeing myself sitting there feels kinda strange.]","As Illness-san activated her magic, even though my eyes were closed, I could see myself sitting in the chair. It felt really strange, like watching an incredibly high-quality VR image.","[Well then, I'll be moving my gaze nooooow.]","[Oooohh..... Amazing. I can see the sea so clearly, both near and far.]","[I've currently adjusted my vision a biiiiit, but if I focus my gaaaaze, it looks like thiiiiis.]","[Eh? Uwahh, too bright......]","I was amazed by Illness-san's eyesight, which could see clearly even into the distance at night. Then, suddenly, it became as bright as daytime, and I could see the sea vividly.","[Even with just the light from the stars, if I concentraaaaaate, I can see as brightly as daytiiiiiime. Even in completely dark caves, it looks as clear as earlier.]","[That's amazing. I can't do anything like that myself, so this experience feels really fresh...... it's kinda fun.]","[Kuhihi, I'm glad if you're enjoying it, Kaito-samaaaaa.]","No, it's not just clear...... It's like seeing through the eyes of powerful people like Kuro....... Come to think of it, during the Six Kings Festival, she was able to spot Lilia-san and the others from a distance that I wouldn't realize she was there at all......","It's a strange sensation, not like looking through a telescope where only distant things are clear, but everything, both near and far, is vivid...... It's just, it feels like I'm getting too much information.","[Kaito-sama, if we continue for too loooooong, it might fatigue you, so I think we should end this sooooooon.]","[Ahh, yes. It's true, seeing so clearly, it's different from my usual vision, and it feels tiring if I do it for too long.]","[Well theeeen, I'll now...... I'll switch you back after a few more momeeeeeents.]","[Unn?]","As I puzzled over why she'd suddenly corrected herself, I saw my own form sitting in the chair again through the shared vision. Then, my face started getting closer and closer...... Eh? Wait right there, isn't this too close?","Confused by my own face approaching so closely, my vision suddenly switched, and just as I tried to open my eyes under Illness-san's gentle restraint, I heard some sort of \"chuu\" sound and felt a soft sensation on my cheek.","[......Eh?]","[Now then, we mustn't let your body get too coooooold, so shall we return indooooooors?]","[Eh? Eeehhh!?]","Watching Illness-san's back as she returned indoors with a gentle smile, I was left speechless for a moment, staring after her in astonishment.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [......Hahh...... Gahh!? J- Just when I was suddenly awoken, damage suddenly......]","Makina : [I was the one who restored you! I enjoyed my pancakes, so I'm now thinking of having some custard cream......]","Serious-senpai : [Huh? You revived me once just to have me turn into custard cream? ......You some kind of tyrant or what?]"]},{"number":1949,"title":"Chapter 1949: Neo Baby Castella Blend 1","paragraphs":["A few days had passed since my first time hosting a party on the ship, and I had been taking it easy, perhaps as a reaction to being so busy with the preparations.","Today, Kuro, who had some free time, came over to hang out with me. We were relaxing together when Kuro suddenly stood up, as if she had just thought of something.","[Ah, that's right! There's something I wanted to get your opinion on, Kaito-kun!]","[Unn? My opinion?]","[Unn. You know I run a coffee company, right?]","[I know. I mean, it seemed like Kuro ran most trading companies...... Well, that aside, it's that company that sells Baby Castella Blend coffee, right?]","The coffee company that Kuro mentioned is that one from which the coffee she usually brings along with her baby castellas when she comes over to play comes from...... a company that sells a baby castella blend. I found out about it from a magazine, and it seems that this company boasts the number one market share among coffee-related companies. They also sell a variety of other original blends.","[Unn. It's about that baby castella blend. It's a blend that's been loved for a long time, and I like it a lot, but I think it's time to create a new, improved version. A second edition, per se.]","[Errr, so you're saying you want to create a new coffee blend that pairs well with baby castellas?]","[Exactly! Baby castellas, with their infinite possibilities, are evolving every day, and I think the coffee we drink with it should evolve too!]","[O- Ouu......]","Well, shoot...... It's yet another baby castella-related talk huh...... Because I just had to respond with interest, Kuro's enthusiasm now kicked in.","From the flow of the conversation, I gather she wants my opinion on this new blend...... Hopefully, it won't turn into a long discussion.","[That said, I put a lot of effort into creating the original baby castella blend, so it's tough to surpass it. I've been working on improving coffee bean varieties for a while, but I couldn't quite get it right.]","[Well, improving varieties seems difficult. But if you're bringing this up now, does that mean you've come up with something good?]","[Unn. Recently, I've noticed I've grown and can do more things. Back then, putting aside magic, when it came to those on the level of Gods' Authority, my abilities were skewed towards destructive abilities. In the first place, Shiro divided her abilities that way...... Well, Shiro has fully regained her original ability now, and I've been growing a lot recently too.]","[Hmm, so it's like your halved abilities are returning to its full state?]","[Right. I guess my abilities, which were at Semi-Omnipotent Level, are getting closer to a fully Omnipotent Level? Well, my abilities are becoming more and more like Authorities...... I've even started being able to interfere with the laws of the world.]","In a sense, Kuro and Shiro are two sides of the same coin, so it's possible that Kuro is also growing as a result of Shiro-san's growth.","Well, that's probably not the main point right now.","[......And so, you mean you were able to successfully improve the coffee bean varieties with the improvement of your abilities?]","[Unn. Well, I did cheat a bit by creating entirely new coffee bean varieties, but I managed to make some pretty good ones...... And so, I think it's about time to create the Neo Baby Castella Blend! And of course, I want to hear the opinion of my fellow member of the Baby Castella Adoration Association, Kaito-kun.]","I felt the same way when she was trying to make the Ultimate Baby Castella, but I wish she'd stop putting me in this mysterious fan club I never signed up for.","No, I do admit that the number of baby castellas I've eaten might be far above what normal people have consumed. After all, Kuro brings them almost every day...... Heck, I can now even distinguish between different baby castellas by taste.","............Arehh? Have I actually become a member of that Baby Castella Adoration Association...... I got roped into the Maid World, and now I've been included as a member of some Baby Castella Adoration Association group...... Just thinking about all this brings me headaches.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [......Haahhh...... Haahhh...... What a terrible experience. Not just with the main story, but even more because of that Mad God..... That guy, is she seriously planning on turning me into a sweets-making machine...... A- Anyhow, I survived! Illness' turn is over!!!]","? ? ? : [...... (With Serious-senpai saying that, it means there's probably something coming up after this arc involving Kuro-san. Well, generally, after couples progress in their relationship, they go on dates......)]"]},{"number":1950,"title":"Chapter 1950: Neo Baby Castella Blend 2","paragraphs":["Kuro mentioned wanting opinions on coffee blends and began arranging several bottles of coffee beans on the table. As opportunities like this don't come by very often, it was intriguing for me to see coffee beans in this state.","The coffee beans in cork-sealed bottles looked stylish and appealing.","[Some people are particular about roasting, but these are primarily roasted for sale in the company. Well, people can also buy beans before they're roasted. We're planning to sell both beans and already ground powder.]","[I'm not very knowledgeable about coffee, but why sell them separately as beans and powder?]","[There are several reasons, but mainly because grinding them makes extraction easier. It increases the surface area...... the area that comes into contact with hot water, making extraction easier. However, increased surface area also means more exposure to oxygen, which can lead to oxidation and a loss of bitterness and flavor.]","[I see, so that's why most are sold in a state that resists oxidation......]","[Unn. However, grinding beans is also quite a hassle, and different grind sizes can affect taste. So, for convenience, many are sold already ground. Ground coffee can last about 10 days, and with a magic box, you don't have to worry about deterioration.]","Indeed, with a magic box, there's no need to worry about deterioration, making powdered coffee convenient and easy to drink......","That said, people who are particular about taste might still prefer beans, but if it were me, I might just go for the powder...... or perhaps, I'll just keep coffee in my magic box already brewed.","[Kuro seems quite knowledgeable about coffee huh.]","[Well, most of what I know comes from what Shalltear and Ein taught me, but I did study quite a bit to find blends that go well with baby castella. By the way, the grind size also affects the taste, you know?]","[Like fine or coarse, something like that?]","[Unn. Finer grind results in a stronger, more bitter taste, while coarser grind makes it lighter and milder. There are five common types: extra fine, fine, medium fine, medium, and coarse. When my company sells powdered coffee, we usually go for the most orthodox medium-fine grind.]","[I see......]","Perhaps because it's related to baby castellas, I felt Kuro's even more talkative than usual, explaining proudly, which is rather endearing.","[......That said, I always thought Ein-san was more into tea, but she's also knowledgeable about coffee huh......]","[Ein is perfect with coffee too. She personally prefers tea, just like many in our family do, so the default drink in our household is tea. Zwei and Funf like coffee though.]","[Ahh~~ I can certainly picture that. People like Tre-san and Raz-san might not like coffee.]","[Exactly, they're not big fans of coffee. Tre doesn't particularly dislike coffee, but Raz isn't keen on bitterness. She's okay with cafe au lait though.]","Yeah, it's pretty much as I imagined. Tre-san would probably act like an adult and smugly drink coffee...... only to make a face when it tastes different than she expected.","[Incidentally, when it comes to the Six Kings, Isis is just like Raz, she doesn't like bitter things, so she hardly drinks coffee. Lillywood hardly drinks anything except water. Megiddo, if she's gonna drink tea or coffee, she'd instead opt more towards alcohol, while Shalltear likes both. Also, it seems Magnawell has recently taken a liking to coffee.]","[Eh? Is that so? Ahh, because he recently got the split body that he can eat or drink with huh......]","[Unn. He's been trying out various foods and drinks, and he seems to have really liked coffee, as he's been studying about it.]","Come to think of it, Magnawell does seem like someone who would enjoy coffee. With his dignified appearance in his human form, he would probably look quite natural drinking coffee.","[Ahh, but I digress. So, I've prepared a fair number of prospects. I was hoping Kaito-kun could taste them and give your opinion.]","[I see, like a tasting session huh? Alright, how many varieties are there?]","[This time, it's \"37 types\".]","[............Eh?]","Wait a moment there. She just said that so casually...... Eh? Am I going to drink 37 cups of coffee now? Won't I end up with a bloated stomach?","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [As Kuro mentioned in the story, grinding the beans finer increases the surface area that contacts the hot water, making extraction easier and intensifying the flavor...... So simply increasing the quantity also makes it stronger. For example, grinding coarser and using more coffee can brew a coffee with strong bitterness and richness yet a good aftertaste. However, adjusting this is quite sensitive and challenging, so trying different methods to find your preference is great!]","? ? ? : [Speaking of which, this Senpai also likes coffee......]"]},{"number":1951,"title":"Chapter 1951: Neo Baby Castella Blend 3","paragraphs":["I was surprised to hear there are 37 different types, but on second thought, I didn't really need to drink the full cup of each. A sip should be enough to get a sense of the flavor...... though 37 types are still quite a lot......","[The coffee has been prepared in advance. I was thinking of having you try them in order, starting with the coarsely ground, milder ones. I think it’ll be clearer than starting with the strong ones.]","[Though you say that, I'm not very good at judging coffee quality.]","[That's fine, it's more about your general impression. Whether you think this one seems like it would go well with baby castella, or if you like this flavor———- just your loose opinion is enough. We'll make the final decision in our meeting, so consider it just a reference.]","[I see, that makes me feel more at ease.]","Since my opinion is just a reference, it’s good that I can evaluate them casually. In that case, let's start drinking the coffee Kuro had prepared...... unn, it's already delicious.","[Somehow, even though this was just the first cup, it already seems like it would pair really well with baby castellas.]","[Unn. All of these have been adjusted to pair well with baby castella, so they should all match well.]","[I see...... By the way, does Kuro’s company offer anything besides the baby castella blend?]","[Of course, we do. We also have some new products planned for release alongside this Neo Baby Castella Blend. Ahh, that's right. I'll give Kaito-kun some samples, so if you know any coffee lovers, recommend them. They’re scheduled to be released at the beginning of the month after next.]","Coffee lovers huh...... The first people who come to mind are Ozma-san and Elise-san. Ozma seems to really like coffee, and Elise also identifies herself as a coffee lover, so recommending it to them seems good.","Other than them...... Perhaps Shea-san? I don't remember specifically having discussed this with her before, but she gives off the impression that she might prefer coffee over tea.","......They're the only ones that come to mind right now. I generally think most people I know prefer tea. There might be coffee lovers I’m not aware of, but since this is for promotional purposes, it’s fine to recommend it as long as they don’t dislike coffee.","[......Ahh, this one might be my favorite out of all the ones I've tried. The aftertaste is clean, so it seems good for the morning.]","[Fumu fumu, number 9 huh...... However, I see, as expected of Kaito-kun! Not only do you base your judgment with how matching it is with baby castellas, depending on whether it's for morning, noon, or night, the best match could change. Maybe it's worth considering releasing three varieties for morning, noon, and night......]","[H- Hmm, I wasn't really thinking that deeply about it...... But there are coffee beans specifically suited for morning coffee, so it might be a good idea?]","I wasn’t really considering what Kuro mentioned. I just thought it seemed like a good choice for the morning...... but since there are morning blends for canned coffee, what she said does make sense. Well, let's just ignore how she just casually talked about eating baby castellas in the morning, noon and night......","[By the way, is there a particular one that you like, Kuro?]","[For me, I'd say the coffee around this area. It’s a bit stronger in bitterness, but it enhances the simple sweetness of the baby castella, so I think it’s a good match.]","[Indeed, considering the sweetness left in the mouth after eating baby castellas, a slightly bitter coffee might actually be a better match to reset the palate.]","Surprisingly, discussing which coffee pairs best with baby castellas while tasting the options turned out enjoyable, and just like that, Kuro and I continued to have a fun discussion about the Neo Baby Castella Blend.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [Considering the title, I guess the story would continue until the introduction of the company and their sales?]"]},{"number":1952,"title":"Chapter 1952: Neo Baby Castella Blend 4","paragraphs":["Though it took quite a bit of time, I finished drinking the coffee that Kuro had prepared. To be honest, there are many where I can’t tell the difference. After all, I’m an amateur, so I can’t tell subtle differences in coffee with just one sip.","However, among them, I picked out about 5 kinds that caught my interest or simply suited my taste.","[......I think these are the ones that might go well with baby castellas.]","[Ohh, as expected from Kaito-kun! My opinion might also be close to that...... I was thinking this or this might be good too.]","[Yeah, those two certainly are top-level among what I sampled. They also seem to pair well with baby castellas, so with our opinions aligning, these should be good?]","[Unn, unn. Since these are coffee chosen by the main members of the Baby Castella Adoration Association, me and Kaito-kun, there's no doubting that!]","I'd prefer it if she didn't make me a key member of an obscure fan club I don’t remember joining...... With how Ein-san also gave me some inexplicable position like Maid Advisor without me knowing, I guess this master and servant duo really would resemble each other huh......","[Thanks, Kaito-kun! This was very helpful!]","[I'm glad I could be of help...... That said, even though I only had one sip each, that was still quite a lot.]","[Unn, it might have been a bit too many...... I had so much fun restructuring them that I may have made too much.]","[Well, you do tend to go overboard when it comes to baby castellas......]","[Eh? T- That's totally not the case...... right? I'm just a bit, umm, a bit passionate when it comes to baby castellas...... is it...... no good?]","[If you yourself aren't confident about it being otherwise, just give up and admit it.]","[Ugh...... Yes.]","I mean, Kuro was aware she goes overboard when it comes to baby castellas huh...... It seems like her excitement just makes her lose control, and unlike Eden-san or Ein-san, she is reflecting on her actions. Based on what I’ve seen so far, I have a feeling that those reflections don’t really lead to improvements......","[Well, that said, Kuro being on a rampage is still cute when compared to Eden-san's.]","[Kaito-kun, Kaito-kun, even I would get shocked when you compare me to her...... Errr...... Ahh~~ That's right, just remembered something! I brought some snacks to share with you, Kaito-kun!]","[......You were losing the argument and have now changed the topic huh.]","[T- That's totally not the case, you know?]","Given that Kuro is aware that she's aware she does go overboard, continuing this topic would be disadvantageous for her...... I mean, knowing she had almost no chance of breezing through this topic, she changed the subject to dodge away from this discussion.","Seeing this rare, vulnerable side of hers that she probably doesn't show to others, I couldn't help chuckling. Kuro going on a rampage really is just cute. Even so, it's fun to hang out with her......","[Well, nevermind...... So, what did you bring?]","[Tadaaa! It's this!]","[This is...... a pot filled with pudding?]","[Yep. There's a small shop in a city east of Archlesia Empire. It's basically a shop that deals with ceramics, but they sometimes make their own pudding and sell it in these special ceramic containers. It’s a delicious pudding known to those in the know.]","[Heehhh...... the container is stylish, and it certainly looks delicious.]","Kuro, who has a hobby of food touring, sometimes brings over sweets she likes. As expected from someone who has written several food guidebooks, Kuro's choices are always spot on, and what she brings is always delicious.","[I've got custard and chocolate flavors. Which one would you like, Kaito-kun?]","[Hmm. I think I'll go with the basic custard.]","[Okay, then I'll have the chocolate. Here, the spoon.]","[Ah, a spoon also comes as a set with the ceramic huh...... It's certainly stylish.]","I took the spoon and took a bite right away, and as I thought, it was incredibly delicious. It wasn’t refined like high-end puddings but had a simple, gentle homemade taste that was wonderful.","[Kaito-kun, try out chocolate too. Here, ahhhn.]","[Thanks...... Unn, the chocolate is good too...... Kuro too, want to try out the custard?]","[Ahhhn...... Mmm, delish! Ehehe, it's strange how when I eat with Kaito-kun, the food tastes even better than when I eat it on my eating tours.]","Seeing Kuro smiling happily like that made me smile as well. Just like that, occasionally feeding each other as we did before, we enjoyed our pudding.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [......Just when I thought we were talking about coffee, these two suddenly started flirting with each other. I felt like I'd been suddenly slapped when I let my guard down......]","? ? ? : [......With all the times you've been suddenly slapped like that, why are you still so careless...... You some kind of complacent queen or what?]"]},{"number":1953,"title":"Chapter 1953: Neo Baby Castella Blend 5","paragraphs":["It seems that the direction for Kuro's Neo Baby Castella Blend has been somewhat decided, and like the other new products, they're aiming for a release the month after next.","The next morning, I headed towards Elise-san's shop. When it comes to coffee enthusiasts, Ozma-san is the first person who comes to mind, but the place closest to my home is Elise-san's shop.","Now that I think about it, I don't actually know where Ozma-san lives...... The most likely possibility is that he resides in Megiddo-san's castle, but it wouldn't be strange if he had another place as well.","Anyway, I planned to ask about that with a hummingbird and then head out with the samples for promotion, so I decided to go visit Elise-san first.","Elise-san is usually at the shop except on her regular holidays, and she says she rarely goes out, so the likelihood of her being at the shop is high.","And so I visited Elise-san's shop but......","[......Geh.]","[Ah, hello...... Temporarily Closed?]","Elise-san was just outside the shop, about to hang a sign on the entrance door that said \"Temporary Closed.\"","[......Just as always, you had to come at the most inconvenient times, Human-san. Well, it’s fine. You must have something you need, right? Hurry up and come in.]","[Eh/ Is that alright? If you're closing up shop for the day, that means you must have some errands to run......]","[I have plans this afternoon and will be going out. Since it's a hassle to open just for the morning, I'll just temporarily close shop for today. Well, since I have time until noon, if it's Human-san, I can keep you company. If it's something troublesome, I'll just send you away, but for now, I'll hear you out.]","[I see, then excuse me for intruding.]","Her tone still has its usual sharpness...... or so it would seem, but the fact that she doesn’t complain or try to chase me away makes me think she’s actually quite a kind person.","Prompted by Elise-san, I entered the shop, and she prepared a chair for me.","[So, what’s this about?]","[Actually, someone I know...... Or rather, Kuro...... the Underworld King gave me some samples of a new coffee she's planning to release in her company, so I came to share them and promote it......]","[......Underworld King-sama's company...... Coffee...... Are you talking about Dual Star Trading Company's new product!?]","[No, I didn’t know the name of the company but...... judging by your reaction, it seems to be quite famous.]","It seems like that coffee company is even more famous than I thought...... I knew Kuro’s companies were top-notch in their respective fields, but Elise-san's reaction was unexpected.","[......Human-san...... You actually visit with some good news for once huh.]","[You're saying it as if I always come with bad news......]","[I wouldn't say always, but it's true that you often visit bringing along troublesome matters. Putting aside if Human-san intended it or not....... Well, that's just how you are. So, what kind of new product is it?]","[It seems they're going to release several new products, as I got a lot of samples. I’ll arrange them on the table.]","Elise-san seems quite interested in the new coffee products, but not in an unusually intense way like Ein-san. I mean, I guess that's just how Ein-san is...... Jutia-san also seems to lose her composure when it comes to tea-related matters.","Well, in any case, Elise-san reacted with a slight increase in enthusiasm, but overall, she maintains her usual demeanor.","[......There are quite a few varieties. Will these be released as a series...... Well, since we’re at it, I’ll brew one of them. Is there any particular one you’d like to try, Human-san?]","[I’m not very knowledgeable about coffee, so I’ll leave it up to you.]","[Fumu, then something with a neutral flavor should be good...... Let's see...... Let's go with this one. I’ll go brew it, so wait a moment.]","[Ah, yes. Thank you.]","Elise-san went to the back of the shop and, after a short while, came out with freshly brewed coffee, placing it in front of me along with a piece of cake.","[You brought something nice, so I’m serving you cake as well.]","[Thank you....... By the way, isn’t that brewing process quite fast? Is coffee usually brewed that quickly?]","[Oh, it’s quite expensive, but there’s a specialized magical tool that uses Space-Time Magic to speed up the extraction process. Since I’m a dedicated coffee enthusiast, I have quite a few coffee-related magic tools.]","[I see, that sounds quite convenient.]","[Yeah, it's convenient alright, but it’s really expensive, so not many people buy it. It's also quite large, so it’s generally suited for use in coffee shops or stores.]","Elise-san sat down at the seat across from me and began chatting while enjoying her coffee. It's just, the cake was only served to me, there was none in front of Elise-san.","[Arehh? What about your portion of cake, Elise-san?]","[I’m not really fond of cake. The one I served you is from those I kept to serve to guests, so I just brought out Human-san's portion.]","[I see.]","[......Hmm, this blend is nice. It has no strong flavors and seems to pair well with anything.]","After answering briefly, the conversation shifted to the new coffee products, and just like that, I spent some time chatting with Elise-san about coffee.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [For guests....... Considering Elise's personality, it’s probably meant for Kaito and Alice, right?]","? ? ? : [No, she doesn't even offer me tea, always having this strong \"just hurry up and go home\" aura, so it’s probably cake she bought for Kaito-san.]","Serious-senpai : [Well, Alice showing up = orders from the top, and even in casual conversations, she always had that \"just hurry up and go home\" vibe, so if you think about it, I guess she's relatively soft with Kaito......]"]},{"number":1954,"title":"Chapter 1954: Neo Baby Castella Blend 6","paragraphs":["Regarding the coffee sample that Kuro gave me, I inquired about Ozma-san's availability via hummingbird and found out that I'll be going to Ozma-san's house tomorrow.","It seems that Ozma-san's house is in a different location from Megiddo-san's residence, and it was planned for me to teleport to Megiddo-san's residence, where Ozma-san would pick me up.","Ozma-san aside, as for someone who might like coffee, Shea-san comes to mind, but are there others as well?","[......Why don't you just ask me?]","[Well, that feels a bit like cheating...... No, guess it's too late for that now huh...... Do I have any acquaintances who like coffee other than Ozma-san, Elise-san, and Shea-san? Oh, by the way, does Shea-san even like coffee?]","Since I was relaxing at Alice's general store, it seemed like Alice read my mind and told me.","Well, it's true that Alice is the best source for information. She probably knows my acquaintances' hobbies and preferences almost perfectly, even those I might not be aware of.","[Just as Kaito predicted, Shea-san likes coffee. Also, here’s a list I've prepared. The names at the top are the ones who like coffee the most. The ones at the bottom prefer coffee over tea but they don't particularly mind much whichever. People who drink coffee regularly are around this part of the list.]","[Your support is too perfect.]","The list Alice handed me had names of my acquaintances who like coffee, including those I hadn't noticed. It was exactly the information I needed. I suppose it's as to be expected of her, her preparation is so thorough that she must have anticipated this in advance.","As I was thinking about this, Alice started grinding the sample coffee beans with a coffee grinder. The sound of the beans being ground and the faint aroma of coffee were delightful.","[Kuro had already brought some brewed coffee, so this is the first time I’ve seen it being hand-ground like this.]","[Well, if you don’t have any particular preferences, buying pre-ground coffee is fine. However, freshly ground coffee has a better aroma, so if you’re going to put in the effort, grinding it yourself is better. Finding the right grind setting for your taste is also a good idea.]","[Grind setting?]","[Different grinders have different mechanisms, but for this coffee grinder, you can adjust the grind by moving the adjustment screw up or down under the handle. Generally, moving it up makes it coarser, and moving it down makes it finer.]","[Heehhh~~]","While explaining, Alice finished hand-grinding the coffee and placed a tool with a transparent flask-like container on the counter.","[This is...... a siphon, right?]","[That's right. Well, coffee made with a siphon tends to taste better.]","[Unn? What's this cloth-like thing?]","[This is a Nel filter, a cloth filter. It makes coffee with fewer impurities and a smooth mouthfeel, and most people use a Nel filter with a siphon. You set the filter in this funnel and insert it into the siphon's flask to extract the coffee. However, it's not very beginner-friendly because if you over-extract, the bitterness can become too strong.]","[Heehhh....... there are so many different coffee-making tools huh.]","[Yes, there are various methods like AeroPress, Ibrik, Percolator...... Each has different compatibility with beans...... but well, ultimately, as long as it tastes good, it's all that matters. Here you go.]","Alice, while giving a slight wry smile, handed me a cup of coffee she brewed. Taking a sip...... it was delicious. It perfectly matched my taste, and it was the best coffee I’ve had recently.","[......It’s incredibly delicious. It feels like it perfectly suits my taste.]","[Given your taste preferences, a slightly coarser grind with a clean flavor is probably what you’d enjoy. Among Kuro’s new products, using a slightly coarser grind for these beans would make them taste great. I’ll also nonchalantly serve some castellas that pair well with coffee as a snack. Oh my, as expected of the Transcendental Beauty Alice-chan, the ideal girlfriend with flawless mindfulness!]","[Yes, yes.]","[Isn't your response too sloppy!? Please compliment me properly!]","[......So says someone who gets embarrassed when I properly give my response...... Well, it’s true that Alice is incredibly considerate, always helping out, fun to be with, cute, and definitely the best girlfriend.]","[......Ahh~~ Umm...... I'd also feel troubled if you compliment me too much...... L- Let's keep it in moderation......]","[It's because you're like that that I'm being lighthearted about it......]","Reacting as I thought she would, Alice, who looks away bashfully when directly praised, is so incredibly adorable that it makes me chuckle.","Thinking it might be fun to give her some unexpected compliments in the future, I enjoyed the delicious coffee Alice made.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [She may be made fun of for how embarrassed she easily gets, but if you think about her actual specs, she really is flawless......]"]},{"number":1955,"title":"Chapter 1955: Neo Baby Castella Blend 7","paragraphs":["When I arrived at Megiddo-san's castle, where I was supposed to meet Ozma-san, he was already at the entrance. Although there were still over 15 minutes until our appointment, it seemed he had been waiting while smoking a cigarette.","[Ya, Miyama-kun, welcome.]","[Hello, Ozma-san. I'm sorry for making you wait.]","[No, no, Uncle just arrived here early, so you don't need to worry. Well, let's not stand here chatting. How about we move and chat?]","[Ah, yes..... Is it okay not to greet Megiddo-san before we head out?]","I asked Ozma-san as he immediately started to move. Technically, we were just using Megiddo-san’s castle as the meeting place, and we didn’t have an appointment with her specifically.","However, I felt it might be rude not to greet her since we were at her castle, so I inquired, to which Ozma-san responded with a light smile.","[Yeah, Master is out today and isn't home, so no need to worry about that. She was apparently quite moved by an artwork displayed at the ship party before, so she might be making sculptures or something by now.]","[Ahh~~ Now that you mention it, I did see her in the Art Plaza in the Northern District of Symphonia before.]","[Symphonia's Art Plaza certainly is quite famous. There’s a similar place in the Hydra Kingdom, which is also popular among young artists, though it’s not in the Capital but in another city.]","Hydra Kingdom has a penchant for progressive things, and their artwork tends to be quite daring. It’s almost like avant-garde art, which I didn’t fully understand but seemed close to contemporary art.","Anyway, since Megiddo-san wasn’t present, heading straight to Ozma-san’s home seemed fine.","[Is Ozma-san’s house close from here?]","[Ahh, errr...... Can you see that small hill over there?]","[Ah, yes...... Is it located over there?]","[Unn. To put it simply, that hill is land owned by me, and my house is located there.]","[I see......]","So the whole hill is like Ozma-san's garden...... That's awesome. But well, considering Ozma-san’s status as a top-class figure in the Demon Realm, being one of the Six Kings' Executives and a Duke-rank, it’s not surprising that he owns that much land. Heck, I wouldn’t be surprised if he owned a mountain.","[Still, it’s a bit surprising. I thought you lived in Megiddo-san’s castle.]","[Agni-chan and Bacchus-kun live in the castle. But I prefer a quiet place when I want to relax...... Plus, if you live in the castle, saying things like \"Come drink with me\", Master would regularly gather everyone and hold a party.]","[That does sound like Megiddo-san.]","[By the way, speaking of Master, she seems to like Miyama-kun even more than before recently. So much so that she talks about you all the time. I mean, she even said something about liking you in a romantic sense....... Umm, are you okay with that? I’m not sure if I can stop her, but if you’re troubled by her actions, feel free to consult me.]","[Ah, no, I'm totally fine...... Rather than that, I thought Ozma-san liked Megiddo-san......]","Since the incident with Megiddo-san's destructive impulses, I knew she had grown even fonder of me than before...... I mean, she openly declared it herself. Well, I’m a bit relieved that she’s stopped her initially intense and aggressive approach after apparently getting a scolding from Kuro.","That said, I had thought that since Ozma-san had long known Megiddo-san’s true form, he might have feelings for Megiddo-san...... but upon hearing my words, Ozma-san looked as if I just suddenly asked about the universe.","[......Eh? Do you mean romantically?]","[Yes.]","[......You sure say something so terrifying, Miyama-kun. No, \"I\" have sworn firm loyalty to Megiddo-sama as my King...... but thinking about having a romantic relationship with a tyrant like that, that's just frightening.]","Ozma-san really seemed genuinely horrified. His use of \"I\" (Ore) instead of \"this old man\" (Oji-san) made it feel like he was being completely honest.","[......If I were to have a romantic relationship with someone, I would definitely want someone calm and gentle. You see, Megiddo-sama is quite overbearing, right? Being in a relationship with someone like that is definitely quite the hassle...... Rather, are you sure you're going to be alright, Miyama-sama? Megiddo-sama really seems to like you, and she won’t stop easily.]","[......Ah, well, about that...... I mean, among those I know, Megiddo-san technically isn’t counted among those I consider as someone I can’t properly talk with...... I have acquaintances who are much worse, so forcefulness on Megiddo-san’s level isn’t really a problem for me.]","[......You’ve really grown, Miyama-kun. Honestly, I don’t feel like I can match up to you in that regard.]","Ozma-san spoke with a sense of deep admiration, and I responded with a wry smile.","<Afterword>","Makina : [Ah, how sad. To think that there were troublesome people who could make my sweet beloved child say something like this...... I'd like to see the faces of those fools at least once.]","Serious-senpai : [......Don't you have a mirror?]"]},{"number":1956,"title":"Chapter 1956: Neo Baby Castella Blend 8","paragraphs":["Ozma-san's house was a log cabin standing on a small hill. Just from the outside, it looked stylish and had a great atmosphere.","When I went inside, I found a room with a warm, wooden feel, featuring stylish furniture and a fireplace despite the simple design. Hmm, I suppose this is to be expected...... I feel that such furniture reflects the owner's taste.","The room was quite tidy with not many items, giving an impression of a mature calmness.","[It's a stylish and pleasant room, isn't it?]","[You think so? Thanks. Well, even though I have a house, most of my stuff are stored away with Space-Time Magic, so the interior tends to be quite simple.]","[It certainly is more convenient to store belongings in a magic box...... Ah, and this is the sample coffee.]","Putting aside interior decor, it's usually more convenient to put items in a magic box. It's easy to retrieve and doesn’t deteriorate...... However, just like with Isis-san, I feel that books should be displayed on a bookshelf to create a certain atmosphere, and for items that someone else might use, you can't just store them in a magic box.","[Thank you. Well, Uncle also enjoys the coffee from the merchants at Underworld King-sama's place and drinks them often. Miyama-kun, have you tried this coffee already?]","[Yes, I've had a taste of it.]","[I see. In that case, let me serve you the coffee I usually drink instead of the sample...... Feel free to sit wherever you like.]","[Thank you...... I suppose Ozma-san really drinks coffee quite often?]","Ozma-san's usual coffee huh...... I wonder what it's like? Actually, I've received coffee grounds from Ozma-san several times before, but those were usually when he had obtained rare coffee beans, so I don't think I've ever tasted the coffee he regularly drinks.","[Yeah, I do like coffee quite a bit. I go around buying various rare coffee beans, but the ones I drink most are the standard ones. It has a stable flavor. I mean, even though I tried various rare ones, I end up settling on the flavor I'm familiar with.]","[Ahhh, I get what you mean. In the end, what you're used to is often what you'd like the most.]","I can relate to Ozma-san’s opinion. Rare things are delicious and trying different ones is refreshing, but ultimately, I end up returning to what I’m used to...... Like, there's this feeling of \"this is the best after all\" or something like that.","The thing I eat the most in this world are baby castellas, but Kuro frequently creates and brings new versions. Some of them are incredibly delicious, but in the end, simple baby castella feels the most stable.","[Exactly that. By the way, the coffee Uncle usually drinks is from the Underworld King-sama’s trading company. I buy the beans before roasting and roast them myself. Aging the beans for a certain period before roasting just enhances the richness.]","[Heehhh, aging huh. That sounds quite complicated.]","[That's right, it can be challenging as you have to carefully check the beans to prevent mold, which makes it difficult but...... Uncle can just cheat a bit with magic.]","With a wry smile, Ozma-san brewed the coffee. Seeing him without his trench coat, his well-toned muscles were impressive.","Moreover, there's his tall stature and composed demeanor...... Hmmm, I also want to have a cool, mature aura like that, but I can’t quite imagine myself ever having such an atmosphere.","[Well, but for my case, Uncle often drinks coffee at cafes. Each cafe has their own unique characteristics, and it's quite interesting because you can come across surprisingly different flavors.]","[Cafes huh...... Now that I think about it, I feel like I haven't had many opportunities to visit cafes. I often go to restaurants though......]","[Ahh, that might be because you mostly use Teleportation Magic for travel. Maybe you don’t end up entering cafes because you don’t go there to meet up with people. Additionally, it’s possible that there aren’t many cafes in the places Miyama-kun usually goes, so you might not notice them unless you’re paying attention.]","[Indeed...... It might be a good idea to actively look for cafes next time.]","[That's right. Finding your favorite spot is enjoyable...... Sorry for waiting, here you go.]","The lack of opportunities to visit cafes might be because of my magic box. Since food and drinks are stored in my magic box, it's easy to address any hunger or thirst while outside.","Well, it might be interesting to actually look for cafes. There might be some high-end ones near my home, so a cafe with that kind of atmosphere could be refreshing and enjoyable.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [Coffee lovers seem to be calmer than the tea lovers......]","? ? ? : [No, even among the tea lovers, the only crazy one is basically Ein-san......]"]},{"number":1957,"title":"Chapter 1957: Neo Baby Castella Blend 9","paragraphs":["During our casual chat over coffee, probably because we had discussed a bit while on the move, the topic naturally shifted to relationships. This time, though, it wasn’t about my own love life but rather about Ozma’s.","[Ozma-san, you mentioned you prefer a quiet woman, but isn’t Epsilon-san cool and calm?]","[......Ah~~ I suppose so. She usually is, well...... like that, I guess.]","......It seems like there’s a bit of a discrepancy in our impressions here. Sure, being one of the War King's subordinates, Epsilon-san is also aggressive and likes fighting, but she generally has a cool impression. However, Ozma-san’s response seems a bit evasive.","It feels like while acknowledging Epsilon-san’s coolness, he’s suggesting that that isn't the case when it comes to romance.","[Epsilon-chan is indeed cool and calm, and she’s a good person. But setting aside the fact that she’s a subordinate of the War King and likes fighting, if we focus only on romance-related matters...... Epsilon-chan is kinda...... umm...... heavy with her affection.]","[......Ah, I think I get what you mean. The problem is in that direction huh......]","[In fact, because Uncle is stronger than her that there's no problem, but if Epsilon-chan had been stronger than me...... I fear she might just confine me before I knew it. Ah, no, I don't mean to speak ill of Epsilon-chan, but she just gives off that kind of image......]","I see, so Epsilon-san’s affection is intense and somewhat suffocating...... Now that he mentions it, she does seem like the type to cling strongly to things she likes.","[In terms of romance, Agni-chan is the type to aggressively pursue head-on. Epsilon-chan, on the other hand, tends to strategize and cut off any escape routes...... There was even a time when preparations for a wedding were advancing without Uncle knowing......]","[......A- Ahh, I see...... So she would prepare everything and invite the other Six Kings, making it impossible to cancel the wedding at the last minute huh......]","It’s likely that her affection for Ozma-san plays a part, but it could also be that since her straightforward approaches have been rejected, she resorts to more underhanded tactics...... Imagining how Ozma-san felt upon realizing that wedding preparations had advanced without him noticing is genuinely frightening.","[......In that sense, Agni-chan is much easier to deal with in romance. Agni-chan only makes her approach head-on. Epsilon-chan, on the other hand, always changes her approach, which is troublesome...... Well, it’s a relief that since Uncle is stronger, the range of strategies she can use is somewhat limited.]","[How should I say this...... You also got it rough huh, Ozma-san.]","[Hahaha, well, both of them are good girls...... I just don’t know why they’re so fixated on this with a dried-up middle-aged guy like me...... Well, there's also the part where I find it more comfortable to be single.]","[Fumu...... By the way, what are Bacchus-san and Kong-san’s romantic situations like?]","Well, the reason Agni-san and Epsilon-san’s approaches aren’t working is largely due to Ozma-san’s lack of desire for marriage or romance, which greatly influences the situation.","And since we’re on the topic, I decided to ask about the romantic situations of the other members of the War King's Five Generals.","[Kong-kun is the type to cut off things he doesn’t understand or is not good at, so he seems completely uninterested in romance. Bacchus-kun, on the other hand, has about 80 wives.]","[Eeehhhh!? 80 wives!?]","[Ah~~ No, it might be a bit different from what you're imagining, Miyama-kun....... We have a lot of hotblooded individuals here...... There are many women among the War King's subordinates, and most of them prefer men who are stronger than themselves. Some of them are the type to impulsively confess their feelings after a mock battle where they’ve given their all.]","......Are they some kind of amazon or what? Well, the War King's subordinates do have that kind of nature...... Of course, not everyone is like that, but it’s undeniable that it’s a faction with many battle fanatics.","[And so, Bacchus-kun doesn’t refuse any of these confessions. When someone confesses, he says something like, \"Umu, I will allow you to call yourself my wife until your feelings wane\" and he’s the type who doesn’t chase after those who leave......]","[I see. So, even if someone’s feelings wane and they want to end the marriage, he doesn’t particularly try to keep them and just lets the relationship dissolve?]","[Unn, well, that's what the person himself intends to do...... But despite his appearance, Bacchus-kun is quite attentive. He frequently gives small gifts and checks in with his wives, so not many of them actually want to end their marriage.]","I see, Bacchus-san is quite considerate...... Come to think of it, Megiddo-san often designates Bacchus-san when assigning sudden tasks and he seemed to be considerate towards Lilia-san when we first met and had a party in her garden.","Still, having 80 wives is impressive...... He might be at the top among the acquaintances I’ve known so far......","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [He's considerate towards Lilia? ......Ah, that stuff that happened in the manga huh...... However, if Bacchus has that much romantic experience, it seems like Ozma should consult him.]","? ? ? : [Actually, his experience isn’t that extensive. As Ozma-san said, his relationships were mostly the result of just one pattern...... And Bacchus-san’s opinion would definitely be something like \"Why not just accept the proposal?\"]"]},{"number":1958,"title":"Chapter 1958: Neo Baby Castella Blend 10","paragraphs":["After returning from visiting Ozma-san's house, where I handed out some coffee samples, I was looking over a list that Alice had given me.","Since there’s a limit to the samples, I can’t visit everyone, but since Alice gave me the list, I want to make sure to give samples to those who like coffee.","Shea-san is definitely on the list, and then there are others toward the top of the list...... Oya?","As I looked through the list, I found a somewhat surprising name. This list from Alice contained names of people who like coffee, and most of them do indeed seem like they’d be coffee enthusiasts. However, there was one person who didn’t seem to have the image of a coffee drinker.","This person was in the middle of the list, just below those who regularly drink coffee...... Well, I’ll ask her about it the next time we meet.","With that in mind, I started confirming plans with the people I intended to visit with the coffee samples, including Shea-san.","Before I knew it, I was in a lush, highland-like area. The place I was standing on resembled a wooden terrace, but the rest was covered with grass like a meadow, with a pleasant breeze blowing, making it quite comfortable.","[My child! It's Mother!!!]","[Hello, Makina-san...... Even though you already have a body where you can act as yourself, I see our meetings in dreams continue as usual huh.]","[Well, it’s easier for me to control myself here...... I can impose various limits on myself, so it’s reassuring. Plus, here I can monopolize my beloved child!]","Since I had experienced this many times before, I quickly realized that I was in a kind of dream space created by Makina-san. In fact, I had become quite accustomed to it due to the frequency of these visits.","By the way, this space changes everytime———– sometimes it’s a rooftop, other times a riverside...... most probably depending on Makina-san’s whim. It’s like a little trip and quite enjoyable. The sensations of the wind and other elements are so real it doesn’t feel like a dream at all.","[......By the way, I was going to ask Makina-san about something. I found your name in the middle of the list of coffee lovers that Alice gave me. Do you like coffee?]","Yes, Makina-san's name was on the list I received from Alice, but I found it a bit surprising since I wouldn’t have guessed Makina-san was a coffee lover, so I decided to ask about it.","Thereupon, Makina-san, with a somewhat complicated expression on her face, crossed her arms.","[Hmmm...... How should I answer that...... It's a bit tricky.]","[Unn? What do you mean?]","[Well, errr...... I like café au lait and caramel lattes. So, in a broad sense, I suppose I could be considered a coffee lover but...... since I hardly ever drink regular coffee, I’m unsure if I should really say I’m a coffee lover.]","[Ah~~ I see, that certainly makes it tricky.]","Café au lait and caramel lattes are indeed coffee beverages. If you prefer these over tea, as Makina-san mentioned, you might be considered a coffee lover in a broad sense. But it’s a subtle distinction.","[Right? Well, if I had to say, I suppose I could be considered a coffee lover...... kinda? Here, caramel latte.]","[Ah, thank you.]","With a wry smile, Makina-san produced a caramel latte and handed it to me. It came in a cup that looked like it came from a major coffee chain, and taking a sip revealed a sweet flavor spreading in my mouth.","[In the first place, I mostly drank mineral water before becoming a God, and I haven’t had many different kinds of drinks.]","[It sounds like Makina-san had quite an extraordinary past. Wasn’t your food mostly canned goods and military rations?]","[Unn. Looking back now, I do feel my life back then was terrible, but at that time, I didn't think much of it since it was all I knew...... Ah, but if we're speaking of favorite beverages rather than tea or coffee, I might actually prefer cola.]","[Fumu, I guess it had to be because it pairs well with burgers?]","[Unn, burgers go best with cola! Not that I’m against kids who like eating them with orange juice or other drinks, but personally, I think its combination with cola is the best...... Speaking of which, my beloved child might not be familiar with this, but in burger shops in Australia......]","Watching Makina-san excitedly talk about hamburgers, I sipped the caramel latte with a wry smile. Makina-san truly is a bright and fun person when she’s not going off the rails...... No, seriously, if only she didn’t go off the rails......","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [But even if he says this and that, I feel like his affection for Makina has increased compared to before.]"]},{"number":1959,"title":"Chapter 1959: Neo Baby Castella Blend 11","paragraphs":["<Author's Notes>","Since I got home late due to overtime and had less time to write, today's chapter is short.","Now then, regarding the coffee samples, while it’s certain that I’ll give one to Shea-san...... I’m considering giving them to about three more people, assuming I don’t receive any additional samples from Kuro.","That said...... I won’t just follow Alice's list in order. There are some people on the list who I don’t think I should give a sample to.","For example, Zwei is one such person. Although her name is near the top of Alice’s list, suggesting she might like coffee a lot, it’s hard to say if she should receive a sample.","Zwei-san certainly does seem like she's a coffee lover———- she gives off a competent career woman vibe, and coffee seems to suit her. Well, her actual personality is kind and earnest...... but I still think her appearance makes her one of the top fits for coffee among my acquaintances.","That said, Zwei-san is part of Kuro’s family...... so Kuro is likely already aware of her coffee preference and would have given her a sample already.","Among the names on the list, Funf-san and Eva-san are also mentioned, but I assume they have received samples directly from Kuro as well. I think it’s best to exclude Kuro’s family from this distribution.","On the other hand, I want to actively offer samples to those who likely haven’t received any from Kuro. For example, I definitely plan to give a sample to Amel-san.","It seems fitting that Amel-san would like coffee...... I mean, what Amel-san cares more isn't about the coffee's taste, but how cool she'd look like drinking it. Heck, she might be one of those who dumps a lot of sugar in her coffee.","Well, since I also have plans to visit Amel-san’s house, it works out perfectly. So, Amel-san got a sure spot...... as for the other two......","Frea-san's name is also quite high on the list. I could certainly imagine her drinking coffee. As for the Seven Princesses, none of their names are on the list, so it seems like they prefer tea over coffee.","Among the Death King's subordinates, Rasal-san's name is on the list but quite far down, so she probably just slightly likes coffee. It seems Isis-san is not fond of coffee, and Rasal-san probably has more opportunities to drink tea often.","Names like Megiddo-san and Bacchus-san are also further down the list, with a note that says \"these guys prefer alcohol.\"...... Unn, well, I can certainly see that.","Several names from the Ten Demons are on the list, but they’re not very high. On the other hand, all the Four Great Demon Dragons except Grandiereus-san have their names on the list, and they’re all near the top.","......Hmm, it seems like it would be best to give the samples to Frea-san and have her share them with the other members of the Four Great Demon Dragons. Since Frea-san’s name is higher on the list than Eingana-san and Fafnir-san, she would be a better choice for this.","That makes two...... As for the last one...... Hmm...... Ah, this person seems good.","Having chosen three people to give the samples to after Shea-san from the list, I sent a hummingbird to check their schedules.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [......There's no one who seemed like it would develop into a sweet plot...... Good! Well, I'm curious about the last one though...... Who is it? It's probably not among his lovers...... Kuro produced that coffee, Shiro seems to prefer tea, Lilia and Sieg also drink tea, as is the case with Isis, Alice made that list, Vier prefers herb tea, Illness would probably be either tea or wine, while Anima...... I'm not sure, probably? I don't know anything about Fate, but I don't think she has any particular preferences when it comes to drinks......]"]},{"number":1960,"title":"Chapter 1960: Neo Baby Castella Blend 12","paragraphs":["Having checked Shea-san's schedule, I arrived at the Middle-level of the God Realm———- the area where High-ranking Gods reside. It's a location I surprisingly don't visit often.","Although it has served as the venue for the White God Festival, I usually go to the upper level or to the Sanctuary, so opportunities to visit the Middle-level are rare. The number of High-ranking Gods is small compared to the vastness of the Middle-level, allowing them to use the land quite luxuriously. It seems that the High-ranking Gods build their temples in places of their choice.","However, Shea-san is originally a direct subordinate of Fate-san, so, like other direct subordinates, she has the right to build temples or the like in the Upper level, but it seems she prefers to live in the Middle-level.","Since the teleportation location I registered here in the God Realm was on the Upper level, we’re meeting up there. When I arrived after teleporting, Shea-san was already there.","[Hello, Shea-san.]","[Hm? Ahh...... Welcome.]","Since the recent improvements in Fate-san's work situation, Shea-san has stopped clicking her tongue when meeting me, indicating an increase in favorability.","In fact, since Fate-san started working, Shea-san’s attitude towards me has noticeably softened, and I can feel the rise in her favorability. Looking at it the other way though, it seems she must have been quite troubled by Fate-san before then...... Previously, even though she understood I wasn't at fault, her frustration from her own difficulties was palpable......","[I've already informed you about it via hummingbird, but I've brought with me a sample from Kuro's company.]","[Sorry for the trouble, and thank you..... Well, standing around chatting is a bit much. Shall we move to my place?]","[Yes. Shea-san's house is in the Middle-level, right?]","[My temple is technically in the Upper level, but that's for work. My private space for relaxation is in the Middle-level. As a god, I don’t sleep and that's not a place for me to stay overnight, so I didn't use it much before...... Well, I didn't have the luxury to use it......]","Previously, because Fate-san was always slacking off, Shea-san was almost constantly overwhelmed with work. Moreover, after I appeared, Fate-san started escaping from the God Realm even more under the pretext of meeting me, so all the burden fell on Shea-san. It’s no wonder she wanted to complain to me when we first met.","[Thinking of it that way, that means you have quite a bit of leeway now, right?]","[Unn, well, just having God of Fate-sama working regularly makes a huge difference. In fact, recently I've had so much extra time that I've been setting up furniture and fiddling with the house's interior. Well, I truly owe it all to you...... I'm really grateful.]","[Rather, saying it like that makes me wonder how bad it was before...... w- well, I'm glad to hear that.]","She really must have had a hard time. Judging by how her attitude towards me has softened, it really feels like I can sense the extent of the hardships she endured before.","The place we arrived at by Shea-san's Teleportation Magic was a relatively small house. It was spacious enough for one person, but considering Shea-san's position, it seemed rather small...... Well, since she's got a separate temple for work, this might be sufficient for personal use.","[......I mean, the atmosphere here is different from other buildings in the God Realm. It's made of wood.]","In the God Realm, houses are typically made of stone or a material resembling white marble...... many of them matching the image one might have of a temple...... I mean, almost all buildings are like that.","On the other hand, Shea-san's house is wooden, and the interior has a cozy feel to it, a place that really felt like someone lived in, which might be quite rare in the God Realm.","No, well, speaking of the places the Gods lived in that I know of, I could only think of the Supreme Gods’ temples and Sanctuary......","[Well, I'm a bit of an oddball among the Gods. Nowadays, Gods have started visiting the Human and Demon Realms more often, so this might be the case at the moment..... but perhaps, as time goes by, there will be others who build houses like mine.]","[I see, the God Realm is undergoing changes as well......]","Shea-san’s expression as she spoke was somewhat pleased, and it seemed like she was happy to see the changes happening among the Gods.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [Her attitude towards Kaito has visibly softened, and you can sense her favorability increasing.]"]},{"number":1961,"title":"Chapter 1961: Neo Baby Castella Blend 13","paragraphs":["The inside of Shea-san’s house was stylishly arranged with a cohesive set of furniture, just as Shea-san had mentioned after recently buying new pieces.","It had an antique feel to it. Shea-san seemed to like that kind of design, and from the general atmosphere this place has, it kinda feels like a wizard’s home in the forest.","[You okay with coffee?]","[Ah, yes. Thank you.]","[As for accompaniment...... Kaito, are you bad with spicy stuff?]","[That's right. I'm really bad with them!]","[I see. In that case, I'll get something that's a bit too sweet......]","This is a crucial point. Although I’m not actually that bad with spicy foods, saying otherwise here could lead me to hell.","Shea-san loves spicy food almost as much as Megiddo-san does, and she once sent us candy with a level of spiciness that was like hell from the Hydra Kingdom. Moreover, for Shea-san, that snack wasn’t even considered extremely spicy.","For Shea-san, tasty spiciness is at a level where people might die. What she considers mildly spicy is already hellishly spicy to me, what she considers normal is extremely spicy, and what she considers sweet is just a bit spicy...... There’s a huge difference in our taste buds, so I need to make sure to emphasize that I’m not good with spicy foods.","By doing so, Shea-san will give me something she considers too sweet. For me, it would be a normal-tasting treat, so I can enjoy it safely.","[......It's something I received from others, but I got cookies here.]","After a while, Shea-san served cookies with the coffee. They were lightly sweet and quite delicious.","[They’re delicious, but I was a bit surprised that you have sweet cookies, Shea-san.]","[Ahh, I got those from the God of Fertility. It was a thank-you gift for helping out with work. I wasn’t sure what to do with them since I’m not good with sweet things, so it’s good to use them up now.]","[I see...... By the way, do you drink coffee often?]","[Yeah, I also drink alcohol, but I drink coffee more frequently. As I mentioned, I’m not good with sweet things, so I prefer beverages that don’t have a sweetness to them.]","So, does that mean she's generally drinking it black? In fact, it doesn't seem like she's gonna add sugar or milk to her coffee...... Arehh? But since there’s a jar of sugar cubes in front of me, does that mean she sometimes adds sugar...... or is it just prepared for guests?","[However, Underworld King really reaches out to a lot of industries huh. Even though she just publicized portable food and bath additives recently, she got another new product huh...... Well, she got a different company for each business though......]","[You know a lot about her businesses huh.]","[Well, I do shop in the Human Realm from time to time. They're called Instant Food, right? I bought and tried some of those portable foods from the Underworld King’s company, and it was quite well done...... The bath additives are interesting too, and they seem to have a lot of applications. I suppose that's to be expected from the top of multiple trading companies, I'm quite impressed.]","Come to think of it, when I met Shea-san back when that matter with Dr. Vier was happening, she mentioned being out to buy new snacks, so she might be quite sensitive to trends or the type who checks out new products.","At least for instant foods, they’re still popular and in short supply, so she must have bought them early on.","[Just as Shea-san said, it seems that Kuro has been releasing quite a few new products recently. They were selling magic tools like video and recording magic tools, and he mentioned expanding their business into the Human Realm.]","[Right now, the entire Human Realm is experiencing an economic boom, so she's probably making sure to catch that wave. Well, the cause of the boom is mostly you though......]","[Eh? Me?]","[To be precise, because you live in the Human Realm, the Six Kings, the Supreme Gods, and Shallow Vernal-sama have been visiting the Human Realm more frequently, which has significantly boosted the economy. Also, though this kinda feels somewhat deliberate, the frequent discovery of new technologies and new types of ingredients recently is a contributing factor.]","[Ahh, that’s probably because there was a change in the agreement between Shiro-san and Eden-san, so the restrictions on products from our world have been relaxed.]","[I see, that explains it......]","Recently discovered new technologies used to be restricted by Shiro-san and Eden-san’s contract, which meant that concepts for such technologies couldn’t be conceived in this world. The partial lifting of these restrictions likely led to a surge in new technologies.","As for the new types of ingredients, some might be prepared by Eden-san for those she calls her children, and there might also be items created by Shiro-san.","......Hmmm...... Areh? But if you think about it again...... Just as Shea-san said, could it really be mostly my fault? Well, I don’t think those were bad though......","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [I think most, maybe even 99% of the stuff happening around has something to do with Kaito.]","? ? ? : [Well, Eden-san’s efforts to listen to requests from the other otherworlders are fundamentally rooted in her liking for Kaito-san and settling in Trinia because of that. In that sense, I suppose most things had something to do with Kaito-san.]"]},{"number":1962,"title":"Chapter 1962: Intermission: Empty Illusion","paragraphs":["<Author's Notes>","I'm having a bit of a hard time with the next chapter, so here's an Extra Chapter to take a breather.","It was just one of the usual days. I was casually chatting with Kuro, who had come over to hang out, when Kuro suddenly seemed to remember something and called out to a different area.","[Right, Shalltear, you have a moment?]","[Yes, yes, what is it?]","[I have a few additions regarding the patents. Put this one up for free while having this one charged per use.]","[Alrighty.]","Kuro handed some documents to Alice, who appeared in response to Kuro's call. Come to think of it, I recall hearing that Alice manages Kuro’s patents.","In exchange, she receives a portion of the usage fees, which is likely an important source of income for her.","[.......Hahh, but really, having Kaito-kun around makes it so much easier to get in touch with Shalltear.]","[Unn? Was it hard to contact her before?]","[Unn...... Really hard! Shalltear doesn't have any specific base and vanishes quickly. The only guaranteed time I'd see her was at the Festival of Heroes, and if I need to contact her at any other time, I have to start by searching for her!]","It seems like Kuro had been troubled about this more than expected, as hearing my words, Kuro clenched her fists tightly while talking. It’s rare for Kuro to express her dissatisfaction so clearly, so it’s apparent that it was a real struggle.","[By the way, how did you contact Alice in those cases?]","[Through the Ten Demons children. They're the only ones with direct access to Shalltear, having magic tools that connect directly to her, so I visit them to get in touch with her. However, the Ten Demons children are scattered or in hiding, and they would sometimes be on missions, so finding them was also quite a hassle.]","[Ahh~~ I see......]","[And what's worse is that Shalltear obviously knows I'm looking for her and even knows what I'm looking her for, yet she wouldn't contact me until I reached out to her...... That's just mean!]","How should I say this....... Kuro seems to have accumulated more dissatisfaction than I expected. Alice also looks awkward...... or rather, she’s avoiding eye contact, perhaps to keep Kuro's frustration from turning toward her.","Well, the frustration was clearly directed at Alice from the start, but since I’m the one listening, Kuro is speaking to me.","[Moreover, when I don’t have anything specific to ask, Shalltear often drops by for a visit. But when I do have something to ask, she never shows up...... I mean, Shalltear... You're doing that on purpose, right? Not showing up when I’m searching for you was definitely intentional, right?]","[.......Nahhh, that's totally not the case. Alice-chan is simply very busy, and I also had some difficulty making contact during those times.]","[......Hmmm...... Hey, Kaito-kun, do you think it was intentional or not? Just go with your gut feeling.]","[Kuro-san, can you please not do that? Umm, deciding what is correct based on gut feeling and swinging the conversation that way......]","Just as the conversation was directed to Alice, Kuro suddenly asked my opinion on this matter. Hmm, my gut feeling huh......","[......Hmmm, I don't really have a real basis, but probably 50-50? There were times when she was really busy, but there were also times when she just didn't show up just to tease you or as a prank...... No, that really is just my hunch though......]","[Fumu, I see~~ So Shalltear...... was doing it on purpose half of the time?]","[Kuro-san, let’s think this through calmly. Kaito-san was just guessing, right? There’s no real basis for it, no evidence. Isn’t it a bit harsh to make judgments without evidence?]","[Evi dance?]","[Stop with the puns please, it just makes my head hurt...... It's \"evidence\", proof. I'm talking about supporting information.]","Well, I dunno if I should say it's to be expected or not, but the conversation between Kuro and Alice took on a somewhat comedic tone...... Alice was sweating nervously, trying to cover up her mistakes, while Kuro was watching her with a sharp gaze, clearly not missing any of it.","[H- Hmmm, well, it's true that there's no basis or evidence, so it might be a bit forceful to unilaterally assume that Shalltear had any ill intent......]","[That's right, that's right! It’s wrong to put a crack in the friendship between me and Kuro-san based on such flimsy reasons! Kaito-san is just speaking off the cuff based on intuition.]","[I see......]","[.....................]","[.....................]","[......But he got it right, didn't he?]","[......Well~~ I'm genuinely surprised he guessed it so accura——— Ouch!?]","It seems my offhand guess based on intuition was actually spot-on, as Kuro's knuckles struck down on Alice's head, who was making this incredibly annoying tehepero face.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [With Kaito around, she definitely had a close stationed at her miscellaneous goods store, and in the first place, she's always guarding Kaito, making it easy to find her, so I guess it's really made things easier for Kuro.]"]},{"number":1963,"title":"Chapter 1963: Neo Baby Castella Blend 14","paragraphs":["While chatting with Shea-san over coffee, our conversation gradually shifted to topics concerning the Gods.","[By the way, Kaito, you mentioned that you haven't been to the Middle Level much?]","[Yes, I usually go to the Upper Level or the Sanctuary. Last I'm here was back in the White God Festival.]","[Fumu, now that you mentioned it, despite being acquainted with the Supreme Gods and Shallow Vernal-sama, you have few acquaintances among the High-ranked Gods...... Were those in the party before the only ones you know?]","[Yes, among the High-ranked Gods I've met are you, Sky-san, Gaia-san, and Marine-san. Ah, those I invited are limited to those I've met and exchanged greetings with. I had seen some others but haven't really talked with.]","As Shea-san mentioned, I have few acquaintances among the High-ranked Gods...... Speaking of which, there's even fewer among the lower gods.","And considering that I am acquainted with the Supreme Gods, who are normally hard to meet, and the God of Creation, it does feel strange that I have so few connections with the High and Low-ranked Gods.","The same goes for my acquaintances among the nobility; I have few connections with Barons and Viscounts. It's understandable why Alice says my social connections are skewed.","[......What about the God of Flash or the God of Thoughts?]","[I've never talked to them directly. I've seen High-ranked Gods like that time you guys gathered in Lilia-san's garden, so I might recognize them if I saw them......]","[I see...... God of Life-sama's two assistants and one other direct subordinate, and among God of Fate-sama's direct subordinate, me...... For you to not be acquainted with any of God of Time and Space-sama's direct subordinates, that's quite skewed.]","[I've been wondering about this for a while, but how many direct subordinates like Shea-san do Supreme Gods have?]","When talking about the Supreme Gods' direct subordinates, it refers to the Gods who are allowed to live in the Upper Level. While I know they exist, I’m not sure how many there are.","Hearing my question, Shea-san lightly nodded and then explained.","[Basically, each Supreme God has five direct subordinates. That said, even though those fives are collectively called \"direct subordinates\", we have differing roles. First are the two \"Assistants\" to the Supreme God. They receive direct instructions from the Supreme God and assist them with various tasks, so they hold a lot of authority. For God of Life-sama, they're God of Sky and God of Earth, for God of Fate-sama, it's me and God of Fortune, and for God of Time and Space-sama, they're God of Flash and God of Thoughts. The remaining three direct subordinates are responsible for relaying messages between the Supreme Gods and the Low-ranked Gods or to the other High-ranked Gods...... They relay tasks assigned by the Supreme Gods to other Gods and compile reports to deliver back to the Supreme Gods.]","[Fumu fumu, so the assistants are technically in a higher position?]","[In name, they're technically next in line after the Supreme Gods, but in actuality, there's no significant difference in status or influence among the five direct subordinates. We are almost equal in standing.]","Come to think of it, I think I heard a bit before that generally speaking, High-ranked Gods and Low-ranked Gods are assigned to serve under one of the Supreme Gods.","If we apply this to a company setting, each Supreme God is like the head of a department———– perhaps a department manager or something similar. The assistants like Shea-san, Sky-san, and Gaia-san would be like section managers, and the remaining three direct subordinates might be akin to section heads or similar roles.","[So that means that including Shea-san, there are 15 High-ranked Gods living in the Upper Level. Then, I think there will be opportunities to eventually meet them.]","[......Well, if it's you, I wouldn't be surprised if you quickly said you've met all of them. If you're interested in meeting God of Fate-sama's direct subordinates, let me know and I can introduce you to them.]","[Thank you. I’ll definitely take you up on that when the time comes.]","Compared to the Demon Realm, I have fewer acquaintances in the God Realm, so meeting other High-ranked Gods as Shea-san mentioned seems like something I can look forward to.","Also, although she's not a High-ranked God, I'm curious about that God of Fertility-san, who seemed to be going through quite the hardships from the stuff I heard about her.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [Whoa there, I think I heard the rumbling of a Stomachache Warrior's stomach somewhere......]"]},{"number":1964,"title":"Chapter 1964: Neo Baby Castella Blend 15","paragraphs":["After chatting with Shea-san for a while and completing the purpose of this visit, I thought it was too early to head back immediately. So, I decided to take the opportunity to greet some acquaintances.","I plan to visit Chronois-san and Life-san, and then perhaps spend some time with Fate-san. Well, that's if everyone is at their temple......","[Ahhh, so that’s why you came by. How diligent of you. But well, you’ve come at a good time, I welcome your visit.]","[Thank you. I'm sorry for suddenly visiting even though you're working.]","When I first visited Chronois-san's temple, Chronois-san welcomed me warmly. This is just my impression, but I feel like Chronois-san was the busiest among the Supreme Gods, so I was worried that my sudden visit might be a bother, but it seemed Chronois-san understood my concern and she spoke with a smile.","[No, rather, I've recently had more free time. There's also the fact that the Festival of Heroes isn't held this year, but it's mostly because God of Fate has started to do their job somewhat regularly. Thanks to Miyama, I don’t have to go through the trouble of finding and capturing or scolding her for escaping. As for God of Life, she's originally someone who always completed her tasks within the deadline, it was just that you'd often be around while she was resting...... Well, thanks to that, there are no delays in work, and I have quite a bit of leeway. I could really feel how much effort God of Fate is putting in this time.]","[A- Ahaha...... Shea-san also mentioned something like that.]","The impact Fate-san has brought———- or rather, the impact Fate-san working seriously has brought———— well, putting aside seriousness at work or not, the impact it had was evident. Just by working once a month, Chronois-san and Shea-san, who had seemed so overwhelmed by work, are now quite relaxed. This shows how overwhelming it must have been before.","Well, from the moment I first met her, she had been escaping from her duties......","[That said, that doesn't mean I don't have any concerns anymore. Recently, Shallow Vernal-sama seemed to have been talking frequently with Otherworld Gods.]","[Eh? Is that so? Not just Eden-san?]","[Yeah, not Earth God. No, of course, I think Shallow Vernal-sama expanding her interactions with Creators of other worlds is wonderful, and if Shallow Vernal-sama approves of their presence, there's no issue but......]","That does seem a bit unusual. Of course, if Shiro-san mentally growing resulted with her increased interactions with Creators of other worlds, there shouldn't be a problem.","Makina-san also mentioned being acquainted with Gods from various worlds, so fellow World Creators probably have some interactions with each other.","[......I wonder why? Somehow, even though I have no concrete reason for it, I feel like I might be affected by that.]","[......Hold your resolve, Miyama. Also, if possible, if you could keep it from becoming too flashy...... That would really help.]","[I- I'll do my best.]","Yes, Chronois-san’s concern seems to be about what Shiro-san might gain from interacting with Otherworld Gods.","If the scope of her interactions suddenly expanded from just Makina-san to others, she must have some purpose behind it, and it seems quite likely——— no, very likely———- that it might involve me.","Even though I was feeling somewhat uneasy from that conversation I had with Chronois-san, I took a deep breath and visited Life-san's temple.","Just like Chronois-san, Life-san welcomed my visit, and we chatted a bit. The main topic was my desire to expand interactions with the Gods, similar to what I had discussed with Shea-san.","[......I see, expanding your interactions is truly wonderful, Miyama-san. For the Gods, being able to interact with Miyama-san, who had received Shallow Vernal-sama's blessing and is her lover, is indeed an honor.]","[That's kind of an exaggeration...... Well, I’m not thinking of anything specific. I’d just like to get to know more people if the opportunity arises. Like knowing people I've heard about, such as God of Fertility-san from Life-san's place, so if I get a chance, I'd like to meet her.]","[I see, she does have a relatively approachable personality, so that was indeed a good idea. Please wait a moment.]","[......Eh?]","After saying that, Life-san moved her hand in a circular motion in the air. The space in that part of the air began to distort, and the face of someone I feel like I’d seen before———- God of Fertility-san appeared.","\"Haehh? God of Life-sama? Is there something you need?\"","[Come to my temple immediately.]","\"......Eh? Right now? I- If you could give me a moment......\"","[I suppose so. You have your own matters at hand...... Well then, I'll give you \"30 seconds\".]","\"Hyiiih!? T- T- Thirty seconds!?\"","[......You still got 25 seconds.]","\"Abababa......\"","After the God of Fertility's face turned pale and the communication was cut off, she rushed into the temple with a desperate expression just 15 seconds later.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [Chronois and Kaito probably never imagined that Shiro wasn't the one who contacted them, but that they were the ones trying to make contact with Shiro regarding Nebula...... Also, this one newly appearing in the spotlight clearly looks like someone in a pitiful situation......]"]},{"number":1965,"title":"Chapter 1965: Neo Baby Castella Blend 16","paragraphs":["Fifteen seconds after the sudden call, seeing the flustered and pale-faced God of Fertility-san, Life-san nodded with satisfaction.","[Well done, God of Fertility. To arrive within the time I've specified, as expected of you.]","[......T- Thank you...... S- So, how may I be of service?]","[Miyama-san wishes to communicate with you. Briefly introduce yourself.]","[Haehh? Ahh, I see, so that's...... Understood.]","God of Fertility-san, momentarily puzzled by Life-san's words, quickly noticed my presence and nodded in understanding.","Shen then approached me, offering a gentle smile and a slight bow.","[This would be the first time we have spoken directly like this, haven't we? I'm the God of Fertility, Elune. I'm one of the Low-ranked Gods stationed in the Human Realm, mainly in charge of the Archlesia Empire.]","[Nice to meet you, I'm Miyama Kaito. I'm sorry that I had you called so abruptly this time.]","Elune-san was a woman with long brown hair that was softly and loosely styled, and her appearance and the atmosphere around her conveyed that she was a good-natured person. How should I say this...... You could say just by looking at her, you would really feel she's a very kind person.","She was about 150 cm tall, a little on the short side, but her breasts were large and their proportions were rather distinctive, making it hard not to look in that direction.","In any case, she gives the impression of a kind, gentle older sister with a fluffy atmosphere.","[Please don’t worry about it. I have always wanted to talk with Miyama-san, so I am pleased to have this opportunity.]","[God of Fertility is one of exceptional character and ability, and I myself rely on her greatly. She's the only one among the Low-ranked Gods permitted to freely enter my temple, which I believe speaks to her worth. I would have added her among my direct subordinates if she were not given such an important role overseeing Archlesia Empire by Shallow Vernal-sama.]","[Hnn...... That is quite the honor, but if you could be a bit more considerate with your summons...... N- No, I know that God of Life-sama doesn't ask me for anything beyond my capabilities but...... It feels like you always push me to the edge. If you could give me a little more leniency......]","[Unn? What is it?]","[I- I was saying nothing!]","The exchange made the difference in their power dynamics quite evident, but Life-san seemed to be highly praising Elune-san, practically showering her with compliments.","Also, this is just my guess from their exchange, but it seems that Life-san tends to be strict with those she evaluates, naturally becoming more demanding.","Just like the 30-second summons she made earlier, she probably set a time Elune-san could manage without any problem. However, when she demands something, she sets a standard that, while achievable with effort, ends up seeming strict in practice.","Elune-san herself seems to be aware of this, and while she's happy that Life-san appreciates her so highly, she also hopes for a bit more leniency given the difficulty of her demands.","[If Kaito-san has some time, why don't we sit down and chat a little? We've currently only done the self-introductions after all......]","[I'd appreciate that, and I'm fine with time too...... but would you be okay with it, Elune-san?]","[Eh? Me?]","[Yes, if it isn't convenient for you, you don't have to force...... Unn?]","I was about to say she doesn't have to force herself if it was inconvenient for Elune-san, but for some reason, Elune-san was looking at me blankly...... as if she didn't even understand why I was asking her that.","[......Umm, God of LIfe-sama? In this case, regarding what Miyama-san asks here, will my circumstances have any influence at all?]","[No, they will not. The only thing that should take over MIyama-sama, who has received the blessing of Shallow Vernal-sama, is a direct command from Shallow Vernal-sama. Any circumstances other than that can't be compared with it at all. However, since Miyama-sama is very kind-hearted, he must be being considerate to you.]","[I see...... No, given our position, Miyama-san is far above me, so I was a bit confused. Miyama-san, I’m very grateful for your thoughtfulness. There’s no issue with my circumstances. Ah, it's not because this was something Miyama-san desires, but I really don't really don't have any particular plans, so it would be as Miyama-san wishes......]","[If that's the case, since we're here, it would be great if we could have a little chat.]","As expected from Life-san's subordinate, Eluna-san’s way of thinking seems to be somewhat similar to Life-san’s. Although Life-san has a somewhat gentle demeanor, her loyalty to Shiro-san seems to be quite high among the Supreme Gods, so Elune-san's sense of value might be similar to hers.","Well, in any case, I was looking forward to chatting with her, so I’m grateful for this opportunity.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [I see, because she has high expectations that she's strict to her...... but her comments about her were full of praise, and even when she just arrived, she said \"as expected\" there, so it seems she really thinks highly of Elune.]"]},{"number":1966,"title":"Chapter 1966: Neo Baby Castella Blend 17","paragraphs":["And so, I ended up having a casual chat with Life-san and Elune-san over some tea. Prompted by Life-san, I took a seat, and Life-san then addressed Elune-san.","[God of Fertility, prepare the tea...... make sure it’s a cup worthy of Miyama-san.]","[Hyiihh, why do you add such a daunting remark at the end...... I- I'll do my best on that though......]","Life-san probably believed that Elune-san could make a tea that would satisfy me, but from Elune-san's perspective, it felt like an extremely high bar was set since I had received Shiro-san's blessing. Elune-san’s face clearly turned pale.","Even so, Elune-san, despite feeling the pressure, made the tea properly and placed it in front of me.","[Please, I hope it suits your taste......]","[Thank you.]","No, that's quite the resolute face she has there...... I feel a bit sorry for Elune-san, who looked like she was awaiting judgment, but I can't really discern the fine differences in tea flavors. I’ve started a tea brand and have had my fair share of tea, but I’m not able to detect subtle taste differences.","[......It’s delicious.]","[......Phew...... Thank goodness.]","When I told Elune-san that the tea she brewed was delicious, she let out a sigh of relief, then served some cookies to go with the tea and took a seat.","[Elune-san, while I do have Shiro’s blessing...... It's not like I myself am that great of a person, just someone ordinary, so you don’t need to be overly formal.]","[I see, an ordinary person...... ordinary...... What should I do...... This is different from the ordinary I know......]","[God of Fertility, Miyama-san prefers not to be treated with excessive formality. I believe he wants you to interact with her more casually.]","[I- I see, so that's how it is.]","[Yes, but of course, there are limits. While you are to interact with Miyama-san casually as he wishes, you must still maintain a sense of reverence. Of course, since it's you...... I trust you can handle this without any issues?]","[Hyiiih, I- I'll do my best......]","How should I say this...... There are a lot of points I'd like to throw my tsukkomis to...... but for now, it seems both parties haven’t fully accepted the idea of me being an ordinary person.","W- Well, I couldn't help but feel that there was a bit of pressure on Elune-san, but it was reassuring that Life-san seemed to pick up on my intentions and told Elune-san to relax a bit more.","[By the way, Elune-san, you have a temple in Archlesia Empire, right?]","[Yes, I do have a temple in the Capital. As for those who are responsible for Archlesia Empire, there's another one with me, God of Hunting, but her temple is in the second-largest trading city, not in the Capital.]","[I see. Speaking of which, in the Symphonia Kingdom, there's also God of Health who had her temple in the Capital, but there's also another God responsible there as well, right?]","[Yes, the ones responsible for Symphonia Kingdom are God of Health and God of Law. Incidentally, the ones responsible for Hydra Kingdom are God of Love and God of Freedom.]","[That said, the tag \"responsible\" there just means those who have their temples in that country. Low-ranked Gods sometimes participate in festivals in the Human Realm as guests, chosen from the subordinates of the Supreme Gods who manage each country. This is also the case with the High-ranked Gods who give their blessing to royalty during the New Year. In that sense, all of my subordinates could be considered responsible for Archlesia Empire.]","Come to think of it, when I first came to this world and went to receive a blessing, I recall hearing something about High-ranked Gods visiting the royal castle to bless the King.","[Well, nowadays, Gods visiting the Human Realm for reasons other than work has become more common. Since I originally have a temple in the Human Realm, I often get asked various questions by others.]","[Elune-san has this gentle-looking atmosphere around you, which might make it easier for people to consult with you. Well, it’s also likely it's simply because you're more familiar with the Human Realm.]","[Hahaha, I'm glad to hear that. If you ever find yourself nearby, Miyama-san, please feel free to drop by my temple. You’re always welcome.]","[Thank you, I’ll definitely visit if the opportunity arises.]","Elune-san’s gentle smile really conveys her warmth, and combined with her unassuming personality, she gives off a comforting, soothing vibe...... an image of someone that brings you relaxation.","Well, I actually haven’t visited many of the Gods' temples, but if I ever go to Archlesia Empire's Imperial Capital, it might be a good idea to stop by.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [Regarding this story, which has got nothing to do with the coffee in the title, I won't say anything more...... I won't say anything but...... he's going to Fate's place after this, right? ......You mind if I leave my seat for a bit?]"]},{"number":1967,"title":"Chapter 1967: Neo Baby Castella Blend 18","paragraphs":["<Author's Notes>","I got home late, so today's chapter is short.","After having a light chat with Life-san and Elune-san, I arrived at Fate-san's temple as initially planned. Since I don’t have any more plans for today, I think I can relax and take it easy.","However, I haven’t checked Fate-san's schedule, but she...... probably isn’t busy or anything...... right?","[Arehh? Kai-chan, what's up? You came to see me?]","When I arrived at the entrance of the temple, Fate-san, having sensed my presence, came out to greet me. She was still sitting on a cushion with her usual relaxed smile, but she seemed a bit excited, so it looked like she’s happy about my visit.","[Yes, I came to the God Realm for some errands, and since I was already here, I thought I’d stop by to greet Chronois-san, Life-san, and you. I’ve already visited Chronois-san and Life-san, and since I have no more plans for today, if it’s convenient for you, thinking it would be great if we could hang out together, I came to visit.]","[O- Ohh...... That sounds great! I very much welcome that! Now, now, come on in.]","[Well then, if you'll excuse me.]","Upon hearing my words, Fate-san's face lit up with a bright smile, and she happily invited me into the temple. As we moved inside the temple though, Fate-san suddenly stopped.","[Fate-san?]","[Ah~~ Sorry, Kai-chan, could you wait for just 1-2 minutes?]","[Eh? Yes, alright.]","After notifying me for a bit, Fate-san got off her floating cushion and went into a nearby room. The door wasn’t closed, so I could hear the conversation.","[......God of Fate-sama?]","[Pass me all the workload I have...... Unn...... There, done. Well then, have these delivered to God of Time and Space, and since I already did my work today, I'm spending time with Kai-chan now. I absolutely won’t accept any additional work or anything like that, and if anyone disturbs me, I’ll be really mad.]","[Y- Yes, understood. Please enjoy your time.]","[Unn, thanks~~]","Hearing this, Fate-san came out of the room, closed the door, relaxed the serious expression she had on her face, and then jumped on me.","[Kai-chaaaaan!]","[Whoa there......]","I hurriedly caught her, but since I hardly felt any weight, it seemed she was floating to make it easier for me to catch her.","Fate-san hugged me tightly, nuzzled her cheek against my chest, and spoke in a sweet, affectionate voice.","[I did my job properly~~ Praise me, praise me~~]","[Ahaha...... It really is amazing. You finished them in no time at all. Fate-san has always been incredible, but you did a great job handling everything there.]","[Ehehe~~]","For the time being, I patted Fate-san’s head while responding to her request for praise, and she smiled happily with a relaxed expression. She had a very cute, affectionate vibe, almost like a cat seeking attention.","Just like that, for a little while, I continued to gently hug her and pat her head until she seemed satisfied.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [......I see, so she finished her work because she didn't want to be disturbed while she's alone together with Kaito...... T- They're really going all out from the start huh......]"]},{"number":1968,"title":"Chapter 1968: Neo Baby Castella Blend 19","paragraphs":["Fate-san seemed to be satisfied after clinging to me for a while, as she created another floating cushion, sitting on it. For some reason, she also made the same cushion appear in front of me.","[Kai-chan, you ride that~~]","[Unn? Alright.]","There was no problem with just walking, but since I had no particular reason to refuse her suggestion, I decided to follow Fate-san’s words and get on the cushion in front of me.","The cushion itself was soft and comfortable to sit on, but even though I knew it was safe, riding on something floating in the air makes me a bit uneasy. Well, I doubt I would actually fall but......","[Alright then, let's go~~]","[......Ohh, this is a bit interesting, but why are we moving like this?]","With Fate-san’s shout, the cushion began to move, giving me the feeling of experiencing an amusement park ride. It was fun in its own way, but I was curious about why she chose this method of transportation.","[Ahh, you see, my room is filled with cushions so that I can lie down anywhere instantly...... Walking around itself isn't something I expected to do, so I set it up to be convenient for me in my usual state~~]","[Ahhh, I see......]","I remember when I first went to visit the God Realm, where I went to visit Fate-san's temple and I slightly saw her room...... which felt more like a large saloon, but that aside, it seemed like a sea of cushions.","At that time, she was hurriedly tidying up, but now she didn’t seem to be trying to impress anyone and appeared to be planning to show me the room filled with cushions.","Just like that, we moved around on our floating cushions, and as we passed through the door to Fate-san's room without actually opening it, we were greeted by an immense number of cushions...... so many that the floor was completely hidden.","[......Somehow, this is quite a spectacular sight, isn't it? Rather, why is your room like this?]","[It's so I can lie down anywhere, anytime.]","[I guess that does sound like Fate-san......]","[Besides, I can also do things like this too. Torya!]","With a casual shout, Fate-san dove from her floating cushion into the sea of cushions below. Ahh, that does look a bit fun. I can certainly see its appeal.","[You can dive into the cushions like this.]","[That certainly looks quite fun.]","[Right? Come on, Kai-chan, you jump too! Don’t worry, you won’t hit the floor.]","It kinda reminded me of that kids' playroom filled with balls, and after seeing Fate-san's dive, I also felt like diving into the sea of cushions myself, so Fate-san's suggestion is a welcome one.","Well, since the floating cushion was hovering at a reasonable height, I hesitated a bit, but decided to trust Fate-san’s words and dived.","[O- Okay then, here I go! Whoa!?]","When I dove into the sea of cushions, the cushions were more elastic than I had imagined. It wasn’t quite like a trampoline, but there was enough bounce to lift my body.","And somehow, I must have bounced awkwardly at an angle...... because I was now caught in Fate-san’s embrace.","[Ehehe, you're right on target, Kai-chan~~]","[I- I was surprised with the strange way my body bounced, but did Fate-san do something?]","[Something like adjusting the way something bounces is quite simple~~ I've adjusted it so that you bounce towards me. I caught you properly so you don't get hurt or anything, didn't I? Besides, with my boobs this big, I think leaping into them must have feel good~~]","[That is, well...... I won't deny it.]","Actually, having my head held in Fate-san's chest like this felt truly wonderful. No, Fate-san wasn’t wearing a bra or anything, so the softness of her breasts was conveyed directly.","With such a size, and without a bra, to have maintained such a firm shape without sagging———- it must be because she's a goddess...... No, wait, what am I thinking? I think I might be a bit rattled......","[Ohh, Kai-chan's embarrassed~~ Fufufu, I see Kai-chan also likes them~~ Here, here, come on, these breasts are Kai-chan's, you know~~]","[Wait, Fate-san, what strange thing are you doing......]","[Ehh~~ Even though it's true?]","Even though Fate-san, who said that with a mischievous smile, was really cute, how should I say this...... I couldn't help feeling conscious of the blush rising on my face.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [Hyuuu...... Y- Y- Y- You sure...... know a lot about what goes underneath huh, you playboy...... I- Isn't it about time we end that now? Let's get back to the coffee stuff, okay?]"]},{"number":1969,"title":"Chapter 1969: Neo Baby Castella Blend 20","paragraphs":["Lying in a sea of cushions feels oddly mysterious. It’s different from lying on a big cushion, and not quite like sleeping on a futon. I think the most fitting description———— would be more like being buried under a massive number of cushions.","Fate-san is in a very cheerful mood, embracing me to her, and at her request, I’ve placed an arm under her head, forming a sort of arm pillow.","She seems to be completely at ease and comfortably nestled against me, but for me, feeling her soft body and knowing she’s so defenseless makes this quite challenging.","No, if Fate-san had been intending to make that approach, then I wouldn't have minded responding...... but in reality, Fate-san is just acting normally.","[By the way, Kai-chan, why did you come to the God Realm today? Did you go to see Shallow Vernal-sama?]","[Ahh, no, I came to deliver a sample of new coffee from Kuro's company to Shea-san. Kuro asked me to promote it if I knew any coffee lovers......]","[Ahhh~~ I see, Kurorin is still up doing all sorts of stuff huh~~]","Yes, even in a situation where she's cuddling with me and we're intimately close, it doesn’t turn into a flirtatious conversation. Fate-san just starts a casual chat, demonstrating her usual self.","Actually, I confirmed it after we became a couple, but Fate-san is basically someone who loves physical affection. Now that I think about it, even before we became a couple, there were quite a few times when she would hug me, but since we became a couple, it feels like that has increased significantly.","When we're together, we're usually either cuddling up close like now, lying down with her head on my lap, or clinging to my back like I'm carrying her. It seems like she's the type who wants to be close to someone she likes.","It's very cute, but it can be quite overwhelming when she catches me off guard.","[By the way, Fate-san, do you prefer tea or coffee?]","[Hmmm, I don't really drink much of either. It's not that I dislike them but...... it's just, I drink whatever is provided to me, but making them for myself is troublesome.]","[That certainly sounds just like Fate-san.]","[But well, I have the Authority of Fate, so I think I'd be good at making it. No, not like I've actually made any though...... I mean, I did manage to make cookies well even though it was my first time. I can do it if I try...... I just don't.]","[It's quite something hearing you say that yourself...... but well, you being able to do it when you want is true.]","Indeed, just as Fate-san says, she can do basically anything when she tries, but she just doesn’t. This applies to her work as well———– she has the ability to finish all her tasks in just a few minutes but she usually doesn't bother doing them.","I think it would be enough if she just did her best for 1-2 minutes then be lazy for the rest of the day, but Fate-san, finding that extremely troublesome, doesn’t even try for that long. One would think escaping and being chased by Chronois-san would be more trouble, but she still doesn’t do it.","[Well~~ I might make some for Kai-chan someday~~ If I feel like it, that is.]","[I'm looking forward to it then. Whether the day will come or not is another story......]","[Mhmm~~ I think it would. Putting aside for others, if it's for Kai-chan, I put in quite an effort. Fuhehe, I guess I just want to do something for someone I like~~]","Yes, even for the extremely lazy Fate-san, there are two exceptions. One is when anything involves Shiro-san, the Absolute being for the Gods...... As she herself had said, as long as she can serve Shiro-san, she wouldn't care if she's not a Supreme God, so she acts seriously when it comes to anything related to her. Well, I suppose this one applies to all Gods, not just Fate-san......","The other exception is when anything involves me. The reason Fate-san does work regularly, something that has a significant impact on Chronois-san and Shea-san, is because she doesn't want Chronois-san to interrupt our alone time.","Also, she once made cookies for me, and though it was on a whim and only when she felt like it, she sometimes tried to do things voluntarily.","Her making an effort herself feels like her way of expressing affection, and it makes me really happy.","[Hey, hey, Kai-chan doesn't have any plans for the rest of the day, right?]","[Yes, that's right.]","[Then we can relax together as much as we want~~ You can even stay the night if you want.]","[That sounds good. This is also nice...... just unwinding and doing nothing.]","[Right~~ Lazing around is the best, isn't it~~ Ah, that's right...... Kai-chan, Kai-chan.]","[Yes?]","[Chuuu......]","[Eh!? Wait, Fate-san, what are you doing all of a sudden!?]","[Well, I just felt like kissing you!]","Fate-san suddenly leaned in, pressed her lips against mine, and then smiled with a relaxed expression, as if she had done something completely normal.","She's really quite capricious, and sometimes her impulsive actions surprise me...... but still, I feel that spending time with Fate-san is a lot of fun.","<Afterword>","Doctor M : [......Errr, what?]","Serious-senpai : [Say it’ll take me about 3 chapters to recover! Please!!!]","Doctor M : [It seems that Serious-senpai has too much sugar and needs about 3 chapters to recover...... If that’s the case, it can’t be helped. To help you recover quickly, I’ll tell you all about my beloved child for 3 chapters straight......]","Serious-senpai : [I'm better now! I'm healed already, so no need for that treatment!!!]","Doctor M : [Eh? Ah, is that so? Well, if you’re better, then no treatment needed. But regardless of the treatment, let me tell you all about my beloved child......]","Serious-senpai : [......Eh? Wait......]"]},{"number":1970,"title":"Chapter 1970: Neo Baby Castella Blend 21","paragraphs":["<Author's Notes>","I've been a bit busy and haven't had time to write so today's chapter is a short one.","I finished handing over the samples to Shea-san, so next, I planned to visit the others———- Amel-san and Frea-san, so I was thinking of starting with Amel-san.","When we were at the Founding Festival at Archlesia Empire together, I had promised her I would visit her house, so this time, I decided to focus on that and while I'm at it, deliver the sample to her.","And so, I sent Amel-san a message via hummingbird asking, \"I’m thinking of visiting your home. Is there a convenient day for you?\"","The reply came back immediately. It was incredibly fast.","\"I've indeed heard my sworn friend's plea! The doors of my home are always open before the bond of our friendship! If you wish, I will become a shooting star soaring through the sky to guide you to the promised land! The choice of the shining moment lies with my sworn friend. Feel free to write it down and send it back like a bird of gospel.\"","Amel-san’s overflowing enthusiasm was clear from her hummingbird message. If I were to translate it into regular words......","\"I understand my sworn friend's request. I’m always happy to have you visit my home. Since the village of the Wingeds is far from the Capital, if you wish, I can come pick you up. Just let me know the date and time that works for you through hummingbird.\"","It seems like Amel-san is leaving the scheduling to me. When I checked if tomorrow would be okay, I got another immediate response via hummingbird. It looks like there won’t be any problems, so I decided to visit Amel-san’s house tomorrow.","The next day, after a night had passed, I headed off to the village of the Wingeds...... isn't something I did. Although I had seen it from the sky once before, I hadn't actually descended to the village or registered the location with my Teleportation Magic Tool, so I would need Amel-san to come and pick me up.","However, since meeting at my house could lead to the possibility of Amel-san zooming over from Archlesia to Symphonia like she did before, I decided to arrange our meeting place in Archlesia Empire's Capital.","[My sworn friend! Today is a wonderful day! Even the clear blue sky seems to be blessing us!]","[Hello, Amel-san. Sorry for suddenly bringing today's matter yesterday.]","[No! If it's my sworn friend, you're always welcome. It's been my dream to invite friends to my ho...... Hrnn! Time is but a trivial matter compared to our bond. As I’ve written in the whispering birds, the door to my home is always open to my sworn friend.]","Amel-san seemed incredibly happy, and I really felt like I could see a little puppy wagging its tail energetically behind her.","[Well then, let’s get going, my sworn friend!]","[Ah, yes. By the way, what will our mode of transportation be......?]","[Come on, let's soar together as shooting stars!]","[Ahh, so it's really gonna be that huh......]","I had suspected as much. It probably wouldn't be Teleportation Magic...... and sure enough, Amel-san quickly moved behind me and firmly held me...... lifting me up and spreading her wings.","Although it would take less time than when we were from Symphonia, traveling like this makes our bodies quite glued to each other, making my heart beat so fast that I can't compose myself...... Ahh, right, I should put on the glasses I got from Shiro-san so I can see the scenery properly along the way.","<Afterword>","? ? ? : [I arrive to cut out what happens around Makina \"after she lets Serious-senpai hear about her story\". it doesn't really affect the afterword.]","Serious-senpai : [Can't you even attempt to save me instead!? ......I took major damage from all the sweetness and was mentally attacked after that...... Kuh, so this is the trial that assaults the embodiment of seriousness......]","? ? ? : [Isn't this unrelated to that embodiment of seriousness?]"]},{"number":1971,"title":"Chapter 1971: Neo Baby Castella Blend 22","paragraphs":["The settlement where the Wingeds live...... It's a bit too large to be called a village, so it might be better to describe it as a town or a small city.","When I saw it from the skies before, the place was like a gathering of houses that were somewhat scattered from a high altitude, but the shapes of the houses were quite unique. They were like a bunch of lollipops stuck into the ground, with their living areas positioned quite high, supported by a single pillar.","My first thought upon seeing them was that they're poorly balanced, and I’d expect them to break if an earthquake hit, but they probably manage with magic. Moreover, I noticed there are no ladders or stairs to reach those living areas. Since the Wingeds can fly, it's not a problem for them...... but the design really doesn't feel like they consider visitors from other races.","[How should I say this...... It has quite a unique atmosphere, isn’t it? It did seem like an aerial city when I saw it before......]","[Indeed, the place might seem unusual to other races. However, there always exists a reason for things. Us Wingeds were essentially a sky-dwelling species, so our homes are designed to be suitable for us to land in, while also avoiding obstacles when taking off.]","[Ahh, I see, so the high placement of the living areas prevents obstacles from getting in the way when flying off.]","Indeed, now that she mentioned it, there are no buildings taller than those lollipop-like houses, and the houses are spaced out enough to avoid any obstructions when flying off.","[Also, the Wingeds were simply quite a reclusive species. The others don't even consider the thought of inviting people of other species. Personally, I think the barrier between species should eventually be broken down, but we just don't have enough time. To change everyone's deeply ingrained way of thinking, a long time is necessary.]","Speaking of which, I remember being told that there were various procedures for inviting other species, and it wasn't something that could be done immediately. From what I've heard from various people, the Wingeds are extremely reclusive people.","It seems like Amel-san is more inclined towards interacting with other races. In fact, Amel-san participated in the afterparty of the Harmonic Symphony and seemed to be quite active in seeking interaction with other races. W- Well, let's just put aside her somewhat chuuni-ish phrasing hindering smooth communication......","[By the way, where's Amel-san's house?","[As the Chief of the Wingeds, I live in the place closest to the Heavens. In other words, it's over there. Let's head there right away.]","Amel-san, being the Chief of the Wingeds, lives in the place closest to the Heavens...... In other words, she resides in the highest place within the mountains the Wingeds reside...... Well, to put it simply, her house is at the top of the mountain.","The place looks...... normal. It's a bit larger than the other Winged houses, but otherwise, it looks ordinary...... I thought it would have a more chuuni-esque design, but that doesn't seem to be the case.","She might also be the type that focuses more on interior design.","[Now, come in, my sworn friend! I welcome you to my Chaos Realm!\"","[Thank you for having me...... Ohhh.......]","When I went inside, it wasn't all black as I expected, but rather had a cool vibe. The furniture is somewhat dark in color, but there’s a wooden counter, making it feels a bit like a stylish bar.","[It has a stylish and cool atmosphere. The furniture has a consistent theme, and that counter is really cool.]","[Really!? Thank goodness! I'm happy my sworn friend likes it! You know, I recently made that counter seat. When I visited my sworn friend's house before and saw the bar inside, I thought it was really cool, so I created a similar atmosphere here. You can enjoy a drink while looking at the scenery there! Also, I made two seats for when my sworn friend visits, so we can later———— Hrnn!? L- Let's discuss our covenant later.]","When I praised the interior, Amel-san’s face visibly lit up with joy as she excitedly explained everything. Reverting to her natural self and flusteredly correcting herself, her face blushing red, was also typical of Amel-san.","[That sounds like fun. By the way, I was actually here to give you something...... a sample of coffee, and I thought you might like it.]","[Isn't this the Jet-Black Drip? If it's a sample, does that mean it will be released to the public eventually?]","[Yes, it will be sold in Kuro's...... the Underworld King's trading company. I heard Amel-san likes coffee, so I thought this would be a good time to visit you.]","[I see, I do enjoy drinking the Jet-Black Drip. Clad in darkness as I am, I may have felt quite drawn to such beverage...... though I can't drink it without sugar......]","Despite adding the last part in a somewhat quiet voice, Amel-san remained in high spirits throughout. It was clear that she was genuinely happy that I had come to visit, which made me feel quite pleased as well.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [I see, so this is the Jet-Black Pomeranian......]"]},{"number":1972,"title":"Chapter 1972: Neo Baby Castella Blend 23","paragraphs":["When I handed Amel-san the coffee sample set, Amel-san looked at it with interest before nodding slightly.","\"Thank you for your thoughtfulness. Since you went through the trouble of getting this, I'll go ahead and brew this Jet-Black Drip right away. This hard shell shall be crushed and bring about a blessing of rain to the black desert.\"","Since the sample was in bean form rather than powder due to its preservation period, I had brought a coffee grinder just in case, but it seemed Amel-san also had her own coffee grinder.","The coffee grinder Amel-san pulled out looked significantly larger than the ones Ozma-san and Alice used.","[Oh, that's quite a large coffee grinder. Does Amel-san have some particular preferences as well?]","[......Eh? Ah, no...... This is a magic tool that, once you set the filter and put in water and beans, does everything automatically......]","[I see...... That's quite convenient.]","I see, it's not just a coffee grinder but a coffee maker with a built-in grinder. She just put in the coffee beans and water, set the filter in the designated spot, and then the magic tool does the rest automatically.","[......So something like this exists huh. No, I personally don't have the dedication to coffee where I'd adjust the grind myself, so something like this seems more convenient.]","[I agree with you to that, my sworn friend. While I do prefer drinking the Jet-Black Drip, I don't necessarily have extensive knowledge about it. I enjoy it because of the taste...... and it makes me look cool...... so I do habitually drink it, but while I can detect considerable differences, my palate isn't sensitive enough to notice subtle differences.]","Honestly, I can totally relate to Amel-san’s perspective; I'm the same way. I enjoy coffee and have my preferences, but I’m not so fuzzy about it that I'd grind beans to the perfect level just to make the best cup.","I can tell how coffee is different to some extent. The coffee Alice brews was incredibly delicious, and drinking it makes me feel a bit moved. But if asked whether I can discern very slight differences in each grind, I’d have to say I honestly can’t.","And so, if I were to make coffee for myself, I'd prefer using a coffee maker. In fact, seeing Amel-san's coffee maker, I even thought about getting one for myself.","[I guess I'll bring out some snacks to accompany the tea then. What would you like, Amel-san?]","[That's a tough question. If we're going with the staple, cookies would be the choice, but since the Jet-Black Drip is a bitter drink...... pairing it with something that has a contrasting radiance might be fitting.]","[Indeed, sweet things would pair well with it...... How about chocolates?]","[That would indeed be excellent. Chocolates, while they hold darkness within them, have characteristics opposite to the Jet-Black Drip...... It should harmonize well.]","Pairing the bitter coffee with sweet snacks is a classic combination, and since Amel-san agreed, I took out some chocolate from my magic box.","Incidentally, these chocolates were those that were made by Nebula and are not the kind meant to pair with tea sold by Nifty; it’s chocolate made separately as an ordinary snack.","Soon, the coffee was ready, so we sat at the counter seats as Amel-san requested. Amel-san looked happy and seemed pleased that the counter seats were being put to good use.","[We can't exactly make a toast with the Jet-Black Drip, but I'm already happy sitting here like this with my sworn friend. Now then, let's try this new possibility...... Ah, if you'd also like sugar cubes and creamers on your coffee, feel free to use them, my sworn friend.]","[Ah, yes. Thank you.]","While I was thinking of having my first sip of coffee black to start with, Amel-san took three sugar cubes from the jar and stirred them into her coffee.","......She sure added quite a lot. I think adding three sugar cubes would likely make it quite sweet...... but Amel-san seemed satisfied after taking a sip, so she probably drinks it with that much sugar regularly.","Amel-san then reached for the chocolate I prepared, took a bite, and her eyes lit up.","[Delish!? Wow, this is the sweetest and most delicious chocolate I've ever had! As expected, my sworn friend really knows about all the tasty stuff———— Hrnn!? Erhem. My sworn friend's keen eye for finding valuable things always amazes me.]","[Thank you. Those chocolates are......]","Just like that, I spent some time enjoying casual conversation with the consistently happy Amel-san while sipping our coffee.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [In fact, it seems like most people have a preference for coffee at that level. Of course, there are those who are seriously dedicated to authentic coffee on the same level as those sold in cafés but...... Well, if you can enjoy it as a hobby, then it might be worth going all out and thoroughly pursuing it.]"]},{"number":1973,"title":"Chapter 1973: Neo Baby Castella Blend 24","paragraphs":["In front of Amel-san's house, there's a large window that allows us to see the village of the Wingeds. Since Amel-san's house is situated at the highest point in the village, we can get a panoramic view of the entire area.","[Somehow, this is different from what I imagined. There are more things here than I expected. There are quite a few shops within the village too.]","[I get how you feel, my sworn friend. It's true that the Wingeds is a closed-off species and is often seen as living contrary to the progress of civilization. However, being closed-off doesn't mean we exclude everything around us. We integrate useful technologies like magic tools into our lives. While most Wingeds generally lead lives that are self-contained within the village, some engage in trade and procure goods from outside.]","I see. So, while they’re not eager to interact with other races, they do occasionally acquire things from outside when necessary...... Come to think of it, even though their attendance in Archlesia Empire's Founding Festival is more of a formality, they do set up small stalls every year selling accessories. It seems that, just like how Lilia-san does things, they also engage in transactions that require connections.","[Well, the Wingeds' village is located on a high mountain, so we need to source some ingredients like seawater fish from outside. Personally, I think they should engage more with the outside world but...... dealing with the weight of centuries can be troublesome. Time can become a chain that binds thoughts. Breaking that chain requires time......]","[It’s tough to suddenly tell people who haven’t interacted much with other species for years to start doing so more. As you said, taking your time might be the best approach.]","[Yeah, but by actively engaging with the outside world, I believe the Wingeds' awareness would gradually change. Though transformation takes time, there are signs of progress.]","[Indeed, Amel-san active involvement with outsiders could likely increase the others' interest in external interactions. To think of such a thing and implement these changes, as expected of the Wingeds' Chief.]","[Ehehe, you think so? Hearing my sworn friend praise me makes me hap——— Hrnn!? My gratitude for the compliment.]","Amel-san seems to be genuinely working hard to change the Wingeds' way of life. Her participation in events like the Harmonic Symphony's afterparty is probably part of her effort to gradually shift the tribe's awareness by showing herself as an active leader interacting with other races.","[Do other species rarely visit the Wingeds' village?]","[I wouldn't say no one visits, as there are some exceptions. First, there are those who visit through the legal process. This requires approval from several high-ranking members within the village, and the application process is extensive. Even if you apply, it’s not guaranteed to be accepted, so it’s quite a hassle.]","[Speaking of which, you mentioned that the procedures to allow me into the village were complicated last time I visited.]","[Yeah, but as my sworn friend has the Blessing of the God of Creation, you're an exception. In your case, it's just like another exception, my sworn friend is more like the one being invited by the Wingeds. This exception applies mainly to Gods. The Wingeds are extremely religious, especially in their worship of the Great Natural Elements like the sky, earth and sea...... and the origin of all those things, God of Life-sama. For important ceremonies, we sometimes invite Gods, and in those cases, none of those legal procedures is needed.]","I've heard that the Wingeds are highly religious, so I understand them inviting Gods. I’m curious about who actually comes———— perhaps someone like Elune-san?","[I see...... By the way, who usually comes? Is it the Low-Rank Gods stationed in Archlesia Empire?]","[Sometimes Gods with temples in Archlesia Empire, like God of Fertility, will attend, but generally, it's one of the Gods serving God of Life-sama. It's usually decided by the divine beings themselves, our side doesn't designate anyone from our side...... Ahh, but God of Ocean Marine-sama graciously participates in the ceremonies quite frequently.]","[Marine-san? ......Ahh, one more question: How do the Wingeds view Eingana-san?]","[The Sea Dragon seated in the Great Oceans? Isn't she an Executive of the Earth-Shaking Dragon King...... Is there anything else about her in particular?]","......I see, so that's why Marine-san participates so frequently in the ceremonies. It seems that the Wingeds don't regard Eingana-san as the God of Sea unlike the other Humans and clearly worship the God of Ocean Marine-san as the God of Sea.","For Marine-san, who is quite concerned about people's recognition of her, it’s likely that she favors this tribe that clearly sees her as superior to Eingana-san in matters related to the sea.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [Ahh~~ I see, that makes a lot of sense.]","? ? ? : [The Wingeds praise Marine-san as the God of Sea and worship her sincerely, so Marine-san is happy to be treated with such affection and unless she has other plans scheduled, she attends the winged tribe's ceremonies as much as possible.]"]},{"number":1974,"title":"Chapter 1974: Neo Baby Castella Blend 25","paragraphs":["After having coffee at Amel-san's house, I was told that, since I was here, she would show me around the Wingeds' village. I had only seen the place from the air before, so I was a bit interested.","[But my sworn friend, I hope you don’t take this the wrong way, but the majority of the Wingeds see you as an exalted being who received the Blessing of the God of Creation Shallow Vernal-sama, and might treat you as if you were the Gods' Divine Messenger. My sworn friend might not feel pleasant under such attention, but please understand that they held no ill intent.]","[Yes, it's alright. Thank you for worrying about me.]","[Unn...... Oh, but since you're with me, I don't think they'll approach you just because they see you as an exalted being.]","Well, to be honest, I'm already somewhat used to being treated like that from how people treated me in Rigforesia, so it's fine, but Amel-san seems quite concerned about me.","Since Amel-san is the only Special Individual Winged and one of the few with the strength on the level of a Peerage Holder in the Human Realm, she might be feeling concerned about the various gazes around.","In fact, she seemed very excited that I came to visit and mentioned how this was like the first time she's invited a friend to her home, so it seems she had been treated specially in a different sense than persecution.","[I'm not too bothered about it, so don't worry. Rather than that, I'm looking forward to walking around with you, Amel-san.]","[Ah, unn! I also have many places I want to show my swo——— Hrnn!? As expected of my sworn friend, always calm and composed...... Well then, let's depart at once!]","Feeling as if I'm seeing the phantom of a puppy wagging its tail behind her, with a face full of joy, Amel-san moved behind me. The Wingeds' village has no bridges or suitable infrastructure for walking, so it's necessary for one to fly. Since I can’t fly, Amel-san would carry me.","Amel-san happily lifted me and flew up, explaining as we descended at a gentle speed.","[Right in front of us now is a district with various shops. Here in the Wingeds' village, this district is basically the only one with stores. In the first place, there's little interaction with the outside, so the number of stores is small. However, the brilliance sought by those who reside here is adequately present.]","[It might be few considering the size of the village, but it's easy to understand that if you want to shop, you come here huh...... Those are...... Ohh, they even sell fish here.]","[Many Wingeds like fish. However, the Wingeds can have a rather unbalanced diet, as many of us could tend to be extreme with our likes and dislikes. Well, it's just \"many\", as there are some like me who don't have many dislikes...... Oh, but I don't like bitter stuff very mu...... Hrnn!?]","They have a racial trait of having strong likes and dislikes? Moreover, rather than them having specific likes and dislikes, each individual has their own preferences, and those preferences can be quite extreme.","That might be a rather interesting aspect of their ecology. I don’t know if it's due to a heightened sense of taste or a tendency towards picky eating, well, so let's just recognize it as things being that way.","[Do you also do your shopping around here, Amel-san?]","[No, I generally don’t shop in the village. There’s a reason for that: among the Wingeds, the Chief's authority is very strong. Even if I don’t desire it, many believe that the Chief, as someone of higher rank, should be treated with reverence. Therefore, I wasn't able to purchase things over there, as many of them would prefer to offer their products as gifts rather than engage in monetary transactions...... As brilliant a leader as I may be, I have no intention of being a tyrant. I understand that their actions come from pure respect and not malice, but it still casts a shadow on the brilliance I feel in my heart......]","I see, Amel-san, being the Chief of the Wingeds, holds a very strong authority. It seems that many people consider it unthinkable to accept money from her, preferring to offer the goods to her instead.","Even though Amel-san understands that this is out of pure respect, she feels uncomfortable and thus prefers to shop elsewhere.","In reality, with Amel-san’s flying speed, traveling to a nearby town would be instantaneous, so it likely isn’t much of a hassle.","[How should I say this...... It seems that the Wingeds have a lot of peculiar ways of thinking.]","[Fufu, you could say they're quite set in their way. Well, we do have many good points as well...... Ah, my sworn friend! There are many shops around here that sell sundries and small articles.]","[Small articles? Like the accessories sold by the Wingeds?]","[No, people who come here to shop are mostly part of the tribe. Those accessories are sold to other species, so you won't find them in the village shops. Items recognized as \"Wingeds' Specialties\" are sold at the few places we have contact with outside.]","[I see.]","Now that she mentioned it, that certainly makes sense. According to Lilia-san, getting the Wingeds' specialties requires connections, but if you look at it the other way, if you have those connections, you can purchase those. Since Amel-san mentioned sending someone to negotiate with Lilia-san, it seems there are people handling transactions with outsiders.","However, considering the unique things around, from the shapes of the houses to their culture, exploring the Wingeds' village like this feels quite refreshing and enjoyable......","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [As expected of the man who is acquainted with almost all of the world's Top Authorities and known as \"The Hero of the Elves\" and \"World's Singularity\"...... Just from the look on his face, you could tell he's no ordinary guy. In fact, he doesn't seem to care at all about being considered divine.]"]},{"number":1975,"title":"Chapter 1975: Neo Baby Castella Blend 26","paragraphs":["In the shopping district of the Wingeds...... The shops have their usual unique designs, and while we breeze through them in the air, the place felt different from the typical shopping street in my mind. Anyhow, for the time being, as we browsed through a variety of shops, my gaze turned towards a sundries store.","[......That's a rather unusual brush. However, since they're selling quite a few of those, it must be a popular item, right?]","What caught my eye was a certain brush. The brush itself was wide and had soft bristles, but what was distinctive was the handle, which was adjustable and could be lengthened significantly. It also had several bendable sections...... It seemed like a brush intended for reaching places that are hard for one's hands to reach.","I wasn't particularly concerned about it, just curious that a brush like that also exists...... but there were an unusually large number of them being sold. Is a specialized brush like that really in high demand?","[Ahh, I understand my sworn friend's curiosity. To answer that question, those are brushes for our wings.]","[A- Ahh, I see! That's why they're designed that way...... It can also reach places like the base of the wings on your backs.]","With Amel-san's brief explanation, I understood. The unique angle of the brush was designed to clean the base of the wings, much like using a back scratcher...... So they're something specially made for the Wingeds.","[For the Wingeds, the beauty of our wings is important, and everyone makes sure to take care of them. There’s even a belief that if your wings are dirty, your heart is dirty too. But ironically, wings tend to collect the impurities of the world. Therefore, it’s necessary to periodically clean them.]","[Fumu fumu, I see. By the way, since these items are displayed together with those brushes, are those large plastic-like items for wings too?]","It makes sense that the Wingeds value the beauty of their wings. Since they move while flying, dust and other particles can easily stick to feathers. So, wing brushes are essential and in high demand.","With that in mind, I considered that the seemingly unrelated items in that sundries store might all be related to wings...... so I asked Amel-san for clarification.","[Yeah, that's something we put over our wings when bathing. When our wings get wet, it feels like having a heavy weight on our backs, which many Wingeds dislike. During bathing, we avoid getting our wings wet and use special brushes dampened with a small amount of water for cleaning feathers.]","[Indeed, with the Wingeds' wings being quite large, they would become heavy if they absorbed water. Moreover, they would likely take a long time to dry.]","[Those who can use magic simply wash their wings and dry them with magic. That's what I do for my wings...... But sadly, the vast doors of magic's depths aren't open to everyone. Only the chosen ones can handle their wings this way.]","There are just so many people around me that can use it so I sometimes almost forget, but in the Human Realm, not many people can use magic­———- only around 20% or so. If the Wingeds follows this ratio, 8 out of 10 people wouldn’t be able to use magic, so there is indeed a demand for such products.","[Now that you mentioned it, Amel-san's wings do have a fascinating shine to it.]","[Ehehe, you think so...... Being praised like that makes me embarrassed. But since I'm also a Winged, I take care of my wings meticulously. Their color and luster are something I'm quite proud of. My wings are black, so having any sort of dirt on them is quite conspicuous, and I’m quite careful about this. My sworn friend to be able to tell that makes me so happ——— Hrrn!? E- Erhem...... Well, anyhow, that's how it is.]","Perhaps, for the Wingeds, receiving compliments about their wings is quite a cherished gesture. Even Amel-san seemed genuinely pleased, speaking in her natural tone......","However, what I said wasn't just flattery———- Amel-san's wings are truly beautiful. Looking at the other Wingeds, most have wings in white, gray or light brown, so Amel-san's black wings really stand out.","Black wings were apparently the sign they're a Special Individual, and since Amel-san seems to be the only one with such a characteristic among the Wingeds, her black wings symbolize her uniqueness. It seems she takes great care in maintaining them.","In fact, I personally also pay a lot of attention to the shine of Bell and Lynn's fur, and since I often use a soft brush to clean Lynn's feathers, I understand the effort involved in grooming one's wings. To achieve the level of care Amel-san has for her wings would require meticulous attention, and I think she did a splendid job at that.","Well, putting that aside...... Brushes for wings huh...... There might be some here that could be useful for brushing Lynn, and perhaps for Bell as well, so for the time being, I'll make sure to check out all the brush-related items around.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [He's as doting of a parent as usual.]","? ? ? : [Kaito-san has always been really particular when he's brushing Bell and Lynn after all.]"]},{"number":1976,"title":"Chapter 1976: Neo Baby Castella Blend 27","paragraphs":["I enjoyed shopping with Amel-san, visiting several stores and purchasing items like brushes. Initially, I was told they couldn't receive payment because I was the one blessed by Shiro-san...... but Amel-san cleverly persuaded them by arguing with \"Since my sworn friend, the one blessed by Shallow Vernal-sama, wished to pay for it, insisting on giving it away for free would be more disrespectful.\" As a result, I was able to shop normally.","[Well, this method only works because my sworn friend is blessed by the God of Creation. It's a widely held belief among the Wingeds that going against the will of the Gods is disrespectful. No, well, if it weren't my sworn friend, much less offering those goods to you without compensation, they wouldn't have even sold their wares to you......]","[Anyhow, I'm relieved I could shop normally. Thanks to you, Amel-san.]","[Ehehe.]","Hearing my words, Amel-san displayed a truly happy smile. How should I say this...... Despite actually being much older than me, she has this cuteness you could feel from a young girl.","Well, given her appearance and personality, it’s not surprising that she seems younger.","[My sworn friend! Is there anything else you'd like? If you desire, like the stars illuminating the night, I can guide you to any place you wish.]","[Thank you, but I've already shopped enough...... Hmm. I might like to visit a place with beautiful scenery next. You know, the Wingeds' village is in the high mountains, so there should be many scenic spots.]","[Leave it to me! I'll take you to a place with stunning views!]","It would have been alright to end the tour around the village here and return to Amel-san’s house, but seeing the eagerness in her eyes, I felt she still wanted to show me more, so I requested a place with beautiful scenery.","Amel-san’s expression brightened again as she quickly moved behind me, securely holding me, and flew up into the sky.","Since there are no bridges in the Wingeds' village, we had to move this way...... that's something I should know about, but being like this, her hugging me from behind, gets my heart racing.","[Incidentally, where are we heading?]","[There's a place called the Wind Peak, a few distance away from the village. Great winds flow like they were guided, and the wind passing through the rock crevices plays like music. That said, that was apparently not a natural miracle but a creation of our ancestors......]","[So, it’s a place where the wind sounds like music? That sounds amazing.]","[Yes, and the view of the majestic nature is also wonderful.]","As I admired the flowing scenery, thinking we were heading to an amazing place...... I saw a place that looked like a hedgehog’s back with many sharp rocks arranged.","Upon closer inspection, there was a flat area about 1-2 meters in radius at the center of these sharp rocks, where Amel-san and I landed.","Looking around, the sharp rocks were in a lower area than this flat area, so they were barely visible. Instead, what caught my eye was the majestic mountain range that Amel-san had described earlier as a breathtaking view.","And not only that, but music could be heard as well. The sound, reminiscent of a flute, harmonized beautifully, creating a unique yet pleasant melody similar to a folk song.","[......Eh? It sounds more like music than I expected? Was this place arranged like this on purpose?]","[Yeah, thanks to the surrounding mountains and terrain, this peak is designed so that the wind direction is almost constant unless the weather turns rough. The sharp rocks we saw earlier have several holes in them, and the wind passing through these holes has been adjusted to create music. Of course, there are some tricks involved.]","[Tricks?]","[Yeah. At the entrance to this area with the sharp rocks, there's a special Barrier Magic that prevents the sound from becoming jumbled. It blocks the wind at regular intervals to adjust the spacing of the wind as it reaches the rocks. That’s why it sounds like a proper melody.]","[I see...... Even so, this place is amazing. The scenery is breathtaking, and the music is beautiful......]","Indeed, if the wind continues blowing, the same rock would produce sound repeatedly, and without some form of interval, it wouldn’t work as a melody. Still, the fact that natural wind and holes in the rocks create music is amazing and impressive.","[This is one of my favorite places. I’ve been coming here often to enjoy the view since long ago...... That's why I've wanted to bring you here, my sworn friend!]","[I see...... Thank you. I’m really happy to have been brought to such a wonderful place.]","[Ehehe, I'm glad you're happy, my sworn friend. Ah, that's right, on the mountain over there......]","Just like that, with a genuinely happy smile, having forgotten her usual chuuni-tone, Amel-san shared stories about the area and her memories from the past.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [......This feels like a breaking point, so maybe we'd head to Frea-san next?]"]},{"number":1977,"title":"Chapter 1977: Neo Baby Castella Blend 28","paragraphs":["After handing the coffee samples to Amel-san, I only had Frea-san and one more person left. Since I had already confirmed the schedule, it seemed like the last person I'd visit would be Frea-san.","And so, I came to see the other person on my list, but this was the first time I've come to this place. It was one of the trade cities between Symphonia Kingdom and Hydra Kingdom, and although it was easy to get to from the Royal Capital's Teleportation Gate, it was still the first time I'm visiting this city.","[Errr...... It should be this way.]","Following the notes prepared in advance, I walked along and soon spotted a building about twice the size of a typical house. The sign read “Mikumo Trading Company” in the local script.","Yes, this was Akane-san’s trading company’s base. Unlike other companies, Akane-san’s is a mobile trading company, so this base mainly functions as an office and warehouse, and they don’t sell products directly from here.","[Ohh, you've arrived. Didn't get lost, did you?]","[Hello, Akane-san. No, this was almost straight out of the Gate...... However, I didn’t expect you to wait outside for me.]","[Well, you are an important guest...... Other than that, I just didn't have much work today and was bored. It's those times when we're waiting for the arrival of ordered goods~~]","[I see......]","[Well, let's not stand around talking here. Come on in, I'll show you to my office.]","Exchanging a few words with Akane-san, who had been waiting for me outside the building, I followed her inside. The atmosphere inside was that of a mid-sized wholesaler’s office, with people who seemed to be company members bustling around.","[Oya? For the Chairman to be bringing in a man...... Could her spring have finally come? It's a miracle, so don't let him slip away.]","[Stop with the strange misunderstandings, he's a guest...... Wait, the heck do you mean by miracle? I'll tell you this now, but the only reason I haven’t had any romantic involvement is because I’ve been focused on work. If I wanted to, I'd be extremely popular, you know? My charm is off the charts!]","[......I see, otherworld men have quite the terrible taste huh.]","[......Oiii, you lot! Since this idiot seems to have the time to tease the boss, pile up the work on her!]","[W- Wait, Pres!?]","[Kaito, this way.]","Right after entering the building, a woman at the reception desk started chatting with Akane-san, and they exchanged lighthearted banter.","[Geez, doesn't it feel like just about everyone here lacks proper respect for the President?]","[Doesn't that just mean Akane-san is approachable?]","[Good grief, if these guys were just running off their mouth, I'd fire them on the spot, but most of them are annoyingly competent......]","With a wry smile, Akane-san led me to her office, and I couldn’t help but smile as well. It was a small trading company, and the number of staff members was low, but just like how Frau-san is with her, everyone here had a family-like atmosphere, and the mood in the office was bright and pleasant.","Just like that, we walked a bit further and entered a room at the back of the office. It was a simple room with a set of reception sofas and a work desk, where we happened upon Frau-san placing something on Akane-san’s desk.","[Hello, Frau-san...... what are you doing?]","[If it isn't Miyama-sama, good day...... Ahh, well, a new magic tool has just arrived, and I was thinking of letting our respected President try it out......]","[That's the magic tool you install in showers, isn't it? If you activate that here, I'll dock your pay based on how much of the desk gets wet...... Ahh, Kaito, have a seat on that sofa.]","After a lighthearted jab at Frau-san, Akane-san gestured for me to sit on the sofa, which I did.","[Kaito, would you like something to drink?]","[Ahh, actually, that's related to why I came by this time...... I was asked to promote a new coffee blend from Kuro’s trading company to some acquaintances, so I brought some samples.]","[Ahh, I see, so that's what it is...... In that case, why don’t we brew some of that new blend? I’ve heard of the coffee from Kuromu-sama’s place, but I haven’t had it much myself.]","[Arehh? Really? I heard from Alice that Akane-san is a coffee lover though......]","[Yeah, well, it’s true that I drink coffee often. But you see, our trading company also deals in coffee, and we get ours from a different company, so I don’t have many chances to drink Kuromu-sama’s coffee. Her company mainly sells through their own stores and doesn’t do wholesale selling to others.]","[Ahh, I see......]","Now that she mentioned it, it made sense. Akane-san’s trading company is more like a wholesaler, primarily sourcing goods from various other companies and stores to sell in places where there’s demand. So, she probably drinks coffee from her own suppliers most of the time.","[Fumu...... Let's go with this one. Frau, could you brew this?]","[Understood.]","Even so, it seemed she was knowledgeable about coffee. After lightly checking the aroma of the samples, she selected one and handed it to Frau-san, showing that she's knowledgeable about coffee.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [The other one is Akane huh. Yeah, I can certainly see her more of a coffee person than a tea person.]"]},{"number":1978,"title":"Chapter 1978: Neo Baby Castella Blend 29","paragraphs":["Frau-san brewed some coffee and brought it over. It wasn't in a coffee cup, but in a mug, which somehow seems to fit Akane-san's vibe.","They probably have regular coffee cups for guests, but since it's just me, she went with the mug on purpose.","[Hou~~ What a nice aroma. As expected of a product from Kuromu-sama's trading company, they are of excellent quality.]","[Miyama-sama, please be cautious not to be deceived. She's acting like she knows what she's talking about, but this president usually only drinks cheap coffee.]","[What's wrong with that!? I don't care if coffee is drip or canned, they're both coffee! Well, not like there's canned coffee in this world.]","[Really? You picked out the sample beans so quickly, I thought you were knowledgeable......]","Akane-san seems to like coffee, but she doesn’t seem to be too particular about the types. It’s like how a salaryman would drink a can of coffee or grab some from a convenience store on the way to work———— Coffee would just be part of their morning routine.","However, she did pick out the beans quickly earlier, and now she's talking about the quality just from the aroma, so she does seem knowledgeable.","[Ohn? Me, knowledgeable...... Oh, I see what you mean! It's not that I know a lot from drinking different kinds myself; it's because I can judge the quality of the products my trading company handles. But when it comes to my personal coffee, I'm not that picky...... Besides, if I stock expensive beans for myself, Frau and the other idiots will drink them without asking.]","[Nah, I think it's your fault for leaving high-end products where we can see them.]","[That's why I don't leave those things out...... Ah, Frau, there's some gift sweets on that shelf over there, serve some to Kaito...... You can only have two.]","[......I'll have ten.]","[Try negotiating a bit more modestly...... Three, and any more will be deducted from your pay.]","They're having their comedy-like routine as usual, but I notice the sweets have already been placed in front of me, showing Frau-san's efficiency.","Well, she's also made herself some coffee and is drinking it, which certainly is just like Frau-san...... I can see why she gets along with Luna-san.","[And so, Kaito, you've promoted this to various acquaintances huh...... If you're the one promoting it, they must be some pretty big names.]","[Well, there's Ozma-san, one of the Five Warlords, Shea-san, a High-rank God, Amel-san, the Chief of the Wingeds...... that would be all at the moment.]","[You know, you're saying that so casually, but those aren't people you can just meet easily.]","I've also given some to Elise-san, but she's just a regular person, and as for Makina-san, we only talked in a dream, so I didn't give her any samples.","[Well, in this case, since Kuro is the client, if she really wants to, she can handle the promotion herself.]","[Ah, guess you're right. Kuromu-sama knows a lot of people, and if she seriously wanted to, she could include her wide connections in her sales strategy. She probably just casually asked you to hand out some samples.]","[Right...... Ah, speaking of which, the sales of the accessories I entrusted to Akane-san seem to be doing really well.]","[Well, of course, they're accessories made from the Dragon King's scales after all. There's no reason they wouldn't sell. The Dragon King is widely revered, especially among merchants, so there's a huge demand...... In fact, we even had to place some purchase limits on them.]","I already knew from Anima and Caraway that the sales of the accessories made from Magnawell-san's scales, which I had entrusted to Akane-san for sale, were doing extremely well.","Speaking of which, I remember Lilia-san mentioning before that Magnawell-san is regarded as some sort of God of Commerce in certain circles...... Apparently, it's related to things like the Flying Dragon Courier and the trade of monsters, but I don't know the details.","[But if we're speaking of promising results, it looks like Kaito's tea brand is also thriving. You got a big boost from the initial buzz, but the fact that it continued to sell well afterward means the quality is being recognized. Aren't you thinking of opening branches?]","[It seems like there are plans for that, but it looks like it could cause issues if we don't open them simultaneously in the three Human countries. So if we do open stores, it would likely be in the form of a simultaneous grand opening for three stores, but we're holding off because we don't have anyone who can oversee those stores.]","[Yeah~~ If you're going to expand across three countries, you'd at least want someone who can use Teleportation Magic. It would be tough to manage all three stores if you focus on just one country, and since the products are aimed at the wealthy, you'd have to be mindful of various things.]","[Right. Well, we'll figure that out gradually...... once we find the right people for those stores, that is.]","As Akane-san said, it would certainly be easier to entrust those stores to people who can use Teleportation Magic. Using Teleportation Magic Tools could work too, but while we're at it, I'd also prefer someone well-versed in magic.","Well, there's no need to rush into it, so I'll just keep it in the back of my mind.","<Afterword>","? ? ? : Since we have an Omnipotent-class being on standby, there shouldn't be any problems...... Good!]","Serious-senpai: [Which part of that is \"Good\"!?]"]},{"number":1979,"title":"Chapter 1979: Neo Baby Castella Blend 30","paragraphs":["Having finished giving the samples to Akane-san, the only remaining person to whom I plan to give a sample is Frea-san. I asked Kuro for a few extra samples so that I could pass some samples to Magnawell-san and his other subordinates.","I arranged to meet Frea-san in front of the same transfer gate where we met during the Dragon Carnival, and we quickly reunited.","[Welcome, my comrade. I wholeheartedly welcome your visit.]","[Hello, Frea-san. As I mentioned through the hummingbird, here are the coffee samples. I also brought enough for Magnawell-san and the other Four Great Demon Dragons, so please distribute them at your discretion.]","[I understand. Thank you for your consideration, my comrade...... Now then, since you've come all this way, I'd like to invite you to my abode. Would that be alright?]","[Yes, if Frea-san is alright with that, then of course.]","With a smile, Frea-san invited me to her home, and of course, I had no reason to refuse, so I nodded. After hearing my response, Frea-san gave a slight nod before returning to her original dragon form.","(Then, my comrade, climb onto my back.)","[Yes. Well then, if you'll excuse me.]","Just like when she took me to the Dragon Carnival, I climbed onto Frea-san's back and we began to move.","As before, Frea-san flew at a speed that suited me, so I felt safe and had the leisure to enjoy the scenery from the sky.","However, I was curious about what kind of place Frea-san's abode was...... or rather, what standard her house was based on.","Frea-san's true form is this 5-meter-long wyvern, and the human form I'm used to seeing, with an outfit that was a mix of sarashi tied on her top and gakuran, is the result of Transformation Magic.","In that case, her abode would likely be designed based on her dragon for...... If that's the case, wouldn't her house be bigger than usual Human-oriented homes?","[......By the way, what kind of place is your abode, Frea-san?]","(Hmm? Ah, I think I understand what you're getting at. You're wondering if the abode is based on my dragon form or human form, right?)","[Yes, I was thinking it might be too large for me if it's designed for your dragon form......]","(You don't need to worry about that. I'm planning to take you to a house that's suited for my human form...... To be precise, I have two abodes: one suited for my dragon form and one for my human form. Doing paperwork in my dragon form is cumbersome, and certain preferences are restricted when I'm in dragon form, so I’ve prepared both types of abodes adjacent to each other.)","[Ahh~~ I see, so it’s like you have a large building suited for your dragon form next to something more like a human house?]","(You can see it that way.)","I see, now that she mentioned it, it's certainly more convenient to have a place where you can live comfortably in either form. With someone as powerful as Frea-san, constantly using Transformation Magic wouldn’t be an issue at all, so having both options is the most efficient.","(To elaborate further, I own several sizable mountains as my territory. I've built my abode there and allowed some of my subordinates to live in certain areas. In human terms, you could say my subordinates live in the neighborhood.)","[Heehhh...... That's incredible, owning several mountains......]","(Much of the southern lands of the Demon Realm belong to Magnawell-sama, and like myself, some of us have been granted land by Magnawell-sama. The mountains I own weren’t purchased with money; they were lands bestowed upon me by him.)","[I see...... That’s quite impressive. I’m really looking forward to seeing what it’s like.]","(It would be great if it meets your expectations...... Anyhow, it’ll take about 15 more minutes at this speed, so take your time and relax.)","I haven’t been to the southern part of the Demon Realm very often. One reason is that the Southern Region is under Magnawell-san's control, so it has a high concentration of monsters and fewer cities compared to other areas. Also, it’s partly because Magnawell-san doesn’t live in a city but rather in a place surrounded by rocky mountains.","......Well, now that I think about it, I haven’t really explored many areas outside of places related to the Six Kings. The Demon Realm is vast, and it might be interesting to visit more places.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [Speaking of which, Kaito's base of operations is in the Human Realm, so he doesn't visit the Demon Realm very often.]"]},{"number":1980,"title":"Chapter 1980: Neo Baby Castella Blend 31","paragraphs":["After flying for a while, I began to see a mountain that looked like our destination, but Frea-san's home was different from what I had expected. Rather than a house, it was more like a castle...... or rather, a fortress. Partly due to being nestled against the mountain, it had this sturdy atmosphere.","[Errr...... Is that the place?)","(Yeah. That's the home I use in my human form. The entrance to the one I use in my dragon form is up to the left of that home.)","[Ah, that big cave-like structure, right? I see...... That said, even the home you use in your human form is incredibly large. Just from looking at it, it looks like a fortress.]","(Yeah, I get what my comrade is trying to say. But considering that I sometimes land in my dragon form and then transform into my human form, it’s more convenient to have a building like that.)","I see, now that she mentioned it, that does make sense. If she's moving in her dragon form like now, landing on the roof and then transforming into her human form inside her home, she'd need a roof big enough to accommodate her 5-meter-long dragon body. Overall, it’s probably more convenient to have a larger residence.","(Although it may appear massive at first glance, about 80% of it is a facility for training, so the living space isn't as large as it seems. I'm the type who likes to try everything at least once, so I've equipped it with training equipment and facilities from both the Human and Demon Realm, from all over the world and from different eras.)","[That's very much like Frea-san. In that case, you'd definitely need a lot of rooms, ending up looking like a gigantic gym.]","(Fumu...... My comrade, forgive my ignorance, but what is this gym?)","[Oh, it’s something from my world...... A facility where members can use equipment to work out and strengthen their bodies.]","Frea-san seemed interested in the word \"gym,\" so I gave a brief explanation about the sports gyms I knew.","(I see, instead of preparing the equipment and space yourself, you pay money to use a place that already has those training equipment set up...... I see, that would indeed reduce initial investment costs and make training more accessible...... That’s brilliant. Providing such a place for those with ambition but without wealth...... This is good information. I’ll keep this in mind for the future.)","Frea-san appeared quite intrigued by the concept of a gym, and I had a feeling that she might actually build one at some point. The lack of gyms in this world was probably due to the fact that public transportation, like trains, wasn’t as developed, making it somewhat difficult to travel long distances.","So, I think it would be highly practical for Frea-san to create a gym for her subordinates. Many of the Dragons can fly, so accessibility wouldn't be much of an issue.","As we continued our conversation, Frea-san landed on the roof of the fortress-like house. There was a figure on the roof, a woman who appeared to be one of Frea-san's subordinates. She waited for Frea-san to lower me down and transform into her human form, then quickly bowed her head with great enthusiasm.","[Thank you for the hard work, Big Sis!]","[Yeah, is something the matter?]","[I’ve brought the item you requested, Big Sis! It's finished!]","Frea-san's subordinate...... or rather, she felt more like her underling than a subordinate. Is it because of Frea-san's outfit that she kinda felt like the leader of her own delinquent group?","Anyhow, after discussing something with Frea-san, the subordinate noticed me and bowed.","[Oh, you're here too, \"Big Bro\"! Thank you for the hard work!\"","[Eh? H- Hello...... Umm, \"Big Bro\"?]","[Since you're Big Sis' comrade, you're like the Big Bro to us!]","[I- I see?]","Somehow, I've acquired another strange nickname. While I did wonder why I was being called \"Big Bro\" just because I was their Big Sis' comrade, I couldn’t help but nod in response to her loud and energetic demeanor.","Well, I suppose adding one more nickname at this point doesn’t make much of a difference......","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [As expected of the guy who was called \"Human-san\", \"My child\", and even \"My God\"...... His outlook in life is on a whole different level.]"]},{"number":1981,"title":"Chapter 1981: Neo Baby Castella Blend 32","paragraphs":["After greeting me, Frea-san's subordinate used what seemed like Space-Time Magic to conjure a large box. This must be the item that Frea-san had requested.","[Big Sis, here it is.]","[Ahh, it must have been rough, good work. I'll take it here.]","Frea-san easily lifted the huge box, which was several meters tall, as if it were just a small one. The box then emitted a light and disappeared. It didn’t seem like it was stored in a magic box, so she likely teleported it somewhere else.","After that, she conjured a large barrel-like object and placed it in front of her subordinate.","[Share this with the others.]","[Thank you, Big Sis! I'll gladly take it! Well then, I'll be leaving now!]","[Yeah, let the others know I appreciate their efforts.]","[Understood!]","After replying to Frea-san and giving me a quick nod, the subordinate’s body glowed and transformed into a massive dragon. She stored the barrel using Space-Time Magic and flew off.","[Sorry for taking up your time, my comrade.]","[No, don't worry about it.]","[I had asked my subordinates, who are skilled at crafting, to make something for me. I thought it would take them a bit longer, but it seems they hurried to complete it.]","[That big box from earlier, right? Is it some kind of training equipment?]","[You're not entirely wrong, but it’s a bit different from what you might imagine. If you're interested, would you like to see it? It’s stored in a room we'll pass by on the way to my private quarters.]","[I don't really understand what you mean, but if Frea-san is okay with it, I’d love to see it.]","Curious about the box's contents, I nodded and followed Frea-san as we moved along. We walked through a fairly spacious hallway for a while until we reached a large set of double doors, where Frea-san stopped. It seemed this was the room, and the doors looked quite heavy and solid.","[Those are quite the impressive doors.]","[They're nothing special. Eingana suggested that the room should be spacious, so I prepared a larger room. Well, let’s go inside.]","[Yes...... O- Ohh...... This is...... I see, it's a room for practicing music.]","As soon as I stepped into the room, I understood what Frea-san had meant earlier. Inside, there were multiple guitars and magic tools for performing music, along with a stage-like platform.","I suddenly recalled the band Frea-san, Eingana-san, and Fafnir-san had formed, which I had seen in the Hydra Kingdom.","In other words, this room was for the band’s music practice, and the box from earlier was probably related to that. That's why, in a way, it was indeed used for training, just not the kind of training I had in mind.","[Come to think of it, I remember you performed live in Hydra Kingdom...... Wasn't your band called Dragon Soul?]","[Unn? Were you there? To think I didn't notice my comrade's presence...... I still have much to learn.]","[......Ahh~~ No, things were a bit complicated back then...... A- Anyhow, the contents of that box are for your band activities, right?]","I did see Frea-san live performance in the Hydra Kingdom, but it was when I was traveling with Shiro-san...... in other words, we were watching from a different dimension, so it’s only natural that Frea-san didn’t notice me. That said, explaining all of that would take too long, so I decided to steer the conversation back to the topic at hand.","[Yeah, it's a magic tool designed to adjust sound reverberation. I place it in all corners of the room. Once I decide to take something up, regardless of the reason, I go all out———– that's my way. I don't intend to hold back when it comes to playing music either...... I plan to train with everything I've got, so I can reach even greater heights.]","[Hahaha, I see, that's just like Frea-san. However, you were really cool playing the guitar. I've got no clue how to play instruments, but watching you made me want to give it a try.]","[Fufu, I see. Well, if you ever feel like it, don’t hesitate to let me know. I can teach you enough to play for fun, and it would be enjoyable to perform together with my comrade.]","[That sounds great. I’ll definitely take you up on that if I get the chance.]","Well, to be honest, back in high school, I kinda yearned to play the guitar. However, getting into it seemed tough———— I had to buy a guitar and learn the chords, which felt like a big hurdle, so I never actually took the plunge into the hobby.","......However, now that I know there are guitars in this world too, and since I have both the money and time, maybe I really should give it a shot.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [Whoa, seems like a weird flag just got triggered.]","? ? ? : [But you know, Kaito-san is actually pretty suited for music. He has a good ear, and with his Sympathy Magic, he could even infuse emotions into sounds. If he really puts his mind to it, I think he could be pretty amazing......]"]},{"number":1982,"title":"Chapter 1982: Neo Baby Castella Blend 33","paragraphs":["<Author's Notes>","I'm not feeling well, so today's chapter is short.","Frea-san's room had quite a few things in it, but it didn't feel cluttered; rather, it was neatly organized.","The impression it gave was of a capable career woman's room, with everything necessary precisely arranged where it needed to be.","[Did you think my room would be full of nothing but training equipment? You can laugh at my scattered interests if you want, but once something catches my interest, I tend to dive into it, which has resulted in a rather cluttered room.]","[No, actually, this is just what I imagined. My image of Frea-san certainly is associated with training, but it's not just combat-related training. I had the impression you actively incorporate anything that enhances yourself, so having a room like this makes sense.]","[Fufu, I see, you understand me well, my comrade. It's a little embarrassing but pleasant at the same time...... But we can't keep standing around, can we? My comrade, use that chair over there...... I thought I might brew some sample coffee since you're here, but considering you've likely had several cups during your visits to others, would you prefer something else? My comrade, how do you feel about fruit drinks?]","[Ah, yes. I'm fine with it.]","[Well then, I'll have that prepared.]","Frea-san is quite considerate, and she seemed to have noticed that I've been drinking coffee at various places, so she decided to offer me something different.","I'm not exactly tired of coffee, but I do appreciate the idea of having something else for a change.","After a short while, Frea-san brought me a glass of what looked like orange juice. Taking a sip, I found it wasn't orange juice, tasting more like a fruit juice mix, with a refreshing flavor that was quite nice.","[It's delicious. Refreshing, with a good aftertaste. I think it'd be great to drink after exercising.]","[I'm glad you like it, my comrade. This drink was made by someone I invested in, and I'm quite fond of it myself. I'll give you a note...... The store is located in a city in the Hydra Kingdom, so stop by if you get the chance.]","[Thank you.]","This is just my guess, but that's probably the result of Frea-san investing in someone she recognized as having ambition, similar to when she previously helped that guy who was trying to steal from a store.","It was indeed a very delicious juice, so I'll try to buy some if I get the chance.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [Come to think of it, even though she may seem like a musclehead, she invests in various things, takes on different challenges, and is quite broad in her activities......]"]},{"number":1983,"title":"Chapter 1983: Neo Baby Castella Blend 34","paragraphs":["After getting the juice, the conversation naturally shifted to casual chatting. The topic was, of course, about the coffee samples I had brought.","[I learned from Alice that the Dragon King's subordinates...... or rather, everyone of the Four Great Demon Dragons prefer coffee over tea.]","[Yeah, it seems that Dragons generally prefer coffee to tea. This is just based on my knowledge, and there's no concrete evidence for it, but it might be a species-related preference...... That said, it doesn't mean that everyone likes coffee above all else. If I had to choose between tea and coffee, I'd pick coffee, but if I had to choose from all beverages, I’d prefer alcohol.]","[Ahh, I see, that was the case with Megiddo-san as well. Speaking of which, I was actually curious about something———— High-ranking Demons can usually negate status effects, but do they get drunk from alcohol?]","For example, I wouldn’t expect status effects to affect someone like Megiddo-san, and like in my case, Shiro-san's blessing prevents me from getting drunk to a certain extent, so it wouldn't be surprising if Megiddo-san had similar abilities.","Back when we had our first drinking contest, I didn’t quite understand how this world was like yet, but from my perspective, the Six Kings are almost omnipotent beings, and since Megiddo-san also has high magical prowess, I think nullifying drunkenness is something she's capable of......","[In that regard, they can adjust it as they like. It's difficult to describe, but they can decide how drunk they'll get before drinking and can instantly sober up if they want. Therefore, if two Demons who can negate status effects are having a drinking contest, it's customary to deactivate their status effect resistance beforehand. If someone is quite powerful, they can usually tell if their opponent has such status effect negation active.]","[I see...... Hmmm. Errr, actually, I once accepted a drinking challenge from Megiddo-san and won, but at that time, I had Shiro-san’s blessing, which prevented me from getting too drunk. So, when Megiddo-san learned that, they seemed to accept their defeat...... but if that's the case, isn't what I did there considered cheating?]","[No, in my comrade's case, what you had was something different from status effect negation magic. Even if you were using such a magic, if it wasn't detected before the contest, it's the fault of the other party for lacking the ability to detect that. Megiddo-sama would likely think the same. If my comrade has the blessing of the God of Creation Shallow Vernal, which negates drunkenness, and they hadn't detected it beforehand, it would be considered their personal defeat.]","Now that she mentioned it, it makes sense, and Megiddo-san would probably think that way. From what I’ve seen so far, Megiddo-san doesn’t seem to care too much about the outcome, and she acknowledges that drinking contest as her loss. She’s not the type to dwell on the past.","I’m not particularly worried about it myself; I was just curious, so I’m glad to have had that clarified by Frea-san.","[Somehow, I get the feeling that Frea-san would like something like sake...... Ahh, speaking of which, does sake exist in this world?]","[I think I've heard about it before. It's that alcohol made from rice, right? Rice itself is relatively rare, but I've heard that Neun from Kuromueina-sama's place and Blossom from Lillywood-sama's place enjoy it.]","[Ahh~~ Those two definitely seemed like they'd like it.]","[Well, if my comrade says it seems like something I'd like, then I'm interested...... I'll try it out someday.]","[Yes, if the opportunity arises, definitely...... Ah......]","It seems that rice is quite rare in this world, so sake made from rice isn’t very well-known. However, it does exist as I’ve seen it a few times...... In fact, I just remembered that I have some Japanese sake-like alcohol.","[......Frea-san. I have some sake, or rather, some alcohol that was like sake here...... Would you like to try it?]","I had completely forgotten, but I bought some sake for 3000R at Kaori-san’s store. I intended to drink it later, but I had completely forgotten about it after storing it in my magic box.","[That would be great but...... is that alright?]","[Yes. I mean, I had actually forgotten I had it too, so I'm glad this conversation reminded me...... Here it is. Please help yourself.]","[Thanks...... It has a refreshing and pleasant aroma. Well then, if you'll excuse me...... Hmm, I see, this is indeed excellent. Despite the aroma, it’s almost devoid of sweetness and has a crisp, refreshing taste that is quite pleasant. As my comrade said, it perfectly matches my taste. I’m grateful to have found something so good, and I sincerely thank you, my comrade......]","[Ahaha, I'm glad you like it.]","[Yeah, but drinking alone feels a bit lonely. Since we’re at it, would you mind drinking with me?]","[Yes, I've been wanting to try that sake too, so let’s drink together.]","I took out a glass for myself, and after lightly clinking my glass with Frea-san, we drank the sake. The alcohol content is quite high, but as Frea-san said, the aftertaste is crisp and very easy to drink.","Well, it's currently the middle of the day but...... sometimes, enjoying a drink at this time can be nice.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [Come to think of it, he did buy that sake...... I completely forgot.]"]},{"number":1984,"title":"Chapter 1984: Canalis 1","paragraphs":["The promotion for the samples requested by Kuro...... I feel like it took quite a while, going around to various places, but it ended without any issues.","Well, it was actually quite enjoyable. I visited some places I hadn’t been to before and heard some interesting stories. Even though I thought I knew a lot after being in Trinia for a while, I realized there are still overwhelmingly many places I haven’t been to.","I want to visit various places again, but for the time being, I’ll just take it easy for a while......","[Master, may I have a moment?]","[Anima? Unn, what's up?]","[There's a letter addressed to Master requesting a visit to the mansion. Normally, we would handle such requests here, but the letter mentioned that the sender had previously met you and introduced themselves, so I came here to confirm.]","[Hmm? People who send such letters are usually nobles, right? If they were connected to the Six Kings, they’d contact us through the Six Kings’ Executives or the Six Kings themselves...... Ahh, well, if we've met directly, it wouldn't be strange for them to send a letter. By the way, who is it?]","I’m quite famous among the nobility, so I often receive such letters. Even so, compared to the letters that reach Lilia-san, mine are fewer, thanks to the various Kings and Alice who keep things in check.","Most of the letters are invitations to parties or requests to meet and talk once. Basically, Anima handles the refusals on my behalf, and I only receive letters from acquaintances.","However, this time, Anima looked puzzled, so I guess she didn’t recognize the name of the person who sent the letter.","But since Anima manages almost everything about my house, including the assets, and is my lover whom I talk to often, is there someone I know whose name she doesn’t know?","[The letter states it's from someone named Jane Doe, do you have an idea who that might be?]","[A- Ahh! I see, it's from Jane-san huh...... Unn. She had been accompanying Laguna-san to the ship party the other day, and I exchanged greetings with her at that time.]","[I see, in that case, that makes sen...... Master? Did you just say that Jane Doe was someone who accompanied Laguna-dono?]","[Eh? Unn, that should be the case......]","[That's odd. I know the names of all the guests and their companions, but I don’t recall a Jane Doe among Laguna-dono’s companions...... No, there shouldn't even be anyone named Jane Doe at the party...... Ah, no, it's possible I simply forgot but......]","[......Eh? Arehh?]","That does sound strange. While it’s possible Anima could have forgotten, the number of people who were at the ship party as companions of the participants, rather than as my acquaintances, was very small. I think it was fewer than ten people or so.","Also, wasn't Jane-san a noble from Hydra Kingdom...... No, wait. She didn't say anything like that. She mentioned how her high-class aura had been leaking, but never had she explicitly say she was a noble.","[......That certainly was odd, but she didn't seem like a bad person......]","[That's true. Shallow Vernal-sama and Alice-dono were at the party as well, and it's hard to believe they'd just overlook an intruder.]","[Hmmm...... Alice, do you know anything about Jane-san?]","What Anima said makes sense. Since Alice was at the party, it’s unlikely she would have overlooked someone who wasn’t supposed to be there. So, I thought asking Alice would be the best option. Surprisingly though, Alice also appeared troubled.","[Hmmm...... She might be an Otherworld God. I remember the names and faces of the residents of this world, but she doesn’t match any of them. After the party, I checked, but there were no sightings of her anywhere else, and in the first place, this is just my estimates, but she should be Omnipotent level.]","[That's quite the outrageous thing you're saying there...... Heck, you're saying you remember the names and faces of everyone in the world so nonchalantly...... Well, nevermind. So, Jane-san is likely an Otherworld God?]","[The possibility of that being the case is quite high, but she implied something along the lines of having been a God before, so she might have some circumstances. However, she showed no hostility towards Kaito-san, and she seems to have received permission from Shallow Vernal-sama to come, so I don’t think she’s in any way a problem. I also asked Shallow Vernal-sama about her, and from what she said, \"She's a God who created a world that doesn't exist anymore, and as she requested to stay in this world for a while, I granted permission.\". Other than those words, she didn't provide any further details.]","[I see...... Well, she doesn’t seem to be a bad person, and I’d like to hear what she has to say...... Anima, could you reply and let her know she’s welcome to visit?]","[Understood.]","It seems like matters were more significant than I expected, but she really does seem like a good person. With Alice and Shiro-san knowing about her, it might be unnecessary to worry too much.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [The fact is, she's been thoroughly educated by the Absolute, so she's extremely sensible...... I mean, for her to not have visited as she pleased and asked permission in writing beforehand, I think she's already pretty sensible at that point.]"]},{"number":1985,"title":"Chapter 1985: Canalis 2","paragraphs":["If it was as Alice said, Jane-san being an Otherworld God, it would be a mystery where the letter had come, but the destination it was sent to was simply an address in Hydra Kingdom, and I was supposed to send a reply there.","Well, if she really were an omnipotent god, something like an address wouldn’t be a big deal, so that’s not really the issue. What’s important is figuring out what her true objective is, including the fact that she was part of the party from the very beginning.","From my personal impression, Jane-san doesn’t seem like a bad person. Although her facial muscles were dead, I didn’t sense any malice in our interactions; in fact, she seemed like a good person.","It’s completely based on intuition, but according to Alice, “Kaito-san, your first impressions in these matters are usually spot on.”, so I want to believe it’s okay.","After exchanging a few letters and setting a date, the day finally came for Jane-san’s visit. To be honest, if she was a God on the same level as Shiro-san or Makina-san, I would have expected her to visit more forcefully...... but she politely exchanged letters, consulted me carefully about the schedule, and then visited, so by this point, I already had the impression that she was a pretty decent person.","[Well~~ It’s been a while since the ship party. I’m really happy to meet you again, Kaito-sama...... Ah, I brought some baked goods, here you go.]","[Hello, Jane-san. Thank you for the gift.]","[No, no, sorry that it's just cheap stuff...... Ah, excuse me. Before we start, may I apologize for something?]","[Eh? Apologize?]","[Yes, actually, I lied to you, Kaito-sama. The name I used last time, Jane Doe, isn’t my real name. Tahaa~~ I’m really sorry for being such a mysterious woman with multiple names. I didn’t have any bad intentions, but I had some circumstances that kept me from using my real name for a while, so I ended up using a fake name on the spot.]","According to Alice, \"Jane Doe\" was apparently a name used back in my world for unidentified female corpses, so I had guessed it might be a fake name.","However, from Jane-san’s tone, it doesn’t seem like she was trying to deceive me, but rather that she used a fake name because she felt uncomfortable using her real name due to some circumstances.","[......Introducing myself once again, I'm Canalis. Troublesome it may be, I'd appreciate it if you could update your records about me with this name.]","[Canalis-san then, understood.]","[Ah, and you might have already heard from the bodyguard, but I’m a God from another world. Well, I did create my own world, but I’m not very good at managing it, so I left it to a friend and have been wandering around various worlds, so it might be more accurate to call me a former God. Tahaa~~ Sorry for the confusion with all these twists and turns in my backstory!]","How should I say this...... She admitted to being a god too easily, or rather, she didn’t seem to be trying to hide it at all. While guiding Jane-san——— Canalis-san to the reception room, we continued our conversation.","[By the way, what about when you said you were with Laguna-san back at the party?]","[That's a fact. No, well, I was invisible and followed from behind, so it wasn’t as if I participated as Laguna-sama’s companion...... Oh, but please don’t worry. Indeed, I wasn’t formally invited, but I’m not shameless enough to eat or drink in such a state. Even though I'm envying the others as they get to eat those delicious-looking food, I didn’t touch anything!]","[......No, I wouldn’t have minded if you had eaten or drunk something......]","[Ohh, you're more generous than I expected, as expected of Kaito-sama, quite charming you are! ......I wish I knew that back at the party though.]","She continued her lively, fast-paced conversation as usual...... but her facial expression didn’t move an inch. It seems that her dead facial muscles aren’t an act but are genuinely real.","Well, I’m used to this kind of thing with Shiro-san, but in Canalis-san’s case, her voice is full of emotion, so she feels different from Shiro-san and her voice that lacks intonation.","[So, why did you come to that party in the first place?]","[I came because I wanted to see Kaito-sama. Ah~~ Errr, I hope you don’t take this the wrong way, but you’re currently the hottest topic among the World Creators, with rumors about you spreading everywhere. Tahaa~~ It's that, you know? You could say you're currently trending!]","[......Eh? Me? W- Why?","[Hmmm, this might sound like I’m speaking ill of your lover, so I hope you don’t get upset but...... Shallow Vernal is literally the embodiment of the End, someone the World Creators deeply fear. Since Kaito-sama had won against that Shallow Vernal and had her as your lover, the World Creators were like, well, how should I say this...... They're all thinking along the lines of \"what kind of monster are you?\", and everyone seems to respect you for it. Ahh, of course, I'm also Kaito-sama's fan!]","[.......................................I- I see?]","Somehow, I had just been hit with an incredible revelation...... Eh? I’m being talked about among the Omnipotent and Omniscient Gods? That's a shocking new fact I just learned.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [That just shows how much Shiro was feared, but Kaito, both among the nobles and Gods, he seriously became famous in all the weird places......]","? ? ? : [Thanks to Alice-chan's efforts, the general public doesn’t know much about him...... but I wonder? Can't you hear it? The sound of a stomachache flag rising for a certain Duchess......]","Serious-senpai : [Just let her go already......]"]},{"number":1986,"title":"Chapter 1986: Canalis 3","paragraphs":["I heard a shocking truth from Canalis-san, but even though Canalis-san travels to different worlds, it's not like the Gods who manage their own worlds can easily come here, so I probably don't need to think too deeply about it.","Makina-san is a special case, being the God from the world I originally came from and already knowing Shiro-san from before. If the World Creators fear Shiro-san, there's no way they'd come to this world just to see me, so I think things would probably be alright.","With those thoughts in mind, I arrived at the reception room and had Canalis-san sit down. At that moment, Illness-san came in with some tea, placing it and some snacks in front of both me and Canalis-san before leaving with a bow.","[......So, getting to the main point, what brings you here today, Canalis-san?]","[Well, the main reason is to formally introduce myself to you by my real name, Kaito-sama. Ahh, I know what Kaito-sama is thinking. You’re wondering why I introduced myself with a fake name at the party but used my real name the second time we met...... Well, to put it simply, I resolved the problem I was dealing with.]","[Problem?]","[Yes, that's right. Hmmm...... This might take a while, but do you mind if I talk about myself?]","[It's alright. I'm curious, and if Canalis-san is alright with it......]","As I suspected, Canalis-san is indeed a good person. Earlier, when she was about to talk about how I was being talked about among the Gods and how Shiro-san is feared, she made sure to check with me beforehand. Even now, she's confirming things before moving forward.","How should I say this...... Compared to other World Creators like Shiro-san and Makina-san, Canalis-san seems much more reasonable, not being forceful with his own thoughts at all. It’s easy to forget that she’s an Omnipotent God.","[As I mentioned earlier, I created a world once. But things didn’t go well, and due to various circumstances, my world faced a crisis of ruin...... Tahaa~~ I’m really sorry for my poor management! A God whom I deeply respected and admired saved my world by sacrificing herself. Well, she probably doesn’t think of it as a sacrifice, and she'd likely get mad if I said that, so let’s keep this between us......]","[S- Somehow, the scale of the story is immense right from the start.]","[Tahaa~~ As beautiful as I am, I still am an Omnipotent God, so you could say I'm a big deal of a woman. Ah, I'm not geographically big, okay? There are physically large World Creators, but I'm proud of my slender body. Oops, sorry, I got sidetracked.]","Her tone remains as humorous as before, and her voice is bright, but as usual, her expression doesn’t change at all, and there’s no light in her eyes. Somehow, though, I feel like I’m getting used to this atmosphere.","[Anyhow, to continue the story...... I ended up with a lot of regrets, a lot of self-loathing, and most importantly, I realized I wasn’t cut out to manage worlds. So, I asked a friendly World Creator to take over managing my world, and I became something of a wanderer, traveling from world to world. Tahaa~~ You could say I'm like the local hobo!]","[I see. I imagine you've been traveling in a span of time beyond my imagination.]","[Yes, I’ve traveled to many different worlds, so I know a bit about them. Well, putting aside my wandering tales, getting back to the main topic...... well, because of my self-loathing and those other feelings, I unconsciously avoided using my real name. Ah, and by the way, the muscles in my face quit on me after that incident too.]","She speaks in a cheerful tone, but her story is quite heavy. In short, she lost someone she respected dearly, and out of regret and self-loathing, she stopped using her real name and her expression became void.","[......Arehh? But since you introduced yourself with your real name this time, does that mean you had a change of heart?]","[That's right. Actually, the person I respected has been revived...... or rather, she has been reincarnated. Being able to reunite and talk with her has helped me come to terms with a lot of things.]","[I see...... Ah~~ Errr, sorry if I'm wrong, but could it be that you're someone who knew Nebula back when she was a God?]","[........................That's strange. I thought this was a very delicate topic, so I tried to be quite vague about it...... In my mind, there's no way Kaito-sama should have been able to react as if you already knew about this...... Arehh?]","Though her expression didn’t change, Canalis-san tilted her head with a very puzzled tone.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [Wait, he knew about that!? Ah, but I see...... Could it be...... With how much of an idiotic parent he is, I was thinking he might have been ignoring common sense when matters are related to Nebula, but if he knew that Nebula, a downgraded God she may be, was still a Quasi-Omnipotent one...... His reactions would be more like \"If it's Nebula, she should be capable of something like that\"......?]"]},{"number":1987,"title":"Chapter 1987: Canalis 4","paragraphs":["If I were to say when it was, I think it had been a while since Nebula had become a part of the family. I had just finished brushing Bell and was sitting under the shade of the World Tree with Nebula on my lap, relaxing when she suddenly said:","[Ah, come to think of it, Milord.]","[Unn?]","[It's not a big deal, but I used to be a God.]","[......A God? Like Shiro-san or Eden-san?]","[Yes. I haven't created my own world, so I technically wasn't a World Creator, but I had a position close to that. I was brought to my end with Shallow Vernal's Epilogue, and was later revived...... hmmm, or perhaps you could consider it as more as \"reincarnated\" as the Spirit of a World Tree.]","[I- I see?]","The suddenness of that revelation left me stunned, but I knew Nebula wasn’t the type to joke about such things. Besides, there’s already Isis-san as a precedent.","And when I consider things like the World Tree’s sudden mutation, something even Lilywood-san couldn't believe possible, and the fact that a Spirit of a World Tree had taken up residence where one shouldn’t exist, if Shiro intervened...... well, it makes sense.","[Well, it really isn’t that big of a deal. The past is the past, and it doesn’t change the fact that I’m now the spirit of Milord's World Tree, nor does it alter who I am. Wherever I may be, I remain the Absolute, and that doesn’t change!]","[Fufu, I see...... Well, I guess hearing that doesn't change the person Nebula is, and it doesn’t bring any big changes huh?]","[Yes!]","[But why did you suddenly bring this up?]","Nebula spoke about her past as a God as if it was nothing, as if it were a casual conversation about how \"this was how things were in a previous life.\" She seemed genuinely indifferent about it.","Well, even if her past was as she said, it doesn’t change who Nebula is now, and regardless of her past life, Nebula is still my adorable family she is now, so as she said, it’s probably not a big deal.","However, I was curious why she chose this moment to talk about it.","[Ah, no, it's something I could have spoken of anytime. There's nothing that needs this Absolute to hide. However, I just thought that if I spoke about this right after I appeared, the information might overwhelm Milord, so I decided to wait for a while. Well, it's not like there was a particular reason for me to bring it up, but I thought that if you found out about this later through some other means, it might surprise you. So, I figured it would be better to mention it now.]","[I see, you were looking out for me. Thank you...... Nebula, do you ever wish to return to how you were before, as a God in your past life?]","[No, not at all. Although my current power is much weaker than before, and I sometimes wish I could regain it, I have no desire to return to my previous position. Partly because I’ve accepted my reincarnation, but mostly because I enjoy my life here with Milord and everyone else.]","[I’m glad to hear that.]","Seeing Nebula's cheerful smile made me happy because I could tell that her words were truly from the heart.","As I gently patted her head, Nebula narrowed her eyes in contentment. Unn, no matter what her past was, Nebula remains the same, and since she doesn’t mind it, I shouldn’t either.","Thinking that, I continued to enjoy my relaxed conversation with Nebula.","[......Ahh, one more thing. There might be a chance that someone I knew in the past could visit this world, but those around me had all been well-mannered, so there shouldn’t be any problems.]","[You mean, like Gods?]","[That's right. Most of them would be Creator Gods, but I doubt they’ll come in large numbers, and if I notice them, I’ll talk to them. If they visit Milord, just call for me, and I’ll handle it.]","[Got it. I'll count on you then.]","[Yes! Please leave it to me! I'm Absolute after all!]","Recalling the conversation I had with Nebula a while back, I turned my gaze toward Canalis-san in front of me.","Though her expression remained unchanged, Canalis-san clearly appeared confused. After a brief silence, she finally spoke up.","[......Errr, Kaito-sama, where exactly did you hear that story?]","[......Well, I heard this directly from her.]","[I- I see......]","[Ahh~~ Errr, should I call Nebula over? I feel like the conversation would go more smoothly if she were here.]","Since Canalis-san seemed to know Nebula, it might be best to have her present. Nebula also mentioned that if any of her old acquaintances showed up, I should call her, so that’s what I’ll do.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [Ahh~~ I see, with Isis as a similar precedent and the fact that Nebula herself is so clear-cut about it, it was probably easier for Kaito to accept...... Though with how indulgent he treated her about this, I still sense a bit of how idiotic of a parent he is......]","? ? ? : [By the way, the timing when this was revealed was right after Nebula-san first made tea. Back then, Kaito-san was still amazed by things like the intricately crafted sugar and how she completely revamped the garden in such a short time. But from then on, he started taking things like \"Nebula is amazing, so of course, she can do that\" in stride, and that was because he knew she used to be a God.]","Serious-senpai : [......I just thought he just got even more doting.]"]},{"number":1988,"title":"Chapter 1988: Canalis 5","paragraphs":["For the sake of a smooth conversation, I decided it would be better to call Nebula, so I asked her to come to the reception room as well.","[You called for me, Milord?]","[Unn. I’d like you to sit in on this......]","[I see. It would certainly make things smoother with me here. Hello, Canalis-san. May I join you?]","[Yesh! Ah, yes. H- Hello, Nebula-san...... P- Please go ahead.]","[Hmmm. I would appreciate it if you could speak more naturally...... but I suppose we can have that as a goal for the future.]","[Urk, m- my apologies. I’m just relieved I managed to say your name without stuttering......]","Canalis-san's expression was as unchanging as ever, but her voice clearly betrayed her nervousness, almost as if she were in awe. From what I’d heard before, Nebula might have a higher standing than her in the past.","Well, Nebula didn’t seem bothered by it, smiling wryly, so I didn’t think there was any need to worry.","[So, the reason Milord called me is that he figured out that Canalis-san and I were acquainted?]","[T- That's right. I mean, Nebula-san...... you told Kaito-sama that you were a God?]","[Yes, Absolute that I am, I see no need to hide anything from Milord. I informed him ahead of time to avoid him feeling surprised later on.]","[I see, that's very much like you, Nebula-san...... but in that case, maybe I didn't need to force myself to address you with \"-san\" honorifics......]","[No, the current situation is different from before, and it’s appropriate to behave accordingly. I trust that you can adapt to that, Canalis-san.]","[N- Nebula-san...... Y- Yes! I'll do my best!]","Though Canalis-san's face remained expressionless, her voice was filled with emotion, showing just how much she respected Nebula.","Well, even now, Nebula is pretty amazing, and if she was much more powerful than in her current state, she must have been even more incredible before. So, Canalis-san’s reaction was understandable.","[But in any case, this does make things easier to discuss. Kaito-sama, I actually came here today with a rather presumptuous request. Tahaaa~~ I’m terribly sorry for being so bold! I was worrying about how to bring it up, but since you already know about Nebula’s situation, it’ll be quicker.]","[Unn? A request?]","[Umm, I'm aware it's a terribly impolite thing to ask, but...... Could I live in your home?]","[Eh? In my home?]","[Yes! I won’t be a bother at all, and if there’s no room, I can create a pocket dimension to live in, and I’ll pay rent!]","[I don't mind.]","[I completely understand if you want to say no, but I just.................................... Unn? Ah~~ I'm sorry, Kaito-sama, was that an OK just now?]","[Eh? Ah, yes.]","Since I had no reason to refuse, and there were plenty of spare rooms, I didn’t think it would be an issue, but it seemed my easy approval caught Canalis-san off guard, and she asked again, confused.","[......No, no, let's think this through. I certainly am the one who requested you, but you should really consider it carefully! You can’t just let someone you’ve only met twice, who has a deadpan face and dead eyes, suddenly move into your house! You should be more cautious...... Not that I'd ever harm you, of course......]","Canalis-san’s reaction was surprisingly sensible for an Omnipotent God. Given the strong impressions Gods like Shiro-san and Makina-san had, the fact that she was so down-to-earth was a bit disorienting.","[Canalis-san, I believe Milord has taken into account that you and I are acquainted, but more than that, he has an exceptional eye for people. I'm certain that MIlord's response is based on his understanding that you are a person of strong virtue.]","[I- Is that so...... Kaito-sama, while I’m certainly grateful, please don’t feel like you have to be overly considerate. After all, this would mean a new resident in your home, so let’s make sure to thoroughly discuss and agree on the conditions. I’m more than willing to follow the rules of your household, so please don’t hesitate to say what’s necessary.]","[A- Alright. Well, let’s take our time and discuss the details.]","......No, seriously, Canalis-san is so reasonable that it's almost disorienting. But well, if it's Canalis-san, I don't think there will be any issues. Considering she's also familiar with Nebula, and her bright, approachable personality...... Once they get used to her unchanging expression, I’m sure everyone else will get along with her quickly.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [Well, I can understand being surprised at how sensible she is when you compare her to Shiro and Makina. Also, an Omnipotent God just went to live in Kaito's house huh...... As expected of the Singularity.]"]},{"number":1989,"title":"Chapter 1989: Canalis 6","paragraphs":["<Author's Notes>","I got home late due to working overtime, so today's chapter is short.","It's not a problem at all for me to let Canalis-san live in my house, but as she mentioned, we do need to align our conditions and expectations.","For my part, I don’t need any rent or anything like that; she can just use one of the vacant rooms. However, I doubt Canalis-san would agree to that, so a discussion is necessary.","And so, we decided to have this conversation with Nebula as well, making it the three of us. However, Nebula is only about 1 meter tall, so the sofa and table in the reception room don't match her size. It would have been nice if we had a special chair for her...... but we don’t, so Nebula is currently sitting on Canalis-san’s lap.","Not that there's anything wrong with that...... but Canalis-san seems to be having a rough time. No, even though just like usual, her expression isn’t changing at all, her eyes are darting up, down, left, and right at high speed. Even without any change in her expression, I can clearly tell she’s very flustered.","I mean, for her facial muscles not to budge despite being so shaken...... it’s impressive.","[......Canalis-san, errr, you alright there?]","[I- I'm alright. It’s just that the sudden happiness that descended upon me is so overwhelming that my mind couldn't fully process it. If you ask whether it’s a good or bad thing, it’s overwhelmingly good...... but at the same time, I feel as though a chill is running down my spine.]","[A chill? Why would you even......]","[Well, how should I say this, it's kind of a personal thing...... but one thing I can say is that I feel like the me who is here right now exists at the end of countless galaxy-destroying punches...... No, if they found out this happened, things wouldn't end with just a punch...... Anyhow, I feel like I was in such a situation where I don't know if I'm in heaven or in hell. But for now, it shouldn't interfere with our discussion......]","[A- Alright.]","I felt like I heard some alarming words, but since Canalis-san told me to continue the discussion without worrying about it, I complied and we worked out the finer details.","As expected, the sticking point was how to handle the rent. Of course, Canalis-san is a God with Omnipotent abilities, so I imagine she could create as much money as she wants but......","[No, even though I can create it, producing unlimited amounts of money could disrupt the balance of currency, so I’m thinking of earning money through some kind of work.]","[......I- I see.]","She really is astonishingly proper, as despite having Omnipotence, Canalis-san doesn't seem like she'd opt to overuse it.","At that moment, seemingly having come up with an idea, Nebula lightly clapped her hands.","[Milord, I have a suggestion. Milord and Anima-san were considering creating a store for our tea brand, weren't you? How about entrusting that to Canalis-san?]","Nebula’s proposal made perfect sense. Indeed, we had discussed opening Nifty stores, and we were still pondering over who would be in charge.","Since we need to open stores simultaneously in the three countries, it would be ideal to have someone proficient in teleportation magic who can travel between them. In that sense, Canalis-san might be the perfect candidate.","It would ultimately depend on how willing Canalis-san is, but entrusting her with the tea brand, paying her a salary, and then receiving rent from that income seems like a pretty good arrangement.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [Even if handling customers might be difficult with her expressionless face, as a manager, she's certainly an ideal candidate. I mean, she is Omnipotent, so she can pretty much do anything......]"]},{"number":1990,"title":"Chapter 1990: Canalis 7","paragraphs":["<Author's Notes>","This chapter was originally planned to be together with the previous one as a single chapter, so this chapter is also a bit short.","After receiving Nebula's proposal, I explained the situation to Canalis-san to some extent. Since I still need to discuss it with Anima and Caraway, I couldn't make a decision right there, but I suggested the idea of taking on such a job.","[I see, I understand the situation. Yes, if Kaito-sama is alright with it, please leave it to me. Though my facial muscles are like this, making me not exactly suited for customer service, I can certainly cover that. Tahaa~~ sorry about the unchanging poker face!]","[That's reassuring. Actually, I was really struggling with who to put in charge of that part.]","[No, no, I'm also grateful to find work in this world, and if it involves selling products made by Nebula-san, it gives me extra motivation.\"]","[I trust Canalis-san's abilities, so I think she's the right choice.]","[Nebula-san......]","Well, I'll certainly consult with Anima and Caraway, but considering that the original creator, Nebula is recommending her, and her abilities are at an Omnipotent level, not to mention her personality is surprisingly reasonable for a World Creator, it seems like there's no better candidate other than her.","[Alright, we'll work out the details with Anima...... Errr, she's the one serving as my Head Retainer...... As for Canalis-san's room......]","[Ah, I'm fine with any room. With your permission, I can expand it as much as needed, either by space expansion or creating a subspace.]","[I'll leave that stuff to you, but we need to check with Illness-san...... the maid in our household...... and ask her to bring up the floor plan. Errr, I was thinking you could use this room on the first floor.]","My house is almost identical to Lilia-san's mansion, so it's quite large. While Lilia-san has employed a considerable number of servants, on my side, there's just Illness-san, Eta, Theta, Anima, Caraway, Mom and Dad, and Aoi-chan and Hina-chan, who felt bad about continuing to borrow guest rooms at Lilia-san's mansion and moved over here where there are spare rooms. Including myself, that's a total of ten people...... so we're only using ten rooms.","There are a lot of rooms left unused. Incidentally, as for the reason why I chose Canalis-san's room for her, it seemed like she was close with Nebula, so I thought a room near the garden might be better.","[I think...... I'm not entirely sure, but it's relatively near the World Tree in the garden, and I think you might have a view of it from there, making it easier to converse with Nebula. What do you think?]","[For you to be so considerate to someone like me who just suddenly barged in...... As expected of Kaito-sama! Tahaa~~ a man who's popular with the ladies really is on a different level! Oh my, can I take it as the budding of our love story?]","Well, just like that, an Omnipotent God, Canalis-san, ended up living in my house...... but I still have something important to take care of———– a very big challenge, in fact.","Now then, this situation of a new Omnipotent Otherworld God moving in....... How should I explain this to Lilia-san......?","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [Once again, Lilia gets hit in the gut out of nowhere......]"]},{"number":1991,"title":"Chapter 1991: Canalis 8","paragraphs":["Explaining things to Lilia-san is something I can't avoid. Strictly speaking, Canalis-san is just living in my house, and there's no real connection to Lilia-san or the Albert Duchy...... but considering they'll be neighbors, it's better to explain things now. I don't even want to imagine how angry she'll be later if I don't.","Checking with Lilia-san about her schedule, it seemed she was free, so I decided to seize the moment and head to her office with Canalis-san.","[Excuse me, Lilia-san. Sorry for dropping by all of a sudden.]","[No, I just finished my work, so I was free anyway...... So, is something the matter?]","[Actually, there's someone I'd like to introduce to you......]","[......Hey, why did her eyes suddenly become as dark and resigned as the night sea......? How many scenes of carnage has this young woman been through to look like that......?]","As soon as I spoke, the light in Lilia-san's eyes vanished. Even though she didn't say a word, I could almost hear her thinking, \"Did you bring another troublesome person from somewhere?\"","Even if it's just for a moment, the way she smoothly reached for her stomach medicine gave off an aura of dignity.","[......So, Kaito-san. From where is this authoritative figure from now...... I'm afraid this is the first time I've seen her...... Ah, excuse my rudeness. I should introduce myself first. My name is Lilia Albert.]","[Nice to meet you, I'm Canalis...... However, I'm not someone of authority, okay? You could say I'm more of a traveler from another world? I've come to live at Kaito-sama's house, so I thought I'd introduce myself. Tahaa~~ Sorry for being an unconventional traveler.]","[A traveler from another world? Like Kaito-san and Eden-sama? Normally, this would be a huge deal...... but well, considering it's Kaito-san, it's not surprising you'd bring home one or two people from another world.]","[I’m quite an unusual being myself, so I wouldn’t be surprised if you didn’t believe that I’m from another world...... but it seems like you've already had your share of unexpected guests being brought by Kaito-sama huh.]","Indeed, under normal circumstances, if someone claimed to be from another world outside of the Hero Summoning, they'd probably be suspected of having a fever or an illness...... But given past experiences, Lilia-san just stared off into the distance without much doubt.","[But even if you're not someone of authority, crossing between different worlds must mean you possess significant strength, right?]","[Well, I was a God who created my own world, and I'm Omnipotent...... You could say I used to have a position equal to Shallow Vernal in this world.]","[ ! ? ! ? ]","[Lilia-san!?]","A dull thud followed as Lilia-san's face slammed onto the desk.","[......I- I'm such an idiot...... How could I have let my guard down...... It's someone Kaito-san brought along, she obviously wouldn’t be normal...... Uuuu...... My stomach hurts.]","Lilia-san mumbled quietly to herself with her face buried in the desk, but after a moment, she seemed to recover and lifted her head. No, though I fully understood that it was my fault, I still couldn't help but be impressed by how quickly she bounced back from all her experiences.","No, the actual cause of her feeling like this is me, and I'm really sorry about that but......","[F- Forgive me. So, Canalis-sama mentioned that she would be staying at Kaito-san's house. Does that mean you plan to stay in this world for a while?]","[Yes. It's more like I'll be settling here, although it's not entirely set in stone yet. I plan to work for Kaito-sama.]","[Work?]","[Yes...... Errr, Kaito-sama, should the details be kept private for now?]","[Ah, no, it's alright. I planned to explain everything to Lilia-san anyway...... So, to explain from my side, I've been thinking of appointing Canalis-san as the head of the Nifty store expansion that I've been planning. Of course, I'll discuss it with Anima and others first but......]","[......I see...... A God on par with Shallow Vernal-sama...... You're going to hire such a person as a store manager...... Ahhhh, I can't take this anymore...... Just when I thought I'd met most of the influential people in this world, you start bringing in powerful beings from other worlds...... Do you not know how to hold back? Can I lie down for a bit? My stomach hurts.]","With an indescribable expression on her face, as if she was trying to endure a headache...... Lilia-san muttered with a hint of sorrow in her voice.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [After all the hardships and stomachaches, she'd gotten to the point where she could say she got to know almost all of the major authoritative figures in this world, and then, just when she let her guard down, a stomachache from another world arrives......]"]},{"number":1992,"title":"Chapter 1992: Canalis 9","paragraphs":["<Author's Notes>","I got home late because of the typhoon, so I got home late. Everyone too, you be careful out there.","Regarding Canalis-san, I consulted with Anima and Caraway, and there was no problem———– in fact, they were rather relieved. It seems both of them had been trying to find personnel by reaching out through their various connections but were struggling without success, so they welcomed the idea.","[Given the nature of simultaneously operating in three countries, it would be better if the person could use Teleportation Magic...... For example, someone like Akane-dono would be ideal, but since she's the head of her own company, we can't exactly ask her.]","[If we leave it to someone affiliated with one of the three nations, that could potentially lead to trouble, so it's really fortunate to have someone who isn't affiliated with any of the three Human countries.]","As I thought, being able to use Teleportation Magic is indispensable. In the worst case, we could buy and lend out Teleportation Magic Tools, but that's difficult due to their high cost.","Considering this, as Caraway mentioned, Canalis-san, a visitor from another world who isn't affiliated with any of the three countries, is the perfect candidate.","[Good gracious, I'm grateful for the expectations placed on me. Tahaa~~ I'm glad to be a convenient choice. I'll do my best to live up to those expectations.]","[Given the nature of the job, you'll likely be busy traveling between the three countries......]","[Eh? Ah, no, I just need to be \"in all three stores at the same time\", so that isn't really a problem. I'm Omnipotent, after all, so being in multiple places at once is fairly easy for me. Tahaa~~ if only my facial muscles hadn't atrophied, I could have done customer service myself and had the wages for those personnel for myself, but things don't always go that smoothly. Ahh, if I could use Creation, I could create a friendly store clerk. I would need to get permission from Shallow Vernal though...... Tahaa~~ You can basically expect me to be able to do just about anything.]","She's such a sensible person that it's easy to forget, but Canalis-san is an Omnipotent God, and she can truly accomplish anything we can imagine.","She can be present in the stores of all three countries simultaneously, create store clerks...... Honestly, it's to the point where Canalis-san alone could handle everything.","[......In that case, Canalis-dono...... Would it be possible for you to create our store in all three countries at the same time? I mean, at the same time, without any time lag?]","[There's absolutely no problem with that. If it's about creating living beings, it's basic courtesy to get permission from the God of this world, Shallow Vernal first, but for buildings, as we've already talked about such a thing in our contract, I'm free to create them. Oh, there are some limitations on materials, though. Actually, if you give me some design requests, I can create a subspace and do a mock-up creation there.]","[......Anima, wouldn't that mean we'd be opening a store with zero cost......?]","[Yeah, Cara, I was thinking the same thing. As expected of an Omnipotent God...... As expected of someone Master brought along.]","In any case, Canalis-san is more than competent, so opening the tea brand stores shouldn't be a problem.","It seems like she can even accommodate requests about where to open them, so it might be a good idea to send a letter to Ryze and the other rulers to confirm where the stores should be built.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [(Omnipotent) Store Manager...... The power of that title is way too strong.]"]},{"number":1993,"title":"Chapter 1993: Canalis 10","paragraphs":["In the office of the royal castle in Symphonia Kingdom, King Ryze and Crown Princess Amalie were discussing about a letter they had just received from Kaito.","[It’s truly fortunate that Nifty is opening a store for us. Nifty's products have become the talk of high society, to the point where not owning one is considered out of touch. Up until now, the items were being distributed in limited quantities across multiple trading companies and stores, so having a dedicated store is a great relief.]","[Yeah, and they're apparently planning to open stores in the three countries simultaneously...... It’s a considerate move, balancing relations between nations. I feel sorry for the trouble this must have caused Miyama-kun, but given his influence, this arrangement is greatly appreciated.]","The tea brand Kaito established has become a huge hit among the nobility. Kaito himself was already well-known within the nobility, and the products he offers are so exceptional that the brand is rapidly gaining a strong reputation, not just among the nobles but also among tea enthusiasts.","Until now, the brand’s items were only available through consignment, so access to them varied depending on one’s connections with the trading companies or stores involved. This created disparities even among the nobility, with some finding it easy to acquire the products and others struggling.","However, with Kaito establishing a dedicated store, a certain level of fairness can be ensured. Foolish nobles who might try to exert pressure on Kaito’s stores have already been dealt with by the Mad God from the other world, and for Ryze and the other rulers, this will reduce complaints from the nobility and make inventory management much easier.","[......The representative seems to be someone named Canalis...... Does that name ring any bells?]","[No, at least, not to my knowledge...... However, it’s stated that this person will not only represent Symphonia Kingdom's store but also Nifty itself, so I assume they possess the necessary capabilities.]","[Given that they'll be entrusted with Miyama-kun’s brand, someone unqualified wouldn’t satisfy figures like the Phantasmal King or the Underworld King. It’s possible that they might have sent a capable person from their camps...... We should look into it just in case.]","[Understood. As for the land provided for the store...... Considering it will be a luxury-oriented shop and its proximity to Miyama-sama’s residence, I believe this street would be most suitable. Securing the land early was the right decision.]","[We anticipated that eventually, stores would be established...... If Miyama-kun has no objections, let’s have him open his store in this location.]","This situation wasn't just limited to Symphonia Kingdom, as the other countries had also gathered information indicating that Kaito’s tea brand would eventually open their own stores, and they had secured suitable land for when that time came.","For now, things were proceeding as planned, and with this in mind, Ryze and Amalie began discussing the contents of their reply letter to Kaito...... However, later on, they would find themselves troubled by the fact that no matter how much they searched, they couldn’t find any information about the person named Canalis. But that’s a story for another time.","At the same time, in the office of the royal palace in the Hydra Kingdom, Laguna was reading a letter that had just arrived from Kaito.","[Well, yes, this is how things would unfold...... The location I’ve secured is good, so there’s no problem...... Unn? Ahh, they've appointed a representative huh. That makes sense, having young Anima also look after the stores would place her under a lot of pressure, so selecting another representative is certainly effec...... tive......]","[Your Majesty?]","As Laguna muttered to herself while reading the letter, she suddenly stiffened, her expression one of astonishment. Seeing this, her attendant tilted their head in confusion and called out to her.","However, Laguna didn’t seem to hear the voice of her attendant; instead, she was lost in thought, perplexed.","(C- C- C- Canalis-sama!? W- Why is that person...... This shouldn't be just two people having the same name...... No, now that I think about it, she did say that the reason she joined my party was to meet Kaito. It must be Canalis-sama.)","Among the three kings, only Laguna was aware of Canalis’s existence. In fact, for Laguna, Canalis was someone she owed a great debt to———— someone she holds faith towards, although that's something she keeps to herself because holding faith to an Otherworld God, given her position, would be quite problematic.","After all, ever since Canalis had raised Laguna's growth limit, she had felt a tangible sense of progress in her daily training. It was as if she had returned to her younger days, making each day an absolute joy. She was deeply grateful from the bottom of her heart.","(I’m honestly delighted to be able to see her again. But if that’s the case...... the representative of Kaito's tea brand would be an Omnipotent God...... That guy really is beyond extraordinary...... However, if I’m preparing land for Canalis-sama, I should reconsider...... It might be better to have it closer to the temple...... No, Canalis-sama isn't one of our Gods, so would it perhaps be better to have it away from the temple? Hmmm...... I’ll need to reevaluate the location.)","While the land Laguna had secured was quite good, she felt she needed to consider more carefully if she was preparing it for someone she owed so much to like Canalis. With this in mind, Laguna pulled out a map of the Capital and began pondering with a serious expression.","It would be some time before Laguna finally heard her attendant’s voice again.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [Of course. There's no way they'd dig out any information about her....... So that means, to everyone except Laguna, she's gonna look like some mysterious unknown entity that was suddenly chosen out of nowhere......]"]},{"number":1994,"title":"Chapter 1994: Canalis 11","paragraphs":["The news of the development of the stores of Kaito's tea brand naturally reached Chris, Archlesia Empire's Emperor. Like the other rulers, she promptly prioritized this matter.","[I must say, I'm looking forward to it. Nifty's products are currently so popular that someone like me, without noble connections, finds it quite difficult to get my hands on them. The thought of having more opportunities to purchase them makes my heart dance with joy.]","[You must be joking. I would think you have more connections in various places than even I do......]","[Fufu, I wonder about that?]","Chris replied with a wry smile to the words of Alexandra, the Head Maid who had brought in the tea. The idea that Alexandra, who's undoubtedly the First Emperor and a Super Maid who commands great influence in the global Maid community, would lack connections was nothing short of a joke......","In fact, she did manage to get her hands on a limited edition first batch cup from Nifty, and although Chris isn't aware of how Alexandra did it, she still somehow purchases tea leaves and other items from them regularly.","To tell the truth, although Chris isn't aware of this, Alexandra...... or rather, Aria, has grown close to Kaito, and ever since then, instead of placing orders through the store as a friend of Kaito's, she's been able to directly place orders to Anima at Kaito's home. Because of this, she's been able to regularly acquire products.","[However, what I'm curious about is this representative, Canalis. I've done quite a bit of digging, but there's almost no information on them. If they're entrusted with such a brand, they must be quite capable, but the complete lack of information about them is unsettling.]","[Indeed, I also considered the possibility of a pseudonym and conducted my own investigations...... but there’s absolutely no information about them, including their background. However, I did hear that after reading a letter from Kaito-sama, Emperor Laguna was so shocked that she began reconsidering the location of the store. While it's just a rumor, there's a possibility that Emperor Laguna knows who this person is.]","[......In that case, it's highly likely that this person is a big shot we're unaware of. But for there to be no trace of their past at all, could it be that Phantasmal King-sama had manipulated their publicly available information?]","[If that's the case, it will be difficult for us to investigate her.]","The reason for their lack of information about Canalis was that she's actually an Omnipotent God who arrived from another world, and it's hard to imagine that such an Omnipotent God would be quickly entrusted with the tea brand.","In the end, Chris and Alexandra concluded that their information has likely been manipulated by Alice.","In a white space whose location was unknown, Canalis, with a blank expression and streaming with cold sweat, was staring at the World Creator in front of her.","[......Canalis...... I...... I need you to explain in detail...... while I'm still able to maintain my sanity.......]","[Y- Yes......]","Canalis had come to explain that she ended up living with Kaito...... in other words, in the place where Nebula lived, and that she had been entrusted with selling Nebula’s products...... However, the World Creator in front of her seemed to be brimming with an aura of jealousy, with the word \"envy\" almost visibly written all over her face.","Ideally, Canalis wouldn't have wanted to report such obviously troublesome news, but the person in front of her was Omniscient, and even if she tried to hide it, it would eventually come to light. Thus, she chose to explain first, thinking that if it were discovered later, it wouldn't be settled with just a galaxy-destroying punch.","[......I- I see. So, you’ve been honored with the privilege of living in the same house as Nebula-sama, and you’re entrusted with selling the items created by Nebula-sama...... and on top of that, the room you got is in a position where you can see Nebula-sama’s World Tree well, and you often talk to Nebula-sama and invite her to have tea with you...... Did I get that right?]","[That's right. Well~~ Kaito-sama’s generosity is just amazing; he’s like a consideration demon, really cool. Considering that we were acquainted, he made sure I could be close to Nebula-sama. Tahaa~~ He really just makes my heart go kyun~~!]","[I- I'm so envious! I’m still negotiating with Shallow Vernal about visiting Nebula-sama, and here you are, already living in such a paradise! Ughhhhh......]","[No well, if I were in the opposite position, I’d feel the same, so I understand your feelings. However, let’s refrain from impulsive actions. Calm down, we’re beings who can communicate.]","Canalis tried to calm down the World Creator in front of her, who seemed on the verge of being driven mad with jealousy. However, the next words from the World Creator made her face turn from blue to white.","[......W- Well, that's fine and all. I'm envious you get to live like that now but...... what I want to ask about more than that...... you were able to have Nebula-sama sit on your lap? Heck, it seems like you even patted her head......]","[....................................Errr, I'm quite busy, so I'd be excusing myself...... is what I wanna say...... Ah, no good huh......]","Canalis had tried to avoid the most problematic topic by honestly conveying other information, but unfortunately, she couldn’t escape...... and soon after, Canalis’s scream echoed through the space.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [It seems like there are plenty of Omniscient Gods among Nebula's former subordinates, so there's no way she could keep secrets...... Canalis, my condolences.]","? ? ? : [More importantly, isn’t Alice-chan being blamed for things she has nothing to do with? No, I understand why they thought that way, but I...... Alice-chan isn't involved this time, okay?]"]},{"number":1995,"title":"Chapter 1995: Canalis 12","paragraphs":["A few days had passed since Canalis-san had started living in the house, and a few days had also passed since I entrusted the tea brand to her. Now, we were going to discuss the interior design of the stores we planned to open.","We planned to inspect the location with Anima, Caraway, and myself. Since it was agreed that Anima's office would be a suitable meeting place, we gathered there, and soon Canalis-san arrived.","[Well~~ Sorry to keep you waiting. I've received a bunch of design and interior ideas, so I made a rough model in a subspace for you to check. Tahaa~~ I apologize for being a woman quick with my work. Also, the interior can be adjusted, so please let me know if you have any suggestions.]","[It's nice to be able to preview it before it's actually built. But, errr, Canalis-san...... Errr...... Your face is dented like something out of a gag manga......]","[Ohhh, excuse me, I just got hit by a \"Multi-Dimensional Crushing Kick\" earlier and forgot to fix it.]","Canalis-san's face was deformed, as if it were a ball of clay that had been punched from the side. But as soon as I pointed it out, it returned to normal.","I've got a lot of questions I'd like to ask, but assuming that \"Multi-Dimensional Crushing Kick\" was as powerful as it sounds, the fact that it only deformed her face, I guess that's as to be expected of someone Omnipotent...... No, I have no idea why she got hit with something as dangerous-sounding as a Multi-Dimensional Crushing Kick, but considering she interacts with Gods from various worlds, something might have happened.","[......However, Canalis-dono, while it's certainly helpful to be able to check how the stores are like beforehand, isn't it a bit too soon given that we haven't received a response from any countries about available land for the store yet?]","[The size of the store will depend on the size of the land, and even if we have a good layout or design, it might not fit the actual location, right?]","Anima and Caraway’s concerns were valid. The stores' size would indeed change depending on the size of the land, and adjustments would need to be made to match the surrounding landscape.","But, well, that's only a general concern...... it wouldn't apply to someone like Canalis-san. Well, since I often talk with Shiro-san and Makina-san, I already know that Canalis-san \"already knows the size of the land and the surrounding landscape\", but it's understandable that Anima and Caraway would feel uneasy.","[Ahh, I've already checked the future regarding the location, conditions, sunlight, and view from the stores, so I've considered all of that in the model. Tahaa~ Sorry for being able to do just about everything!]","[......Come to think of it, Canalis-sama is on the same level as Shallow Vernal-sama, Anima.]","[Indeed, it's our immaturity that we didn't immediately consider that possibility. Given that Master remains composed and confident, he probably realized that immediately.]","Well, the difference in experience regarding interactions with World Creators plays a big part in it, so it's not Anima and Caraway's fault at all.","Anyhow, we pulled ourselves together and began checking out the stores Canalis-san created in the subspace.","[First, this is the store we are planning to build in Symphonia Kingdom. The design is primarily white, giving it an overall luxurious feel. Since this will be in an area in Symphonia Kingdom where luxury stores line the streets, we've added more decorations to make it stand out while ensuring it blends in with the surrounding stores.]","[This does exude a sense of luxury, like a store meant for nobles. The decorative details on the pillars are also incredibly intricate.]","[Well, for me, it’s as simple as imagining it and creating it, so it didn’t take much effort. Tahaa~~ It's like I got a portable 3D printer!\"","The store, which was prepared for Symphonia Kingdom, had a beautiful white exterior with gold patterns and decorations. It looked like a place that nobles would frequent, and the design didn’t feel out of place in a high-end shopping area.","I often visit the high-end areas in Symphonia Kingdom, and this design definitely fits the vibe of the luxury stores there.","When I stepped inside, I found that the interior design was quite interesting.","[......Half of the space is turned into a café?]","[Yes. Some customers may want to taste the tea before buying, and many wealthy individuals prefer to shop leisurely, so I've designed half of the store as a café. Not only can customers enjoy the teas that are for sale, but it also allows us to gauge reactions to new products.]","[I see......]","Since Anima and Caraway have invested in various stores, they seem to understand the intent without much explanation. They were inspecting different parts of the store, documents in hand. As for me, not really grasping the finer details, Canalis-san kindly provided explanations.","Well, to be honest, I was more like an observer, just enjoying the atmosphere of this luxurious store.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [If they were to prepare items that are exclusive to that café area, that could turn out to be a pretty big deal.]","? ? ? : [Well, in that case, they will probably make it limited in quantity or perhaps even make the café accessible by reservation only. Since it's a high-end store, they have plenty of options for adjustments.]","Serious-senpai : [And just like before, Anima's overflowing \"I love Kaito\" aura during regular conversations is just as strong as ever.]"]},{"number":1996,"title":"Chapter 1996: Canalis 13","paragraphs":["As expected, it seems that Canalis-san is quite exceptional. Perhaps her experience traveling through various worlds contributes to this, as despite being a supernatural entity like an Omnipotent God, she possesses the perspective needed for business...... The stores for the countries other than Symphonia Kingdom were also tailored to the characteristics of each location.","The store for Archlesia Empire had a high-end feel while also evoking a sense of history...... An exterior and interior that adhered to the traditions of the Archlesia Empire, which impressed both Anima and Caraway.","In contrast, the store in Hydra Kingdom had a terrace seating in the café area, designed so that customers could view the sea. The exterior and interior also conveyed a sense of luxury while maintaining a casual atmosphere.","[......Honestly...... There's nothing to complain about.]","[Yeah, it's far better than what we had in mind, and it accurately reflects our requests. You've even made fine adjustments based on the expected clientele. We could open these stores right now without any issues.]","[Tahaa~~ it's great to hear that from the two of you! Ahh, I’ve also customized the café menus for each of the three countries. While the basic lineup of teas remains the same, I've prepared blends and limited-time items specific to each country. This way, people will be encouraged to visit stores in other countries as well.]","This seems like a very effective strategy. A store-exclusive menu naturally piques interest, and since Nifty is a tea brand targeting the wealthy, many of its customers likely have the means to travel to other countries.","[In that case, it might be good to have original products for each store.]","[Ah, actually, Nebula-san also had the same idea and created new original tea leaves. Tahaa~~ Nebula-san's generosity is truly inspiring! Incidentally, each country has a simple, easy-to-understand name, consisting of the initials of each country's name followed by the word \"leaf\". Here are documents related to them. I’ve been entrusted with the brand expansion, so we’re also preparing for mass production.]","[Impressive quick work...... Fumu, I see...... Everything fits within the budget, or rather, it barely uses any of the budget. Canalis-dono, is this really alright?]","[It's alright. Since I’m involved, there’s no need to spend money on capital investments. I can create things after all...... As for cultivating the tea leaves, I've created dedicated jiangshis...... Ahh, errr, you call them Golems in this world, right? I create and control them, so there's no labor cost. I've already obtained permission from Shallow Vernal on this matter, so everything's good to go. Tahaa~~ I guess it's fine to claim myself a capable woman, right?]","(T/N: Canalis described them as 躯体/Mukuro-tai, 躯 means corpse,体 means body. To put it simply, 躯体 would mean something along the lines of reanimated corpse. An undead being that has a physical body of its own. Zombies would be more of Rasal's thing, so I translated 躯体 as jiangshi.)","Putting aside claims, she certainly is capable...... Despite the fact that the letters with location suggestions from each country haven't even arrived yet, it seems like almost all the preparations for opening have already been completed———— too quickly, in fact.","Well, when I left the work to her, she seemed highly motivated despite her expressionless demeanor, so maybe she was really eager to get things done.","[Well, that said, there are still many things to consider, like the café menu, and I’d like to hear everyone's opinions. I’ve eaten many things in various worlds, so I have plenty of experience...... but I'd like you to check if the flavors are suitable for this world. Tahaa~~ it looks like I'll be able to serve homemade food to Kaito-sama!]","Canalis-san’s expression remains unchanged, but she seems to be having fun, and hearing her voice somehow makes me feel warm inside.","But setting that aside...... Nebula's new tea leaves huh...... There will definitely be people who react to that. I’d better tell them to place direct orders in advance......","[Speaking of which, until now, we’ve been having Anima handle it, but from now on, should I have my friends’ orders go through Canalis-san instead?]","[Yes, if you could direct them to me, that would be fine. Actually, how about I create some kind of magic tool for it? One that could function like a tablet from Kaito-sama's world. By operating this magic tool, they could place their orders, eliminating the hassle of sending letters and such.]","[......Can something like that really be created?]","[I just quickly used omniscience to check, and with the current techniques and magic crystals available in this world, it’s definitely possible to make. This world already has magic tools that can transfer documents placed in a box to a paired magic tool, so I think we can adapt that. Well, it won’t have many functions, but it should work fine for placing orders.]","[I see, then in that case, please go ahead.]","[Leave it to me!]","Hmm, she really is incredibly capable. It seems there’s no issue leaving everything related to the tea brand entirely in Canalis-san’s hands.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [Well, being omnipotent is already a complete cheat, so she can really do anything.]","? ? ? : [As long as it doesn't require permission from Shallow Vernal-sama or violate any contracts, it seems like she can handle anything. Since she's pretty considerate, it looks like she would do a great job even if we leave everything to her.]"]},{"number":1997,"title":"Chapter 1997: Canalis 14","paragraphs":["A few days after Canalis-san had us inspect the shops she was planning to build, they received messages from the rulers of various countries asking them to open stores on their desired lands.","As expected, each country wanted a shop in their Capital City, and the locations seemed pretty good. Well, Canalis-san had already looked at the future and had considered the locations, so there shouldn't be any problems.","[Incidentally, Canalis-san, when can we open the shop?]","[We can open it tomorrow if you want. We've already set up mass production, received permission from Shallow Vernal, created the staff, and finished training them, including basic knowledge of this world. So, we're ready to go at any time.]","[As expected of Canalis-san, you work fast. But opening tomorrow might cause some trouble, right?]","[Yes, considering the needs of each country and the fact that Anima-san and others mentioned wanting to run an opening campaign, including promotions...... I think opening next month would be more reasonable.]","[Then, if everything checks out with Anima and the others, let's have the opening in a month.]","With Canalis-san's power, it would take no time to prepare the shop on site, and as she said, it could be opened anytime.","But well, opening the day after tomorrow would only cause stress for the rulers, so a little more time was allowed.","[Ahhh, by the way, Kaito-sama. Since it's snack time, would you like to try some of the sweets we'll be serving at the shops? I'll invite you to my room. Tahaa~~ Well, it was originally Kaito-sama's room!]","[Thank you. In that case, I'll take you up on your offer......]","I was just thinking I'd like to eat something sweet, so I gladly accepted Canalis-san's offer.","We walked over to Canalis-san's room, and when we entered...... Arehh? Was the room always this spacious? I had told her she could adjust the room as she liked, so maybe she had expanded the space using Time-Space Magic like Alice did.","[......Ahh, did you expand the space?]","[Oh, I'm sorry for not mentioning it sooner. I had been prioritizing the brand and shop, but after things settled down, I remodeled my room yesterday. I created a few extra spaces and made it so that the rooms could be switched. Ahh, this room was made to accommodate you and Nebula-san, so it's a bit more spacious for comfort.]","[I see...... Eh? Extra spaces? \"Rooms\"?]","[Yes. Well, you see, I'm omnipotent, so creating multiple spaces in the same location via phase shifting is no problem for me. Tahaa~~ This could solve all housing problems! That said, to leave the hidden spaces, you'd need Time-Space Teleportation...... Oh, Kaito-sama, please have a seat here...... Ah, may I sit with you?]","[Thank you. Yes, of course...... Or rather, I'd just feel uncomfortable if you remained standing.]","When I agreed, Canalis-san sat across from me and lightly snapped her fingers. Thereupon, on the table which had been empty until that moment, colorful cakes and freshly brewed tea suddenly appeared.","[Now, now, please help yourself without hesitation. There's plenty, so eat as much as you like, and if you can't finish it, feel free to leave the rest. I'll just appropriately convert the leftovers into magic power or another form of energy for reuse...... Tahaa~~ Sorry for being so eco-friendly!]","As always, Canalis-san maintained her usual expressionless face, but her voice seemed to carry a hint of excitement...... This is just my hunch, but it felt like she was genuinely enjoying herself.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [I mean, her light tone and easygoing vibe might make it seem like she's just being casual, but Canalis's feelings for Kaito are probably super intense......]"]},{"number":1998,"title":"Chapter 1998: Canalis 15","paragraphs":["The sweets that Canalis-san prepared all had an elegant atmosphere, with a luxurious feel that seemed fit for nobles and the wealthy.","However, they weren’t all just artistic and refined things that make you wonder how to eat them; there were also simple cakes available.","[......Is this dome-like thing perhaps...... one of those that you pour milk over to melt?]","[Yes, it’s a chocolate dome. We wanted to keep a playful spirit, and while it’s simple, doesn’t it make you excited?]","[It certainly does, and I’m actually excited right now...... O- Ohh...... There's a fruitcake inside?]","[It pairs well with chocolate after all. Incidentally, the fruitcake inside is made with fruits from different countries, so the combination of fruits varies slightly depending on the country. The one in front of Kaito-sama is made with fruits from Symphonia Kingdom.]","[That’s amazing. But there also seems to be a lot of stuff here that looks difficult to prepare.]","[Well, with this kind of dessert, the visual impact is also important. It’s about creating that wow factor. But well, rest assured, every staff member I create is going to be given the highest level of confectionery skills, so they can easily make even the most challenging items. Oh, and by the way, the one Kaito-sama is eating right now, I made it myself. Tahaa~~ Sorry for scoring points with my girlish sweet-making skills!]","I see, that’s reassuring...... or rather, doesn’t that mean the quality is going to be incredible? In fact, this cake is ridiculously delicious, and the presentation is stunning.","However, as expected, Canalis-san basically uses ingredients available in this world, unlike Shiro-san, who created ingredients that don’t exist like that time with baby castellas.","It seems like she’s thinking about menus that match the specialties of each country, and her thought process is extremely sensible, so I can really trust her.","[When you say you made it, do you mean you cooked it, not created it? Canalis-san, you’re also good at cooking huh.]","[Tahaa~~ Well, I'm omnipotent after all...... though it sounds a bit baseless, I do cook occasionally, so I have quite a bit of experience. Ah~ but, it’s not like I did it that often...... H- Hmmm?]","[What’s the matter?]","[Well, from my perspective, I only did it occasionally, so I wanted to say I have little experience...... but having lived several billion years, when you add it all up, I'm not sure how to judge this. Tahaa~~ The fact that billions of years don’t seem that long to me is a sign that my sense is way too godlike!]","[Ahaha, that is indeed a tricky situation.]","I chuckle and agree with Canalis-san’s words. Even though she only did it occasionally, since she’s lived for an immense amount of time, her accumulated experience far surpasses that of any chef or pâtissier. And the fact that billions of years don’t seem long to her is exactly what you’d expect from an Omnipotent God...... The scale she's in is literally beyond comprehension.","[Canalis-san, you’ve traveled to various worlds, right?]","[Yes, I’ve been all over the place. I’m a little proud of how many acquaintances I have...... Ohh, even though I look like this, I'm actually quite perceptive, and I can tell you’re asking for stories from other worlds! Leave it to me! Since we’re enjoying sweets right now, how about I tell you about some interesting sweets from another world...... Actually, there’s a dessert in another world that you eat with your fingers.]","[By the way you said it, I'm guessing you don't mean sweets you pick up by hand, right? It's also not like the locals have mouths on their fingers or anything like that?]","[No, it’s a sweet that species like Kaito-sama, who consume food orally, choose to eat with their fingers. It has a jelly-like texture that, when you put your finger in, slowly gets absorbed into your body. You might wonder, doesn’t that mean you can’t taste it? But it’s made with special materials that don’t exist in this world, so even though you’re absorbing it through your fingers, you can taste it.]","[That’s quite mysterious and interesting. I’m curious about how it feels like.]","[Leave it to me...... Here you go. I made a small portion, so please give it a try! Taha~~ I suppose I could claim myself to be a considerate woman now?]","Canalis-san, knowing that I would be interested, quickly brought out the dessert she had mentioned. It looked like an ordinary jelly in a semi-transparent container.","Do I put my finger into this?","[......O- Ohh...... Eh? Ahh, this is amazing. I can really taste something. T- This feels kinda strange, tasting something even though there's nothing in my mouth...... Hmm, It has a refreshing, soda-like flavor.]","[It must be really disorienting at first. You get used to it after eating it a few times...... Well, I do wonder if \"eating\" is the right word here. Well, since this dessert uses several ingredients that don’t exist in this world, putting aside if it's for Kaito-sama, I can’t exactly serve it in the café.]","[Rather, was it okay to serve it to me? I mean, like how the God from my world made a contract with Shiro-san, aren’t there restrictions on items from different worlds?]","[Ahh, it's alright. The Creator God of that world is also a fan of Kaito-sama, so I think she'd be pleased. Tahaa~~ As expected of Kaito-sama, you sure are popular!]","Unnn, errr...... why exactly is an Otherworld God, whom I’ve never met, a fan of mine? I did hear how I've become famous among World Creators because of my connection with Shiro-san, so maybe it's related to that...... H- Hmmm. Let's just stop thinking about it too deeply.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [It certainly doesn't feel surprising if there was some kind of special agreement among World Creators to make exceptions just for Kaito.]","? ? ? : [This is one of those, isn't it? The \"Kaito-only Exception\"...... Let's call it \"KO Exception\".]","Serious-senpai : [Stop making up weird terminologies......]"]},{"number":1999,"title":"Chapter 1999: Canalis 16","paragraphs":["Canalis-san shared various stories about her experiences traveling through different worlds, and since she’s a great storyteller, her stories had been really enjoyable.","There are parallel worlds like Trinia that are relatively similar to the world I came from, as well as worlds with completely different ecosystems and common sense.","Canalis-san also mentioned that she had been to a place with creatures that seemed to be a fusion of machines and living beings, just like that dragon model Lilia-san received as a reward from Makina-san.","[There really are a lot of different worlds. Do the World Creators decide what kind of world they’re going to make?]","[Hmmm, there are many different types of such situations. For example, here in Shallow Vernal's world, her intentions are very strongly reflected. She modeled it after a world she referenced and made adjustments to the finer details. Well, this world is quite small, so it’s probably easier to tweak things down to the small details.]","[Now that you mention it, I think Makina-san...... Ah, errr, the God from my world said something similar. She mentioned that this world is too small for her true form to fully enter......]","[Makina...... Ahh, Machine God huh. Yeah, she's one of the larger Gods in terms of existence, so bringing her true form here would be quite difficult. In my case, I was originally set up to travel between various worlds...... Errr, I’ve partitioned my authorities and abilities into categories, stored them in a special dimension, and reduced my existence. So I pull out what I need when I need them...... To put it simply, it’s like storing everything on a cloud server. Tahaa~~ Well, of course, there are restrictions, but thanks to that, I can maintain my slim and slender figure!]","I see. Canalis-san must have been traveling between worlds for a long time, and of course, as is the case with Trinia, in small worlds———— though this is based on the standards of World Creators———— she probably made various adjustments so that she could come without causing any negative effects.","[Oops, I got sidetracked. Well, anyway, just like Shallow Vernal's case, some Gods meticulously adjust their worlds, while others just leave them alone...... There are even Gods who, after billions of years, look at their own world and say, \"Huh? Was it always like this?\". Some are even so irresponsible that they’ll decide to destroy the world and remake it because they don’t like it anymore.]","[In fiction, Gods like that often end up being overthrown by the inhabitants of the worlds they created.]","[Yeah, that does happen in some worlds. While we lump all Gods who created worlds as World Creators, we have varying abilities. Some are only good at creating worlds, and their overall power isn’t anywhere near Omnipotent, so they can get overthrown. Then there are Gods who tried to destroy their worlds on a whim, but when they see the inhabitants' resistance, they feel guilty or find it too bothersome and pretend to be defeated. Well, you’d wonder why they even created a world in the first place, but that’s just how it is. Tahaa~~ Gods may sound grand, but in the end, that's the kind of beings they are.]","This is just my hunch, but it feels like Canalis-san's stance is that while there may be a difference in power between Gods and humans, there isn't much of a fundamental difference between them.","Perhaps that’s why, despite being an Omnipotent God, she feels approachable and easy to talk to.","[How should I say this...... When I hear stories like that, it makes me think that Canalis-san is a really kind person. It’s hard to express, but it's something that makes me a bit happy.]","[Whoa there, Kaito-sama, that innocent smile is extremely dangerous. It’s a critical hit straight to my heart, you trying to kill me by making my heart skip a beat? Tahaa~~ Well, it does make me happy to hear that! Ah, by the way, changing the topic a bit, there’s the matter of meeting the rulers of each country as the representative of the brand......]","[Oh, when is that happening?]","[In three days. Yes, with all three countries. It’s more efficient to visit them simultaneously, so I plan to meet with all three rulers at once. Don’t worry, it will all be with my real body, so it won’t be disrespectful...... Tahaa~~ Sorry for being a woman who can exist in many places at once!]","The opening of the store is roughly set, and the day when Canalis-san will fully begin her activities as the representative of the tea brand is close...... Well, it already feels like she’s been working like crazy, but the amazing part is that for her, it’s probably no more than a minor effort.","In any case, with Canalis-san taking care of everything, I feel much more at ease.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [Ryze...... shouldn't be a problem. Chris...... same, not a problem. As for Laguna...... It would be no different from her greatest benefactor coming for an audience, so you could say this would be quite the body blow...... Looks like this time's stomachache is heading for Laguna......]","? ? ? : [Knowing the other party is an Omnipotent God must make her feel even more stressed about being the one receiving the audience.]"]},{"number":2000,"title":"Chapter 2000: Canalis 17","paragraphs":["In the royal audience chamber of the Hydra Kingdom, a place not often used due to both King Laguna's nature and Hydra Kingdom's stance, preparations were made for an important visit. This visit was significant not only for Hydra Kingdom but globally...... as it was to welcome the representative of Kaito's prestigious tea brand.","King Laguna was already present in the audience chamber...... two hours ahead of the scheduled time......","[Your Majesty, there is still quite a lot of time before the visit......]","[Yeah, I know. Don’t worry about it, I just want to think about a few things......]","Laguna knew that Canalis, who was visiting, was an Omnipotent God. However, this was not common knowledge but rather something she knew personally due to their direct acquaintance. For others, Canalis was just a mysterious individual representing Kaito's brand.","(......To be honest, it's a bit disconcerting to welcome Canalis-sama while acting like I'm at a higher status like this. I should be the one kneeling to greet her...... Nngh, I'm starting to understand now why young Lilia was having those stomachaches. However, with only myself knowing Canalis-sama’s true identity, I can't afford to act recklessly...... This is troubling.)","For Laguna, who had great gratitude towards Canalis and knew that she's an Omnipotent God, it would be more appropriate for her to kneel in greeting. However, from the perspective of others, despite Canalis being entrusted with the role of being the representative of Kaito's brand, her position was below that of King Laguna, making it impossible for Laguna to kneel.","Feeling quite conflicted, Laguna spent time in the audience chamber...... until Canalis arrived at the scheduled time, and the audience began.","[I bid you welcome, C- Canalis-dono...... My kingdom is not so ceremonious, so please be at ease.]","[Thank you for your kindness. As the representative of Nifty and the overall manager of the upcoming stores opening next month, I offer my greetings to Your Majesty Laguna. I believe there will be opportunities for me to ask for your support in the future, and when that time comes, I will be in your care.]","[I, too, hope to build a good relationship with Nifty. I pray for a long-term relationship...... Now then, Canalis-dono, we’ve completed the formal greetings, but to deepen our friendship, I have prepared tea in a separate room, so would you be interested in drinking them with me?]","[That’s a very gracious offer. I’ll gladly accept Your Majesty’s kindness.]","After the brief exchange of greetings, Laguna guided Canalis to a separate room. Once inside, Laguna informed the palace guards and staff to return to their posts, confirmed she was alone with Canalis, closed the reception room door, casted Barrier Magic, and then hurriedly bowed before Canalis.","[I'm terribly sorry, Canalis-sama! For me to have acted in such a rude way......]","[Eh? Ah, no, please don't worry about it. Actually, Your Majesty’s status is higher, and considering the circumstances, it’s understandable. Rather, I should thank you for taking care to keep my true identity a secret. Please, accept my thanks. Ah, my facial muscles are completely paralyzed, so I may look like this, but I’m not angry at all, so please don’t worry. Tahaa~~ I’m sorry for the confusing expression! As I said earlier, I hope we can continue to build a good relationship, so once again, I'm in your care.]","[Your words are too kind...... I am pleased to have met you again, Canalis-sama.]","Although Canalis's expression didn’t change, her tone was gentle, and Laguna, relieved, raised her head.","[However, I was quite surprised when I received your letter. I never imagined that Canalis-sama would become the representative of Kaito's tea brand......]","[Tahaa~~ Kaito-sama suggested it to me, and I ended up being entrusted with that role. Well, I do worry sometimes———— His guard is just too low, trusting someone like me, who's almost a stranger to him, a bit too much. But at the same time, it's flattering to be trusted like that. It’s quite a complicated feeling.]]","[Kaito has a remarkable eye for people, so he must have instinctively judged that you were someone worthy of trust, Canalis-sama. Still, it's quite a bold decision to entrust you with the brand so suddenly......]","[Good gracious, you said it. But well, I suppose it's that kind of boldness that has allowed him to accomplish so many great things. Tahaa~~ Sorry about that, I'm a big fan of Kaito-sama, so I tend to steer the conversation in that direction......]","[No, talking about Kaito is a topic that's easy to expand on, so talking about him is good for me as well.]","As the tension eased somewhat, Laguna continued chatting with Canalis, now appearing more relaxed and enjoying their conversation.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [Laguna seems like the type who never forgets a favor and is pretty serious about her sense of duty. She also seems to have a strong sense of faith]","? ? ? : [Right. By the way, Serious-senpai...... Have you rested enough?]","Serious-senpai : [Eh? Why are you asking that...... I'm having a really bad feeling here...... Is the story gonna lead to a sweet development?]"]}]);
